<dīkṣādarśaḥ >

<īFP ṭ.ṇo. 372 >

<page 1262-1670 >

<copied from a ms beloning to ṣundaradiksitar, ṭirunelveli >

<ṭhis is an important ṣiddhānta work by Vedajñāna who lived in >
<Vyāghrapura in ṭamil ṇadu. īt deals with the varieties of initiatory >
<rites described in the āgamas, quoting from them extensively. >

|| {dīkṣādarśaḥ} || 

<p. 1262> 

vande kalkaka vighneśaṃ vāñcchitārtha prasiddhaye | varadaṃ 
sarvabhaktānāṃ yallabhā vallabhaṃ prabhum || 

śrīmadadabhra sabhānāthaṃ vyāghrapāccheṣa pūjitam | 
ānandasarpiṇīṃ śaktiṃ bhajāmyānandasiddhaye || 

kriyākāṇḍa pravṛtāṃśca sāntānika gurunapi | 
vedajñānamunejñāna mokṣadaṃ sādhusadgukam || 

āgamānāmanantatvā davalokitumakṣamāt | (***) pratibodhāya 
dīkṣādarśa ihocyate || 

kāraṇe (-) 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi śivadīkṣā vidhikramam | narāṇāṃ 
mokṣasiddhyarthaṃ sarvapāpaharaṃ param || 

sarva rogavināśārthaṃ dhanadhānya samṛddhidam | 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi aprabuddhasya dehinaḥ | 
sarvatatvanibaddhasya sarvadharmamayasya tu || 

paśudharma vimuktasya anādimaladūṣitataḥ | śṛṇuvākyaṃ 
parāndīkṣāṃ śivasāyujyadāṃ śivam || 

ṣaṭsahastrikāyām (-) 

dīkṣayā śravaṇe yogyo dīkṣayā pūjanekṣamaḥ | 
dīkṣayāśramadharmāstu pravartante yathārthataḥ || 

dīkṣayā prāpyatejñānaṃ dīkṣayāsiddhibhāk bhavet | 

<p. 1263> 

muktidānena via dīkṣā jñānadācāntaraṃgiṇī || 

śivadīkṣādhiśuddhāye sarvatraivādhikāriṇaḥ | nāsti 
dīkṣāsamastīrthaṃ nāstidīkṣā samaṃ tapaḥ || 

nāsti dīkṣāsamo dharmo nāsti dīkṣāsamo guṇaḥ | nāsti 
dīkṣāsamaṃ jñānaṃ nāsti dīkṣā samā smṛtiḥ || 

nāsti dīkṣāsamaṃ śreyo nāsti dīkṣāsamaṃ kulam | 
vākyanānāśataścāpi dīkṣājñānakriyā tathā || 

yogacaryādi catvāri teṣāṃ saṃvarddhanāddhruvam | 

pauṣkare (-) 

mantrauṣadhabalai yardvat saṃnirodhāviṣṭasya tu | tathā yatsarva 
pāñcānāṃ saṃnirodhastu dīkṣayā || 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

viṣṭāpahāraṃ kurute dhyānabīja balairyathā | kurute 
vāgaviśyeṣaṃ tathācāryaśśivādhvare || 

dahyate dhārmya mānāṇḍā kunāyantu yathā balam | tathā cāryo 
dahet puṃsāṃ pāśabaddhantu dīkṣayā || 

parākhye (-) 

dharmādharmakṣayakarī dīkṣeyaṃ pārameśvarī | jñānato 
yogataścaiva caryātaśca na mucyate || 

dīkṣayā cātra muktistu sarveṣāṃ prāṇināmiha | tasmāttu 
śivasāmarthyānmuktissarvatra siddhayati || 

<p. 1264> 

asmātpravitatādbandhāt parasaṃsthā nirodhanāt | dīkṣaiva 
mocayatyūrdhvaṃ śaivandhāma nayatyapi || 

tathā skānde bhṛguśāpa prakaraṇe (-) 

nātrāmrakṛtaḥ kaścit utkarṣo vidyate nṛṇām | parāndīkṣāṃ 
vināśaivīṃ bandhatraya vimocinīm || 

tasmānmuktirdīkṣayaiva nāśrarmaināsya karmabhiḥ | 

skāndhe kauśikakhaṇḍe (-) 

adhvaśuddhiṃ vināye ca muktimicchanti mānavāḥ | 
adaṇḍapāṇiścāṇḍastu gantumārabhatehaṇat || 

yathā droṇi vihīnāhi tartumicchanti sāgaram | adhvaśuddhiṃ 
vihīno hitayā muktiṃ samīhate || 

kimatra bahunoktena bhūyo bhūyo vadāmi ca | ṣaḍadhvaśuddhi 
yuktātmā muktimeti na cānyathā || 

kāśīkhaṇḍe (-) 

pañca krośekṛtaḥ kāśyāṃ sa tu nirvāṇa dīkṣitaḥ | nāmāpi 
gṛhṇatāṃ praśyāṃ sadaivāstre na saṃśayaḥ || 

vāmanapurāṇe vāsudevaṃ pratyupamanyuḥ (-) 

ahaṃ kathaṃyiṣyāmi sarvapāpa viśodhanam | saṃskāraṃ paramaṃ 
puṇyaṃ śivenaparibhāṣitam || 

samyakkṛtādhikārī syāt pūjādiṣu naroyataḥ | 

<p. 1265> 

saṃskāraḥ kathyate tena ṣaḍadhvapariśodhanam || 

vāyupurāṇe upamanyukṛṣṇasaṃvāde (-) 

śivāgamertha yatjñānantatra tat jñānamucyate | śivāśritānāṃ 
kāruṇyāt śreyasāṃ mokṣasādhanam || 

kṛṣṇaḥ (-) 

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi śivasaṃskāramuttamam | mantrasaṃgrahaṇe 
kiñcit sūcitaṃ na pravistaram || 

varāhapurāṇe muktimat pratirīśvaraḥ (-) 

daivī pāśupatī dīkṣā yogaḥ pāśupatastviha | 
tasmādvedamārgāccayadanyamiha jāyate || 

sadrūpaṃ karmavijñeyaṃ raudrakarma vivarjitam | 

ata eva brahmādayassarvepi dīkṣitā śrūyante | 

yathā raurave (-) 

patayassā (*) nā proktā brahmaviṣṇvindrasaṃjñitāḥ | 
teṣāmatyantamaiśvarya vidyeśānāṃ mahātmanām || 

(**) tadyogamītsantasteṣāṃ śaraṇyamabhyayuḥ | 
vidyārājadhirājeśastetyantaṃ nirapekṣiṇaḥ || 

jarāmaraṇasaṃsāra bandhabheda vicakṣaṇāḥ | 
mudrāmaṇḍaladīkṣābhi yajanaijyā parigrahaiḥ || 

vidyāvṛtopaścaiva mantratantrāṃga nisrataiḥ | 
divyairanugrahaścānyai śuddhatatvā va bhāsibhiḥ || 

<p. 1266> 

teṣāmanugrahaṃ cakre mantramantreśvarāśśivāḥ | 
pitāmahaścāpitebhyo vāpya mahodayam || 

śaiva paramanirvāṇa kāraṇaṃ jñānamuttamam | ṛṣibhyo 
vibudhebhyaśca pitṛbhyaśca yathākramam || 

prayacchanti mahātantraṃ tantrarājaṃ mahātmanām | pitāmaha 
niyogāśca ṛṣayaḥ chinna saṃśayaḥ || 

dīkṣā vidhividhānajñāḥ manujebhyaḥ pracakṣate | 
śivendukiraṇādetat sūtramātravinissṛtam || 

pāśaughatimirāṇḍānāṃ prakāśakaraṇaṃ param | 

niśvāse īśvarī kecit kasmin gṛhāṇadeva dīkṣidā devadānavāḥ 
| 

traṣividyādharāssiddhā gandharvātsarasaḥ prabho | 
yakṣarākṣasabhūtāśca piśācoraga kiṃnarāḥ || 

guhyakāśca mahādeva krūrāśceva vināśakāḥ | stvāntena 
dīkṣitāyena devasyāsya dhruvaṃ bhavet || 

tadahaṃ śrotumicchāmi bhagavan īśvaraḥ | vijaye tu samākhyātaṃ 
tasminbrahmā tu dīkṣitaḥ || 

niśvāse tu samākhyātaṃ nandraro yatra dīkṣitaḥ | ataḥ kubera 
varuṇā yamaścaivāśvinā vapi || 

gaṇāścaiva mahābhāga rudrāścaiva tu dīkṣitāḥ | 

<p. 1267> 

siddhavidyādharāstatra tathā svāyaṃ bhuveti ca || 

nāmadvaya samākhyātaṃ dakṣādyā yatra dīkṣitāḥ | prajānāṃ 
patyaścaiva tathā brahmasutāśca ye || 

dīkṣitāśca niyuktāśca asurāścaiva santatam | (*) da rākṣasa 
gandharvāḥ piśācoraga kiṃnarāḥ || 

garuḍādyā dvijāścaiva ye ca lokeṣu saṃsthitāḥ | pañcadhā 
bhedabhinnastu āgneye yeva dīkṣitāḥ || 

mātaro yadgṛhāścaiva ye ca vighnādaye gaṇāḥ | kiraṇe hi 
samākhyātā ādityo yatra dīkṣitāḥ || 

mantra jāpena siddhāstu sarveṣāṃ sādhakāsthitāḥ | makuṭepi 
samākhyāto nidāna kṣetra vādibhiḥ || 

galāntaṃ mantrikalpaiśca ṛṣibhissevitā sadā | 

tathā śaivapurāṇe auma saṃhitāyām (-) 

labdhvā bhavataśśakrāśca śaivīndīkṣāndite sutāḥ | 
śivaliṃgārcanaikāntā jātā stripura vāsinaḥ || 

śivapūjā kṛtasteṣāṃ patyaśca patidevatāḥ | 

dīkṣottare dīkṣā prakāraḥ (-) 

saṃyojanaṃ sajjananaṃ bhogabhojanameva ca | pāśacchedestathoddhāro 
dīkṣākarmaṇi pañcadhā || 

tathā mṛgendre (-) 

pāśānāṃ samādhikārāṇāṃ bhedanaṃ śrutyasaṃbhavāt | 

<p.1268> 

dīkṣāparamaviśleṣaḥ pāśacchede nirodhanam | parāśuddhamalaṃ 
mukti vyaktiḥ paramaniṣkṛtiḥ || 

pāśasaṃghāta śakti saṃrodhiniṣkṛtam | vidhāya bhāsayeddhāma 
pākavicchittivartmanā || 

ityādyāgamapurāṇa vacanābhyāṃ dīkṣāyāmokṣaṃ na tu vaidika 
saṃskāreṇa tathā devyāmate (-) 

yatrācāra vicārosti dīkṣitānāṃ śivāgame | vaibhyante vaidikā 
mantrāstathānyā vaidikī kriyā || 

yatraiva vaidikā mantrā pradhānaṃ brāhmaṇasya tu | na 
tacchiroditaṃ śāstrantratpratyā ṛṣibhāṣitam || 

tatrāsaktānarāmūḍhā kliṣyante dvaitavādinaḥ | tetu 
saṃskāriṇo duṣṭā paśutvānmalino yataḥ || 

yatra no vaidikā mantrā ssaṃskārasya pramāṇataḥ | varṇānāṃ 
saṃskṛtānāñca viśeṣonopālbhyate || 

śivajñānasya prādhānyaṃ śivatatvasya nibhṛmaḥ | 
śivāśramāgataṃ jñānaṃ tacchāstraṃ śivasammatam || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

catvāriṃśattu saṃskārā viprādyairapyanuṣṭhitāḥ | prathamaṃ 
svāṃganāyāstu garbhādhānamanantaram || 

puṃsavanañca sīmantaṃ viṣṇobalimanantaram | 

<p. 1269> 

jātakarmantathā nāmakaraṇanniṣkrāmaṇantathā || 

anna prāśanakañcaiva pravāsagamanantathā | vai devaṃ tatotsargaṃ 
pañcatvekapa saṃskṛtiḥ || 

parāyaṇañca godānaṃ snāna mudvāhakantathā | 
aṣṭādaśaśarīrasya saṃskārāssamudīritāḥ || 

deva yajñaḥ pitṛyajño bhūtayajñastathaiva ca | manuṣyaṃ 
brahmayajñañca mahāyajñāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 

sthālīpākaścāgrāyaṇañcaitrañcāśvayujaṃ tathā | 
aṣṭakāparvaṇañcaiva saptaite pākayajñakāḥ || 

agnyāveyañca darśañca paurṇamāsyaṃ tathaiva ca | 
āgrāyaṇāṣṭakañcaivaṃ cāturmāsya manantaram || 

nirūḍhapaśubandhaśca sautrāmaṇirathāntakam | haviryajñāśca 
saptaite somasaṃsthā tathaiva ca || 

agniṣṭomotyagniṣṭoma ityaṣṣoḍaśakastathā | 
vājapeyotirātrāṇi āptoryāmamataḥ param || 

somasaṃsthā iti proktāssaptayajñā manīṣibhiḥ | catvāriṃśattu 
saṃskārā vaidikāḥ kramataḥ kriyāḥ || 

kṛtavatopyukta mārgeṇa dīkṣayā mokṣa eva hi | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

rasasiddhe yathā tāmraṃ hematvaṃ pratipadyate | 

<p. 1270> 

tathātmājñānasaṃbandhācchivatvaṃ pratipadyate || 

raurave (-) 

evaṃ śaivādhvaraṃ prāpya dīkṣāmantra samudbhavam | na 
punarjanmatāṃ yāti dīkṣito manujottamaḥ || 

bhinne dehe śivo bhūtvā śivadharma samanvitaḥ | 
śivānandamanuprāpya avibhāgāya kalpate || 

yathā samudramāsādya nadī bhraṣṭāṃbu vāhinī | 
kṣāratoyatvamāpāti tan prabhāvānmahodadheḥ || 

evaṃ vai bhinna dehātmā śivamevādhigatcchati | 
saritsamudrasaṃyogāt vibhāgo naiva jāyate || 

[iti vāmadevātmaja vedajñānaviracita dīkṣādarśa upoddhāta 
vidhiḥ] || śaivalakṣanam 

atra dīkṣā śaivācārādhīnatvāt śaivalakṣaṇamatrocyate | 
tathā vīratantre (-) 

śaivāssaptavidhājñeyāsteṣāṃ bhedaṃ śṛṇusvatha | 
anādiśaivaḥ prathamo ādiśaivo dvitīyakaḥ || 

tṛtīyantu mahāśaiva caturthaścānu śaivakaḥ | 
pañcamovāntaraśśaiva ṣaṣṭhaḥ pravara ucyate || 

saptamaścāntyaśaivaśca śaivānāṃ bheda īritaḥ | 

<p. 1271> 

anādiśaivassaśivaścādiśaivaśśivadvijaḥ || 

vipraścaiva mahāśaivaḥ kṣatriyo vaiśya eva ca | 
anuśaivaśsamākhyātaśśūdraścaivāntarasmṛtaḥ || 

svarnāṃṣaṣṭhamadhyastha kulālaḥ pāraśavastathā | 
pravarāścaiva saṃproktā antyaśaivamathocyate || 

itonyajātayo yāstu antyaśaivāstute smṛtāḥ | 
savarṇādisvarūpaśca uttaratra pradarśitaḥ || 

tatrāvadhāryatāṃ kāmike (-) 

srvānugrāhakaḥ proktassāntānika guru smṛtaḥ | sṛṣṭayanantara 
kāle ye dīkṣitāḥ śikādayaḥ || 

śivena tatkulotthāsyuśśaivāssantānikā dvijāḥ | ādiśaivāstu 
te jñeyāssarvānugrāhakā smṛtāḥ || 

ādiśaivakule jātaḥ śreṣṭhassyāt sthāpanādiṣu | 
dīkṣitāssarvamartyānāṃ pratiṣṭhāyāmathotsave || 

snapane prokṣaṇenyatra prāyaścittābhiṣecane | vyākhyānādau 
śāstrasya svārthaivāthaparārthake || 

kāraṇe (-) 

śivena dīkṣitāścaiva śivabhrāhmaṇa ucyate | 

santāne (-) 

ādiśaivena kartavyaṃ pratiṣṭhādyarcanāntakam | anyathā 
kārayedyastu ābhicārāya caiva hi || 

<p. 1272> 

suprabhede (-) 

vivāhamaṣṭadhā proktaṃ śivena paramātmanā | teṣāṃ pūrva 
catuṣkantu brāhmaṇasya mahātmanā || 

kartavyamāsūraṃ vāpi trīṇi cānyāni varjayet | suśīlāṃ 
rūpasaṃpanāṃ kulajāṃ bāndhavānvitām || 

asagotrāṃ hi kuśalāṃ vadhūṃ saṃgrāhya buddhimān | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

samānagotra pravarāṃ jñātvāsaṃbandhamācaret | 
samānagotrapravarāṃ kanyāṃ vṛṇuyātsadā || 

ūḍhā cedbhaginī yadvā matṛvatparirakṣayet | tasyāśca 
rakṣaṇaṃ kāryamāhārācchādanādibhiḥ || 

vivāhadoṣa śudhyarthaṃ vratañcāndrāyaṇaṃ caret | tayā 
sahapramādena saṃyogādyaṃ kṛtaṃ yadi || 

prāyaścittaṃ tadā tasyāntadvidhānamihocyate | sakṛtāgamane 
kuryāttena cāndrāyaṇañcaret || 

sahasraṃ ghoramantrantu vivāhe dvisahasrakam | 

ityādi tatra vistareṇa pradarśitam | tatrāvardhāyatām | 

tathā vīratantre (-) 

sagotre ca saṃbandhaṃ na kartavyaṃ kadācana | tatrāpi 
jāyamānāstu tatkulaṃ syānta bādhyate || 

<p. 1273> 

teṣāṃ ṛṣīṇāṃ viprendra jātānāñca punaḥ punaḥ | 
śivadvijānāṃ dīkṣāñca na kurvīta kadācana || 

upanītaṃ samāpyante maṇḍale pūjayecchivam | snapanaṃ 
cāṃgaśudhyarthaṃ kārayettu śivadvijān || 

dīpte (-) 

śaivaṃ pāśupatañcaiva kāpālaṃ lākulaṃ tathā | 
tantrabhedamahaṃ vakṣye śaivādināṃ yathākramam || 

kāmikaṃ yogajaṃ cintyaṃ kāraṇantvajitaṃ tathā | dīptaṃ 
sūkṣmaṃ sahasrañca aṃśumānsuprabhedakam || 

nārasiṃhañca niśvāsaṃ svāyaṃ bhuvamathānalam | rauravaṃ 
vīrabhadrañca makuṭaṃ vijayantathā || 

candrajñānañca biṃbañca prodvītālalitaṃ tathā | siddhaṃ 
santānaṃ sarvoktaṃ vātulantantra meva ca || 

kiraṇaṃ pārameśañca aṣṭāviṃśati saṃkhyayā | śaivabhedaṃ 
samākhyātaṃ śṛṇupāśupataṃ tathā || 

prājāpatyaṃ pāśupataṃ pravṛddhaṃ padmasaṃhitām | vāsiṣṭhaṃ 
kāśyapaṃ kalpaṃ vārāhaṃ bhārgavāntaram || 

praphulla vāsavañcaiva vāyuproktaṃ tathaiva ca | vāruṇaṃ 
bāhutaspatyaṃ pārameśañca ṣoḍaśa || 

māyā pāśupataṃ proktaṃ kāpālaṃ śṛṇusuvrata | 
pañcārddhañca purāklpaṃ śivaguhya pramāṇakam || 

<p. 1274> 

sūhamādarśanañcaiva padmaṃ kanakaśailakam | niruktañcaiva 
suprāpaṃ siddhārthaṃ hi caturdaśa || 

kāpālameva mākhyātaṃ lākulaṃ śṛṇucānala | lākulañca 
mahāvidyāṃ kriyākālaguṇottaram || 

varahaṃsañca kaumāraṃ viśvasārottarantathā | 
saṃvartaliṃgakalpañca navadhā bheda ucyate || 

ete caturvibhedeṣu yathā yenaiva dīkṣitaḥ | tenaiva sthāpanādīni 
tantreṇa samācaret || 

tathā kāraṇe (-) 

eteṣu śaivabhedeṣu yadā yenaiva dīkṣitāḥ | tantreṇa tena 
kartavyā sthāpanādi kriyāstathā || 

vīratantre (-) 

eteṣāmapi tantraraṇāṃ ekaikasya tu saṃkaraḥ | tantra 
saṃkaramevoktaṃ na kuryāttantra saṃkaram || 

tantrasaṃkaradoṣeṇa rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati | aṣṭāviṃśati 
bhedena śaivabhedo vidhīyate || 

eteṣāṃ saṃkarañcaiva na doṣāya prakalpate | 

kāraṇe (-) 

prārabdhaṃyena tantreṇa tattantreṇa samācaret | noktañcedanya 
tantreṇa tatsarvāṃ ca samācaret || 

anukta maviruddhañca tadgrāhyaṃ saṃhitāntarāt | 
ekenavartamānāyāṃ kriyāyāṃ kāraṇaṃ vinā || 

<p. 1275> 

sācānyena kṛtaṃ yattu tatsyādācārya saṃkaram | 
vaiguṇyākaraṇasyaiva virodhe sati yatra tu || 

sā kriyā tasya śiṣyeṇa kartavyaṃ tena śāstrataḥ | athānyena 
kṛtañcettu kartṛnāśo na saṃśayaḥ || 

suprabhede (-) 

siddhāntaṃ sarvasāraṃ hi tantraṃ śuddhaṃ śivaṃ smṛtam | 
vāmañca dakṣiṇañcaiva miśrakañca tridhā amī || 

śaiva bāhyāssamākhyātāste tu śaivaipūjitāḥ | 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

kālakāpālakādīnāṃ sarvasaṃkhyāntareṣu ca | 
śaivassarvādhikārī tu na śaivemī kathañcana || 

śaivamūlātyāgamastu śrutayaśca viśeṣataḥ | 

tathā makuṭe (-) 

śaivassarvādhikārī syāt svakīye cāpasra ca | anyeṣāṃ 
svasvatantreṣe vidyatetvadhikāritā || 

[iti śrīmadvayādhrapuranivāsi vāmadevātmaja vedajñāni viracita 
dīkṣā darśe lakṣaṇa vidhiḥ] | 

<p. 1276> 

|| [athācārya lakṣaṇavidhirucyate] || 

ācārya lakṣaṇam 

bhīmasaṃhitāyām (-) 

ācārya lakṣaṇaṃ jñeyaṃ āditassarvakāraṇam | ācāryamūlaṃ 
sarvaṃ hi sthāpanādi ca karma ca || 

tasmāttallakaṣaṇaṃ pūrvaṃ prekṣitavyaṃ viśeṣataḥ | yadā 
lakṣaṇa hīnena sthāpanenograbuddhinā || 

tena karmakṛtañcettu tatradeśādyupadravaḥ | 
tasmāttallakṣaṇayuktena kārayetpūjanādikam || 

ācāryeṇa prasannena viśiṣṭena viśeṣaṭaḥ | ācāryasya 
viśiṣṭasya lakṣaṇāni śubhāni ca || 

sarveṣvevāgameṣvevaṃ kīrtyate kīrtikāraṇāt | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

nirvāṇadīkṣitaśśiṣyo gurusaṃsṛṣṭi yogikaḥ | 
parārthaliṃgapūjāyā adhikāro na vidyate || 

kāraṇe (-) 

kumārī himavanmadhya pūtaṃ kṛṣṇa mṛgodbhavam | jātastatrādi 
daivaśca ācāryavara ucyate || 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

kṛṣṇavarṇamṛgo yasmin devo sañcarate (**) | 

<p. 1277> 

taddeśāyājñikaṃ vidyāt yadvadviprairadhiṣṭhitaḥ | yatra 
viprāssadācārā yatayaśca tapodhanāḥ || 

santidevāstathā devā puṇyadeśāntarādiśet | 
taddeśakulasaṃbhūta ācāryāśśāstrasammatāḥ || 

tathā kāmike (-) 

āyāvartodbhavaśrīmān sarvalakṣaṇasaṃmitaḥ | 
yatraviprāssadācārā yatayaśca tapodhanāḥ || 

santi vedāstathā vedā āryāvarta iti smṛtāḥ | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

taddeśa yājñikaṃ vidyāt yaccaviprairanuṣṭhitam | 

jñānaratnāvalyāṃ (-) 

gaṃgāravo mahītāpi gautamī ca sarasvatī | yamunā kṛṣṇaveṇī 
ca kāverī gaṇḍakī tathā || 

gautamī sarayussindhurddeviketi caturdaśa | puṇya nadyastu 
vijñeyāssarvalokahitāvahāḥ || 

mahadbhirmunibhissaṃvyā yājñikaiśca tapodhanaiḥ | (*) 
valiṃgaisvayaṃ bhūtairmunideva prakīrṇakaiḥ || 

tattīraṃ saṃbhavā deśā puṇyadeśāmatāssatām | 

suprabhede (-) 

ādiśaiva kulodbhūtā pañcagocara saṃsthitāḥ | 

<p. 1278> 

sarvaśāstrārtha tatvajñaśśivajñāna viśāradaḥ | 
śivasiddhānta tatvajña śivāgnigurupūjakaḥ || 

(***) ṣṣoḍaśakādūrdhvaṃ vayassaptatirucyate | 
kriyādijñānaparyanta mekatantre suniścitaḥ || 

kiryāpāde tu nipuṇaścaryāpāde tu vartitaḥ | 
yogapādakṛtābhyāso jñānapādānurañjakaḥ || 

mataṃge (-) 

tantre svāsanāsūyaścakarmajñaḥ kṛtatatparaḥ | 
anujñātābhiṣiktāśca tetvanugrāhikā smṛtāḥ || 

tathā parākhye (-) 

ataraddhikriyopeto vaivarṇe uttamo guruḥ | 
śraddadhānaśśucirdakṣastrīdīkṣādīkṣitassudhīḥ || 

śāstrādhikārī tatvajñastaduttara vidhānavit | 
ṣaḍadhvakarmanipuṇaścaṇḍayāgavidhau varaḥ || 

abhiṣeka vidhānajñastā na pūjāgnikarmavit | 

santāne (-) 

śivāgamajño matimān śivapūjāparāyaṇaḥ | śivadhyānaparo 
nityaṃ śivaśāstra viśāradaḥ || 

caturthe taiṣṇaḍaṃgaiśca dharmaśāstra purāṇagaḥ | 
nyāyamīṃmāsa śāstrajño vidyāsthāna caturdaśa || 

bhāṣyaṃ catvāra evantu tathāṣṭādaśa saṃjñitam | 

<p. 1279> 

yogaśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi vedāntaṃ jyotiṣaṃ tathā || 

catuṣṣaṣṭhi kalāścaiva ṣaṭkarmaṇi tathaiva ca | ārvedotha 
sāmudrayaṃ somasiddhāntameva ca || 

kevalaṃ lākulañcaiva pāñcarātraṃ tathaiva ca | 
etatsiddhāntamārgañca jñātvā vaideśiko bhavet || 

kāmike (-) 

saṃpradāya viśuddhātmā guruputraḥ praśaṃsitaḥ | 
liṃgādikṣamavettā ca vibhakta (********) || 

kāmikādi śivajñānasiddhiyukto viśāradaḥ | 

mataṃge (-) 

heyopādeya tatvajñestadarthetu vyavasthitaḥ | kriyāvānipuṇaścaiva 
vītarāgotyamatsaraḥ || 

varatatve samāyuktaśśivaśāsanatatparaḥ | 
sarvajñāstrārthakuśalaḥ paśuśāstra parāṅmukhaḥ || 

śivaśāstraika cittatmā sarvaprāṇa hiterataḥ | vāstu 
vidyākṛtābhyāsaśśālyoddhāraviśāradaḥ || 

sarvācārasamāyuktastapasvajana vatsalaḥ | 

raurave (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ puṇyadeśokthassaṃpūrṇāvayavaśśuciḥ | padavākya 
pramāṇajñassaṃhitā pārago guruḥ || 

lakṣadhyāyī guruśreṣṭho bhuktimukti phalapradaḥ | madhyamastu 
tadarthajñastatpādajño yamo bhavet || 

saṃhitāpārago vātha lakṣādhyāyyupadeśa yuk | 

<p. 1280> 

saṃhitāsyāccatuṣpāda yuktā kāmikapūrvikā || 

tathā kiraṇe vyākhyāne rāmakarṇācāryeṇātyuktam (-) 

pādānāṃ pravibhāgena caturṇāṃ nāmadheyataḥ | siddhiḥ 
pradarśyate yasmin saṃhitā sābhidhīyate || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

jñānayogakriyācaryā samyagācārayedyataḥ | tasmādārcāya 
ityuktassarvabhūta hitāyavai || 

āvinotīhi śāstrārthānācārāṃ sthāpayatyataḥ | svayamācarate 
yasmāt tasmādācārya ucyate || 

tathā niśvāse (-) 

svayamācarate yasmādācārandarśayeti ca | ucyatepi hi śastrāṇi 
ācāryastena paṭhyate || 

kālottare (-) 

sarvalakṣaṇahīnopi śivaśāstrārtha vidguruḥ | sthāpanādiṣu 
saproktaśśivaśāstreṣu ṣaṇmukha || 

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannaśśivaśastraṃ na vindati | na yogī na 
vratasnāto nāvācārya ucyate || 

niśvāse (-) 

ācāryo mantra tantrajña ūhāpoha viśāradaḥ | śrutismṛtā 
vabhijñaśca jitakrodho jitendriyaḥ || 

<p. 1281> 

sarvakleśa saho dhīro mantratantra mahāhṛdaḥ | mantra kalpasu 
vettā ca prāyaścittaviśāradaḥ || 

paśūṃ bodhayate nityaṃ śaucācārā padeśataḥ | sarvalakṣaṇa 
hīnopi jñānavān gururiṣyate || 

devikālottare (-) 

sarvalakṣaṇahīnopi jñānavāngururiṣyate | varṇāvarṇa 
vicāroyaḥ sa naraḥ pātakī bhavet || 

śivaśāstraika cittātmā paśuśāstra parāṅmukhaḥ | anugrahaika 
cittastu vinītātmā vimatsaraḥ || 

pratijñā karmavitprājño dīkṣākarmasupeśalaḥ | śivasadbhāva 
tatvajñassa eva sthāpaka smṛtaḥ || 

vīratantre (-) 

liṃgasthāpana yogyatvāt sthāpako nāma ucyate | ācāryaśśiva 
evāha śiva ācārya ucyate || 

abhedaṃ yo vijānādi sa varṇādbhinna ucyate | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

ācāryaśśiva eva syādanaghorantarannahi | yaḥ paśye 
danayordbhedaṃ so yo gatimāpnuyāt || 

niśvāse (-) 

ubhayorantaraṃ nāsti deśikasya śivasya tu | savokāra vi (**) 
ścasanādodaya niṣkalaḥ || 

<p.1282> 

tasminsarvāṇi vidyante sacaivaca paraśśivaḥ | sarvavidyāsu 
saṃpūrṇassarva vidhārthakovidaḥ || 

ācāryasya ca mantrasya śivajñānasya śivasya ca | nānātvaṃ neva 
kurvanti ananteścādayaśivāḥ || 

sarve mantrātmakā devā sarvemantrātmakāśśivāḥ | śivātmakena 
mantreṇa śivayāge tu pūjayet || 

aprāpya śivabhāvaṃ paṭhantaśśiva saṃhitām | ajñātvā kurute 
dīkṣāṃ śiṣyācāryau vrajatyadhaḥ || 

aviditvā svayaṃ samyag kriyāṃ yaḥ kurutebhiṣak | āturo 
duḥkhamāpnoti vaidyopi na phalaṃ labhet || 

jñānavijñānakuśalassarvā vasthāṃgatopi yaḥ | sa mocayati 
pāśebhyo jñānanirdhūtakilbiṣaḥ || 

tathā kriyā karmakāṇḍe (-) 

saddeśa prabhavassumūrtiramala jñānakriyā tatparaḥ | 
kṣāntassatkulajo viśuddhahṛdayassiddhānta vedī gṛhī || 

bhedajñaśca ṣaṭhaddhanāmapi tathā dīkṣā pratiṣṭhā vidhau 
siddhassidhyanapekṣakaśśivamayadhyāno guruśśiṣyate | 

atrādhikārinirūpaṇatva vidhirucyate (-) viprādīnāṃ daśānāṃ 
gurutvamuktam | tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

viprādiṣu yajurveṣa manulomādiṣaṭsu ca | 

<p. 1283> 

eteṣāṃ daśajātīnāṃ ācāryatvaṃ vidhīyate || 

tathā kāmike (-) 

catvāro brāhmaṇādyāśca anulomāśca ye matāḥ | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

brahmakṣatriyaviṭśreṣṭhā dīkṣāmadhyāstu pādajāḥ | 
trivarṇikātkramāt martya adhamāstvanya jātinām || 

dīkṣānaiva vidhātavyaḥ kuryāccellobhato guruḥ | narakaṃ 
yātyanenaiva dīkṣito na phalaṃ labhet || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

navakhaṇḍeṣu sarveṣu bhārateṣu yena ca | jātibhedamidaṃ 
kalpyamanyadeśeṣu nāstitat || 

tasmāt ṣaṭkalpanāmātraṃ jātibhedamiti kramam | uccanīca 
kramādatra jātibhedañca kalpitam || 

suprabhede (-) 

savarṇa prathamaṃ vidyāt aṃbaṣṭhadvitīyakramam | 
pāraśaivastṛtīyastu jāyante brāhmaṇodbhavāḥ || 

madgurutyugranāmā ca jāyete tau nṛpasya tu | vaiśyasya cūcūko 
jñeyā anulomāṣṣaḍaiva tu || 

saṃprāpyavidhinā vipro raktakanyāṃ samantrakam | tatra 
jātassavarṇastu anulomeṣu pūjitaḥ || 

<p. 1284> 

tat brāhmaṇastu saṃjñeyo vaikarmā catharvaṇa smṛtaḥ | pītastrī 
viprasaṃyogādaṃbaṣṭho nāma ucyate || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

dvijo nopanitaṃ kuryānnityaṃ karmasu tatparaḥ | savarṇaśca 
niyogena bhiṣak kuryāttataḥ param || 

viprasya śūdrakanyāyāṃ jātaḥ pāraśavaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
gulaśāstoktamārgeṇa bhadrakālīṃ samarcayet || 

gṛhe gṛhe parāhne tu bhikṣāndehīti vādayet | evaṃ 
samācarennityaṃ yāvadāmaraṇāntikam || 

nṛpasya viaśyakanyāyāṃ jāto madgururucyate | nṛpabhāṇḍā na 
kartṛtvaṃ vaiśyaṃ pratyupajīvanam || 

nṛpasya śūdrakanyāyāṃ jātaścogra iti smṛtaḥ | 
viprakṣatriyaviṭchūdraśuśrūṣāṃ kārayetsadā || 

nṛpājñayā tu daṇḍayeta daṇḍayedavi cārataḥ | 

suprabhede (-) 

kṛṣṇāyāṃ vītasaṃyogājjātaścūcuka eva ca | śāka kāṣṭha 
tṛṇādīni vanyajātīva vṛttikāḥ || 

brāhmaṇā kṣatriyā vaiśyāśśūdrāśśuddhakulodbhavāḥ | 
ācāryāste tu vijñeyā nānyeṣāntu kadācana || 

tatraiva jātinirṇaye (-) 

<p. 1285> 

brāhmaṇā kṣatriyā vaiśyāśśūdrāścaivaṃ prakīrtitāḥ | 
eteṣāñca kurvāṇānāmācāryatve niyojayet || 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vaiśyaśśūdrāśśuddhāstu sāyakāḥ | 
sarvasyādānupūrvyeṇa ācāryatvaṃ ṣaḍānana || 

parākhye (-) 

sarvavarṇānato vipraḥ kṣatriyastritayaṃ guruḥ | vaiśya 
śūdradvayañcaiva dīkṣayedahakriyārthavit || 

brāhmaṇassarva jātīnāṃ sadānugrāhakasmṛtaḥ | svajāti 
pūrvamācāryāstrayaśśeṣā nṛpādayaḥ || 

triṣu varṇeṣu ye yuktāste ca tadvarṇino matāḥ | dīkṣā kāryā 
tu sarveṣāṃ tadbhaktaśivayoginām || 

trayāṇāmapivarṇānāṃ na tu śūdrāntyajātiṣu | etatparākhyokta 
vacanamasat śūdraviṣayameva || 

tathoktaṃ vāyavya saṃhitāyāṃ (-) 

asacchūdrāntya jātīnāṃ patitānāṃ viśeṣataḥ | tathā 
saṃkarajātīnāṃ nādhvaśuddhirvidhīyate || 

tetyakṛtrimabhāvāścet śivaparamakāraṇe | pādodaka 
pradānādyaiḥ kuryātpāśaviśodhanam || 

atrānulomajātaye yuktāye vā dvijātiṣu | 

<p. 1286> 

teṣāmadhva viśudhyādi kāryamātra kulocitam || 

suprabhede (-) 

amadyapāstu ye śūdrā śśaivācāryakriyādaśaḥ | 
śivabhaktāścaye teṣāṃ dīkṣākāryānyathā nahi || 

tathā parākhye ca (-) 

amadyapaḥ kulīnaśca nityaṃ dharma parāyaṇaḥ | śūdrakṣatriyavat 
jñeyaśśeṣā nindyāstato bhṛśam || 

vāyavya samhitāyām (-) 

śivaśāstra samāyuktāḥ paśuśāstraparāṅmukhāḥ | brāhmaṇādi 
caturvarṇā ācāryāstu prakīrtitāḥ || 

kālottare (-) 

dīkṣā kriyāvati proktā brāhmaṇādi catuṣṭaye | 
saṃsparśātkārukādīnāṃ hautrintu parivarjayet || 

evañcānugrahaḥ kāryaścatubhirapi deśikaiḥ | 

kāmike (-) 

ityevaṃ kathitā proktā sarvapāva pramocinī | catvāro vidyā 
anulomāśca ye matāḥ || 

nyāyajā mūḍhajātyāṃ vā dīkṣāyāmadhikāriṇaḥ | 
antyajānāṃ na hautrī syāt kiṃtu dīkṣāṃtu cākṣuṣī || 

kiraṇe garuḍaḥ (-) 

<p. 1287> 

madhye varṇacatuṣkasya gurutvaṃ kasyacidvada | 

īśvaraḥ (-) 

caturṇāmapi varṇānāṃ ācāryatvamihoctyate | brāhmaṇādi 
catuṣkasya dvijonugrahako mataḥ || 

trayāṇāṃ kṣatriyo dvabhyāṃ vaiśyaśśūdrassvayonitaḥ | 
anugrahassvabhāryāderyo yathā parivarjayet || 

evañcānugrahaḥ kāryaścaturbhirapi deśikaiḥ | nirapekṣā yato 
mantro yathā tadbhāvanā tathā || 

yathā sthitena bhāvena mantrāḥ kurvantyanugraham | yatastenāntya 
jasyāpi kintu dīkṣātu mānasī || 

kārukāṇāñca saṃsparśānna hautrī parikalpayet | jñātvā 
teṣāṃ parāṃ bhaktiṃ lobhācceddoṣa māpnuyāt || 

sūtasaṃhitāyām (-) 

anyeṣāmapi sarveṣāṃ narāṇāmapi puṃgava | 
pūjādevālayandṛṣṭvā praṇāmastasya kīrtitaḥ || 

vātule (-) 

andhajātistu sarveṣāṃ sthūpindṛṣṭvā samācaret | 

aṃśumati (-) 

sthūlaliṃgaṃ vimānañca sūkṣmaliṃgaṃ sadāśivam | balipīṭhaṃ 
bhadraliṃgañca liṃgatrayamihocyate || 

sūkṣme (-) 

dehaṃ prāsādamityuktaṃ dehīliṃgamiti smṛtam | ubhayorantaraṃ 
nāsti tasmāditthaṃ prabhāvayet || 

<p. 1288> 

vyāpya vyāpakarūpeṇa liṃgameva vimānakam | hemādi sthūpi 
paryantaṃ śivarūpamitismṛtam || 

kiraṇe (-) 

sarva pāpavināśāya bhajedveṣaṃ śivālayam | 

mataṃge (-) 

liṃga māheśvaraṃ prītyā namaskāreṇa yetyatha | pūjayanti 
narāśśūdrāsteṣi ṣaḍgaṇeśvarāḥ || 

ramanti vividhairbhogai prāpyasthānamumāpateḥ | śivavat 
śivabhaktāstu raṣṭavyāśśivakāṃkṣibhiḥ || 

saṃsthitāśca śivairmantrairguruṇāṃ śivamūrtinā | sarve 
samānadharmāṇastathāpyeṣocyate vidhaḥ || 

atra prakṛtamucyate kāmike (-) 

sarvadevārcane viprastvādiśaivo gururmataḥ | viprādayastrayo 
varṇā dīkṣāyāṃ sthāpanepi ca || 

brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyādīnāṃ kṣatriyaśśūdravaiśyayoḥ | vaiśya 
śśūdrasya dīkṣāyāṃ svasvajātāvapīṣyate || 

tathā ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

caturṇāmapi varṇānāṃ ācāryatvamihoditam | sarveṣāñcaiva 
varṇānāṃ dvijonugrāhako mataḥ || 

trayāṇāṃ kṣatriyodvābhyāṃ vaiśyaśśūdrassvayonije | 
evañcānugrahaḥ kāryaścaturbhirapi deśikaiḥ || 

viprādi trayāṇāmātmārtha calaliṃga 
pratiṣṭhāyāmadhikārostīti (-) 

<p. 1289> 

śūdro naiṣṭhikaścet bāṇaliṃga pratiṣṭhāyā madhikāri kāmike 
(-) 

svārtheṣṭau calaliṃgasya pratiṣṭhāyāṃ trayastvime | śūdropi 
śūdradīkṣāyāṃ svārthe calaliṃgake || 

bāṇaliṃgekṣaṇe vāpi sthāpako yadinaiṣṭhikaḥ | 
sanādākhilamantreṣu śivajñāne viśeṣataḥ || 

śūdrasyāpi gṛhasthasya nityeṣṭāveva yogyatā | atrāpi 
nādarahitairmantraireva prakīrtitāḥ || 

kecinnādaśabdasya praṇavamiti vadanti tadayuktam hakarasya nāda iti 
śrūyate | tathā kāraṇe (-) 

nādo hakāramityuktaṃ nādādyantu sakārakam | krūrākṣaro 
kṣakārasyāt kalārṇantu makārakamiti || 

tayā mantra naikaṇḍūkairatyuktam | 

gaganaṃ makuṭava sūryaṃ vyomamāyā śivāntaṃ nabhasi lakula 
lakṣaṃ pañcadhaṃ prāṇaghoṣam | śiva hṛddayamapi 
hṛdbījanādākhyamāhuśśiva manubhuvaneśoniṃbaraṃ liṃgamāhuḥ 
|| 

kāmikebhiṣeketyayogyoyaṃ kiṃ puna sthānādiṣu | atra śūdrasya 
gṛhasthasyābhiṣeka niṣedhaḥ | ācāryābhiṣeka prasaṃge (-) 

mahāpurasya saumyāyāmabhiṣiñcet dvijānatha | pūrvāyāṃ 
kṣatriyāṃ brahman vaiśyānāntu yamasya tu || 

śūdrastu paścimeśāyāṃ sarvā aiśediksthitān | 

<p. 1290> 

evaṃ prakathito brahman pauṣkare pārameśvare || 

tathā kālottare (-) 

abhiṣiktoya mevaṃ hi brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyothavā | vaiśyo vāpyatha 
śūdro vā pratiṣṭhādyadhikāriṇaḥ || 

eteṣu na vikalpoyaṃ kartavyaṃ sthānmanīṣibhiḥ | śrāvayeti 
tathā dhyāyet pratipattiṃ samāviśet || 

iti gṛhasthasya śūdrasyābhiṣeka pratipādanāt na cāsya vacanasya 
naiṣṭhikaviṣayaśūdratva masttviti vācyam | 

caturṇāmapi varṇānāṃ liṃgināṃ gṛhiṇāmapi | 

ācāryatvaṃ śive nāsti siddhānte 
pratipāditamityādivacanaissarvavarṇeṣvapi brahmacāri 
gṛhasthayorgurutvapratipādakairvirodhāt | tasmādevaṃ 
vidhabahuvacanānusāreṇa kāmikasthagṛhastha śūdrābhiṣeka 
niṣedhavacanantasya sthāpanāniṣedhapratipādakasya tadetadyadi 
kaimudikanyāyena sādhakamityavaśyamabhyupeyam | nanu caturṇāmapi 
varṇānāṃ gurutvaṃ tadanupapannam | brāhmaṇasyaivācāryatva 
pratipādakavacanādupālaṃbhāt | yathā merutantre (-) 

atra kiñcidviśeṣosti kṣatriyo vaiśya śūdrakāt | eteṣu 
sarvadādepi dīkṣāṃ naiva samācaret || 

kṣatriyeṇa dīkṣitāḥ kecit kecidvaiśyena dīkṣitāḥ | 

<p. 1291> 

kecicchūdreṇa deveśi dīkṣitāśca yamālayam || 

gatvā janmaśataṃ koṭi viśantinarake dhurvam | tasmādvedā 
viruddhasyāddīkṣāṃ viprasya kārayet || 

mokṣakārikāyām (-) 

sādhakatve tu dīkṣāyāṃ caturṇāṃ varṇināmiha | adhikāro 
gurutve tu brāhmaṇasyaiva kīrtitaḥ || 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

athācāryavaraśrīmān agrajanmāsupeśalaḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

dvijāgraṃ puṇyadeśajamiti | atha caturṇāṃ varṇānāṃ 
gurutvamiti cenmaiva metāni vacanāni brāhmaṇasya gurutve mukhyatva 
pratipādakāni netaravarṇagurutvaniṣedha parāṇi | na caturhi 
kṣatriyādisakāśādadīkṣitasya nirayagāmitva śravanaṃ kathamiti 
vācyam (-) tasyāpi vacanasya viprāsaṃbhave 
itarasakāśādadīkṣāniṣedhaparatvaṃ nikṛṣṭavarṇā dutkṛṣṭa 
varṇasya dīkṣā niṣedhaparatvaṃ vā anyathā 
sarvavarṇavarṇānāṃ svavarṇānu pūrvyeṇācāryasaṃbhava 
pratipādakavacanānāmaprāmāṇya 
prasaṃgāttasmādubhayavacanaprāmāṇyaṃ vyatyāyā brāhmaṇasya 
sarvasya svavarṇeṣvapi mukhya gurutvam (-) kṣatriyādīnāmapi 
brāhmaṇāsaṃbhave svavarṇānu pūrvyeṇācāryatva mityapi 
vyavatyavasthā sarvairabhyu pehveti evameva sarvapaddhati 
kṛdbhirācāryai rapi vyavāsthāpya pratipāditaḥ | 

<p. 1292> 

kiraṇe (-) 

sarvānugrāhakaḥ proktaśśivaḥ paramakāraṇaḥ | dvijādayastu ye 
varṇānyūnādhika tayā sthitāḥ || 

saṃskāropi yaddevāt phalamevaṃ nakiṃ bhavet | saṃskāro 
vāmatasteṣāṃ nyūnadhikatayā katham || 

bhagavan (-) 

na jāterna śarīrasya saṃskāraḥ prāṇino mataḥ | yadi jāte 
ssacai kasmin dīkṣa (********) || 

prāptajantena na jātestvakalatvānta tato mṛtaḥ | 
cinmātrānugrahaḥ proktassarvānugrāhakaśśivaḥ || 

āśramacatuṣke brahmacārī gṛhasthāśramayorgurutvaṃ na 
vānaprastha sanyāsinoḥ | taduktaṃ sarvajñānottare (-) 

dvāvevāśramiṇau gṛhastha brahmacāriṇau | lokānugrahakartārau 
parivrāṭtāpasau nahi || 

tathā kālottare (-) 

gṛhasthassarva varṇeṣu śreṣṭho gururudāhṛtaḥ | 
naiṣṭhikastvadhamo jñeyo bhautikastu viśeṣataḥ || 

vānaprastha vatīnāntu gurutvaṃ neṣyate sadā | 

saṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

śṛṇuṣaṇmukha tatvena bhogamokṣau yathāsthitam | 
brahmacārīgṛhasthaśca (****) deśikottamaḥ || 

<p. 1293> 

dīkṣā pratiṣṭhayoretau bhavāvapyadhikāriṇaḥ | kintu mokṣaika 
yuktānāṃ vibhūtirvimukhātmanām || 

brahmacārī gururjñeyo gṛhasthaścadvidhāstviha | 
pūrvavarṇāśramāṇāṃ hi svesve karmaṇi tiṣṭhatām || 

upāyana tatvājñānānāmmokṣassādhāraṇa smṛtaḥ | yatīnāntu 
yadarthantu gṛhasthairathamātṛke || 

gṛhastha eva tairevadhājñārthibhirupāsate | gṛhasthāditareṣāntu 
nāstibhogādhikāritā || 

tasmāgṛhī guru kāryo bhogamokṣobhayārthibhiḥ | 

tathā santāne (-) 

gṛhasthaścottamo vidhāt brahmacārī yathā bhavet | 
kriyādijñānaparyantamekatantre dṛḍhaśśuciḥ || 

kaśmīratantre (-) 

raktavarṇakyandehamuttamaṃ śyāmamadhyamam | 
sarvakṛṣṇamayandehannayedruka nahi kṣaṇāt || 

suprabhede (-) 

gṛhasthaścottamo jñeyo bhautikabrahmacāryapi | 

vīratanrtre (-) 

gṛhasthaścottamaṃ vidyādathavā brahmacāriṇam | 
sāntānikagṛhīśreṣṭho gṛhasthasstadabhāvanaḥ || 

bhautike brahmacārī vā deśiko gṛhamedhinām | 

<p. 1294> 

naiṣṭhiko naiṣṭhikeṣu syāt bhuktimuktikramānmataḥ || 

kiraṇe sāntānikalakṣaṇamuktam | 

yastu pūrvāśramasthopi saṃskṛtaśśivadīkṣayā | 
santānamapyasantānamarpayantyadhikāriṇī || 

sapūrvāparasantāna dharmabhāvabhayāntakaḥ | santānika guruḥ 
proktaḥ gṛhastho deśikottamaḥ || 

gṛhasthaṃ cottamaṃ vidyādathavā brahmacāriṇam | gṛhastho deśika 
śreṣṭho bhogamokṣaprasiddhaye || 

kāmike (-) 

sṛṣṭayanantarakāle ye dīkṣitāḥ kauśikādayaḥ | śivena 
tatkulotthā syuśśaivāssāntānikastviti || 

sāntāniko guruśreṣṭho gṛhasthastadabhāvataḥ | bhautiko 
brahmacārī vā deśiko gṛhamedhinām || 

naiṣṭhiko naiṣṭhikeṣu syāt bhuktimukti kramānmataḥ | bhuktimukti 
prasiddhayarthaṃ gṛhastho gururiṣyate || 

sarvānugrāhakaḥ prokta ssāntānika gurussadā | anulomakramādvā 
syāt pratilomastu neṣyate || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

naiṣṭhiko naiṣṭhikāṃścaiva gṛhasthāndīkṣayedguruḥ | 
bhautukastu gṛhasthāśca nānyo dīkṣāṃ samācaret || 

śaivasanyāsadīpikāyām | 

<p. 1295> 

bhāvadravyasya satyāge tena sanyāsino yadā | 
dīkṣāsthāpanayostasmādetenaivādhikāriṇaḥ || 

tathāpi guravo jñeyāssanyastānāṃ pradarśane | 

kriyāsārapaddhatyām (-) 

tato yo naiṣṭhikācārya svasvajātipurassarān | mumukṣūnapi 
sanyāstu dīkṣayedavilaṃbitam || 

dīkṣāṃ karoti kṛpayā jantūnāṃ bhuktimuktaye | gururevaṃ 
vidhaḥ khyātaśśiva vatpūjayetsadā || 

dīkṣā pratiṣṭhā yatkiñcittena pālyaṃ prayatnataḥ | 
dīkṣopadeśakṛdyasmāt gurubhistana prakīrtitaḥ || 

vyākhyānaṃ kurute puṃsāṃ deśikastena labhyate | vyākhyā 
pūjāpratiṣṭhādi karoti bhavināṃ sadā || 

ācāryaḥ kathyate paraśiṣyopadeśataḥ | ityevaṃ trividhaṃ 
proktaṃ ācāryatvamihārthataḥ || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

raktamayaṃ deha uttamaṃ śyāmamadhyamam | sarvakṛṣṇamayaṃ dehaṃ 
nayedgururna ca kṣaṇāt || 

viśeṣauktastadyathā (-) 

viprādiṣu caturṣveva manulomādiṣaṭsu ca | ateṣāṃ 
daśajātīnāṃ ācāryatvaṃ vidhīyate || 

<p. 1296> 

lokānuṣṭhānavaśāttattajjāti bhedañca nirdiśet | jātyācāreṇa 
nānyeṣāṃ vacanasya ca gauravāt || 

deśe tetvanyajātīnāṃ abhiṣekaṃ na kārayet | 
patitānānyavekṣyaiva śivāgni na vidhīyataḥ || 

tasmādyateśca kartavyaṃ śaivamārge viśeṣataḥ | 
ācāryāṇāñcavai yatīnāṃ kiñcidantaram || 

parahiṃsayatīnāñca tapassanyāsināñcaye | anayoragnikāryeṣu 
yogyatvaṃ na vidhīyate || 

homaṃvinā tayorevamabhiṣekaṃ vidhīyate | 

[iti śrī vyāghrapuranivāsi vāmadevātmaja vedajñānaviracita 
dīkṣādarśe ācāryalakṣaṇavidhiḥ] || || [atha varjyagurulakṣaṇa 
vidhirucyate] || 

varjyaguru lakṣaṇam 

tathā cintyaviśve śrīnandikeśvaraḥ (-) 

bhagavandeva deveśa kiṃnāmācārya lakṣaṇam | 
vadasvalokarakṣārtha masmākañca viśeṣataḥ || 

īśvaraḥ kāmike (-) 

kāmīkādi śivajñānaṃ vedārthajñānameva ca | samaṃ yo manyate 
mohāttaṃ prayatnenavarjayet || 

<p. 1297> 

devayajñastathāṃṣaṣṭha mūhāpoha vivarjitam | samānagotra 
saṃbandhaṃ kusumākṣañca varjayet || 

parivettā parivittā ca devalañca punarbhavam | abhakṣya 
bhakṣaṇañcaiva kuṇḍabhasmāṃkurantathā || 

(**) vāṃgamadattañca ārūḍhapatanaṃ tathā | alasaṃ prakṣālanaṃ 
caiva prāśyaṃ veśyāpatiṃ tathā || 

asat śāstraparaṃ klībaṃ śaktiṃ sutakaṃ tathā | 
asavyasaninaṃpāradārikaṃ bṛṣalīpatim || 

citrakaṃ gāyakañcaiva (**) kañca vivarjayet | anyāyena śiva (**) 
hāriṇaṃ haradūṣitam || 

alpavidyāmāhiṣakaṃ virūpañca vivarjayet | gurvājñālaṃdhanaṃ 
cāpi paridoṣavicārakaḥ || 

andhaṃ kāṇañca paṃkuñca tathā danturameva ca | kāṇaṃ 
kekaraviṃkañca bhrūśmaśruñca mūrdhajam || 

mahodaraṃ bṛhatkukṣiṃ pūtivaktraṃ vivarjayet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vijñānadīkṣā rahito gururbhaktivivarjitaḥ | īrṣyābhilāṣī ca 
sarvadravyābhilāṣitaḥ || 

guruśuśrūṣaṇāhīno gurunindāsamanvitaḥ | guroriṣṭakārī ca 
jyeṣṭhanmantra samānakaḥ || 

<p. 1298> 

krodhalobhajalonmeṣa (*) śūnyaḍaṃbhaveṣakaḥ | anyato 
hiṃsakolubdhasteyo mūrkhopavādakaḥ || 

capalaṃ karakaṃ duṣṭakṣudrakarmaparigrahī | ahaṃ 
kārīkṛtaghnaśca samayācāradūṣakaḥ || 

jānayoga vinirmukta kṣayakuṣṭhādi rogavān | (**) rtako 
viṣayāsakto duśśīlaḥ kai (**) thā || 

corājñānī ca durmārgī bhakṣako durmukhastathā | svayaṃ 
bhuvāyanaṣṭavratāśca varjyāste tathoktam || 

śivadīkṣā vidhānastu śāstravān tīvrapāvakaḥ | śivādīn 
pūjayennityaṃ svamū (**) ruśalayam || 

anyaliṃgaṃ parityajya (**) gaṃ sarvamāśrayet | sapunarbhūriti 
vijñeyastajjātā kaulikā matā || 

tavato guravo jñeyā yathā dāvācāra pālakāḥ | ācāryāttu 
paribhraṣṭāstyājyāste bhāgnannaliṃgak || 

bhagravratā samu (***) sau bhasmāṃ kurasmṛtaḥ | (*) jjātā (*) nti 
rājñeyā stajjātāḥ kauśikā smṛtāḥ || 

dīkṣā sthāpanayorete santyājyāśśubhakāṃkṣibhiḥ | etaiḥ 
pratiṣṭhitaṃ liṃgaṃ bhuktimuktyorasādhanam || 

evamādi guṇairyukto na pūjyo hi mahītale | asyaivācārya 
nāmatvamabhiṣekaṃ na kārayet || 

<p.1299> 

pramādādabhiṣekantu kṛtañceddoṣabhāk bhavet | 

suprabhede (-) 

īdṛśānvarjayitvā tu sarvakarma bahiṣkṛtaḥ | yadi mohena kurvīta 
sānnidhyaṃ na kadācana || 

vīratantre (-) 

etaistu lakṣaṇairhīnaḥ pūrṇāṃgo muktipādapi | 

[iti vyāghrapuranivāsi vāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita 
dīkṣādarśe varjyagurulakṣaṇa vidhiḥ] || || [atha śiṣya 
lakṣaṇamucyate] || 

śiṣyalakṣaṇam 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa śiṣyāṇāñcaiva lakṣaṇam | 
ahiṃsāsatyamasteya krodhalobhāvivarjitaḥ || 

sahiṣṇururjitastattatsarvakleśa vivarjitaḥ | 

tathoktaṃ pauṣkare (-) 

pareṣu duḥkhānutpādo hiṃsādrohaśatairapi | sā na hiṃseti 
vijñeyā sā hiṃsā śāstracoditā || 

ātvato bhītito vāpi nātathyaṃ satyamucyate | 

ityādi tatra draṣṭavyam | 

śīmadraurave (-) 

brāhmaṇo vrata saṃpanno kṣatriye dharmapārake | vaiśye ca 
satkiryā yukte śūdreśuśrūṣaṇānvite || 

<p. 1300> 

gurudīkṣāṃ prakurvīta śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā | 

taduktaṃ pauṣkare (-) 

(*) nopavāsa tīrthānāṃ śrutādhyayanayorapi | śraddhayā karaṇaṃ 
puṃsāṃ śuśrūṣāṃ parikīrtitaḥ || 

kāraṇe (-) 

cātuvarṇotpavān śiṣyān tathā caivānulomajān | 

surabhede ca (-) 

anulomāśca ṣaṭ proktāḥ pratilomāstrayasmṛtāḥ | sūtaśca 
māgadhaścaiva āyogaśca prayatnataḥ || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

brāhmaṇādi caturṇāntu rogān jñātvā cikitsayet (-) 

senāpatyaṃ camūnāñca kuryādājīva saṃyutāḥ | ete pañca kule 
jātā vīkṣāyāmuttamā bhavet || savarṇādata utpannā pañcaivā 
tenulomakāḥ | ete dīkṣā vidhau tatra madhyamāste viśeṣataḥ || 

caturdaśa ca saṃprokto anulomakasaṃkarī | kula kuṃbhakāro dīkṣā 
yāmaparodhamaḥ || 

vṛtyā putrāścādaśakā dīkṣā dhāmayamādhamāḥ | 
uttamānāñca madhyāstu pañcapañcādhamāmanuḥ || 

adhamādhamakāścāpi daśaproktā viśeṣataḥ | catustriṃśaccaye 
matvā kulasaṃbandhinastathā || 

<p. 1301> 

hīnā cārayutāścāpi krūrakarmayutā api | hīna vṛttiyutā yepi 
dīkṣāyāṃ varjayedguruḥ || 

dīkṣādyayojātīnāṃ akalpena ca bhasmanā | 
tripuṇḍrāṃkitadehāśca rudrākṣa paridhāraṇe || 

amantrakāsvayaṃ paścāt śivadīkṣāyutān parān | liṃginaśca 
sadā bhaktyā dūrataḥ praṇamādikān || 

kṛtvā śivālayādyañca svasvajātyunusārataḥ | yathocitantathā 
kuryāttena svargamavāpnuyāt || 

paścāt bhūmau tu saṃjāto dīkṣayā mokṣamāpnuyuḥ | dīkṣito 
vidhināliṃgī naiṣṭhikopi viśeṣataḥ || 

tasya jāte tu saṃbandho nāstyeva nandikeśvara | bhautikasya 
viśeṣeṇa lokācāra samanvayāt || 

pūrvajātyanu vartavyamiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ | 
vibhaktiviśvāsamadrohaṃ gururvājñā pālana sthitaḥ || 

śraddhāśānti kṣamāsatyaṃ tathā śaucaṃ tapaśrutaḥ | 
kṛtajñāyā ca daśakaṃ yasya śiṣyasya vidyate || 

sa śiṣyāṇāṃ pradhānaśca nāstyete te pradhānakāḥ | 
bhaktiyuktañca śiṣyañca na śikṣayati cedguruḥ || 

śiṣyajñānakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ gurorbhavati niścayaḥ | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena guṇānsarvān parīkṣayet || 

<p. 1302> 

parīksya bahudhā śiṣya muttamaṃ nīcakarmabhiḥ | 
nīcañcottamakarmeṇa tatodīkṣāṃ samācaret || 

alpadoṣaguṇādhikye samameva caivadīkṣayet | abda śiśrūṣaṇānte 
tu bṛṇīyāddeśikottamaḥ || 

suprabhede ca (-) 

śiṣyān saṃvatsarāt pūrvān parīkṣya ca guṇāguṇau | 
guṇayuktāstu saṃgrāhyāḥ guṇahīnānvivarjayet || 

śiṣyopi guruṃ parīkṣyāt gṛhṇīyāttathā | athānada prayogeṇa 
nāyama labhyate || 

vatsarādapiśiṣyeṇa sonyaṃ gurumupāśrayet | 

gurumanyaṃ pradhānopi yamanyeta paurvikamiti ityādi vacanaṃ 
jñānadīkṣāviṣaya sāmānyantatvakṣorṣakālaṃ vibhajya 
sarvajñānottare pratipāditam | tadyathā (-) 

tricatuḥ pañcabhirviprakṣatriyo navavāptabhiḥ | 
aṣṭabhirnavabhivaiśyaḥ śūdre viṃśati dāpayet || 

dīkṣākāletvamīmāṃsā jñānaṃ dāne vicārayet | 

pauṣkare (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vaiśyāśśūdrāścaiva yatastathā | 
jalāndhabadhirāmūkā dīkṣāśaktyā pracoditā || 

mṛgendre (-) 

dīkṣāñca (**) kāstantre ye śiverpita cetasam | 

<p. 1303> 

saṃtsaṃganiratāśśūrā asaṃtsagavarāt mukhāḥ | 
śūśrūṇābhirataśśāntāḥ kālena suparīkṣitāḥ || 

akrodhāvavyacapalā śraddhadhānājitendriyāḥ | 
tenagrāhyāssadādūrāsvācāra parirakṣitāḥ || 

kāśmīratantre (-) 

yaśca muṇḍījaṭādhārī brahmacāravratasthitaḥ | tatra 
vedāgamairyuktamadīkṣā karma samācaret || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vyākhyānañca pratiṣṭhāñca maṇḍalaṃ śiṣyasaṃgraham | 
gurvājñayā prakartavyaṃ ekagrāma patheyadi || 

dīkṣāmātreṇa siśyopi sarvadoṣavivarjitaḥ | paścāddoṣa 
samutpannaṃ manovākkāya karmabhiḥ || 

vyasanādibhirasyaivantatsarvaṃ gurave punaḥ | vijñāpya 
sarvadoṣañca vandayeddeśikottamam || 

prāyaścittavidhānañca guruḥ paścādudīrayet | asannidhau guroreva 
kartavyaṃ jyeṣṭhasannidhau || 

prāyaścittādbhavecchuddhiśśucitvānmokṣamāpnuyāt | 

siddhāntaśekhare (-) 

bahuśramakriyāniṣṭhastapodāna kriyāparaḥ | guruṃ parīkṣayet 
śiṣyo bahudhāsya karmabhiḥ || 

<p. 1304> 

tatra daṃpatyā dīkṣāviṣaye devikālottare viśeṣa uktaḥ | tathā 
(-) 

devaśadīkṣitaḥ pūrvaṃ kanīyāṃścāmareśvara | 
dīkṣitaścetprakartavyā bhavatā parameśvarā || 

śṛṇu devi sasaṃskārotyadhikādadhiko bhavet | śivadīkṣā guruḥ 
kāryā ekasmin bhartṛbhāryayoḥ || 

ardhājjāyāśarīraiśca vādyairvākyaistathātmanoḥ | 
prasiddhessahabhāvasya daṃpatī sahadīkṣayet || 

pitarammātarañcaiva bhrātarañca tathaiva ca | anugrāhyo varārohe 
patnīñca bhaginīntathā || 

jāmātṛpitṛpatnyādyā yogyāssyurmokṣakāṃkṣibhiḥ | 
dīkṣākatarvyā śivo yasmāt kāryanna putratā || 

asaṃkhyeyaṃ idaṃ vākyamadhunābhilakṣitam | śive 
samayīsamasthasya jyeṣṭhāyaṃ pūrvadīkṣitaḥ || 

putrakaḥ putrakasyāpi sādhakassādhakasya ca | gurorapi guruḥ 
proktassamayokti nidarśanāt || 

saṃskārādadhikājyeṣṭho vyatīnāṃ śivaśāsane | na tu jātivayo 
vṛddhā vidyājyeṣṭhatva kāraṇam || 

vidyamānau śirau jyeṣṭhe abhiṣikte kanīyasā | guroranyaguruṇā 
vāpi kaiścitpaścātpratīkṣate || 

<p. 1305> 

anyonya gauravantaśca kartavyaṃ vandanaṃ vinā | 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

dīkṣābhiṣeka jyeṣṭhena kaniṣṭhasya kadācana | 
tapovidyādhipasyāpi kartavyaṃ nābhivādanam || 

mataṃge (-) 

vat śiva bhaktāstu draṣṭavyaḥ śivakāṃkṣibhiḥ | saṃskṛtāśca 
śivairmantrai guṇānāṃ mūrtimūrtinā || 

vāgīśīgarbhasaṃbhūtā sarveprāptavarānarāḥ | yathokta śiva 
saṃskāra pavitrīkṛta mūrtayaḥ || 

sarve samāna dharmāṇaḥ tathāpyeṣocyate vidhiḥ | 

gurorapyagratasteṣā mevamānasaṃ yathānukrama śuśrūṣā 
vandanāni cātra tu kāryāṇi anyonya saṃhṛṣṭairācakṣuṣaviṣaye 
guroḥ || 

[iti dīkṣādarśe śiṣyalakṣaṇavidhiḥ] || || [atha 
śaktinipātalakṣaṇamucyate] || 

śaktipātalakṣaṇam (-) 

yathokta lakṣaṇa śiṣyaṃ prāpta śakti nipātatāratamyena 
tattaccinhaṃ jñātvā tadanuguṇyena dīkṣāṃ vidadhyāt | tathā 
siddhāntaśekhare (-) 

śaktipātavibhedānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣyatedhunā | 
adharmādharmayosssāmyejāte śaktipatatyasau || 

jñānātmikā parāśaktiśśaṃbhoryasminnipātitā | 

<p. 1306> 

tasyaiva kriyate dīkṣā samukto nātra saṃśayaḥ || 

tatpātalakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye tāratamyena dehinām | 
dehapātastathākarma paramānandaharṣaṇaḥ || 

svedoromāñca ityetacchāmī pātasyalakṣaṇaḥ | 

yathā (-) 

bhāskarasya prabhā sadyomeghajālairnivāritaḥ | tadvat 
jñānātmikā śaktiḥ pāśajālaissamāhṛtaḥ || 

pakvapāśeṣu suvyaktā patitetyupacaryate | 

pauṣkare (-) 

samatvaṃ karmaṇāṃ nātra nimittaṃ tadanugrahe | paripākomalasyaiva 
kintvanugrahakāraṇam || 

sarvatrakarma sāmyasya yadyanugrahahetutā | vijñānakevalānāntu 
bhavetkathamanugrahaḥ || 

sakalānāñca sarvatra karmasāmyaṃ na kāraṇam | 

kiraṇe garuḍaḥ | śaktipātādbhaveddīkṣā nipāto na vitvataḥ | 
(**) nvasamavetatvāt sarvadeva sthitāpaśoḥ || 

bhagavān (-) 

upacāreṇa śabdānāṃ pravṛttiriva dṛśyate | yathā 
pumānvimuktopi nityotyukto vinaiśvaraḥ || 

pāśacchedo yathā prokto mantrarāṭ bhagavān śivaḥ | evaṃ 
śaktinipātopi bhaktaḥ proktaśśivāgame || 

nipāto yadvastunaḥ sahasā bhavet | 

<p. 1307> 

tadvat śaktinipātopi bha prokto bhavabhayapradaḥ | tasmādanyatra 
sāmyevā tadātmā deśikaṃ prati || 

pauṣkare (-) 

vairāgyaṃ jāyate kṣipraṃ saṃsārāddaḥkhasāgarāt | didṛkṣā 
jāyate śaṃbhoḥ pādapa jayorapi || 

kadā drakṣyāmideveśaṃ mokṣyehaṃ bandhataḥ kadā | kovā 
darśayitā śaṃbhoriti saṃjāyate matiḥ || 

evaṃ saṃsārato bhūtamanugṛhṇāti ceśvaraḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

anenāpyanumitiśśiṣṭa hetosthūladhiyāmapi | īṣadardhanivṛtte tu 
rodhakatve tamaḥ pate || 

bhavantyetāni kiñcicchiṣṭeṣu dehinām | 

pauṣkare (-) 

śiṣyānāṃ śaktipātārthaṃ parīkṣyāśśivaśāsane | 
abhaktamadvijaṃ krūraṃ nirbhayaṃ vā kriyācyutam || 

dīkṣāmadājñā hantyeṣāmityājñā pārameśvare | dīkṣayaiva 
mocayetpāśāt śivatvañca dadātyaṇoḥ || 

tathā vidyāpurāṇe (-) 

guṇāḍhyaḥ kṛśadoṣo vā śivabhaktaḥ praśasyate 
aśeṣaguṇasaṃpano natvabhaktaḥ kadācana | mlecchopi śivabhakto 
yassonu grāhyo na saṃśayaḥ | 

<p. 1308> 

vipropi lakṣaṇairyukto na dīkṣā bhavavarjinaḥ | śive bhaktiṃ 
dṛḍhaṃ yasya guraunityaṃ kriyāsu ca || 

śivajñanābhyāsane nityaṃ vitatīntvadhāsthitau | 
ananyaniratasyāsyā dīkṣānānyasya śasyate || 

śarīradravya saṃvijñāna vācaḥ karma gaṇānaṇūn | 
gururdhvanadhārayedyastu sotra saṃskāramarhati || 

pauṣkare (-) 

ekasya dīkṣākartavyā dvayorvātha viśeṣataḥ | ata ūrdhvaṃ na 
kartavyaṃ kartavyaṃ narakaṃ dhruvam || 

niśvāse (-) 

aprāpya śivasadbhāvaṃ paṭhanto śivasaṃhitām | ajñātvā kurute 
dīkṣāṃ śiṣyācāryo vrajatyadhaḥ || 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

ajñātvā śiva sadbhāvaṃ ye dīkṣāṃ kartumudyatāḥ | vṛthā 
pariśramasteṣāmityadhvā vātra varṇyate || 

tathā vāyaya saṃhitāyām (-) 

tatva vyāptimavijñāya śuddhivārddhakya (*) cchati | 
vipralaṃbhakaśśuddho nālaṃ prāpayituṃ phalam || 

vṛthā pariśramastasya nirapāya ca kevalam | 

kālottare (-) 

ajñātvālayabhāgau tu ye dīkṣā kurute guruḥ | 

<p. 1309> 

ācāryassahaśiṣyastu narake raurave pacet || 

deśikastu prayatnāstu jñātvā dīkṣā samācaret | ajñātvā 
śāstrasadbhāvaṃ jñānatatva samuccayam || 

dīkṣāṃ karoti ye mohāt paścāttāpaṃ karoti cet | pañcalakṣaṃ 
japeddhoraṃ yadivāñchati śobhanam || 

[iti dīkṣādarśe śaktinipāta nirūpaṇa vidhiḥ] || || [atha 
dīkṣābheda ucyate] || 

mṛgendre (-) 

yatheṣṭa sādanandīkṣā parameśamukhodgatā | nigadyate samāsena 
dvitvādarthasya sā dvidhā || 

bhautikī naiṣṭhikī caiva sāvāntaravibhedataḥ | sāpekṣa 
nirapekṣānyādhālokaśivadharmiṇaḥ || 

svāyaṃ bhuve (-) 

dīkṣā śabdasya nirvacanamucyate | kāraṇaṃ siddhidaṃ mukte 
yāvadvayakṣarārtha mucyate || 

dīyate jñānasadbhāvaṃ kṣīyate karmavāsanā | 
dānakṣapaṇayogācca dīkṣāśuddhikṛdātmanaḥ || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

dīyate jñānasadbhāvaṃ kṣīyate ca malatrayam | tathā 
dīkṣāsamākhyātā jñānandatvāmalāpaham || 

<p. 1310> 

guruṇā caiva sarveṣāṃ mukhyā dīkṣā gurusmṛtā | 

sādhāra nirādhārabhedādvijñānākalānāndīkṣābhedaḥ 
patipādeitaḥ (-) 

cintyaviśve tadyathā (-) 

anugrāhyāstrayaśśāstre vijñānapralayā kalau | 
tṛtīyassakalaśceva ādyopi malamātrakaḥ || 

malakarmasamāyuktaḥ pralayākala eva ca | sakalaśca nivṛtyādi 
kalāvṛtyanta gocaraḥ || 

teṣāṃ kriyāvatī dīkṣā dvividhā nandikeśvaraḥ | sādhārātha 
nirādhārā sādhārā sakalasya tu || 

nirādhārāhvayānyeṣāmeva dīkṣāmayoditā | ācāryanirapekṣyeṇa 
tīvraśaktyānu śaṃbhunā || 

yā kriyā kriyate sādhu nirādhāreti kīrtitā | gurumūlaṃ 
samāsthāya mata (*) pratibheda vā || 

bhaktyā śaṃbhuśca kurute yā kriyā sādhikāriṇīḥ | caturvidhā 
kriyādīkṣā sabījā bījavarjitā || 

adhikāreṇa saṃyuktātyanyā niradhikāriṇī | sabījā samayā cāra 
saṃyuktāna nṛṇāṃ bhavet || 

varuṇapaddhatyām (-) 

sabījādvividhā bhinnā prathamā śivadharmiṇī | 
sādhakācāryayossattā deśakālādibhedataḥ || 

<p. 1311> 

dharmādharmātmakaṃ karma prāgāgāmivicitrakam | sañcintyaśodhyate 
yatra saivoktāśivadharmiṇī || 

adharmamātṛkāśuddhā dvitīyā lokadharmiṇī | 
nityamātrādhikaritvāt samadhīnatha putrakaiḥ || 

dakṣāniradhikāraiva naimittenādhikāriṇī | sādhakā 
cāryayornityaṃ naimittikañcakarmasu || 

sarvatraivāthakāritvāt sādhitaścaivasātayoḥ | dvedhā 
nirvāṇadīkṣā ca laukikīśivadharmiṇī || 

grahiṇāṃ laukikī neyaṃ liṃgināṃ śivadharmiṇī | 
śikhākhaṇḍena saṃyuktā dīkṣā sā śivadharmiṇī || 

etacchivadhamiṇi bhautikanaiṣṭhikabhedena dvaividhyaṃ 
siddhāntaśekhare (-) tadyathā (-) 

bhautikaṃ naiṣṭhikañceti dvividhā sā śivadharmiṇī | 
vratamokṣasamāyuktā bhautiketi nigadyate || 

śarīrapātaparyanta vratī sā naiṣṭhikī matā | 

asyābhiprāyaḥ (-) 

dīkṣāṃ tu kiñcitkālaṃ vratamanuṣṭhāya śāstrokta 
vidhinaivāsya vrata samāptu sā bhautikī | ādehapātaṃ 
brahmacaryamanuṣṭhāna yā sā dīkṣā naiṣṭhikī | varuṇa 
paddhatyām (-) 

<p. 1312> 

atha sa bījadīkṣāyā dvidhā bhedo nigadyate | sadyo 
nirvāṇadāyitvācchirannirvāṇadā parā || 

prārabdhasañcitā (-) kāmike (-) karmakālaṃ viśodhyate | 

yathātyantaviraktānāṃ sadyonirvāṇa dāsadā | 
prārabdhakarmaṇāṃ bhogaṃ yathā sā muktimakṣarā || 

yānti balādayaścaiva svaccho nirvāṇadā bhavet | yathā kriyāvatī 
tatra kuṇḍalamaṃḍalapūrvikā || 

manovyāpāramātrorthā yā sā jñānavatīmatā | sā cānekavidhā 
proktā tatprapañcoya mucyate || 

cākṣuṣī sparśadīkṣā ca vācikī mānasī tathā | śāstrañca 
yogadīkṣā ca hautrītyādiranekadhā || 

cakṣurunmīlya yattatvaṃ dhyātvā śiṣyaṃ samīkṣyate | 
pāśabandhavimokṣāya dīkṣeyañcākṣuṣī matā || 

nidhāyadakṣiṇe haste śaṃbhuṃ brahmāṃga saṃyutam | nidhāya 
śiṣyaśirasi sparśadīkṣā bhavediyam || 

tatve cittaṃ samāsthāya prahitāntara tejasā | 
gururucārayenmantrammantradīkṣāsamāhṛtam || 

yogena yogadīkṣā syāt pradānādyogajā bhavet | agnikāryavatī 
hautrī śaivadīkṣā nirupitā || 

uccaredvacasā mantrān sā dīkṣā vācikī tathā | 

<p. 1313> 

śivaśāstra pradānena nāstradīkṣā samāhṛtā || 

cintye (-) 

athabhakti samāyuktaṃ śivānudhyānakāṃkṣiṇam | parīkṣya ca 
malaṃ śiṣyaṃ vilokyakrūrayā guruḥ || 

dīkṣā kāryaṃ prakurvīta kṛtanityakriyo mataḥ | 
vinaśyatyandhakārantu yathā sūryasya sannidhau || 

guru (*) dīkṣaṇādeva sarvapāpātpramucyate | gururyaṃ spṛśyati 
hastena yaṃ yaṃ paśyati cakṣuṣā || 

śivaṃ bhavati tatsarvaṃ śivādeva prasādataḥ | na lipyate 
malenaiva padmapatramivāṃbhasā || 

tasmādguruśśivaḥ prokto guruśaktirmanonmanī | 
dīkṣāśatasahasrantu pāpānāṃ kṛtavānapi || 

śivajñānamalabdhañcet jñānayātrāṃ samāśrayet | jñānahīnaṃ 
guruṃ prāpya kṛto muktimavāpyasi || 

bhinnanāvāśritastvabdhe yathā pārannagacchati | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena saṃśrayet jñānapāragaḥ || 

madhulabdhe yathā bhṛṃgo puṣpātpuṣantaraṃ vane | 
jñānalubdhastathā śiṣyo gurorgurvantaraṃ vrajet || 

tallabdhaṃ svaṃ visṛjecchiṣyopyadhaḥ patitaśca yaḥ | 

mataṃge (-) 

śivaśaktikaraiḥ spṛṣṭvā vinītā priyāvādinī | 

<p. 1314> 

akrodhinopacāpaṃ ca hṛddadhāno jitendriyaḥ || 

tenugrāhyāssadākrūrā svācāraparipālakāḥ | anyathā 
nādhikārosti dīkṣyadīkṣakayorapi || 

tathā vāmadeva śivāgame (-) 

śāṃbhavī caiva śakti ca māntrī ceti śivāgame | 
dīkṣopadiśyate tredhā śivena paramātmanā || 

gurorālokamātreṇa sparśātsaṃbhāsaṇādapi | sadyassaṃjāyate 
prājña pāśopakṣayakāriṇī || 

sā dīkṣā śāṃbhavī proktā sā punacchidyate dvidhā | tīvrā 
tīvratarā ceti pāśopakṣayabhedataḥ || 

yayāsyānnirvatissadyassaiva tīvratarā matā | tīvrātu 
tīvroratyantaṃ puṃsaḥ pāśaviśodhakī || 

śāktī jñānavatī dīkṣā śiṣyadehaṃ praviśya tu | guruṇā 
yogamārgeṇa kriyate jñāna cakṣuṣā || 

māntrī kriyāvatī dīkṣā kuṇḍamaṇḍala pūrvikā | manda 
mandataroddeśakartavyā guruṇā bahiḥ || 

śakti vātānusāreṇa śiṣyonugrahamarhati | 

pauṣkare (-) 

tadyogyatānusāreṇa karuṇayāgarbhayā dṛśā | punāti 
sādhikāreṇa yaṃ vāpi parameśvaraḥ || 

<p. 1315> 

anugrāhyavinaye tathānugrāhyasya ca | 

kāruṇye saśivaḥ kartavyā tayoryogassudurlabhaḥ | 

asyādīkṣāyāmalanivṛtta śivatva prāptireva phalaṃ bhavati | 
taduktaṃ tatraiva (-) 

dīkṣaiva mocayetpāśānśivatvañca dadātyaṇoḥ | 

tathā raurave (-) 

evaṃ śaivādhvaraṃ prāpya dīkṣāmantra samudbhavam | na 
purnajanmatāṃ yāti dīkṣito manujottamaḥ || 

bhinne dehe śivobhūtvā śivadharmaissamanvitaḥ | 
śivadharmamanuprāpyatvavibhāgāyakalpate || 

yathā samudramāsādya nadīmṛṣṭāṃnuvāhinī | 
kṣāratoyatvāmāyāti tatprabhāvānmahodadheḥ || 

evaṃ vai bhinnadehātmā śivamevādhigacchati | 
saritsamudrasaṃyogādvibhāgenaiva jāyate || 

tasmācchivādhvare rūpakalpanāsvacchavarṇatā | 

tadyathā (-) 

nigūḍhāstatratiṣṭhanti kāṣṭhe vahniryathā tathā | tadvadastu 
yathā vahni maṇḍakasya vaśāt sphuṭam || 

svasvarūpaṃ vijānāti bhāsvaraṃ yatsā nirmalam | andhakastvihavai 
śivasvayameva sadāśivaḥ || 

<p. 1316> 

ācāryatanumāsthāya sadācānugrahe sthitaḥ | 
mantramaṇḍanavatjñeyaṃ adhvācāpyaraṇiryathā || 

vāgīśī yonirvijñeyā dhūmājñeyā mayādikṛt | ātmāvai 
vahnivat prokto sādhakastu paraśśivaḥ || 

malakarmakalādyaistu nirmukto vigatatsamaḥ | tatrasthopi na bādhyeta 
yato'tīva sunirmalaḥ || 

rasavahnisamāyogāttāmraṃ kālikayā yataḥ | viśodhitantu 
tatvajñairhematvaṃ pratipadyate || 

na bhūyastāmratāṃ yāti tathātmā ca gamyañcana | ramasvamantra 
śaktistu kriyā jñeyā tu vahnivat || 

tatvajñaśca śivo devī ācārya tanuvigrahaḥ | ātmāvai hemavat 
jñeyo malo jñeyastu kālikā || 

mantra dravyakriyā yogāt bāhyādhāre yathā priye | guruṇā 
tatraviduṣā yasmādvainirmalaḥ kṛtaḥ || 

na bhūyomalatāṃ yāti śivatvaṃ yātinirmalaḥ | 

vātule (-) 

rasaviddhaṃ yathā tāmraṃ na bhūyastāmratāṃ vrajet | 
jñānasiddhastathā dehī na bhūyaḥ paśutāṃ vrajet || 

vimuktaṃ prākṛtaṃ bhāvaṃ tenaivādhikṛtaḥ pumān | etat jñāno 
gururbrahmā martyaloka paresthitaḥ || 

<p. 1317> 

brahmahatyāśvamedhādyai paśya pāpairna lipyate | 

|| [iti dīkṣādarśe dīkṣābhedanirūpaṇavidhiḥ] || || [atha 
dīkṣādeśanirūpaṇavidhirucyate] || 

dīkṣādeśa vidhiḥ (-) 

tadyathā (-) 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

atha yāgaprasidhyarthaṃ brahmāvartādikaṃ bhavet | deśaṃ 
bhūtasaṃjuṣṭaṃ samit puṣpodakottaram || 

(********) bhāgāntaṃ varṇānāmanupadravam | 
mṛtkuśādyoṣadhīgāḍhaṃ nāstikānāmanindakam || 

kāraṇe (-) 

sahyevā pāridhātre ca mahendre malayepi ca | puṇyanadyabdhatīre vā 
saṃgame vā viśeṣataḥ || 

kṣīravṛkṣa samīpe tu puṣpodyānethavā punaḥ | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

mahendramalaye sahye pāriyātre himālaye | vindhye ca mandare caiva 
śrīgirau himaparvate || 

gaṃgā tīre ca kālindau narmadā tuṃ bhadrake | sarasvatyāṃ 
payasvinyāṃ kāveri kanyakā taṭe || 

vārāṇasyādi puṇyeṣu kṣetra deśeṣu vā punaḥ | samudrakāyāṃ 
nadyāyāṃ tīre śuddhe mahāhṛde || 

puṣpodyānethavānityaṃ kṣīravṛkṣe samīpage | 

<p.1318> 

prāsāde ca maṭhe caiva śrotriyasya gṛhethavā || 

śuddhadeśe manoramye mṛtsnādhikatale same | 

svāyaṃ bhuve (-) 

mahendre malaye sahye śrīśaile himavadgirau | pāriyātrāṃ budhe 
vindhye śuddhimācakṣaparvate || 

gaṃgāyāṃ yamunāyāñca tayorantara eva ca | sarasvatyāṃ 
dṛṣṭavatyāṃ godāvaryāmapāṃ nidhau || 

narmadāyāṃ kṛṣṇaveṣyāṃ sindrau pañcanade tathā | tuṃga 
bhadropa kaṇṭhe ca candrabhāgopakaṇṭhake || 

guhyāyatanatīrtheṣu nadīnāṃ saṃgameṣu ca | bhavane vane goṣṭhe 
śrīpurekṣīra (***) ke || 

brahmakuṇḍe kadaṃbe ca gurossamaniśobhane | devālaye viśeṣeṇa 
dakṣiṇadvāri veśmani || 

kundavṛkṣasyamūle ca dīkṣāsthānaṃ prakalpayet | 

cintye (-) 

devālaye maṭhe caiva guruśiṣya gṛhe tathā | dīkṣāsthānantu 
kartavyaṃ maṇdapaṃ vidhipūrvakam || 

kāśmīratantre (-) 

puṇyakṣetre śivakṣetre sadādīkṣā praśasyate | 

tathoktaṃ kriyākaraṇamaṇḍanapaddhatau (-) 

udyāneṣu śivālayeṣu saritāṃ tīreṣu padmālaye | 

<p. 1319> 

kāñcyāṃ vyāghrapurepayodhiparidhe japte (**) śva parvate (-) goṣṭhe 
vāpi gurorgṛhe svabhavane śrīkālahastīśvare gokarṇe bahupāvane 
tanubhṛtāṃ dīkṣāsthalaṃ śasyate | 

mataṃge (-) 

śivolayasthabhūmayaḥ pravarāvane | sarit gaṃgā mahāpuṇyā 
kālindī cāpyaninditā || 

sarasvatī narmadā ca catasrassarito varaḥ | āryāvartodbhavāpāstā 
svayañcaiva mahārṇavaḥ || 

gaṃgāyamunayormadhye dīkṣākṣetramanuttamam | 
saritassaṃgamaśśastā udyānaṃ sāmanoramaḥ || 

vimalaṃ sṛ saritśreṣṭha yatra vā nalinī śubhā | ebhyo 
syekatamaṃ bhadramathavā yanmanoramam || 

ālayādau sthānaviśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

kāmike (-) 

haryāgre maṇḍapaṃ kryādyāga gṛhañca pārśvayoḥ | uttare vā 
prakartavyaṃ caturaśraṃ yathā bhavet || 

gṛhādi viṣaye tadagre dvārotsedhamānāntarantyaktvā 
tadbāhyapradeśe daśahastamānena yāgārthamaṇṭapaṃ kuryāt | 

tathā jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

dvārocchrayāntarantyaktvā gṛhaṃliṃge gṛhāgrataḥ | daśahasta 
pramāṇena maṇṭapaṃ kārayetsudhīḥ || 

etadevātmārthaliṃga pratiṣṭhāyāṃ maṇḍapaṃ kāryam | 

<p.1320> 

mataṃge (-) 

prācyodakaṃ bhavedbhadraṃ yāmyāṃ girivaraṃ śubham | kṣatraṃ 
dūrvādibhirnaddhaṃ kuśabilvopabṛṃhitam || 

grāhyaṃ tvavidānityaṃ suparīkṣya yathākramam | 

smṛtauvarjya deśamuktam (-) 

sindhusauvīraṃ rāṣṭraṃ tathā vāsinaḥ | 

koṃkavaṃgakaliṃkāñca gatvā saṃskāramarhati | 

atha bhūparigrahaṇārthaṃ praveśa balirucyate | 

kāmike (-) 

bhūparigrahaṃ (-) 

navabhāgaṃ dharāṃ kṛtvā brahmasthānādi tatkramāt | navādiṣu 
balindadyānmantreṇānena vāstuvit || 

ime bhūmau vasantotra bhūtapaiśāca rākṣasāḥ | 
svecchagacchantvimāṃ bhūmimāgramihavāsine || 

dadhyājyāpūpasaṃyuktai ranyaisteṣāṃ bilaṃkṣipet | 

etadviśeṣaṃ śiva (***) nirmāṇa sthāpanādipikāyāmasmābhiḥ 
prapañcitantatravalokyatām | 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi mahītala viśodhanam | tasyāḥ 
parīkṣāvijñānaṃ parigrahaṇameva ca || 

<p. 1321> 

jalatīra samīpasthāṃ śuddhāṃ bhūmiṃ parīkṣayet | hastamānaṃ 
purā khātvā pūritāyādhikā śubhā || 

samaṃ madhyamā jñeyā kaniṣṭhāyā na pūritā | 
yasyavarṇassayogāndhaśśobhanā sa ca vidyate || 

bhūmisaṃśodhanaṃ kṛtvā kṣetrajananaṃ kuru | janite tu 
śivakṣetre paścādvai bhūparigrahaḥ || 

tathā niśvāse (-) 

dravyāḥ parīkṣaṇañcaiva tathā bhūmi parigrahaḥ | 
sādhakasyābhiṣeke tu ācāryāṇāntathaiva ca || 

mṛgendre (-) 

vidhinā vakṣyamāṇena kṛtvābhūmeḥ parigrahaḥ | puṇye nadye 
samitpuṣpa kuśavāri samanvite || 

deśe varṇānugāṃ bhūmiṃ prāgīśo digbhavāṃ bhajet | 

yasya brāhmaṇādivarṇasya yādṛkvakṣyamāṇaṃ tattadeva 
varṇānugamiti tatraivoktaṃ (-) 

himasṛk kālanīlābhaṃ madhunādirasottamam | ghṛtādideśakṛnmadya 
gandhināṃ suprarohiṇam || 

yathā saṃkhyaṃ brāhmaṇādīnāṃ himarudhidhaharitāla 
śyāmavarṇāṃ kaṣāyāmla karakarasāṃ 
ghṛtaraktagomayasirāgandhāñca bhuvaṃ parigrahet | evaṃñca 
proktaṃ brahmarasagandhāssarvā eva brāhmaṇabhūmayogrāhyāḥ | 
ājyā varjya tisrokṣatriyasya pañcaścādvaiśya śūdrasya nidhāya 
śilābhūmiñca kīrtitāḥ | 

<p. 1322> 

kāraṇe (-) 

kṣetrastadativaśādurvīṃ kathitāntvānulominām | 

niśvāsakārikāyām (-) 

viprasya tisrorājñasya ubhe viśeṣa ekā śūdrasya niyamā 
śilābhūmiñca kīrtitāḥ | 

yaṣṭvā tu devadaiveśi hunedaṣṭaśataṃ kramāt | balistatraiva 
dātavya deśikenamahātmanā || 

bhūmyāḥ parigrahāhyeva tava devi udāhṛtaḥ | uktavarṇā saṃbhave 
prāyaścittau varṇānāpādayet || 

tathoktam (-) 

brāhmaṇādi catuṣkasya varṇābhāve tadīśvaraiḥ | sahasrādhika 
homena varṇāpādanamācaret || 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

bhūmintatra parīkṣyeta nimnonnatavivarjitāḥ | anūṣarā 
samaklinnā mṛdākardama vālukā || 

tuṣakeśāsthirahitāṃ bhasmāṃgāravivarjitām | 
duṣṭaśalyāvinirmuktāṃ snigdhāṃbhāravatīṃ śubhām || 

śūrpādyākṛti nirmuktāṃ prāgudk plavanāmmahīm | śodhitāṃ 
karaśaṃkhena karakhātaparīkṣitām || 

<p. 1323> 

varṇāvarṇādyavikalāṃ mahīṃ kāmaphalapradām | manaḥ 
pratikaśanmukhyāṃ siddhevāpi yathoditām || 

suprabhede (-) 

śubhāśubhanimittāni tasmin kāleparīkṣayet | śubhe tu prasthite 
yāyādaśubhe tu nivṛttayet || 

aśubhetvagnimāstīrya śivenaiva śataṃ hunet | 

niśvāse (-) 

pāpevā patiṃ vidyāt śubhe daśubhamādiśet | 
śayanānāmanādṛtya kurute karmamānataḥ || 

dharmiṇī pratighātāni vighnātyabhi bhavanti ca | tasmātsarveṣu 
kāryeṣu śakunaṃ pratipūjayet || 

atha varjyabhūmividhirucyate | 

santāne (-) 

varjya bhūmiḥ (-) 

valmīkāṇṭhañca auṣadhyaṃ kramiduṣṭañca varjayet | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

keśasthikaṇṭakādīnāṃ gartoṣaravivarjitām | 
sarpavamlīkanirmuktāṃ bhasmāṃgāra tuṣokṣatām || 

kāmike (-) 

kramiduṣṭāntu pārābhyāṃ valmīkādyañca varjayet | 

śaṃkusthāpana vidhirucyate (-) 

pauṣkare (-) 

bhuvaḥ parigrahārthantu śaṃkusūtrāṇi veśayet | 

aṃśumati (-) 

mānaṃ niścitya tatpūrve nikhane tatparigrahām | 

<p. 1324> 

tritālaṃ vā dvitālaṃ vā kṛkatālamathāpi vā || 

mṛdamutthāpya saṃśodhya anyamṛdbhistu smaret | puṇyakṣetre 
nadītīre śuddhadeśe manorame || 

saṃgṛhya mṛdamādāya tadgartaṃ pūrayetsamam | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

secayetpañcagartatoyena pañcagavya śivāṃbhasā | 
dhautavastraśśuciḥ snātvā tatassañcālayetpunaḥ || 

akālakulakalaśairvastrapūtena vāriṇā | tataḥ kuṭṭāpayedyastu 
palāśośvatthamudgakaiḥ || 

darpaṇodarasaṃkāṃ sarvatrasuparīkṣitām | urvīmevaṃ vidhāṃ 
prāpya yajenmaṇḍalamuttamam || 

|| [iti bhūparigrahavidhiḥ] || [atha dīkṣākāla ucyate] | 

kāla nirṇayam (-) 

saha (**) ne śṛṇu devi paraṃ guhyamadhivāsanamuttamam | 

sarvasaṃhitasāmānyaṃ kathayāmi tavākhilam | tithinakṣatra 
vārāṇi śakunāni śubhāni tu || 

divyārṣarikṣabhaumāni labdhvā samyak samācaret | 

makuṭe (-) 

uttarāyaṇa kāle tu śuklapakṣeśubhe dine | adhane viṣuve caiva 
grahaṇeśarataddine || 

sarvamāseṣu kartavyamācāryaiśca yute dine | 

<p. 1325> 

sumuhūrte sulagne ca dīkṣākarma samācaret || 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

śaradvasantayoryoge dīkṣākarmavidhirvaraḥ | tayorasaṃbhave vā'pi 
nityatvepi praśasyate || 

atra (-) śaramāsayugalaṃ mokṣārthināmeva vasantayugalaṃ bhuktimukti 
nimittaṃ ihābhimukhyate bhuktiranuṣaṃgatomuktiśca | evaṃ 
caturmāsa dīkṣākarma vidhiśreṣṭhaḥ | 

dīkṣāyāmabhiṣeke ca tathā mantra parigrahe | bhūtagrahaṇamokṣe 
ca dravyālābhā (*) karmaṇi || 

kārtikyāñcaiva vaiśākhyāṃ svarbhānorapi darśane | ayane viṣuve 
krāntau saṃsthitau guroryajet || 

uttamāditubhedena kālaṃ siddhāntaśekhare uktaḥ | śaratkāle tu 
vaiśākhe dīkṣāśreṣṭhaphalapradā || 

phālgune mārgaśīrṣe ca jyeṣṭhā dīkṣā tu madhyamā | 
āṣāḍhe māghamāse ca kaniṣṭhā samudāhṛtā || 

nirmitā śrāvaṇañcaitraṃ puṇyabhādrapatau tathā | ninditeṣvapi 
māseṣu dīkṣoktā grahaṇe yutaḥ || 

ninditeṣvapi māseṣu dīkṣoktā grahaṇe yutaḥ | viṣuvetyayana 
dvadve āṣāḍhantumahotsave || 

dīkṣā kāryā tu kāleṣu pavitreśuklaparvāṇi | 
śuklapakṣeśubhādīkṣā kṛṣṇapakṣe pañcamāddināt || 

<p. 1326> 

kāraṇe ca (-) 

varjyamāsena mukhyena dīkṣākālamuktam | 

tadyathā (-) 

pūrvabhadre pademākhe āṣāḍhe mārgaśīrṣake | dīkṣāṃ na 
kārayeddhīmān anyamāse tu kārayet || 

kāmike viśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

sthāpanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ dīkṣā śivarātri śivotsavam | sauramāse 
tu kartavyaṃ cāndramāse vicitrakam || 

śuklapakṣeśubharkṣe tu śubhavārādibhistataḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

udaṅmārga pravartake śuklapakṣe śubhe dine | 
mṛgendrapaddhatyāmaghoraśivācāryeṇoktam || 

vinā caitraṃ vinā pauṣkaṃ vināvarṇaṃ praśasyate | anyamāseṣu 
sarveṣu dīkṣākarmasukhāvaham || 

mohaśūrottare (-) 

dīkṣādisthāpanañcaiva pavitrādiśatakratuḥ | adhimāse na 
kurvīta yadicchecchubhamātmanaḥ || 

atra valmīkādimāsapi niṣiddhamiti kālavivekesmābhiḥ 
pradarśitantatrāvayāryatra | atha (*) dhirucyate | 

suprabhede (-) 

saptamyāñca navamyāñca ekādaśyāmathāpi vā | paurṇa 
māsyāmamāvāsyāṃ dīkṣākarmaṇi naśyate || 

vīratantre (-) 

dvitīyā pañcamī vāpi ṣaṣṭhīvātha viśeṣataḥ | 

<p. 1327> 

dvādaśī vā gṛhītavyā trayodaśyāmathā bhavet || 

etāvaitiśubhaḥ proktā dīkṣākarmaṇi śobhanā | 

caturthī navamī vātha viśeṣataḥ paurṇamāsiṃ vinā śeṣā 
śuklapakṣe bubhukṣuṣu | 

yogaje (-) 

madhyāṣṭanavamī caiva amāvāsyāñca varjayet | 

svāyaṃbhuva sūtra saṃgrahe (-) 

paurṇamāsyaṣṭamīśuklā tathā caiva caturdaśī | bhuktyai 
dīkṣāsu tithayaḥ sakṛṣṇamukti karmasuḥ || 

dinaṃ chidrādyayuktāśca ye cānye tithayasmṛtāḥ | 

athavāravitepiyāgāṃgabhāvitvāt saṃgrāhyayāga karmaṇi 
kālottare (-) 

caturthyāmathavāṣṭamyāṃ pañcadaśyāntathaiva ca | 
paurṇamāsyāṃ prakartavyaṃ bhūtikāmaissite sadā || 

nicchidrāṇi na yuktāśca yathānyāstyatithayasmṛtāḥ | 

|| atha vāravidhirucyate || 

vīratantre (-) 

somaśukrabudhojīva vārāśreṣṭhatamāḥ budha | 

suprabhede (-) 

nakṣatrāṇi tamanyāhurāditya somavārayoḥ | gukaśukrendu sūnau ca 
dīkṣākarmaṇi śobhanam || 

|| atha nakṣatravidhirucyate || 

yogaje (-) 

rohiṇīśravaṇañcaiva śraviṣṭhā trīṇi cottarā | 

<p. 1328> 

puṇyayukśatabhiṣakcaiva dīkṣānakṣatra mucyate || 

svāyaṃ bhuve (-) 

trīṇyuttarāṇi rohiṇyāṃ saumyāñca gurudaivatam | maitraṃ 
saurañca nakṣatraṃ pāvanaṃ cairameva ca || 

nairṛtaṃ vaiṣṇava brāhmaṃ tathā puṇyādhidaivatam | etāni 
śivayāge tu prasthāni ca caturdaśa || 

nānyanyaivaveditayāgādekādaśa parityajet | śeṣuprārabhedyāgaṃ 
yāgeṣu susamāhitaḥ || 

kāraṇe (-) 

puṇyā ca rohiṇirāditya śravaṇā cāśvinīmakhā | 
sāvitrīntvāṣṭravāyavyannairṛtaṃ maitrameva ca || 

tiṣyaṃ trīṇyuttarādyā ca aśastrī putrajanmadam | 

nakṣatrādi daivata nirṇayaḥ śaiva kālaviveke 
prapañcitatvādatrana likhyate | 

nakṣatrāṇi praśastāni dīkṣākarmaṇi kārayet | pūṣā revatī 
āditya punarvasu sāvitraṃ hastaḥ || 

tvāṣṭraṃ citro vāyavyaṃ svātī naiṛtimūlaṃ maitramanūrādhā 
uttaraṃ uttaraphālgunī uttarāṣāḍhottarra proṣṭhapadā 
stisrastathā | niśvāse (-) 

trīṇyuttarāṇi rohiṇyāpuṇya mṛgaśīrṣakam | hastaṃ 
svātiranurādhāmakhāmūlañca revati || 

abhijicchravaṇañcaiva śivayāge caturdaśaṃ | 

<p. 1329> 

candrasūryoparāge tu ṣoḍaśītimukheṣu ca || 

grahanakṣatrayogeṣu viṣuvecotsaveṣu ca | ayaneṣu ca sarveṣu 
yāgassarvārtha siddhidaḥ || 

atra ṣaḍaśīti mukhalakṣaṇaṃ niśvāsatantre pratipāditam | 
mithunaṃ kanyakā caiva dhanurmīnau tathaiva ca || 

ṣaḍaśīti mukhetyevaṃ catvāraḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 

etadubhaya rāśicatuṣṭayaṃ ṣaḍaśītimukhamityucyate | 

|| atha lagnavidhirucyate || 

kāraṇe (-) 

rāśayaścarāśreṣṭhā madhyamā ubhayāsmṛtāḥ | sthirāśca 
naidhanasthāne grahāssarvevivarjitāḥ || 

ācāryasiṣyayoścaivānukūlyaṃ śivaṃ bhavet | 
meṣakaṭakatulamakarāścarā śreṣṭhamadhyamubhayarāśayaḥ || 

mithunakanyādhanurmīnohyubhayātmakāḥ | vṛṣasiṃhavṛścika 
kumbhāsthirāḥ | naidhamaṣṭamasthānam | taduktaṃ yogaje (-) 

aṣṭasthānān grahān sarvān parihārena viśeṣataḥ | 
bṛhaspatyudayaṃ vāpi śukrodayamathāpi vā || 

vīratantre viśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

vṛṣabhaṃ vātha siṃhaṃ vā vṛścikaṃ kuṃbhameva ca | mithunaṃ 
vāpi kanyāṃ vā dhanurvāmīnameva vā || 

ete ca rāśayaḥ proktāścararāśīśca varjayet | 

<p. 1330> 

sthirarāśau prakartavyamubhaye (*) nubhodaye || 

dīkṣākarmasamārabhya tatra somodayaṃ vinā | somodayaṃ lagne 
candra ityarthaḥ 

|| [atha yogavidhiḥ] || 

yogāśca prītirāyuṣmān saubhāgyaśśobhanaṃ śubham | sukarmā ca 
dhṛtirvṛddhi dhruvassiddhiśca harṣaṇaḥ || 

varīyān śivassiddho brāhmaṇaiśca ṣoḍaśa | nindyā nindyāni 
sarvāṇi praśastāni vimuktaye || 

aśubhayogastuviṣkambha atigaṇḍaṃ vyāghrapāta vapāvyatīpātaḥ 
paridhassādhyaḥ śubhraṃ vaidhṛti ityekādaśa aśubhayogāḥ | 
prītyādi ṣoḍaśayogāgrāhyāḥ | 

siddhantaśekhare (-) 

jyotiśśāstraṃ viditvena na dīkṣāṃ kuryāt bubhukṣuṣu | 

mumukṣessarvadādīkṣā kālādi nidyamo nahi | 

tathā devikālottare (-) 

phalaṃ patati śākhāyā padmaṃ bhūmau yathākramam | tathā 
bhāvaṃghribhaktiścet nahikālaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 

śubhe dine śubhe vāstrī sūteṣake tu garbhake | 

<p. 1331> 

tasmāt śiṣyaḥ pariyāgo dīkṣākālaḥ prakīritaḥ || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

garbhiṇī prasave tantuparipākamitismṛtam | paripākamidaṃ śiṣyaṃ 
jñānagarbha samudbhvam || 

taddinaṃ jñānagarbhantu sarvamāseṣu dīkṣayet | 

evaṃ dīkṣāyā viśeṣa kālasāmānya mantropadeśakāla jyotiṣe 
pratipāditam | tadyathā (-) 

mantrādyāraṃbhaṇaṃ caitraṃ bahuputraphalapradam | vaiśākhe caiva 
vṛddhissyāt sarvasaṃpatkaraṃ tathā || 

jetumakarañcaiścātyāṣāḍhe bandhunāśanam | śrāvane cāyuso 
vṛddhirbhādrapade prajākṣayaḥ || 

āśvayujyāṃ susaṃpatti kārtikeratna saṃbhavaḥ | mārgaśīrṣe 
śubhaṃ nityaṃ puṇyesthāna vināśanam || 

māghe mohāyate nityaṃ phalane vaiśyamuttamam | evaṃ samyag 
viśodhye dātavyo mantriṇā manuḥ || 

kāladarśepi (-) 

śiṣyajanmadivaseṣu saṃgrahe pragrahe rāśineśayorapi | puṇya 
yogayujivādine nṛṇandehaśuddhirabhidhīyatepurā || 

|| [ācāryābhiṣeka kālavidhiḥ] || 

śrīmanmataṃge (-) 

śuklapakṣe tu sutithau samyak prāpyottarāyaṇe | 

<p. 1332> 

aṣṭamyāṃ vā caturdaśyāṃ abhiṣekaṃ praśasyate || 

atraivāmṛtayoga uktaḥ (-) 

mūlārka mūlayogairvā śravaṇena sahaikataḥ | tadajñātvā 
proṣṭhapadāyāṃ vā lohitāṃgaśśubhadinam || 

kṛttikāsthānabudhvā tu dinaṃ vipra praśyasya vai | gurorvā divase 
bhādre punarvasu samāgamaḥ || 

phālgunyāṃ śukravāre vā svadyarkṣe vā śaśaiścaraḥ | 

tathā patanamūlarāśi śravaṇantathā ityādi amṛtayogam kuryāt | 
budha dvitīyā ityādi dagdhayogañca śukre 
gurusttarābhyāmityādināśayogañca varjayet [iti dīkṣādarśe 
kālavidhiḥ] | || [atha dīkṣānirmāṇa maṇḍapavidhirucyate] || 

tadyathā (-) 

aṃśumati (-) 

maṇtapa nirmāṇam (-) 

yāgāṃgamaṇṭapaṃ vakṣye tadrūpaṃ śṛṇu pārvati | 
kṣmākārantumakāraṃ syāt aptatvantuṇakārakam || 

agnitatvañca ṭakāraṃ pavanākhyaṃ pakārakam | vyomākāraṃ 
makārantu pañcavarṇodbhavaṃ kramāt || 

pañcavarṇābhidhānaṃ syāt pāñca bhautikarūpakam | pañcabhūta 
pañcakalā rūpammaṇḍapamucyate || 

adhva śuddhiyutairmantrai rāśramairyamakhālayam | 

<p. 1313> 

adhvamantrāśrayo yasmāt pūjāṃ cakre tathādibhiḥ || 

tasmāttannāmamātraiva yāgamaṇṭapamucyate | 
maṇṭapantukriyārūpaṃ tallakṣaṇamihocyate || 

yasyā śivaviśāle kṛta deśe kalpayedbudhaḥ | 

maṇṭapānāṃ mānapramāṇatvānmānāṃgulaṃ ṣaṭbhedamuktaṃ 
kāśyape (-) 

pavāṣṭaguṇitaṃ mānaṃ mānāṃgula mihottamam | 
saptasaṃkhyayavaistāraṃ mānāṃgulantumadhyamam || 

ṣaṭsaṃkhyā yavavistāraṃ mānāṃgulaṃ tathādhamam | śālyāyata 
catuṣkantu uttamāṃgulasaṃjñitam || 

sārddhāgniśāli dīrghantu madhyamāṃguli saṃjñakam | 
śākalyāśca triguṇadīrghamadhamatvaṃ gulaṃ bhavet || 

evaṃ hi ṣaḍvidhaṃ proktaṃ mānāṃgulaṃ dvijottama | 
mānāṃgulantu traividhyaṃ cintyāṃgaṃ madhya uttamam || 

ācārya dakṣiṇe hasti madhyamāṃgulimadhyame | parvatārañca 
dīrghañca nāhaṃ nirmātrāṃgulantridhā || 

tadaṃgulaiścaturviṃśairhastamānaṃ prakīrtitam | 

aṃśumati (-) 

mānamātrāṃgulābhyāṃ vā maṇṭapamāna niścayaḥ | yāgāṃgani 
ca sarvāṇi mātrāṃgulena kārayet || 

suprabhede bhaṃgulaṃ paricchinattiti (-) 

prāsādaṃ maṇṭapaṃ caiva prākāraṃ gopuraṃ tathā | 

<p. 1334> 

grāmādhvakṣetrageṣu mānāṃgulavidhānataḥ || 

kūrce pavitrake caiva sruve sṛkbhirathānyakaiḥ | yāge 
prayojatānīha mātrāṃgulavaśāṃ nayet || 

atha mānāṃgulairvāpi kārayedyāgakarmaṇi | toraṇādipatākāśca 
kūrmādyāsanakalpanam || 

aṣṭamagularūpāṇi sṛksruvādikapātrakān | avagāhanapīṭhañca 
tripādiphalākān kramāt || 

evamādīni sarvāṇi kuryāttanmānavittamaḥ | prasaṃgā dātmārtha 
prajāyāmaṃgulantu vidhīyate || 

viśvakarmīye (-) 

ātmārthaṃ yadgṛhārcānāṃ mānāṃgulyena kārayet | 
tadyavenālpamānañca gṛhārṇānāṃ vidhānataḥ || 

suprabhede (-) 

pradeśaśca vitastiśca gokarṇaśca ime trayaḥ | yajñādike 
prayoktavyā prāsādādau na dāpayet || 

kāraṇe (-) 

kūrmāsanamuktam (-) 

rudrāṃgulantu vistāraṃ tasyairdhve naivakārayet | 

śilpe (-) 

vāsiṣṭhe maṇṭape ca tathā kuṇḍe sṛksruvecāṣṭamaṃgale | 
maṇḍale vedikāyāñca samidhādye viśeṣataḥ || 

hīnādhikaṃ bhavedvipra kṛtvā sarvaṃ punaḥ punaḥ | kṛtvaitān 
kramaṇe caiva paścātkarma samācaret || 

<p. 1335> 

anyathā cetanārthaṃ syādhajamānasya rogakṛt | 
durbhikṣabhayavṛddhisyānnātrakāryaṃ vicāraṇā || 

tasmāttanmaṇṭapādīni śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā | 

kārayediti śeṣaḥ | aṃśumati (-) 

ekahastaṃ tadardhaṃ vā talādunnata vedikām | śilāṃ vā 
ceṣṭikāṃ vāpi samiddārumayepivā || 

samāśrayaṃmaṇṭapaṃ kuryādāyatāśramathāpi vā | 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

padmeṣṭakāmayaṃ vāpi śuddhadārumayantathā | mṛṇmayaṃ vā 
tathā kṛtvā viśuddhaṃ yāgamaṇṭapam || 

aṃśumati sādhāraṇamaṇṭapalakṣaṇa muktam | 

pañcahastaṃ samārabhya caikahastavivarddhanāt | trayodaśa 
karāntantu kanyasāditrayaṃ trayam || 

pañcahastaṃ samārabhya dvidvihastavivarddhanāt | 
ekaviṃśatkarāntantu navadhāmānamucyate || 

mānaṃ niścitya tadbhāge paṃktistaṃbhasya bhaktikam | 

uttamādīni saṃ (**) ni kālakaṃ prapāyāṃ samamānāni maṇṭape 
madhyadairdhyakam | 

staṃbhamānaṃ yathā yogyaṃ tryaṃśaikārdhamadhyagāt | 
uttamatritayaṃ staṃbhāṃśca tuṣṣaṣṭhi prakalpitam || 

<p.1336> 

ṣaṭtriṃśadgātrasaṃyuktaṃ madhyamatritayeṣu ca | 
ṣoḍaśastaṃbha saṃyuktaṃ kanyasatrayamaṇṭape || 

etatsāmānyamuddiṣṭaṃ viśeṣamadhunocyate | dīkṣāyāṃ vā 
prastutatvā ddīkṣāmaṇṭapamucyate || 

kāraṇe dīkṣā prakaraṇe (-) 

dvādaṃ rudrahastaṃ vā daśahastamathāpi vā | maṇṭapaṃ 
caturaśrantu ṣoḍaśastaṃbhasaṃyutam || 

uttamādi vibhedena nabavidhamuktam | 

vīratantre (-) 

trihastaṃ pañcahastaṃ vā ṣaḍhḍhastamadhamatraye | 
saptahastāṣṭahastañca navahastantu madhyamam || 

daśaikādaśahastañca dvādaśañcottamaṃ bhavet| ṣoḍaśastaṃ 
bhasaṃyuktaṃ paṃktimānacchrayī || 

śikhāśrañcaturaṃgulyaṃ caturaśrasamanvitam | jātīñca 
caṃpakañcaiva khādiraṃ staṃbhameva ca || 

kramukaṃ veṇudaṇḍaṃ vā vakulaṃ vātha kesaram | 

jāti (*) vakulaṃ (*) kesaraṃ pantai (*) 

yājñīkaiśca vṛkṣairvā nāhaṃ viṃśati raṃgulam | 
ūrdhvamaṣṭāṃśakādekādānupūrvyāt kṛśaṃ bhavet || 

rājñī (***) yavṛkṣajamuttamam | 

tadyathā (-) 

<p. 1337> 

aśvatthoduṃbaraḥ plakṣaścāṣākhadirantathā | nyagrodhaśca 
śamībilvamacūtaṃ vai kaṃkatantathā || 

asanañca śīrṣañca yajñavṛkṣāḥ prakīrtitāḥ | 

plakṣaṃ (*) āṣāḍhi (*) yaikaṃkataṃ (*) 

asanaṃ veheka śirīṣaṃ vā na tu vīratantre (-) 

tatpañcamāṃśaṃ nikhanenmedinyāṃ tatra vittamaḥ | 
nālikeradalairvaṃśaiścādayettatsamaṃ tataḥ || 

nālikerasya patreṇa kardhvamācchādayedbudhaḥ | maṇṭapaṃ vātha 
kuṇḍaṃ vā kartavyantu pravāmayi || 

kūṭākāralakṣaṇamuktaṃ śāradā tilake (-) 

pañcabhissaptabhirhastairnavabhirvā mitāntaram | 

sarvottamānādaṃgulādihīnaṃ kāryaṃ ṣoḍaśastaṃbha saṃyuktaṃ 
catvāranteṣu madhyataḥ | 

aṣṭahasta samucchrāyāṃ saṃsthāpya dvādaśāditaḥ | pañcahasta 
pramāṇāste chidrāṃ varjayecchubhām || 

aṃśumati (-) 

eteṣāṃ maṇṭapānāntu yathā karmāhi kalpitam | āyādiśubha 
saṃyuktaṃ yajamānānukūlataḥ || 

samāgrammaṇṭapaṃ kuryācchāstra dṛṣṭena karmaṇā | saṣaṭ 
saptādvayavādhikya mukhāyāmaṃ vidhāya vit || 

<p. 1338> 

evammaṇṭapasthāna nirmāṇa sthānanirdeśa ucyate | 

caturdvāra samāyuktañcatustoraṇa bhūṣitam | caturdvāra toraṇa 
sthāpanamuktaṃ yadvā piṃgalā mate || 

hastadvayaṃ bahisttyaktvā toraṇāni nidhāpayediti | 

vacanāt maṇṭapasya dvārāgre hastadvayaṃ tyaktvā tatra 
svātvātoraṇāni nidhāpayet | tathā nyagrodhatoraṇaṃ pūrve yāmye 
cautumbarammatam | 

paścimeśvatthasaṃbhūtaṃ uttare plakṣatoraṇam | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

caturṇāmapi vṛkṣāṇāmabhāvetyekameva ca | pūrve vā 
plakṣasaṃbhūtaṃ nyagrodhañcottare matam || 

tathoktaṃ śāradātilake (-) 

dvāreṣṭatoraṇānisyuḥ kramāt kṣīramahīruhām | 
staṃbhocchrāyāsmṛtā steṣāṃ saptahastaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 

dasāṃgula pramāṇena tatpariṇāha īritaḥ | tiryak phalakamānaṃ 
syāt staṃbhānāṃ madhyamānataḥ || 

kāmike (-) 

viṣṭarordhve triśūlāni pañcahastāṃgulā vidhiḥ | saptāṃgulaṃ 
samārabhya vyomamātra vivarddhitaḥ || 

<p. 1339> 

pakṣamātrāvasānantu phaladairdhyaṃ prakalpayet | toraṇānāñca 
sarveṣāṃ mūlaṃ vai hastamānataḥ || 

vijayottare (-) 

abhāve pādapānāntu yathā lābhapramāṇataḥ | ātmārthe vā 
parārthe vā toraṇāni prakalpayet || 

nivṛtyāṃ paścimadvāre maṇṭape tatpramāṇataḥ | pratyak 
dvārapradeśe tu kalpayet mukhamaṇṭapam || 

dvārāṇi trīṇi cānyāni kaṃpacāramathāpi vā | 

evaṃ dvārasthārddhamātraṃ vā dvāraṃ saṃkalpya pūrvavat | 

kāśyape tallakṣaṇamuktam | 

vastracitaṃ prakartavya saṃyattadviśālakam | 
sthūlāduttarasīmāntaṃ kaṃpadvārodayaṃ bhavet || 

aṃśumati (-) 

sthānaṃ saṃkaṭayuktaṃ cet pūrve vā dakṣiṇepi vā | evaṃ 
dvārasya nirmāṇa maṇṭapābhyantare budhaḥ || 

dvārāṇāmubhayoḥ pārśve āgneyādi vidikṣu ca | 
maṇṭapasyādhidevānāṃ kalaśasthāpanārthakam || 

saptasaptapadaṃ vedī vistṛtaṃ tālamātrakam | 

kāśyape kapāṭalakṣaṇamuktaṃ tadyathā (-) 

atha sāradrumairviprakavārau tu dṛḍhīkṛtau | 
yaṣṭitrayāntaropetau cordhve nistocchikhānvitau || 

<p. 1340> 

snigdhasāradrumairbāhyābhyantare yaṣṭibandhitau | tripañca 
saptasaṃkhyā vā iṣṭasaṃkhyaikapārśvakam || 

athavobhayapārśvau ca lohakīle dṛḍhīkṛtau | 
dakṣapārśvakapāṭe tu yojaye dvā paṭādikām || 

badhvā kapāṭa yogau ca dārulohairdṛḍhīkṛtau | argalādi 
samopetau ghāṭanoddhaṭana kṣamau || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇa saṃyuktau kavāṭaṃ bandhayatsudhīḥ | 

athāṃśumati sūtranyāsaṃ samācaret | 

sūtrabhedaṃ pravakṣyāmi tattadbhedaṃ pṛthak pṛthak | 
paṃktyāditya manuścaiva sūtrasaṃkhyā yamādike || 

padamānaṃ prakartavyaṃ kriyābhedana dvibhedakam | liṃgasya 
sthāpane caiva vimānasthāpanepi ca || 

utsave caiva dīkṣāyāṃ kṛtamācārya secane | trayodaśa pade 
kāryaṃ kṛtvā caiva vicakṣaṇaḥ || 

pratimā berasarvasya sthāpane prokṣaṇepi ca | pavitrāṇyati vāse 
ca vimānaprokṣaṇepi ca || 

ekādaśa pade kāryaṃ maṇṭapairapi sūtrakaiḥ | bālaliṃga 
pratiṣṭhāyāṃ prāyaścittādi karmaṇi || 

aṣṭabandhanakārye ca nityanaimittike tathā | etānnarmapade kāryaṃ 
tattatkarma vicakṣaṇaḥ || 

<p. 1341> 

atra dīkṣāviśeṣasya prastutatvāttāvanmātramatrocyate | 

dīkṣādi trividhāne tu viśeṣaḥ kaśidasti hi | maṇṭapaṃ 
pūrvavatkṛtvā pādaṃ sūtraṃ tathaiva ca || 

madhye navapadaṃ vedī hastamānena connatam | pūrve navapadaṃ 
grāhyaṃ madhye kuṇḍaṃ vidhānataḥ || 

paścime navake vedī śivaliṃgārcanāntakam | kuṇḍavedikayordakṣe 
pūrvāyatavibhāgikaḥ || 

vedikāryajanārthaṃ tu śiṣyasaṃveśanārthakam | uttare nava pade 
vedī kalaśasthāpanārthakam || 

pañcauṣadhī pañcaśālī pañcamṛdbhistu vāyave | 

taduktaṃ cintyaviśve (-) 

sahadevyaikapatrañca bhadraṃ vaikaṃkataṃ tathā | viṣṇukāntiśca 
pañcaite pañcauṣadhamiti smṛtam || 

sahadevī (*) ekapatraṃ (*) bhadraṃ (*) vaikaṃkataṃ (*) 

suśālīko dravañcaiva yavanīvāra veṇukam | etāḥ pañcayavāḥ 
proktā kuṃbheṣva tātprakalpayet || 

suśālī (*) 

parvate ca taṭāke ca samudrevṛṣaśṛṃgake | 

<p. 1342> 

puṇyakṣetre mṛdaḥ grāhyāḥ krameṇaiva tu nikṣipet | 
kuṃbhañcavarddhanīñcaiva kartṛkādanu sūtrakam || 

adhivāsanakāle tu pañcagavyaṃ tathaiśake | tatrāpi padamekantu 
sañcārārthaṃ vilopayet || 

vedyagrevātha cāgneyyāṃ vāstupūjāṃ samācaret | cullikāṃ 
dakṣiṇesthāpya dharmarājasyāgrake || 

śeṣaṃ pūrvavaduddiṣṭhaṃ tatpade tadvidhānake | trīṇi dīkṣā 
prakurvanti śāṃbhavaṃ kurusecanam || 

ataḥ kramaḥ (-) 

dīkṣārthaṃ kalpitamaṇṭape śālipiṣṭārdra kārpāsasūtreṇa 
dakṣiṇottarāntaṃ paścimapūrvāntamanu sūtravinyāsena 
navaṣaṣṭhyuttaraśataṃ bhavati | tasmin bāhyāvṛti 
pradeśetvaṣṭacatvāriṃśat pade dvārañca dvārakuṃbhādi 
sthāpanārthaṃ bālamātravistārāyāmavedīṃ vidhāya pṛthak 
prakṛta tadabhyantara sthitāni catvāriṃśat padāni sañcārārthaṃ 
paritovilopya tadabhyantarasthitaikāśīti pade vāyavyāṃ navapade 
pañcauṣadhi pañcaśālī pañcamṛtā madhivāsanārthaṃ vedī 
vidhāya vakṣyamāṇa prakāreṇa vedīṃ vidhāya tatpūrvaṃ nava 
pade ācāryābhiṣeka kuṃbhasthāpanārthaṃ vedīṃ saṃkalpya 
tatpūrvaṃ navapade kuṃbhavardhanīṃ tanusūtra 
kartaryādyādhivāsanārthaṃ vedīṃ vidhāya taddakṣiṇe navapada (-) 

<p. 1343> 

madhye kuṇḍaṃ kṛtvā tatpaścime maṇḍale varapūjārthaṃ 
pradhāna vedīṃ prakalpya tayoḥ paścime iṣṭaliṃgārcanārthaṃ 
vedīṃ kalpita dakṣiṇepūrvāparāyatadvipade iṣṭaliṃgā 
nasthinyarthañca maṇḍalayajanārthañca hotraśiṣyayoḥ 
sthityarthaṃ parikalpya dharmarājasya sannidhau sthālīpākārthaṃ 
culliṃ nidhāya tatpaścime aṃkurārpaṇa sthāpanārthaṃ vedīṃ 
kalpya tayoḥ pūrve śeṣapade śiṣyādhivāsanārthaṃ ca 
yāgopakaraṇa dravyasthāpanārthaṃ parikalpayet | etatsāmānyānena 
pada vibhāgamuktvā pradhānavedikā lakṣaṇañca pradarśyate | 
tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

vedīṃ kuryādviśeṣeṇa darpaṇodarasaṃnibhām | athavā 
saṃkaṭasthāne yogyarūpeṇa kalpayet || 

hastamātraṃ tadutsedhaṃ ratnimātramathāpi vā | tālamātreṇa 
vākuryā dupavedi samanvitam || 

caturaṃgulamutsedhaṃ vistāradvayaṃgulaṃ bhavet | 

kāmike (-) 

dīkṣāprakaraṇe (-) 

tryaṃgulo dvayaṃgulo vāpi utsedhaṃ saṃprakīrtitam | ekadvitri 
catuḥ pañca tatsamañcārddha vistṛtam || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇayukta pradhānavedimānārthaṃ tatpaścimottara 
vedikādvayotsedhamānaṃ grāhyametadutsedha samānārddhaṃ (***) 
vyaśāna vedikā dvayotsedhamānaṃ kuryādutsedhamānamaṃśumati (-) 

<p. 1344> 

vimānasthāpana maṇṭapa nirmāṇāvasare pūrvaṃ pratipāditam | 

tadyathā (-) 

tatkurvanti caturdikṣu vedikāścopabhadrakām | 
navapadañcaturaśrantu tadarddhotsedhamānayuk || 

āgneyādi catuṣkoṇe tadardhotsedhamānakaḥ | 

anantaroktadīkṣāvidhāne ācāryābhiṣekavidhāne ukta pañcavediko 
vedikātrayaṃ pūrvokta utsedhamānopyasauna iti boddhavyam | evaṃ 
kṛta pradhāna vedikāyāṃ sarvakāmikamaṇṭapa lakṣaṇamuktaṃ 
suprabhede (-) 

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi maṇḍalaṃ sārvakāmikam | maṇḍalaṃ 
sāramityuktaṃ sarvandevālayaṃ viduḥ || 

manḍalantena vikhyātaṃ śivena paramātmanā | sarvapāpāni mucyante 
tato maṇḍala darśanāt || 

dīkṣā kālasya pūrve tu maṇḍalaṃ vidhinā budhaḥ | 

sūtralakṣaṇaṃ kiraṇe (-) 

karaṇaṃ kārpāsakaṃ kṣaumaṃ kuśavalkala saṃbhavam | granthyādi 
rahitaṃ kāryaṃ atha tadvitriṣaṭ bhavet || 

mṛgendre (-) 

purāyatatriguṇāyākṣaumakārpāsaśāṇavaḥ | satkanyāvaritādoṣa 
tredhādiguṇasūtrayā || 

<p. 1345> 

suprabhede (-) 

prāṇamantarabudhvā ca citrabhāgastu lakṣayet | vāmadevena 
mantreṇa sūtrapādantu kārayet || 

pūrve paścimabhāge ca sūtrandatvā samāhitaḥ | tatra sūtraṃ 
prasādhyātha dakṣiṇottaraṃ śubham || 

tatra sūtraṃ tato grāmya māśritena vinirmite | pūrvādi 
paścimāntañca sūtrantatra prasārayet || 

āgnyoḥ prabhavaṃ sūtraṃ vāyavyā prasārya ca | aiśānyāṃ 
prabhavaṃ sūtraṃ naiṛtyāntu prasārayet || 

caturaśraṃ samaṃ kṛtvā navabhāgaṃ vibhajyatām | harmyabhāgena 
padmaṃ syāt karṇikāntu samālikhet || 

caturbhāgaistu tatpadma maṇṭapatropaśobhitam | prathamaṃ 
karṇikābhāgaṃ dvitīyaṃ kesarāṇi vai || 

tṛtīyandhalasandhau tu dalāgrāṇi caturthakam | prathamāvaraṇa 
lekhāntu padmabāhye tu buddhimān || 

kāraṇe (-) 

yadvā (-) 

caturaśraṃ savistāraṃ kauśikāṃśena bhājitam | vyomena 
karṇikāṃ kuryātpakṣāṃśenaiva kesaram || 

śeṣantu damanāyāntu karṇikāyārddhamānataḥ | dalāgre 
kalpayedagrantanmānenāntare dalam || 

<p. 1346> 

dalāṣṭakasamāyuktaṃ kesarantu prakalpayet | prativāraṇarekhāntu 
kuryāddalāgramānataḥ || 

svalpasapañca kartavyaṃ vistare vistarāṃbujam | padmārthena 
bahirvīthī padmamāṃnena vā punaḥ || 

vithīsamacatudvāraśobhā cārusamāśritāḥ | tatsamālokapālau tu 
śobhāstavyoma bhāgikāḥ || 

paṅkajasya samaṃ vātha caturdikṣu niveśanam | 
dvihastañcaikahastaṃ vā ata ūrdhvaṃ na kārayet || 

suprabhede (-) 

na sthūlaṃ na kṛśaṃ hīnaṃ bakraṃ bindu vivarjitam | deva devasya 
bhavanaṃ kṛtvā tanmokṣasiddhidam || 

sthūlaṃ sarvabhayaṃ proktaṃ vaktre kalahamādiśet | hīne tu 
siddhihīnantu binduśatru bhayapradam || 

kṛśe vyādhisamutpannaṃ durbhikṣaṃ varṇamiśrake | sānnidhyaṃ na 
bhavecchaṃbho rajastatsūtrar lambane || 

tasmātsarva prayatnena kartavyaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam | 

kāraṇe (-) 

vītaśuklāruṇā kṛṣṇa vartakānana vacā smṛtā | 

suprabhede (-) 

muktāvarṇaistu tatra miśraṃ vatsavarṇaṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
padmarāgasya cūrṇaistu raktavarnaṃ praśasyate || 

indranīlasya cūrṇaistu kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ prakīrtitam | cāmīkarasya 
cūrṇaistu pītavarṇamudāhṛtam || 

<p. 1347> 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śvetaraktantathābhyāmaṃ pītakṛṣṇañca varṇakam | evaṃ 
pañcavidhaṃ proktaṃ muktādyaiḥ pañcaratnakaiḥ || 

sphaṭikairjātiliṃgādyairharitāraiśca śyāmakaiḥ | 
añjanaiścūrṇanikaraiḥ pañcabhirvā vidhānataḥ || 

padmeṣṭakā cūrṇaistu daśataṇḍula cūrṇakaiḥ | tato harīta 
cūrṇaistu kārayedabajamatravai || 

karṇikāpītavarṇena puṣparāgahemasamaṃ nibhaiḥ | 
yavamātronnataṃ tasyāḥ pañcaviṃśati puṣkaram || 

kesarā guṇasaṃkāśā athordhve śuklavarṇakāḥ | 
padmasyāṣṭadalaṃ śvetaṃ kṛṣṇarekhāttareṣu vai || 

rekhāpārśve tu ratnau tau tathaiva prativāraṇam | raktavarṇena 
vithī syāt padmasya paritastathā || 

dvārāṇi pītavarṇāni kartavyaṃ dvārapārśvayoḥ | 
śobhāścavyupaśobhāśca sarvavarṇaistu kārayet || 

sūtrāntaraṃ yavaṃ proktaṃ hṛsvāddhrasvāntaraṃ smṛtam | 
apasavye muktyarthaṃ bhuktyarthaṃ savyakena tu || 

sarvasiddhi karāgreṇa śrīkāmī muṣṭinaṃ likhet | 

kāraṇe (-) 

vāmājyeṣṭhā ca raudrī ca bhavānī ca rajodhipāḥ | sarvadoṣa 
nivṛtyarthaṃ pītavarṇaṃ prasārayet || 

<p. 1348> 

mūrtessatprakāśārthaṃ śuklavarṇaṃ prasārayet | bhadraṃ 
tvapānārthāya raktavarṇasyapātanam || 

tamasastu nivṛtyaiva kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ prasārayet | kamaṇḍale 
yogapīṭhantu saṃkalpya vidhinā kuru || 

yajetsadāśivandevaṃ karṇikāyāstu madhyame | karṇikā vāmabhāge 
tu yajeddevī manonmanīm || 

āvāhyābhyarcya vidhinā gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt | 
pañcāvaraṇamārgeṇa kṛtvāvaraṇa pūjanam || 

prathamācaraṇaṃ vāpi pūjayitvā yathāvidhi | 

yadvā (-) 

dīkṣādau tu prayoktavyaṃ vedikopari maṇḍalam | svastikaṃ 
sarvatobhadraṃ gaurītilakameva ca || 

pārvatī kāntamapyevaṃ liṃgābjasvastikaṃ tathā | 
latāliṃgodbhavañceti maṇḍalaṃ ṣaḍvidhocyate || 

śāradā tilake catuṣṭayamaṇḍalamuktam | tadyathā (-) 

sarvato bhadrakañcaiva śrāvayenmaṇḍalantathā | 
navanābhamaṇḍalañcaiva pañcābjamaṇḍalaṃ tathā || 

dīkṣāyāñcaiva pūjārthaṃ maṇḍalānāṃ catuṣṭayam | sarvaṃ 
tantrānusāreṇa proktaṃ sarvatrasiddhidam || 

sāmānyamatadīkṣāyāṃ viśesamadhunocyate (-) 

viprāṇāṃ sarvato bhadraṃ gaurītilannṛpastha tu | 

<p. 1349> 

vaiśyānāntu latāliṃgaṃ śūdrāṇāṃ svastikaṃ bhavet | 

sarvato bhadraṃ yathā (-) 

catuṣṣaṣṭhipade madhye padmavīthī caturddaśī | liṃgapīṭhañca 
kaṃpañca karṇikaṃ pañcapīṭhakam || 

catuṣṣaṣṭhyatha netraiśca catuṣṣāḍbhiḥ padaiḥ kramāt | 
mukhavarṇaiśca saṃbhūṣya vedavedapadaiḥ punaḥ || 

liṃgapīṭhe caturdikṣu svastikaṃ padapañcakaiḥ | koṇeṣvekapadaṃ 
kuryāt sarvato bhadrakaṃ bhavet || 

gaurītilakam (-) 

gaurītilakamatulaṃ sūtraissapta daśātmakaiḥ | madhye 
vyomapadaścetaṃ caturlliṃgaṃ caturddiśī || 

vidikṣupatrapuṣpāṇi bhinna varṇaiḥ prakalpayet | pratyekaṃ 
sarvakoṇeṣu pañcaviṃśatpadaiḥ kramāt || 

nānāvidheśca kartavyā latāvarṇairmanoramaiḥ | 
gaurītilakamākhyātaṃ bhogamokṣaphalaṃ bhavet || 

latāliṃgodbhavamaṇṭapaṃ tadyathā (-) 

viśvandvavibhaktesmin caturaśraṃ samantataḥ | ṣaḍbhiḥ puṣpaṃ 
surabhyañca paṭṭaṃ bhāgatrayeṇa tu || 

bhāgekeca tathā vithīṃ liṃgānyaṣṭau tathaiva ca | munidvayena 
dvāraṃ sa (*) latāssaptapadāvadhi || 

<p. 1350> 

latāliṃgodbhavaṃ nāma sarvakāma phalapradam | 

svastikamaṇḍalamuktam (-) 

tadyathā (-) 

prāgagramudagagrañca pañcasūtraṃ prasārayet | liṃgamekapadaṃ 
viddhi tripadaṃ pīṭhameva ca || 

caturliṃga samāyuktamuktavarṇaiśca bhūṣayet | evaṃ 
svastikamākhyātaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 

aṃśumati (-) 

pūrve navapadaṃ grāhyaṃ madhye kuṇḍaṃ vidhānataḥ | 

tallakṣaṇamuktaṃ mohaśūrottare (-) 

hasmānaṃ khanettiryagūrdhvamekhalayā saha | khātādbāhyeṃgulaṃ 
khaṇḍassarva kuṇḍeṣvayaṃ vidhiḥ || 

mekhalātritayaṃ kāryaṃ śrīsarāmayamaṃgulaiḥ | 
devyātsūryāṃgulaṃ nābhistryaṃśena vistareṇa tu || 

ekāṃgulāśritā sā tu praviṣṭābhyantare tathā | kuṃbhadvaya 
samāyuktā cāśvatthapatravadyathā || 

aṃguṣṭhamekhalā yuktā madhyetvājya dhṛtiryathā | dakṣasthā 
pūrvayāme tu javisthā paścimottare || 

pūrvasūtraṃ purādatvā dvitīyaṃ cottarāyatam | 
sarveṣāñcaturaśrantu kṣetraṃ kṣetreṣu saṃpadam || 

kāraṇe (-) 

nābhikṣetraṃ tridhā bhitvā madhye kurvīta karṇikām | 
bahiṃraṃśadvayenāṣṭau patrāṇi parikalpayet || 

<p. 1351> 

dakṣāṃgula samutsedhaṃ bhūtāṃgulantu vistaram | paśakāraṃ 
tathā nābhi kuryātkuṇḍasyamadhyame || 

dvibhāgandalamānaṃ syādeka bhāgantu karṇikā | 

mekhalopari aśvattha patravadyoniṃ kuryāt (-) tathā kiraṇe (-) 

aśvattha patravatkuryā dvistarāṣṭāṃgule kare | 
dvādaśāṃguladairdhyantu tadekāṃgula munnatariti || 

aṃśumati (-) 

evaṃ sarvaṃ samāsādya śilpikarmāvasānake | śilpinaṃ 
visṛjettatra mārjanaprokṣaṇaṃ kuru || 

puṣpayuk kadalīpūgastaṃbhaudvārasya pārśvakam | 
citravastrairalaṃkṛtya pūgapuṣpādyalaṃ kṛtam || 

arddhacandrākṛtiryuktaṃ darpaṇādi vitānayuk | vastreṇa 
veṣṭayedgātraṃ catustoraṇa bhūṣitam || 

dīpadhvajaissamāyuktaṃ vitānopariśobhitam | muktādāmairalaṃ 
kṛtya puṣpamālāvalaṃbitam || 

maṇṭapālaṃ kṛtañcaināndīpasamanvitam | mārjanā lepanaṃ 
kṛtvā śālipiṣṭāttacitrakam || 

triṇīdīkṣāṃ prakurvanti śāṃbhavaṃ gurusecanam | 
śiṣyapadmaparīkṣā ca gurussarvaṃ samācaret || 

|| [iti dīkṣādarśe yāgamaṇṭapa nirmāṇavidhiḥ] || 

<p. 1352> 

|| [atha vāstu pūjāvidhirucyate] || 

vāstupūjā sūkṣme (-) 

sthāpane prokṣaṇe caiva garbhanyāse tathaiva ca | vimānasthāpane 
caiva cotsave yāgamaṇṭape || 

maṇtape ca sabhāsthāne sakalasthāpanepi ca | 
ādyopaleṣṭakāsthāne satrameva nṛttaraṃgake || 

prāyaścittādike cānye sthāpane ca samārabhet | vāstu 
pūjāprakartavyā sarvasaṃpatprasiddhaye || 

vāstupūjā vihīnasyāttadrāṣṭañca vinaśyati | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena vāstupūjāṃ samārabhet || 

tathā jyotiṣaratnākare (-) 

akṛtvā vāstupūjāñca praviśennava mandiram | rogānnānāvidhān 
kleśānaśnute sarvasaṅkaṭam || 

śāradātilake (-) 

tato vakṣyāmi dīkṣāṃga vāstuyāgapurassaram | kṛte yena ca 
mantrajño dīkṣāyāṃ phalamāpnuyāt || 

suprabhede dīkṣā prakaraṇe (-) 

vāstu pūjāvidhāne tu homaṃ samācaret | 

kāraṇe (-) 

vāstuhomaḥ prakartavyaḥ sarvasaṃbhāra saṃyutam | dīkṣābhiṣeka 
saṃpannastvādiśaivo dṛḍhavrataḥ || 

sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyukta śśivaśāstra viśāradaḥ | 

<p. 1353> 

śuddhātmā vāstuvidhinā vāstu homā na kārayet || 

sūkṣme (-) 

ācāryaśśiṣya saṃyuktaḥ pūrvavat snānamācaret | 
viśuddhavastrairācchādya sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuru || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

dīkṣābhiṣekayoḥ pūrvaṃ pratiṣṭhāyāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
taṃtrāraṃbheṣu sarveṣu nānāsiddhiṣu sādhakaiḥ || 

nālikeraphalañcaiva kadalīphalameva ca | kramukaṃ phalatāṃ 
būlamikṣudaṇḍaṃ payodadhi || 

śuddhasthālyāntu saṃsthāpya pūjanaṃ sarvasiddhidam | gaṇeśaṃ 
pūjayettatraṃ nirvighno nānyathā bhavet || 

aṃśumati (-) 

sāmānyārdhyantu saṃkalpya pañcagavyantu sādhayet | 
padavinyāsamārgeṇa nyastvā brahmādirarcanam || 

hastamātrapravistāramutsedhaṃ syātryaṃgulam | vāstu kuṃbhaṃ 
samabhyarcya samayādīni mantrakaiḥ || 

agnikāryoktamārgeṇa agnikāryaṃ samācaret | paryagnikaraṇaṃ 
kuryāt homānte tu vicakṣaṇaḥ || 

atra vāstu pūjāṃ mārgeṣu bahuśaḥ pratipādayati padabhedena 
atradīkṣādau maṇḍūka padaprakāreṇa nāḍīrajju vaṃśādikaṃ 
jñātvā vāstu pūjā kāryā (-) tathā siddhāntaśekhare (-) 

<p. 1354> 

catuṣṣaṣṭi padopetaṃ sūtramaṣṭādaśānvitam | karṇasūtreṇa 
copetaṃ rajvaṣṭakavibhūṣitam || 

marma dvādaśakopetaṃ vāstudeva samanvitam | 

athācāryo hemāṃgulīyakaṭakakeyūrahema yajñopavīta 
kuṇḍalapañcāṃgabhūṣito vāstu yāgāṃgāni dravyāṇyāhṛtya 
pūrvokta manṭapasyāgneyyāṃ vā pratyeka maṇṭape vā 
hastamātravistārādhāmaṣaḍaṃgulocchrataṃ sthalaṃ kṛtvā 
tadupari catuṣṣaṣṭhipadaṃ nirmāya koṇeṣu karṇa 
sūtrāṇyāsphālya tattadagreṣu śūlānyālikhya pūrvādidikṣu 
vṛttānyālikhya maṇḍūka padaprakāreṇa vāstu pūjāṃ vidadhyāt 
| tatpūjā prakāraḥ (-) 

methake śire vidyāt brahmakāyamathocyate | āpāpavatsakau vipra 
vāmabāhuriti smṛtaḥ || 

savitā sāvitrikaṃ caiva dakṣiṇo bāhurucyate | rudro 
rudrajayaścaiva vāmapādaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 

indro indrajapaścaiva dakṣiṇaḥ pādaucyate | mitraścaiva tu 
liṃgantu vṛṣaṇaṃ pṛṣṭhameva ca || 

adhomukhobhuvaṃ prāpya śete vāstu narasmṛtaḥ | pūjākāle 
samutthānantatodaṅmukha ucyate || 

ugratvādbhayakāritvāt pūjitavyaḥ phalārthibhiḥ | caturbhuja 
jaṭāmaulī kamaṇḍalvakṣadhārikaḥ || 

<p. 1355> 

vāmahastastu jānurdhve savyahasta tale sthitam | hemābhamabja 
jāyāstvaṃgandhādyai rūpacārakaiḥ || 

oṃ brahmāsanāya namaḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ brahmamūrtaye namaḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ 
vāstvadhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ ityāvāhanādyaṣṭa 
saṃskāraissaṃpūjya (-) tatprācyā mantargata ṣaṭpadamadhye 
marīcyai namaḥ dakṣiṇāntargataṣatpadamadhye oṃ vivasvate namaḥ (-) 
paścimāntargataṣaṭpadamadhye oṃ mitrāya namaḥ | 
uttarāntargataṣaṭpadamadhye daṇḍarādharāya namaḥ | evaṃ 
prāgādi caturdevānsaṃpūjya tadbihiḥ agnikoṇastha padadvayārddhe 
oṃ savitre namaḥ tadadhaḥ koṣṭārthapade oṃ sāvitryai namaḥ 
nirṛtikoṇadvayārthapade oṃ indrāya namaḥ | tadadhaḥ koṇārddha 
pade oṃ indrajayāya namaḥ | vāyukoṇeṣu padadvayārddhe oṃ 
rudrāya namaḥ | tadadhaḥ koṇārddhapade oṃ rudrajayāya namaḥ | 
īśānakoṇe padadvayārddhe oṃ āpāya nama tadadhaḥ koṇārddhapade 
oṃ āpavatsāya namaḥ | iti koṇeṣvaṣṭa devatān saṃpūjya 
tadbahirāvṛtapade īśānakoṇārddhadakṣiṇa pade oṃ hāṃ 
īśānāya namaḥ tadadīkṣaṇe oṃ parjanyāya namaḥ oṃ jayantāya 
namaḥ | oṃ mahendrāya namaḥ oṃ ādityāya namaḥ satyakāya namaḥ 
bhraṃśāya namaḥ taduttare (-) oṃ dauvārikāya namaḥ hayagrīvāya 
namaḥ | puṣpadantāya namaḥ 

<p. 1356> 

pracetase namaḥ asurāya nama śoṣaye namaḥ | vāyukoṇārddha 
dakṣiṇapade (-) oṃ pāpākhyāya namaḥ (-) aparārthe oṃ vāyave namaḥ 
tatprāk pade (-) oṃ rogāya namaḥ nāgāya namaḥ mukhyāya namaḥ 
bhallāṭāya namaḥ somāya namaḥ atithaye namaḥ 
īśānakoṇārddhapade onditaye namaḥ (-) īśānādiśūlāgre (-) oṃ 
carakyai namaḥ (-) vitāryai namaḥ pūtanāyai namaḥ pāparākṣasyai 
namaḥ pūrvādivṛtta catuṣṭayeṣu (-) oṃ skandāya namaḥ oṃ 
jaṃbhāya namaḥ balipiñcchāya namaḥ (-) oṃ gṛhakṣatāya namaḥ (-) 
ityaṣṭa devatāḥ pūjayet pratyeka dhyānaṃ śivālaya nirmāṇa 
sthāpanādīpikāyāṃ prapañcitamatra samutāyikena dhyānamucyate (-) 

caturbhujayutāśśeṣāḥ khaḍagaveṭika dhāriṇaḥ | kṛtāñjali 
puṭopetā sarvesvasva padasthitāḥ || 

vāstu devān samabhyarcya tattannāmnā namontakam | dadhyājya 
gulasaṃmiśraṃ śuddhānnena baliṃkṣipet || 

sūkṣme (-) 

kukkuṭāṇḍa pramāṇena na balimekaṃ pradāpayet | namontaṃ 
balinirdiṣṭa svāhānteneha hūyate || 

balimaṇṭapasyaiśānāṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ śālinā kuru | lājaiḥ 
puṣpaistilairdarbhai pañcacūrṇairalaṃ kṛtam || 

sakūrcān pallavopetān savastrān sahiraṇyakān | 

<p. 1357> 

palāśa pallavopetān nālikera phalairyutān || 

saṃsthāpya vāstukuṃbhañca parivāraghaṭānvitam | 
arcayedgandhapuṣpādyaiḥ kalaśasthāpanoktavat || 

brahmādivāstudevānāṃ tattanmantraissamarcayet | naivedyaṃ 
dāpayettasmāddhūpadīpādikandadet || 

balimaṇḍalapūrve tu agnikāryaṃ samācaret | āsanamūrtimūlañca 
arcayettu viśeṣataḥ || 

kāraṇe (-) 

palāśasamidhaṃ hutvā catvāriṃśacchatādhikam | 
tatsaṃkhyayājyaṃ hutvā caruntatsaṃkhyayā tathā || 

tilataṇḍulamiśreṇa hutvā pūrvokta saṃkhyayā | vāstvantara 
bāhyasthāṃ devāṃśca svasvanāmataḥ || 

samidādikrameṇaiva pratyekaṃ juhuyāttataḥ | 

yadvā sūkṣme (-) 

daśāhudhīḥ pradhānasya agneṣvekaika māhutim | palāśa 
samidhenaivaṃ hutvā brahmādimantrataḥ || 

tridhādhikapañcāśat devatābhisvanāmataḥ | ghṛtaṃ tatsaṃkhyayā 
hutvā caruntatsaṃkhyayā hunet || 

taṇḍulaṃ tilakamiśreṇa juhuyāttatsaṃkhyayā budhaḥ | dravyānte 
vyāhṛtīrhutvā mahāstrañca śataṃ hunet || 

sarvadravyantu saṃgṛhya sviṣṭakṛddhoma mācaret | 

<p. 1358> 

yadasya karmaṇokte tu hunetpūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ || 

vahnisthañca padasthañca kuṃbhasthañca hṛdi nyaset | 
aśvatthoduṃbarān brahma patraśuṣkān sadarbhakaiḥ || 

tadvāstuśodhane tatra badhvājya tila saṃyutam | tadvāstuśodhanaṃ 
grāhya saṃprokṣya hṛdayena tu || 

tadagre vahnimāropya saṃjvālyāgni bījataḥ | prakārābhyantaraṃ 
sarvaṃ bhavanaṃ yāgamaṇṭapam || 

jayaghaṇākhopetaṃ paryagnikaraṇaṃ kuru | vāstu kuṃbhastha toyena 
prokṣayeddhṛdayena tu || 

ulkāṃtyaktvā tu tadbāhye snānaṃ kuryādvidhānataḥ | vāstu 
homaṃ samākhyātaṃ sarvadoṣa nikṛntanam || 

|| [iti dīkṣādarśe vāstupūjāvidhissamāptaḥ] || || 
athāṃkurārpaṇāvidhirucyate || 

kāraṇe (-) 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi aṃkurārpaṇamuttamam | utsave snapane caiva 
sthāpane prokṣaṇe tathā || 

naimittike ca kāmye ca prāyaścittādikepivā | anyasminmaṇgale 
kārye maṃgalāṃkuramucyate || 

suprabhede (-) 

<p. 1359> 

sarvamaṃgalakāryādau kartavyaṃ maṃgalāṃkuram | 

śāradātilake (-) 

dīkṣāyāmabhiṣeke ca navaveśmapraveśane | utsaveṣu ca sarveṣu 
vidadhyādaṃkurārpaṇam || 

vijayottare (-) 

nirdiṣṭadivasātpūrvarātrau devāṃkurārpaṇam | 
uktakṣīkṣapāyāntu martyānāṃ maṃgalāṃkuram || 

kāmike (-) 

maṇṭapasyeśa digbhāge tanmadhye vā viśeṣataḥ | sthaṇḍilaṃ 
kārayedvidvānaṣṭapatre sakarṇikam || 

suprabhededīkṣā prakaraṇe (-) 

aṃkurāṇyarpayitvātha pūrvoktavidhinā saha | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

dīkṣā pratiṣṭhā kāle ca śuddheṣvanyeṣu vai śubhe | 
aṃkurārpaṇakaṃ kuryāt karmādau nandikeśvara || 

bījānāmadhipaścandro rātrau sasyānivāpayet | dinepi ca kartavyaṃ 
kṛtañcennāśanaṃ bhavet || 

brāhmīye śivayāge (-) 

vāsare sarvadā sandhyā sandhyayorapi | 

kāraṇe viśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

sadyoṃkurārpaṇaṃ cettu divāvā niśi nirvapet | 

<p.1360> 

sūkṣme (-) 

aṃkurādaṃkuraṃ nāsti tattatkarmāntaraṃ vinā | dīkṣānirdiṣṭa 
divasānnavame saptame'pi vā || 

pañcāhetrayahe vā'pi sadya eva samācaret | 

atra mṛtsaṃgrahaṇa kramaḥ (-) nadītīre taṭāke vā 
puṣpodyānavaneṣu vā vane ketāre vā śuddhabhūtale vā gatvā 
sakalīkaraṇaṃ kṛtvā sāmānyārdhyaṃ saṃkalpyāstreṇa 
saṃprokṣya tatra bhakṣyāpūpanālikerādikaṃ vighneśvarasya 
nivedya (-) 

vighneśvara namaste'stu satataṃ modakapriya | vighnāneka 
saṃbhūtān nirvighnaṃtvaṃ prasādame || 

evaṃ prārthaya yajedbhaktyā vighneśa pūjanaṃ param | 

tasminpradeśe nava koṣṭhaṃ prakalpya madhyādīśānta koṣṭheṣu 
madhyakoṣṭhe oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
prāgādikoṣṭheṣu oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ vinatāyai 
namaḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ bhadrāyai namaḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ jayantāyai namaḥ (-) 
oṃ hāṃ bhramaryai namaḥ oṃ hāṃ prasthitāyai namaḥ oṃ hāṃ 
parijṛṃbhiṇyai namaḥ oṃ hāṃ śūlinyai namaḥ iti 
saṃpūjyānukrameṇa baliṃ prasādya tattṛptyarthaṃ sadhṛta 
gulakhaṇḍadadhyodanena tā udvāsayet | 

mṛdamaṃkurakāryārthaṃ gṛhītaṃ tvadanujñayā | 

etatsthānāśrayo devā gacchadhvaṃ hi yathā mukham | iti 
vijñāpyodvāsya balimaṇḍalapūrve puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā 

<p. 1361> 

kuntālīmastreṇa saṃprokṣya hṛdayenābhyarcya śyāmavastranibhāṃ 
bhāsvadājīva locanām hema yajñopavītāñca dvibhujāñca 
dvinetrakam | sarvābharaṇa saṃyuktāṃ karaṇḍamakuṭānvitām | 

raktāṃbaradharāṃ devīṃ dakṣahastojapalānvitām | evaṃ dhyātvā 
oṃ hāṃ bhūdevyai namaḥ āvāhanāmupacāraissaṃpūjya paritaḥ 
lokapālānsaṃpūjya prāṅmukhamudaṅmukhobhūtvā 
astramantramuccārya khānitrādinā triḥ khātvā mṛttikāṃ 
tatpuruṣeṇa sthālyāmādāya tāṃ hṛdayena saṃprokṣya 
puṣpeṇābhyarcya vastreṇa 
varmaṇācchādyāgajādyārūḍhakairmaheśvarai rudrakaṇikādibhirvā 
tāṃ vāhayitvā śaṃkhaduṃdubhi 
jayaśabdanṛttagītavādyaissārddham | pradakṣiṇa krameṇa 
yāgagṛhaṃ praviśya aiśānyāṃ naiṛtyāṃ vātmamālikhya 
īśānādi padeṣu aṃkurārpaṇa saṃkalpita sthaṇḍilopari 
paścimādi pūrvānta dakṣiṇādyuttarāntaṃ pañcasūtra vinyasena 
ṣoḍaśadhā vihakte tanmadhyakoṣṭha catuṣṭaye yāmyapuñjeṣṭa 
dalapadma mālikhya īśānādipadeṣu | svarṇarajata tāmra 
mṛṇmayādvādaśa saṃkhyān suniṣe cūrṇamṛtpūrṇā 
śirīṣāśvatthabilvaikakarṇe sthitā pālikā ghaṭikā 
śarāvānvā kevalaṃ pālikāvadhānyo pari saṃsthāpya 
candrahṛdayādinā sakalīkṛtya sāmānyārdhyaṃ saṃkalpya 
madhyakoṣṭha catuṣṭaye sa sūtraṃ hemaṃ kalaśāntaṃ 
talitāṃbhasā paripūrṇaṃ savāsasaṃ sakūrca pallavasāpidhānaṃ 
kuṃbhaṃ vinyasya | 

<p. 1362> 

oṃ hāṃ somāya namaḥ (-) ityāsanaṃ datvā tadupari oṃ hāṃ hauṃ 
somamūrtaye namaḥ | iti mūrtīṃ saṃpūjya kuṃbhamadhye tu 
toyasyārtoyamadhye tu paṃkajaṃ paṃkajasya ca madhye tu candrarūpaṃ 
praśasya te | 

śvetavarṇa dvinetrañca śvetapadmoparisthitam | dvibhujaṃ 
kumudobhetaṃ śvetavastreṇa viṣṭitam || 

(********)muktābharaṇa bhūṣitam | kirīṭamakuṭopetaṃ 
prabhāmaṇḍala maṇḍitam || 

rohiṇī vallabhaṃ dhyātvā vinyasetkuṃbhamadhyame | 

iti dhyātvā (-) 

oṃ raṃ vaṃ saṃ hīṃ haṃ śrī someśvarāya namaḥ | iti 
kuṃbhamadhye tu samāvāhya sthāpanāni kṛtvā sāṃgaṃ saṃpūjya 
pāyasānnandatvā japāntaṃ kṛtvā pūrvādi sthāpikāsu pālikāsu 

vaikartanasyarūpantu ekavaktraṃ dvihastakam | āyudhaṃ 
svarṇapuṣpañca dvihastena tu dhārakam || 

sauvarṇaṃ bhūṣaṇopetaṃ rajanīvastrameva ca | 

iti dhyātvā (-) 

oṃ vaikartanāya namaḥ 

vivasvatantu svarūpantu dvivaktrañca caturbhujam | āyudhābja 
dvayakaraṃ abhayaṃ varadānvitam || 

piṃgalañcaiva vastraṃ syāt bhūṣaṇañca pravālakam | 

oṃ vivasvate namaḥ (-) 

mārtāṇḍasya pravālantu trivaktraṃ ṣaṭbhunānvitam 

<p. 1363> 

abhayavaradañcaiva akṣamālā kamaṇḍalum | abjadvayakarañcaiva 
hāramābharaṇantathā || 

oṃ mārtāṇḍāya namaḥ (-) 

bhāskarasya svarūpantu dvivaktrañca caturbhujam | namaskāra 
dvihastena parahastāṃ bujadvayam || 

śoṇāntaṃ śoṇavastrañca bhūṣaṇaṃ nīlaratnakam | 

oṃ bhāskarāya namaḥ (-) 

raveścaivasvarūpantu caturbhujasamanvitam | viśeṣādaṣṭahastantu 
akṣamālākamaṇḍalum || 

śūlaṃ pāśāṃkuśābjañca abhayāvaradantathā | āyudhānāmiti 
proktaṃ raktavarṇañca dhāriṇam || 

bhūṣyamamaratakañcaiva evaṃ dhyātvā prapūjayet | 

oṃ ravaye namaḥ (-) 

loka prakāśakaṃ varṇa rājāvartasya sannibham | daśahastaṃ pañca 
vaktraṃ dvihastaiścābjameva ca || 

śūlamaṃkuśadaṇḍau ca japamālā kamaṇḍalum | śarañcāpañca 
daṇḍañca mudrādakṣau karānvitam || 

nīlaraktañca sarvāṃga nīlavastrañca dhāriṇam | 

oṃ lokaprakāśāya namaḥ (-) 

lokasākṣīṃ pravakṣyāmi ekavaktraṃ dvihastakam | 

<p. 1364> 

kalitāñjali hastañca śvetavarṇañca bhāvayet | 
vastramekantukāṣāyaṃ bhasmoddhūlitavigraham || 

oṃ lokasākṣiṇe namaḥ (-) 

trivikramasvarūpantu dvibhujañca caturbhujam | 

oṃ trivikramāya namaḥ (-) 

ādityasya svarūpañca ekavaktraṃ dvihastakam | nālabjakarayugme va 
ḍāḍimikramumaprabham || 

raktābharaṇamevantu saṃcintyādityarūpakam | 

oṃ ādityāya namaḥ (-) 

sūryasyāpi svarūpantu ekavaktraṃ bhujāṣṭakam | abjadvaya 
karopetaṃ khaṇḍādhūpa kamaṇḍalum || 

abhayavaradopetaṃ akṣamālā samanvitam | hemavastrañca hemābhaṃ 
bhūṣaṇaṃ svarṇameva ca || 

evaṃ dhyātvā viśeṣeṇa sūryamūrtiṃ prapūjayet | 

oṃ sūryāya namaḥ (-) 

aṃśumāli svarūpantu ṣaḍvaktraṃ raktavarṇakam | dvādaśā 
hastamevantu purahastāṃbujadvayam || 

tomarāsiñca khaṭgañca kheṭakaṃ pāśamaṃ kuśam | śakti 
vetālamabhayaṃ varadandakṣavāmataḥ || 

aṃśumāline namaḥ (-) 

divākarasvarūpantu dvimukhaṃ catuhastakam | 

<p. 1365> 

bilvapatradvayakaraṃ padmapuṣpakaradvayam || 

rajanīvastra saṃyuktaṃ hemābharaṇa bhūṣitam | 

oṃ divākarāya namaḥ (-) oṃ ravaye namaḥ (-) evaṃ dhyātvārcayet 
yadvā (-) oṃ hāṃ vai kartanāya namaḥ (-) oṃ vivasvate namaḥ (-) oṃ 
mārtāṇḍāya namaḥ (-) oṃ bhāskarāya namaḥ (-) oṃ ravaye namaḥ (-) 
oṃ loka prakāśakāya namaḥ (-) oṃ lokasākṣiṇe namaḥ (-) oṃ 
trivikramāya namaḥ (-) oṃ ādityāya namaḥ (-) oṃ sūryāya namaḥ (-) 
oṃ aṃśumāline namaḥ (-) oṃ divākarāya namaḥ (-) iti 
pūrvādīśānta dvādaśādityān pūjayet | aṣṭapakṣe indrādīn 
saptasaptamantrān pañcapakṣe nivṛtyādīn saṃpūjya dhūpadīpādi 
gandhādinābhyarcya eteṣāṃ pāyasaṃ nivedya 
śuddhapātrasthakṣīre oṃ hrīṃ śaktaye namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
tasminnivāramudgatila sarṣapaśivaṃ kūlasthāni sapta bījāni teṣu 
pañcatrīṇi vā tatprakṣālya catussaṃskāraissaṃskṛtya 
saṃhitayā saṃpūjya śivapūjamiti saṃbhāvya tasminnikṣipya 
pālikādiṣvādhāra śaktiṃ saṃpūjya dhūpadīpādikaṃ datvā 
śaṃkhakāhalabheryāmaṃgaladhvanipūrvaṃ hṛdayena 
mūlabrahmāṃgairvā bījāni sakṣīraṃ vāpayitvā 
somakuṃbhajalenā pratyaha māplāvya tatkuṃbhamapi 
śuddhajalenāpūrayet yāvadudaiśya karmadinantāvat somaṃ saṃpūjya 
nirdiṣṭa divasāvasane kuṃbhastha parāṅmukhārdhyāṃ tatsaṃpūjya 
visrajet | 

<p. 1366> 

siddhānte (-) 

yajamānābhivṛddhayarthaṃ aṃkurāṇi parīkṣayet | 
samyagūrdhvaprarūḍhāni komalāni ca tāni ca || 

aṃkurāṇi śubhāni syuḥ kṛṣṇānyaśubhadāni ca | 
dhūmravarṇānyapūrvāṇi varjayedaśubhāni ca || 

avṛṣṭiṃ kurute nityaṃ dhūmrābhaṃ kalahaṃ bhavet | apūjana 
nāśañca durbhikṣāśyāmalāṃkuram || 

tiryaggate ca vādhi syāt kubjaṃ śatrabhayantathā | aśubhe 
cāṃkure jāte śāntihomaṃ samācaret || 

mūlamantreṇa juhuyāt guruśiṣyaissaha kramāt | aghorāstreṇa 
cāstreṇa śataṃ vātha sahasrakam || 

anaṃkurantu yatkarma tatsarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet | aṃkurārpaṇakaṃ 
kṛtvā karmakuryāttu pūrvakam || 

śrīkaraṃ vijayaṃ puṇyaṃ āyurārogya varddhanam | 
athavānyaprakāreṇa kathyate cāṃkurārpaṇam || 

kāle tu tvarite prāpte kuryātsadyoṃ kurārpaṇam | pālikādiṣu 
pātreṣu nālikera prasūnakam || 

dūrvākṣata tilairyuktaṃ pūrayenmūla vidyayā | 

[iti vāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita dīkṣādarśe aṃkurārpaṇa 
vidhiḥ] || 

<p. 1367> 

|| [atha maṇṭapa pūjāvidhirucyate] || 

tadyathā (-) 

ācāryo kṛtanityāhnīka kriyadvayaḥ parityakta bhojanassayantanīṃ 
sandhyāṃ nirvatya viśeṣatarpaṇārthaṃ punarācamya 
pañcabrahmaṇā vidyāvidyeśvarāṇāṃ tatvatatveśvarāṇāṃ ca 
dhyātvā trivāra dvivāvamekavāraṃ viśeṣatarpaṇaṃ kuryāt | 

taduktaṃ mṛgendre (-) 

tataśca punarācamya pāṇyagreṇa goṇottaram | brahmādi pañcakān 
sarvān vidyāvidyeśvarānapi || 

tatvānadhipatīn sarvān dhyāyan kālārddhamaṇḍale | 
caturthyantāścayānena svāhāntena tu tarpayet || 

cintye (-) 

ātmārthaṃ vidhivatkṛtvā viśeṣaṃ tarpayedguruḥ | tarpaṇānte 
viśeṣeṇa sarvālaṃkāra saṃyutam || 

tathā māhendre (-) 

praviśe maṇṭapantatra bhasmoddhūlita vigrahaḥ | 
pūjayetpūrvamātmānaṃ naimittikamathācaret || 

aṃśumati (-) 

maṇṭapārādhanaṃ vakṣye śrūyatāṃ ravisattama | sarvatantrāṇi 
garbhiṇyātsakalā ca svarūpiṇīm || 

indrādyairloka pālaiśca rakṣaṇīya mukhālayam | 
tantrāṇāmudbhavārthāya maṇṭapārādhanaṃ kuru || 

tasmāttatmaṇṭapaṃ dhyātvā kriyāpūrvaṃ viṃcakṣaṇaiḥ | 

<p. 1368> 

kiṃ rūpaṃ maṇṭapaṃ bhāvyaṃ vadame pārvatī pate || 

maṇṭapantu kalārūpañcatu vaktrantu bhāskaram | maṇṭapāvayavaṃ 
kalpya pañcabhautika rūpakam || 

tanmaṇṭapaṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇa bhūṣitam | gajāṣṭadik 
patākādi daśāstraṃ śaktisaṃyutam || 

maṇṭapāvratadeśe tu kṛtvā tanmaṇṭape budhaḥ | ghaṭe liṃge ca 
bere ca yājñadravye ca puṣpake || 

adhvāṇibhiḥ praśasyante sarvābhāva yavān kramāt | 
sarvamantraiścādhivaset adhivāsana maṇṭapam || 

tasmāttanmaṇṭapaṃ jñātvā kalārūpaṃ smaredrave | kalāyāṃ 
sarvamutpannaṃ yattadrūpaṃ kalāmayam || 

sākalāmantrarūpantu tasmāttanmaṇṭapārcanam | padādhvā 
padabhāge tu varṇādhvā padamadhyage || 

ghaṭodareṣu mantrādhvā berasyāvayaveṣu ca | maṇṭapāvayavadravye 
tatvādhvā saṃsthita kramāt || 

bhuvanādhvāya ūrdhvāya sarvaṃ saṃpādya rakṣitum | kalādhvā 
sarvagarbhā ca ṣaṭhadhvā parimaṇḍitam || 

sarvaṃ jñātvā kṛtantrajña sarvakarmārthako bhavet | 
yāgāṃgamaṇṭapaṃ hyevaṃ arcanaṃtvadhuno cyate || 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

śivoktena vidhānena iṣṭvādevānunukramāt | 

<p. 1369> 

pūjayitvā vidhānena tato dīkṣāṃ samācaret || 

sarvavighna vināśāya gaṇāyāgaudbhaveddhruvam | madhyame 
śivakuṃbhantu dvātriṃśat prastha pūritaḥ || 

varddhanīñca tadarddhena pūritaśśiva pūritaḥ | 
trisūtraveṣṭanaṃ kuṃbhe dvisūtraṃ karake bhavet || 

anyeṣāmapi sarveṣāmekasūtreṇa veṣṭitam | 

ācāryo dakṣiṇapādapurassaram | yāgagṛhaṃ praviśya 
vakṣyamāṇendrāgni padamadhyapade śivasūrya pūjārthaṃ kuṃbhaṃ 
vinyasya tasmin | 

sauraṃ kuṃkumasaṃkāśaṃ parahastāmbujadvayam | abhayavaradopetaṃ 
sarvābharaṇa bhūṣitam | iti dhyātvā nityokta vamabhyarcya 
sūryamūlaśataṃ japāpadādinā samabhyarcya utthāya bahirnirgatya 
pūrva kusaurabhāni pratyarthaṃ pādau hastau ca prakṣālya 
pūrvatoraṇamadhye oṃ hāṃ śāntitoraṇāya bhadrāya namaḥ | 
triśūle oṃ hāṃ pūṣṇe namaḥ oṃ dhātre namaḥ oṃ vidhātre 
namaḥ | dakṣiṇe toraṇe oṃ bhūti toraṇāya vijayāya namaḥ | 
triśūle | oṃ bhavāya namaḥ | oṃ parjanyāya namaḥ | oṃ indrāya 
namaḥ | paścimatoraṇe (-) oṃ balatoraṇāya vajrāya namaḥ | śūle | 
oṃ aryamṇe namaḥ | oṃ mitrāya namaḥ | oṃ tvaṣṭre namaḥ | 
uttaratoraṇe (-) oṃ ārogya toraṇāya namaḥ | nīlalohitāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1370> 

trīśūle viṣṇave namaḥ | oṃ savitre namaḥ | oṃ aṃśumate namaḥ 
iti toraṇa śūladevān saṃpūjya pādyādi datvā 
pūrvadvārāṇyastreṇa saṃprokṣya pūrvadvārādi 
padottarapadakuṃbhe | 

dhvajābhayākṣamālābjaśśānti ssarvopavītinīm | 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ pañcavaktrā caturbhujā || 

iti dhyātvā oṃ hāṃ śāntikalādvārāya namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
paścimadvārasya dakṣiṇa padakuṃbhe (-) 

taptacāmīkarābhāsā caturvaktrendubhūṣitā | 
vaktrābhayākṣamālābjānivṛtti parikīritā || 

iti dhyātvā (-) oṃ hāṃ nivṛtti kalādvārāya namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
paścimadvārasya dakṣiṇa padakuṃbhe (-) 

śāntyābhayākṣamālābjā viśadvivaktrā ca caturbhujā | 
pāśābhayākṣa mālābjā pratiṣṭhā ratnabhūṣitā || 

iti dhyātvā oṃ hāṃ pratiṣṭhākalādvārāya namaḥ | ityabhyarcya 
pādyādinā saṃpūjya pūrvadvārasyottarapadakuṃbhe (-) oṃ hāṃ 
nandine namaḥ | dakṣiṇe padakuṃbhe | oṃ hāṃ mahākālāya namaḥ 
dakṣiṇasya pūrvakuṃbhe (-) oṃ devyai namaḥ dvārasya pūrvakuṃbhe (-) 
oṃ hāṇ caṇḍāya namaḥ iti pratidvāraṃ tayoḥ pārśvayoḥ 
kalaśayosthaṇḍile kṛte bhittau vā tattadhyāna purassaraṃ 
dvārapālānsaṃpūjya lokapālānsaṃbhāvya dhyātvā 
dhvajāṣṭakaṃ pūjayet | 

<p. 1371> 

tathaiva tat śākhayoḥ pūrvadvāradevārcanasyottare asminviṣaye 
dvārāṇāmubhayoḥ pārśve aṣṭāviṃśat padāratam | 

pūrvadvārādinandyādīn śāntyantaṃ bhavati kramāt | 
ityaṃśumadvacane | dvārapālasthāna vaiparītyavarṇanaṃ vikalpya 
tayā va pratiṣṭhā viṣayatayā vā neiyam | pūrvadvāra bāhyottare 
oṃ hāṃ praśāntapatākāya namaḥ | dakṣiṇe | oṃ hāṃ 
śirapatākāya namaḥ | dakṣiṇadvārapūrve | oṃ hāṃ parjanya 
patākāya namaḥ | paścime oṃ hāṃ jayantapatākāya namaḥ | 
paścimadvāradakṣiṇe | oṃ hāṃ bhūtasañjīva patākāya namaḥ | 
uttare (-) oṃ hāṃ amṛtapatālāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ināpatākāya 
namaḥ | pūrve oṃ hāṃ śrī pradāyakāya namaḥ 

raktavarṇa praśāntādyādvibhujā ca dvilocanā | kṛtāñjalipuṭo 
hyeṣā sarvābharaṇa bhūṣitā | 

iti dhyātvā patākāṣṭakaṃ pūjayet tathaiva gajāṣṭakaṃ pujayet 
oṃ hāṃ kumudāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ puṇḍarīkāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ śaṃkukaṇṭhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sarvanetrāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ ṣaṇmukhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ supratiṣṭhāya namaḥ | 
dhyānam | kumudān sitā kālī kṛṣṇabhenduśarāṃśubhān | 

<p. 1372> 

dvilocanāndvibāhūṃśca daṇḍābhayakarānvitaḥ | iti dhyātvā 
pādyādinā supūjya paścimadvāre nityavadvārapālānabhyarcya (-) 

aṃguṣṭhānāmikāgrābhyāṃ oṃ hāṃ śivāya namontakam | 

netradvayepi vinyasya nirīkṣeddivya vighnakān | santyajya 
sarvavighnāṃśca punarnārācamudrayā || 

tarjarnyāguṣṭhapuṣpeṇa oṃ hāṃ astrāya phaḍiti antarikṣastu 
vighnānnirāsānnandikeśvara | savyāpāṣṇi trikhātena bhūmiṣṭha 
vighna nāśanam | 

huṃ phaḍantāstramantreṇa vighnanissāraṇaṃ bhavet | 

iti divyāntarikṣa bhūmiṣṭhā trividhānvighnānutsārya 
paścidvāradehalyāṃ pādena spṛśan vāmapārśva 
śākhāsamāśritya savyapādapurassaraṃ antaḥ praviśya 
paścimābhimukho bhūtvāthādumbara madhye (-) 

caturvaktrañcaturbāhuṃ pradīptāgni samaprabham | 
dakṣavāmakaraiśśakti śūlābhaya varānvitam || 

jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyuktaṃ arddhendukṛtaśekharam | 

iti dhyātvā | oṃ hāṃ astradvārapālāya namaḥ | ityabhyarcya 
pradakṣiṇa krameṇa gatvā itaradvārāṇi saṃghaṭya praviśya 
nairṛte prāk tripadamadhyāsthitakuṃbhe (-) 

<p. 1373> 

brahmā caturmukhodyātā kamanḍalvakṣamālikā | haṃsārūḍhassamā 
yātutvāsīno dvi (***) taḥ || 

iti dhyātvā āhāṃ vāstvadhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ | ityābhyarcya 
pādyādinā saṃpūjya tṛṇādyācchādita yāgagṛhaścet kaṃpeṣu (-) 
oṃ pṛthivī tatvāya namaḥ | triṇeṣu oṃ hāṃ jalatatvāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ agnitatvāya namaḥ | vaṃśeṣu | oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvāya 
namaḥ | aṃghriṣu oṃ hāṃ ākāśatatvāya namaḥ | vitāne (-) oṃ 
hāṃ candrāya namaḥ | taraṃge | oṃ hāṃ jāhnavyai namaḥ | 
darbhamālāyām | oṃ hāṃ vāsukaye namaḥ | ityabhyarcya 
mapavedyarāleṣu | brāhmaṇādīnāṃ svasvasva 
jātyuktatveṣtamaṃgalan | pūjayet | taduktam | karaṇe (-) 

devāṣṭamaṃgulañcaiva dvijāmaṣṭamaṃgulam | 
nṛpāṣṭamaṃgulañcaiva vaiśyānāmaṣṭamaṃgalam | 
indrāṣṭamaṃgalañcaiva sarveṣāmaṣṭamaṃgalam | 

devāṣṭamaṃgalaṃ prastutatvānnoktam | 

patākāśaṃkha cakrañca pūrṇakuṃbhaṃ sapatnakam | chatraṃ 
lakṣmī pradīpañca dvijānāmaṣṭa maṃgalam || 

nṛpāṣṭamaṃgalāgaurī vṛṣagajaścaiva cāmare kesarīdmaṣaḥ | 

patākā ca pradīpañca bhūbhujāmaṣṭamaṃgalam | chatrake tu 
patākā śrī bherī kuṃbhañca dīpikā || 

<p. 1374> 

kalyāvartañca etādyaivaiśyānāmaṣṭamaṃgalam | darpaṇaṃ 
pūrṇakuṃbhañca patākācchatrabherikā || 

śrīvatsaṃ svastikaṃ padmaṃ śūdrāṇāmasṭamaṃgalam | 

evaṃ bhedavidhiṃ jñātvā karma kuryāt | vicakṣaṇaḥ | 

lohajai vīrujairvāpi kārayedasṭamaṃgalam | atha cāṣṭāṃgulaṃ 
tāramāyāmaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulam || 

atha padmasya pīṭhantu taccaturthāṃśamānataḥ | padmorddhe 
darpaṇādīni kārayedatha lekhayet || 

kāmike viśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

rudrāṃgula samārabhya sārdhāṃgula vivarddhanāt | 
viṃśatyekonamātrāntamayamāditrayantrayam || 

hitvāṣṭamaṃgulaṃ vātha tatsthāne tānprapūjayet | 
śaivosṭamaṃgulaṃ kuryāt devānvāthavarṇanāma || 

grāmādau svagṛhe vāpi yajamānānurūpataḥ | pūrvadarpaṇa 
kuṃbhau ca dakṣiṇe vṛṣa cāmarau || 

paścime svasti lakṣmī ca uttare śaṃkhadīpakau | ityete vedikā 
prānteṣu aṣṭamaṃgalapaṃktayaḥ || 

hitvāṣṭamaṃgalaṃ vātha tatsthāne tān prapūjayet | ūrvaśī 
menakā caiva raṃbhā caiva tilottamā || 

sumukhī sundarī caiva kāminī kāmavarddhinī | 

<p. 1375> 

etātvapsarasaḥ proktātvaṣṭamaṃguladhāriṇam || 

darpaṇe (-) 

oṃ hāṃ skandāya namaḥ | pūrṇakuṃbhe | oṃ hāṃ laṃbodarāya 
namaḥ | vṛṣabhe | oṃ hāṃ vīrabhadrāya namaḥ | yugmacāmare | 
oṃ hāṃ gaṃgāyai namaḥ | śrīvatse | oṃ hāṃ mahālakṣmyai 
namaḥ | svastike oṃ hāṃ rudrāya namaḥ | śaṃkhe | oṃ hāṃ 
candrāya namaḥ | dīpe oṃ hāṃ śauryai namaḥ | ityabhyarcyāstra 
prakārakavacāva kuṇṭhanābhyāṃ yāgamaṇṭapaṃ saṃlakṣya 
maṇṭape berāddakṣita kūrmāsane prasānādinādyanyatamaṃ 
vinyasyopariścadvayorjānū ca jaṃghe dve pādāgrañcaiva kārayet | 
kāmiko viśeṣārdhyantataḥ kuryāt | saṃghṛṣṭam | 

īṣannāsāgradṛṣṭistu dehi dīrghañca tatra vai | 
rūcirāsanamākhyātā sarvapūjārhakaṃ viduḥ || 

evaṃ sthitvā karma kuryāt | tathāṃśumati (-) 

vidikā dakṣiṇe bhāge cottarābhimukhasthitaḥ | 
nityavadbhūtaśuddhayādi sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuru || 

dabhaṃgī vaktrabhaṃgī vā ḍhābhaṃgī yathā śramam | 
aṣṭatriṃśatkalābhaṃgī mātṛkādīnyathā nyaset || 

vidyādehañca netrañca hṛdayādīni vinyaset | antaryāgañca 
bhavanaṃ samādhiñcaiva kārayet || 

kāmike (-) 

<p. 1376> 

viśeṣārdhyantataḥ kuryāt yavasiddhārthakādibhiḥ | 

śivatvavyāptika maṣṭāṃga utam | śivārdhyañca vidyātatvānta 
vyāptikañca rodhokhyañcātmatatvāntavyāptikaṃ paśuprokṣaṇārtha 
paśvardhyañca mantrasaṃhitayā trayaṃ saṃpādya 
śivārdhyeṇātmānaṃ saṃprokṣya yāgopakaraṇadravya jātamastreṇa 
saṃprokṣya | kavacenābhyukṣya hṛdayenābhimantrya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhayāmṛtī kuryāt | tataścandanena lalāṭe tilakaṃ 
mūlamuccārya nyastvātmānamabhyarcya mantraśuddhiṃ 
kṛtvoṣṇīṣādina svavapuralaṃ karaṇaṃ kuryāt | tathā dīpte (-) 

sthāpane prokṣaṇe yāge vahnikārye jape tathā | 
uṣṇīṣañcottarīyañca dhārayestu śivadvijaḥ || 

sitaṃ sūkṣmaṃ ca suślakṣṇaṃ sadaśañcāṣṭa hastakam | 
pañcabhāgaika vistāraṃ saptabhāgamathāpi vā || 

ekadvitri kṛvādvahne puritaḥ pariveṣṭayet | tasyāgraṃ dakṣiṇe 
karṇe bandhayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ || 

suprabhede (-) 

anvādhastāt śirontaṃ yat karṇau sañcchādyayatnataḥ | śiro 
veṣṭanakaṃ nāma mṛdunā śuklavāsasā | 

dīpte (-) 

uṣṇīṣārddhaṃ parigrāhya dvau dvau pucche tu bandhayet | 

<p. 1377> 

yajñopavītavaddhāryamuttarīyaṃ vicakṣaṇam | agnidagdhaṃ tathā 
jīrṇaṃ cinnaṃ tatra vivarjayet || 

kāmike (-) 

sottarīyantu viprāṇāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ kevalantu vat | 

kāraṇe (-) 

uṣṇīsañcottarīyañca strī śūdrāṇāṃ vivarjayet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śvetosṇīṣam nyasenmūrdhni mūlamantrābhi mantritaḥ | uttarīyantu 
gāyatryā sadyo jātena vāsasaḥ || 

karpūrakṣodasaṃyuktaiścandanaiḥ kusumaistathā | bhasmanā 
gandhayuktena svātmānaṃ bhūṣaṇaistathā || 

aṃkurā ca viśeṣeṇa deśikotyanta nirmalaḥ | kṣaumaiśca 
śuddhavastraiśca vividhābharaṇairyuta || 

aṃśumati (-) 

arhate naiva vastreṇa ācchādya sa samāhitaḥ | evaṃ vapuralaṃ 
kṛtyānantaraṃ śivahastaṃ vidadhyāt || 

tadyathā (-) 

svadakṣiṇa hastatale vāmāṃguṣṭhena ca lepite tanmadhye 
āsanamūrtīṃ vinyasyāṃguṣṭhādikianiṣṭhānteṣvīśānādi 
pañcakaṃ vinyasya vidyādehanetramūlanyāsau vidhāya 
śivamāvāhyāṃgāni kaniṣṭhādi vinyasya paramīkṛtya śivahastaṃ 
saṃkalpya tenorūpaṃ dhyātvā 
svaśirasyadhiropyānenatamapaṭalucchedayet | 

ṣaṭtriṃśaddarbhasaṃgrāhya jñānakhaṭgaṃ prakalpayet | 

<p. 1378> 

tālamātra samopetakārayedveṇi baddhavat || 

agrantu dvayaṃgulañcaiva granthirekāṃgulaṃ bhavet | 

yadvā (-) upabhedakāraṇe (-) 

dvātriṃśaddarbhasaṃgrāhyantu caturaṃgulam | 
ganthidvayaṃgulairyuktaṃ nā (**) veṇirūpavat || 

granthiragre samāyuktaṃ ratnimātraṃ sudairdhyakam | 
aṣṭādaśāṃgulaṃ deyamathavā dvādaśāṃgulalam || 

śūle tu kaṇṭhamānaṃ tu caturaṃgulameva ca | ūrdhvādhastāṃ 
śayoścaiva pañcatryamgulameva vā || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ saptadhāstrajaptaṃ jñānakhaḍagaṃ 
deśiko dakṣakaṭyāṃ bandhayet | 

kuṃbhastvagnimadhyastho liṃgastho maṇḍalasthitaḥ | ācārya 
hṛdayasthaśca pañcasthaḥ pāśamocaka || 

sarveṣāṃ karma (**) kṣimaṇḍalasyassadāśiva | yajñasya rakṣakaḥ 
kuṃbhe (**) ka homakarmaṇi || 

śiṣye tu pāśanāśāya maddehaṃ pāśamocaka | 

ityuktatvāt sa evāhamiti śivohamityaikyaṃ bhāvya | aiśānyāṃ 
nairṛtyāṃ vā pañcagavya sthāpanārthaṃ ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā 
sthaṇḍilaṃ gomayenālipya tasmin pūrvāgramuttarāgraṃ 
pañcasūtraṃ prasādhya madhye catuspathatvekārthaṃ vilomya (-) 

<p. 1379> 

pūrvādi dvidvi pade dvimekapadaṃ prakalpya āgneryyādi vidikṣu 
ekaikamevaṃ navakoṣṭha prakalpya koṣṭhaprati uttamādi 
bhedenāḍhakamardhaṃ tadardhaṃ vā śālīnvinyasya 
taduparitaṇḍūlandarbhānāstīrya tanmadhye oṃ hāṃ 
śivatatvakoṣṭhāya namaḥ pūrve oṃ hāṃ sadāśivatatvakoṣṭhāya 
namaḥ | dakṣiṇe oṃ hāṃ vidyātatvakoṣṭhāya namaḥ | uttare oṃ 
hāṃ puruṣatatvakoṣṭhāya namaḥ paścime oṃ hāṃ 
kālatatvakoṣṭhāya namaḥ | aiśānye oṃ hāṃ prakṛtitatva 
koṣṭhāya namaḥ iti koṣṭhapūjāṃ vidhāya teṣvāropiteṣu 
pātreṣu madhyādi krameṇa oṃ hāṃ supratiṣṭhapātrāya namaḥ oṃ 
hāṃ suśāntapātrāya namaḥ tejotpātrāya namaḥ raktodakapātrāya 
namaḥ raktodakapātrāya namaḥ amṛtātmapātrāya namaḥ | avyakta 
pātrāya namaḥ | iti pātrapūjāṃ vidhāya teṣu 
kṣīradadhighṛtagojala gomayakuśodakānnikṣipya 
īśitatpuruṣāghora vāmajātagāyatryā mūlena vā yathākrameṇa 
saṃpūjyārdhya bījaṃ nikṣipya īśānadi ekadvitri catuḥ 
pañcamūlenaṣoḍaśavāra mabhimantrya gomayādi saṃhāramārgeṇa 
pañcabrahmamuccarannikṣipyānte kuśodakamūlamantreṇa madhyapātre 
saṃyojya tatra kūrcaṃ kṣipatvā punaḥ kuśasahitena dakṣapāṇinā 
vidhāya saṃhitayā gāyatryā vābhimantrya 
saṃrakṣyāvakuṇṭhyāmṛtī kṛtya dhūpadīpādikandadet | 
tilasarṣapalājabhasma (-) 

<p. 1380> 

kusumakuśākṣatān saptasaṃkhyādvikirān huṃphaḍantāstreṇa 
saptadhābhimantryanetrapaṭapāśa sūtrādīni 
kartaryādyāgopakaraṇa viśeṣadravyāṇi pratyekaṃ 
mūlenābhimantrya maṇṭaparnaiṛtyā 
mīśānābhimukhasthitvordhvakāyo 
pañcagavyābhāmardhyābhyāmastreṇa yāgagṛhaṃ saṃprokṣya 
nirīkṣaṇādi catuṣpadānta saṃskārai sthānaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | 

maṇṭapānāntu sarveṣāṃ saṃskāroṣṭādaśa smṛtaḥ | 
vīkṣaṇādi samāyukto guruśalyānivṛttaye || 

taduktaṃ sūkṣme (-) 

nirīkṣaṇā hṛdayenaiva prokṣaṇantvīśa mantrataḥ | tāḍanaṃ 
huṃ phaḍantenābhyukṣaṇaṃ śirasāyudha || 

ghananañcāstramantreṇa uddhāraṃ ghoramantrataḥ | pūraṇaṃ 
vāmadeve na sadyo naiva samaṃ kuru || 

śikhāyāṃ secanaṃ kuryāt kuṭṭanañcaiva varmaṇā | mārjanaṃ 
netramantreṇa lepanaṃ puruṣeṇa tu || 

nivṛtyādi kalānāntu kalpayet tatsvanāmataḥ | trisūtraṃ vartulaṃ 
kuryāt bījamukhyena mantrataḥ || 

mūlenaiva samabhyarcya īśerekhātrayaṃ nyaset | vajrī 
karaṇamastreṇa catuṣkaṃ mūlamantrataḥ || 

vikirānya sa (*) tra ca vikīrya kuśakūrcakaiḥ | 

<p. 1381> 

saṃgṛhya śivagāyatryā viśedīśānagocare || 

āsanañcāstravarddhanyā kalpayetkalpavittamaḥ | 

vidhātasmin jvaladastrabhūtādvikirān huṃ 
phaḍantāstreṇāntarikṣavighna praśamanārthaṃ vikīrya 
pradakṣiṇakrameṇa bhūtagatavighna nivāraṇārthaṃ hastagate 
darbheṇollikhya tatsaṃhṛtya varddhanyāsanāya aiśānyāṃ 
saṃsthāpya paścime varuṇasyottarakuṃbhe (-) 

padmāsanāsīnā padmābhaṃ padmahastanī | 
hemaratnojvalanbakrakuṇḍalaṃ karṇabhūṣaṇam || 

śobhanāṃbarasaṃnābha śoṇī ca viputā matā | mekhalā 
kaṭisūtrāṃgī lakṣmī lakṣmī vivarddhanī || 

iti dhyātvā oṃ hāṃ mahālakṣmyai namaḥ | padyādinā saṃpūjya | 
aiśānyāntilādi saptadhānyasthe vastre śoṇitāṃ bhasā pūrite 
cūtāśvattha palvalaṃ vā nālikeramātulaṃga phalaṃ vā 
kūrcādyalaṃ mukhe cāmīkara niṣkapramāna ratnauṣadhi 
lohādigarbhite paścimānane mūrtibhūte kuṃbhe | vṛṣāsame | 
pūjya anantadharma jñānavairāgyaiśvarya padmabhūta calāsanakalpya 
tasmin mūrtiṃ saṃpūjya (-) 

caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca kṛṣṇapiṃgordhva keśakaḥ | 
akṣapāśadahrandevaṃ jñānakhaṭgagatānvitam || 

dhyātvā pāśupataṃ devaṃ sāṃgaṃ saṃpūjayedbudhaḥ | 

<p. 1382> 

ityāvāhya bhagavantaṃ śaktyādyāvaraṇasahitaṃ pūjya 
taddakṣiṇataḥ pūrvoktālaṃ kṛtayutām | pratyaṅnālayutāṃ 
niṣkārdhavarṇādigatāṃ muṣṭimātrāntaritā varddhanī vīrasyā 
siṃhasvarūpāmādhāra rūpiṇī īśvarīmāsanaṃ kalpya tasyopari 
calāsanaṃ pūjya oṃ pāśupatāstrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ ityāsanaṃ 
saṃpūjya tadupari oṃ pāśupatāstramūrtaye huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ iti 
mūrtīm | raktavarṇojvalatkeśāṃ khaṭgakheṭakadhāriṇam | 

dhyātvā cāstreśvarandevīṃ gandhapuṣpādinārcayet | oṃ ślīṃ 
paśuṃ phaṭ pāśupatāstramūrtaye huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ 
ityāvāhanādinā saṃpūjya vastrobhayaṃ pratyekandatvā pādyādinā 
pūjayet | kāraṇokta prakāreṇa vā pūjayet śivamādaśāt | śiva 
kuṃbhañca varddhanyāṃ sthāpayetpadmamadhyataḥ | 

pādyācamanaṃ cārdhyaṃ pañcagavyaṃ caturdaśa | puṣpaṃ 
gandhodakañcaiva bilvodaka kuśodakam || 

vidikṣu sapāpayettatra krameṇaiva tu deśikaḥ | śivakuṃbhe śivaṃ 
pūjya vardhanyāntu manonmanīm || 

vidyeśvarantu paritaḥ pūjayet sthāpakottamaḥ | 

utthāya maṇṭapābhyantare prācyāddigvidikṣu sthāpayet | 
indrādīnpūjayenmahākāla sūryayormadhye oṃ hāṃ indrāya namaḥ | 
agni kuṃbhe oṃ hāṃ kuberāya namaḥ | īśāna kuṃbhe oṃ hāṃ 
īśānāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1383> 

tatkuṃbhasya dakṣiṇa kuṃbhe (-) 

oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ naiṛtasyottarakuṃbhe (-) oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave 
namaḥ | indrādi lokapālānsarvān samabhyarcya viśeṣataḥ | 

indrāya parivārāya sāyudhāya savāhanam | 

teṣā māyudhānyarcayet | 

vajradhvajaṃ gadāpadmaṃ cakrahastapramāṇataḥ | śaktidaṇḍaṃ 
kṛpāṇañca pāśaṃ śūlaṃ tadabdhitaḥ || 

svadigbhāgasthitānyatra niṣpādyāstrāṇi yattataḥ | 
saṃpūjayattato bhaktyā yastu dīkṣāṃ samācaret || 

vajraṃ śaktiñca daṇḍañca khaṭgaṃ pāśaṃ tathāṃkuśam | 
gadātriśūlaṃ padmañca cakrañceti gadhāyute || 

iti khyātā kīrtitā cāstramūrtayaḥ | 

jāyāśakti gadāvidyut pāśapadmanapuṃsakau | śeṣā pumāniti 
khyātā kīrtitācāstra mūrtayaḥ || 

ekavaktraṃ dvinetrañca karaṇḍamakuṭānvitam | kṛtāñjali 
puṭopetaṃ dvi bāhuṃ sarvalakṣaṇam || 

lohāni dāruṇānīha vajrādīni daśakramāt | eteṣvekatamaṃ 
kṛtvā ātmamantreṇa vārcayet || 

taduktam | 

oṃ bhrūmiti dvayopetaṃ vajrāya ca tathaiva ca | huṃ 
phaṇṇamontamantraiśca mantrairetānsamarcayet || 

<p. 1384> 

oṃ hrūṃ vajrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | evamitareṣāṃ 
mantramuccāryārcayet | tadanu | 

guruvarddhanīmādāya śivakuṃbhāgragāminīm | avicchinna 
payodharāṃ bhrāmayettāṃ pradakṣiṇam || 

namassannātmakāmetyuktvā mūlamantraṃ paṭhan | 

astradarbhamanusmaran oṃ 

yajñasaṃrakṣaṇārthāya vighnānādhvaṃsa hetave | yūyaṃ 
svāhānamastestu sannaddhāsyastu rakṣaka || 

śivayāgapravṛttoyaṃ tadbhaktānāṃ śivājñayā | 
rakṣaṇīyottarāyebhyo lokapālān samahitāḥ || 

yadvā (-) 

bho bho śakra tvayā sāsyāndiśi vighna praśāntaye | sāvadhānena 
yāgāntaṃ yāvat stheyaṃ śivājñayā || 

iti śivā jñānaṃ pratyekaṃ paṭhitvā svasthāne pūrva kuṃbhaṃ 
paścāt varddhanīñca saṃsthāpya śivakuṃbhe śaktyādi 
śaktiparyantaṃ sthirāsanārthaṃ pūjyā mūrtividyādehaṃ netraṃ 
vinyasya ahavaśuddhi sahitaṃ dīkṣā cet | sṛṣṭikrameṇa 
pañcakalāṃnyastvā mūlenāvahanādi āvaraṇa sahitaṃ pūjya 
paścimābhimukhāyāṃ varddhanyāya sthirāsanārthamāsanaṃ pūjya 
hṛdayādi sthāneṣu | oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ 
ślīṃ śirase huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ paṃ śikhāyai huṃ 
phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ śūṃ kavacāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | 

<p. 1385> 

oṃ hūṃ netrebhyo huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ huṃ phaḍantāstrāya huṃ 
phaṇṇamaḥ | ityaṃgāni vinyasya rakṣāvakuṇṭhanāmṛtīkarraṇaṃ 
vidhāya pādyādisarvopacāraṃ datvā | sāvaraṇaṃ saṃpūjya oṃ 
hāṃ haṃ śivaśaktibhyāṃ namaḥ | iti bhagaliṃga samāyogaṃ 
vibhāvya | aṃguṣṭhordhvāgatammuṣṭiṃ kṛtvā vāmena veṣṭayet | 
liṃgamudreti vikhyātā tatkuṃbhetu pradarśayet | 

bhuktyai tu tadviparyeṇa saṃspṛśet | 

mamāyai bhagarūpiṇyai liṃgarūpadharāya ca | śaṃkarāya 
namastuṃbhya iti stutvā namodya ca || 

oṃ yajñasyāsya patisttvaṃ hi mūrtireṣā tavācalā | eṣate 
jñāna nistriṃśastadgṛhāṇastvamāyudhaḥ || iti vijñāpya 
yāgarakṣārthaṃ devyavasya sarvahaste huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa 
jñānakhaḍgaṃ samarpya | mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā kuṃbhe 
nivedya ca | varddhanyāntarddadaṃśena japtvā nivedya mayā 
pravartate yāgo yajvanā bhavatu kratuḥ | 

rakṣaṇīyastvayā tarhi samaptiryāvadasya hi | yajñarakṣo dhuraṃ 
tasmin evamārotya deśikaḥ || 

iti yāgarakṣāṃ vijñāpya nirodhārdhya maghoreṇa datvā 
tatpātraṃ saṃsthāpya vāyavyaṃ pūrve triḥ padamadhya kubhet | 

praṇamya daṇḍavadbhūmau vijñāpya yassureśā svarosmābhi paśūn 
gṛha hetave | 

<p. 1386> 

pravartitaḥ prayātvantaḥ vighnaśca tava sannidhau | iti vijñāpya | 
oṃ hāṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ | aiśānyaḥ paścima tripadamadhyasta 
kuṃbhe (-) 

praṇamya daṇḍavadbhūmau vijñāpya gurusannidhau | deva devaṃ 
jagannātha jagadānāndakāraṇa | 

śivādhvara pravartoyaṃ tavājñāṃ kurute mama | 

evamavijñāpya (-) 

oṃ hāṃ sadāśivādisaptagurubhyo namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya 
tadājñāṃ labdhvā iṣṭaliṃgapūjārthaṃ vedikāyāṃ 
dakṣiṇatasthitvā nityoktavat sveṣṭaliṃgeviśeṣapūjārthaṃ 
pañcagavyādinā pūjayet | tathā kāmike (-) 

manḍale sthaṇḍile vāpi liṃge vā śivamarcayet | viśeṣa 
snapanopetaṃ pañcāmṛta samanvitam || 

pañcagavya samāyuktaṃ viśeṣeṇa śivaṃ yajet | praṇamya prārthya 
deveśaṃ labdhvānujño gurustathā || 

maṇḍala yajanārthaṃ madhye kṛtavedikāṃ sarvādhāraṇa kṛta 
sarvakāmika padmaṃ vā svasvajātyuktaṃ sarvato bhadrādi 
maṇḍalevā | 

etasminmaṇḍale sāvaraṇamāvahanādi japāntamarcayet | tathā 
suprabhede 

madhye sadāśivaṃ yaṣṭvā gandhapuṣpādibhiryutam | 

<p. 1387> 

ādau garbhāvṛtaṃ pūjyapūjya vidyeśāvaraṇantathā 
gaṇeśāvaraṇaṃ paścāt lokeśāvaraṇantathā | astrāvaraṇamante 
ca pūjayettu yathāvidhi | 

sūkṣme (-) 

yathā tantroktadevānāṃ tathā tantroktavadyajet | maṇḍapaṃ 
pūjayitvā maṇaktadatai cāgni pupūjanam || 

athāgnikāryārthamadhyeṣvārthānujñognikāryānvidadhyāt | 

kāraṇe (-) 

tatpūrveśānabhāgevā kuṇḍevā sthaṇḍilethavā | 
agnyādhānādikaṃ sarvaṃ agnikāryoktamācaret || 

tadyathā (-) 

sārdhya hastaḥ (-) 

kuṇḍanābhiṃ puraskurvan uttarāsyopaviśya ca | athasthale tu 
pṛṣṭhantu ūrdhvaśirasi mekhalā || 

vadatam | 

laṃbamoṣṭhañca pādopari samekhalā | 

padmanābhiṃ samākhyātaṃ mekhaloparisthitam | pātālaṃ 
kukṣirityāhuḥ kuṇḍarūpamihocyate || 

iti kuṇḍarūpaṃ vibhāvyānāmikāṃ guṣthābhyāṃ nyastacakṣuṣā 
kuṇḍaṃ oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ iti nirīkṣya huṃ 
phaḍantāstreṇa khananoddhāraṇe hṛdayena pūraṇa samīkaraṇa 
varmaṇā secana huṃphaḍantāstreṇa kuṭṭanaṃ saṃmārjanopalepanau 
vidhāya | oṃ hāṃ śāntyatīta kalāya namaḥ iti kuṇḍamadhye 
kuṇḍābhyantara pūre | oṃ haiṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ | dakṣiṇe | 
oṃ hrūṃ vidyā kalāyai namaḥ | 

<p. 1388> 

iti bhautikadīkṣāyāṃ sṛṣṭikrameṇa kalāmantrānyasya kuṇḍaṃ 
kalāmayaṃ kalpayet | naiṣṭhikadīkṣāyāṃ kuṇḍābhyantare 
paścimottarāyāṃ pūrvakuṇḍamadhyeṣu 
kalāmantrānsaṃhārakrameṇoccārayet | oṃ haiṃ kavacāya namaḥ 
trisūtre kuṇḍaṃ saṃveṣṭaya oṃ hāṃ kalāmayāya kuṇḍāya 
namaḥ iti saṃpūjya oṃ hāṃ astrāya huṃ phaḍiti kuṇḍamadhyo 
dakṣiṇottaraṃ rekhātraya paścimātpūrvāntamekaṃ evaṃ rekhā 
catuṣṭayaṃ tiryak rekhā sahitaṃ ubhayatra triśūlākṛtinā 
kuśatrayeṇa vajrīkaraṇaṃ vidhāya | oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ 
pūrvottarāgra kuśadvayena catuṣpathanyāsaṃ kṛtvā | oṃ haiṃ 
kavacāya namaḥ | kuṇḍasyābhyantare samantādutthitaiḥ 
kuśairaksapāṭi kṛtvā evamaṣṭādaśa saṃskārānvidhāya 
kuṇḍamadhye oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvarī vāgīśvarāya namaḥ | iti 
kūrcarūpaṃ viṣṭaravinyasya | oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvarī 
vāgīśvaramūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ | iti vinyasya tau dhyāyet | 

vāgīśī sā bhavadgaurī vāgīśasyā maheśvara | 
triṇetraścaturbhujo devaḥ padmarāga samadyutiḥ || 

varadābhayahastraśca śūlapāśadharaṃkaraiḥ | vāgīśī 
puṇḍarībhā caturvaktra dhanastanī || 

vyākhyāya pustakābhyāñca kamaṇḍalvakṣadhāriṇī | 

<p. 1989> 

dhyāyettu viśeṣeṇa ṛtu snātāṃ su yauvanām | 
nīlotpaladalābhāsā dhyāyetkarmoktavatsudhīḥ || 

yadvā (-) 

vāgīśvarantu raktābhaṃ triṇetraṃ caturbhujam | abhayavarado 
petaṃ pāśaśūla dharānvitam || 

devīmāvāhayedvidvānvidhivadviśvamātaram | śyāmāṃ ṛtumatīṃ 
dhyātvā sadvastro mālyabhūṣaṇām || 

prasannavadanāṃ padma patrābhanayana prabhām | vāgīṃ 
vāgīśvarandhyātvā āvāhayetsvasvamantrataḥ || 

iti dhyātvā āvāhya gandhapuṣpādinārcayet | tadanvagni mutvādayet 
kāraṇe (-) 

sūrye kāntodbhavaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ kāṣṭhaje madhyamaṃ bhavet | 
śrotriyā kāraṇaṃ vahniḥ kanyasantviti kīrtitam || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

sandhyāsanājapo homa devatānāñca pūjanam | ātithyaṃ 
vaiśvadevañca ṣaṭkarmāṇi dine dine || 

ṣaṭkarma nirato vipraḥ śrotriyassamudāhṛtaḥ | 

tathā bhārate (-) 

vidvānvai śrotriyaḥ proktā jñāni śrotriya ucyate | 
sūryakāntodbhavābhāve kāṣṭhajanmani madharā || 

prakāramatrocyate tathā kāraṇe (-) 

śamīvā pippalaṃ vātha gṛhyasārataruṃ puraḥ | 

<p. 1390> 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śamī garbhodbhavaṃ grāhyaṃ aśvatthāśśubhalakṣaṇam | 
madhyadeśe svaśāstreṇa suśitena śanaiśśanaiḥ || 

chedayetsakalī bhūtvā puṣpamabhyarcayettataḥ | dairdhyoktā 
hastapramāṇantu athavādvādaśāṃgulam || 

aṣṭāṃgula samutsedhā samācani ghṛṇāṃ śubhām | āraṇīṃ 
kalpayenmantrī yathāvaccaparisphuṭām || 

khādiraṃ nirvṛṇaṃ kāryaṃ maddhāna dvādaśāṃgulam | 
ṣaḍaṃgula parīṇāhamānupūrvyāmayaṃ śubham || 

tathā kāraṇe (-) 

maṇḍanasyāgrake mūle svadhā paṭṭena veṣṭayet | yugāṃgulena 
mūle tṛkīlanena ca sandhayet || 

evaṃ dṛḍhatare daṇḍe kīlaṃ kurvīta cāgrake | saptāṃgulantu 
vistāraṃ tadarddhaṃ vanamucyate || 

ubhayoḥ pārśvayoścaiva muṣṭiraṣṭāṃgulā bhavet | bhūtāṃgula 
parīṇāhaṃ sarvatraiva suvṛttakam || 

pañcaviṃśāṃgulāyāmaṃ trivṛṭgovāla rajjukaḥ | tantunā 
vāthakartavyaṃ kaniṣṭhāṃgulināhakam || 

kiraṇe (-) 

vāyamāmantra pradyoktaṃ govālai statkṛtaṃ bhavet | 
udaṅmukhasthamaghnīyāt śivabīja manusmaran || 

<p. 1391> 

gāyatrī dhāriṇīdīptasyāmnandhānaṃ hṛdinārpayet | bhramaṇaṃ 
kramaśo dadyāt chatraṃ khaḍgeṇa yojayet || 

śikhāyo vaktrakaṃ yujyāt śirasā hasta veṣṭanam | evaṃ 
kṛtodbhavaṃ vahni dvijamadiragothavā || 

sūryakāntodbhavā vā syāt sāmānyagrahaṇopi vā | 

evaṃ prakalpitamagniṃ tāmrapātre mṛṇpātre vā pañca 
brahmamantreṇa samānīya kuṇḍasyāgnyeyyāmaiśānyāṃ nairṛtyāṃ 
vā sthāpya huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa kravyādaṃśa agnikhaṇḍaṃ 
nirṛtikoṇa nissārya nirīkṣaṇādi catussaṃskārairvahniṃ 
saṃśodhya oṃ hāṃ haṃ vahnimūrtaye namaḥ iti sphuratārakāraṃ 
bhūtāgniṃ pūrakavāyunā saṃhāramudrayā gṛhītvā 
lalaṭamadhyastha bindvāgninā naikīkṛtya patatpataṃganibhena 
nābhikuṇṭhastha jāṭharāgninā hṛdayena kuṃbhakena ekīkṛtya 
śarāvādipātrastha vahnau sannirdhūmāṃgārāgni jvālāmālā 
kulaṃ madhyānhādinibhaṃ recakena piṃgalayā vanhiṃ oṃ hrūṃ 
vanhi caitanyāya namaḥ | ityudbhavamudrayā nissārya bhautika 
jaṭharabdaivāgnitrayeṇaivā ṣaḍaṃgenābhimantrya saṃhitayā 
saṃpūjya rakṣāvakuṇṭhādi kṛtvā bhūmiṣu jānumūlenātma 
sammukhaṃ kuṇḍe sthaṇḍile vā tau īśādiga gata śirasā bhūtvā 
| vibhāvya vāgīśvara garbhanāḍyāṃ vāgīśvareṇātaṃ vibhāvya 
kuṇḍamadhyastha padmabhūte nābhau vanhiṃ nirīkṣya nābhau 
hṛdayena samūhya paridhānasya saṃpratiñca vibhāvya | 

<p. 1392> 

śaucā ca noktthaṃ ardhya jalabinduṃ hṛdānikṣipya kavacena 
sadigdha nairācchādya huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa vyajanena ca manyo vā 
agniṃ prajvālya oṃ hrāṃ hrūṃ garbhāgnaye namaḥ | iti 
garbhāgniṃ saṃpūjya | huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa saptavāramabhimantrya 
| taṃ kuśaṃ kaṃkaṇaṃ vāgīśvarī dakṣahaste 
tadgarbharakṣārthaṃ badhvā garbhādhānāya sadyo jātenābhyarcya 
svāhāntaṃ hṛdayena tilāhuti pañcakaṃ datvā | tṛtīye māsi 
puṃsavanārthaṃ vāmadevanābhyarcya svāhānta śirasā tilāhuti 
pañcakaṃ hutvā | oṃ hāṃ puryaṣṭakaḥ dehāya namaḥ iti 
sāmānyārdhyaṃ datvā sīmantonnayana nimittaṃ ṣaṣṭhemāsi 
aghoreṇa saṃpūjya svāhānta śikhyā tilāhuti pañcakaṃ datvā 
avayasīmārthaṃ sāhānta śikhayā pañcadaśa tilāhutirhutvā 
daśame māsi tatpuruṣeṇa saṃpūjya svāhāntakavacena svāhuti 
pañcakandatvā jātegarbhamalāpanodaghnanārthaṃ varmaṇā 
kuśairagniṃ sandhukṣya huṃphaḍantāstreṇa sadyassūtakanivṛttaye 
ardhya jalena kuṇḍabāhyābhyantaraṃ saṃprokṣya darbheṇāstreṇa 
tāḍyakavacenābhyukṣya devihastasthaṃ kaṃkaṇaṃ tyaktvā 
hṛdābhyarcya svarṇakaṃkaṇa bandhana kṛtamiti dhyātvā (-) 

triṃśaddarbhadalai śyāme gṛhītvā bāhumātṛkā | veṇīṃ 
veṣṭikāpiviṣṭarā parikīrtitā || 

<p. 1393> 

tanmānātratavacchādrāssapalāśa tarut bhavet | 
aṃguṣṭhapariṇāhena yuktā paridhaya smṛtā || 

itthamagni śiśurakṣārthaṃ pūrvāndiśi mekhalāsu 
pūrvāgrānuttarāgrān darbhān huṃ phaḍantāstreṇāstīrya | teṣu 
pūrvapaścimayomyāttaradikṣu hṛdā paridhiviṣṭarān krameṇa 
hṛdayena saṃsthāpya vaktrāṇāṃ lālāpanodanāyāgne puṣṭaye ca 
palāśadi samidhaṃ pañcasamidhaṃ gṛhītvā ghṛtākta mūlāgraṃ 
svāhāntāstreṇa hutvā kuṇḍasya pūrvādisthita paridhau pūrve oṃ 
hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | paścime | oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave namaḥ | 
dakṣiṇe oṃ hāṃ rudrāya namaḥ uttare oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ 
iti paridhisthān devān saṃpūjya viṣṭareṣu 
pūrvādīśāntakrameṇa oṃ hāṃ indrāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ agnaye 
namaḥ oṃ hāṃ yamāya namaḥ | nirṛtaye namaḥ | varuṇāya namaḥ | 
vāyave namaḥ | kuberāya namaḥ | īśānāya namaḥ | aiśānyā 
dakṣiṇe oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | naiṛtyāmuttare oṃ hāṃ 
viṣṇave namaḥ | iti saṃpūjyārdhyayitvā bho bho dikpālakamimaṃ 
śivājñayā vighnau nivārya agnikumāraṃ rakṣateti śivājñāṃ 
śrāvayet | atha suksruva lakṣaṇa pūrvakantasya 
saṃskāravidhirucyate | tathā mohaśūrottare (-) 

sruksruvau vidhinā kāryau tadvidhānamihocyate kālottare (-) 

nyagrodhacūtavṛkṣaṃ vā śamī auduṃbaraṃ tathā | 

<p. 1394> 

devadārumayaṃ vāpi raktacandanameva ca || 

śāntike pauṣṭike caiva nitya naimittikepi vā | 

mṛgendre (-) 

brahmāśvatthaśamīparṇī śiṣuṃpādimahīruhā | 

tathā suprabhede (-) 

khadiraśca śamībilvaṃ palāśaplakṣacandanam | athavā 
yajñavṛkṣeṣu yathā saṃbhavataṃ kuru || 

kiraṇe (-) 

cūtacandana jātā ca ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulaṃ yatā | 

kāraṇe (-) 

saṃgrāhyamadhyasāraṃ tu dvidhā kṛtvā taruḥ punaḥ | tatpārśve 
balimākhyātaṃ bakaṃ nirvṛṇaṃ dṛḍham || 

mūlasruksruvayordaṇḍe vṛkṣāgre puṣkaraṃ matam | 

puṣkaraśabdena agramucyate (-) 

kvacabhābhāge baliṃ proktaṃ vṛkṣavāma sajāgṛta | 
vṛkṣadakṣāṃ saṃbhūta sruvalakṣaṇamīritam || 

ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulāyāma maṣṭāṃgulantu vistṛtaḥ | utsedhena 
ṣaḍaṃgulyaṃ phalakāñcaiva kārayet || 

kāmike (-) 

lohajaṃ yādidārūḍhannayet ṣaṭtriṃśadāṃgulam | 

uktañca parākhye (-) 

ṣaṭtriṃśadagulā vāmamuttarāsṛgudīritā | 

<p. 1395> 

madhyamā kanyasā jñeyā dvi dvayaṃgula vihīnatā || 

kiraṇā (-) 

ṣaḍaṃgulaparīṇāho daṇḍasyādvividaṃgulam | 

tathā parākhye (-) 

uttamādi trayāṇāñca daṇḍasyādviṃśadaṃgulam | 

kāraṇe (-) 

karmāṃgulantu nāhasyāmadhastātpada pādayuk | 

śāradātilake (-) 

viṃśatyaṃśairbhaveddaṇḍe videkācāṣṭabhirbhavet | 
ekāṃśenamitaḥ kaṇṭhassaptabhāgamidaṃ mukham || 

vedī triṃśena vistāraḥ kaṇṭhasya parikīrtitā | agraṃ 
kaṇṭhasamānasyāt mukhe mārgaṃ prakalpayet || 

kāraṇe (-) 

bilādūrdhvamukhātkhātvā kaniṣṭhāṃguli mānataḥ | tareṇa 
vāthatāmreṇa nālaketvāsuyojayet || 

kāmike (-) 

vedikāṣṭhāṃgulāyāmaṃ vistārassadṛḍho bhavet | trimātraṃ vā 
caturmātraṃ tanmadhye bilamucyate || 

bilapāhe tu paritaḥ paṭṭikādhyāṃgulena tu | śvabhrasya paritaḥ 
kuryāt padmamaṣṭadalaṃ śubham || 

kāraṇe (-) 

vedikāyāstu paritaḥ paṭṭikā triyavākahanaḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

vedavṛttādi payuta saṃsthiti tritalā vaṭā | 

śaradātilake (-) 

daṇḍamūlāgrayo kuṃbhau guṇavedāṃgulaiḥ kramāt | 

<p. 1396> 

gaṇḍīyamayugāṃśaisyāddaṇḍasyāgre tu īritā || 

sūkṣme (-) 

daṇḍaṃ ṣaḍaṃgulañcāhaṃ gaṇḍākhyo gaṇḍikātrayam | 
ardhāṃgulāpravṛdhyā tu tannāhaṃ caturaṃgulam || 

mṛgendrapaddhatyām (-) 

saptāṃgula parīṇāha ghaṭāṣṣaṇṇāha daṇḍake | 

sūkṣme (-) 

dvayaṃgulantu bhaved kumbhaṃ nāhaṃ vidyāddaśāṃgulam | 

kāraṇe (-) 

dharmāṃgulantu nāhaṃ syāttasyādhastantu vedikā | 

athaḥ padmapṛṣṭhākāra sa karṇikam 

gajoṣṭhasadṛśamāsyaṃ pṛṣṭhaṃ kūrmākṛtirbhavet | 

tathā śāradātilake | 

ṣaḍbhiraṃge pṛṣṭhabhāgo vedyāḥ kūrmākṛtirbhavet | 

hayasya vā hastino vā potriṇo vā mukhaṃ bhavet | 

kāmike (-) 

sruksyāṃ sruvopi tadyoni tanmānaṃ hastate bhavet | 

tathā vīratantre (-) 

sruvasya lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye caturviṃśati cāṃgulam | dīrghamevaṃ 
samākhyātaṃ vṛttañcaiva ṣaḍaṃgulam || 

daṇḍaṃ tryaṃgulannāha mānupūrvyāt kṣayo bhavet | 

śāradātilake (-) 

daṇḍamūlāgrayo gaṇḍī bhavet kaṃkaṇa bhūṣitā | 

vīratantre (-) 

daṇḍāgre caiva viprendra nāhañcaiva ṣaḍaṃgulī | 

mohaśūrottare (-) 

pṛṣṭhe kuṃbhadvayo petaṃ pāke goṣpadavādyathā | dvayaṃgulaṃ 
puṣkarantasya daṇḍamekāṃgulaṃ viduḥ || 

<p. 1397> 

karṣadhāravaṭogaṇḍa mūlegrahikagaṇḍikā | 

kāmike (-) 

nūtanaṃ karaṇaṃ śreṣṭha purāṇantadabhāvataḥ | 
purāṇakaraṇaṃ grāhya deśiko dvijasattama || 

tadājñāpūrvakaṃ yasmāt bhogya karaṇantathā | 
sahasrāghorajāpasya purāṇakaraṇaṃ gṛhet || 

yena śāstreṇa vatsthāne kriyā pūrvaṃ pravartate | tatra 
tacchāstra saṃsiddhaṃ karaṇaṃ vihitaṃ budhaḥ || 

anuttamanyato grāhyamutsavā karaṇādiṣu karmasu | 

evaṃ lakṣaṇa yuktau sṛksruvau sakuśādūrdhva padanādhomukhau 
gṛhītvā nirīkṣaṇādi catussaṃskārabuddhi vidhāyāstreṇa 
saṃprokṣya kavacenābhyukṣya avakuṇṭhayāgnau kāṣṭhatva 
nirāsārthaṃ hṛdayena paratrayaṃ agnyau pratāpya bhrāmya huṃ 
phaḍantāstreṇa kuśāgramadhyamamūlai 
kramaisruksruvāgramadhyamūlāni spṛṣṭvā oṃ hāṃ śivatatvāya 
namaḥ oṃ hāṃ śivatatvādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ iti sruksruvāgre 
| oṃ hrīṃ vidyātatvāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ vidyātatvādhipataye 
viṣṇave namaḥ | iti madhye oṃ hāṃ ātmatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
ātmatatvādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ iti tanmūle itthaṃ 
tatvatrayāvyāpya mumukṣuścet saṃhārakrameṇābhyarcya oṃ haṃ 
hauṃ haṃ śivaśaktibhyāṃ namaḥ śivaśakti śivā iti saṃpūjya 
sṛk sruvau kavacamantreṇa trisūtraveṣṭhitagrīvau svadakṣiṇe 
kuśoparipūrvaṃ śaktimayī sṛjaṃ śivamayam sraṃ saṃsthāpya 
hṛdā gandhapuṣpādinārcayet || <p. 1398> 

|| [atha ājya saṃskāravidhiḥ] || 

ājyasthālyāṃ praṇītāyāṃ pramāṇa dravyapātravat | āsyāṃ 
ṣaḍaṃgulantāraṃ oṣṭhamekāṃgulaṃ bhavet || 

agramekāṃgulaṃ proktaṃ jaṭharadvādaśāṃgulam | 

itthaṃ kṣaṇayuktaṃ tāmrādi pātrasthaṃ gavyavrataṃ 
nirīkṣaṇādibhi ssaṃśodhya ātmānaṃ brahmamayaṃ dhyātvā 
kuṇḍopari tridhāparibhrāmya kuṇḍasyāgneya koṣṭho 
ghṛtabindumādāya oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇesāheti juhuyāt | di sthāpanam 
| tata svadehaṃ viṣṇumayaṃ dhyātvā taddhṛtamīśāna koṇe 
dhṛtvā oṃ hrīṃ viṣṇave svāhā kuśāgreṇājya bindundadyāt | 
ityadhi śravaṇam | tata svadehaṃ rudramayaṃ dhyātvā kuṇḍanābhau 
ghṛtaṃ dhṛtvā oṃ hāṃ rudrāya svāhā kuśāgreṇājyabinduṃ 
juhuyādityudvāsyatam | oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya svāheti kuśadvayaṃ 
pradeśa mātraṃ brahmagranthiyutaṃ dvi hastāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyā 
gṛhītvā oṃ haiṃ kavacāya svāhetyagni svajvalomukhaṃ trirutplavet 
| punastattathāvidhaṃ kuśadvayena gṛhītvā oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya 
svāheti ātmasaṃmukhaṃ tridhā kṛtvā tatkuśadvayamapi 
pavitragranthi munmuttyāgnau nikṣipediti saṃplavanam | teṣāmeva 
vighnānāṃ sarvāyāyogamanaṃ saṃplavanamiti kvacidetrayam | 

<p. 1399> 

proktaṃ hṛściraścūlikāṇubhiriti | oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ 
ityabhimantritaṃ kuśolkamastreṇa ghṛtekṣiptka vahnau nikṣiperiti 
pavitrīkaraṇam | oṃ hai kavacāya namaḥ | iti dīptenānyena 
nirājyāgnau tatkuśaṃ kṣipet iti nīrājanam | huṃ 
phaḍantāstreṇāpareṇa dīptakuśena vahnau kṣipet | ityudyotanam | 
evaṃ ghṛtasya praṇavena pradeśamātraṃ madhyagranthiyutaṃ 
kuśadvayaṃ gṛhītvā agnaye negatraye ca tadvaktre ca 
tatprabhodhanāya homayet | atra homatrakārastu kāraṇāgametyuktaḥ | 
tadyathā (-) 

dakṣiṇottareṇaiva anāmitu su parvakam | aṃguṣṭhañca suparva 
syāt tarjanī mahyamāṃgulī || 

saṃyuktā pucchato dvau tu yutā ca kaniṣṭhikā | toraiḥ 
kārastuṇaitāni mantrassūveṇaitena homayet || 

sruksruvābhāve palāśapatrādīn gṛhītvā saṃskṛtājya juhuyāt | 
tatraiva (-) 

abhāve tu sruvañcāpi palāśodaṃbarairdalai | kiṃśukasya 
dalairvāpi sruvaṃ srutyaika vā dale || 

ājyadakṣiṇabhāgagatān sruveṇādāya oṃ hāṃ agnaye svāhā 
ityagnidakṣiṇanetre hutvā śiṣṭamājyaṃ svāhā iti ghṛtabhāge 
nikṣipya ājyamadhyabhāgādādāya oṃ hāṃ agnīṣomābhyāṃ 
svāhā (-) 

<p. 1400> 

ityagnilalāṭa netre hutvā vaśiṣṭamājyaṃ svāhā iti 
ghṛtamadhyabhāge nikṣipya ājyamadhyabhāgādādāya oṃ hāṃ 
agnīṣomābhyāṃ svāhā ityagni lalāṭanetre hutvā 
vaśiṣṭamājyaṃ hā iti ghṛtamadhyabhāge nikṣipet | savya 
bhāgāddhṛtamādāya oṃ agnaye sviṣṭa svāhā vaktre hutvā 
śiṣṭamājyaṃ hā iti ghṛtabhāgatraye nikṣipaṇa śuklapakṣa 
kṛṣṇa pakṣe tu vāmadakṣiṇa pūrvavat kuryāt oṃ hāṃ somāya 
svāhā ityagni vāmanetre hā iti ghṛtavāmabhāge oṃ hāṃ agnaye 
svāhā iti ghṛtamadhyabhāge oṃ hāṃ agnaye sviṣṭakṛte svāhā 
ityagni vāma dakṣiṇa madhye netreṣu mukhe vā hāṃ iti 
ghṛtabhāgatraye kṣiptvājyasahitāyābhimantryāstreṇa saṃrakṣya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhaya mūlena dhenumudrayā mudrayāmṛtī kṛtya 
śaktimantreṇa mahāmudrāṃ pradarśya mūlena pūjya saṃskṛtyājya 
lavasaṃskṛta sarpiṣi śodhanārthaṃ kṣipet | ajite 
asaṃskṛteṣvannāgnau ca hutaṃ bhavati | niṣkalam | 

tasmātkuṇḍādi saṃskārān kuryānmantreṇa deśikaḥ | 

sruveṇa ghṛtamādāyāgneḥ paścimāsye oṃ hāṃ sadyojāvāya 
svāhā udaṅmukhe | oṃ hiṃ vāmadevāya svāhā | dakṣiṇāsye oṃ 
huṃ aghorāya svāhā | pūrvāsye | oṃ heṃ tatpuruṣāya svāhā | 

<p. 1401> 

ūrdhvāsye oṃ hoṃ īśānāya svāhā ityekaikayā tisṛbirājyā 
hutibhirvaktrābhidhāram | atha sandhānam | oṃ sadyojāta 
vāmadevābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ hiṃ huṃ vāmadevā ghorābhyāṃ 
svāhā | oṃ hūṃ heṃ aghoratatpuruṣābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ heṃ 
hoṃ tatpuruṣeśābhyāṃ svāhā iti tisṛbhi 
rājyāhutibhirvasandhāna mathavaktrasandhānam | oṃ hāṃ hiṃ huṃ 
heṃ hauṃ aghora tatpuruṣeśānābhyāṃ svāhā | ityagni koṇa 
mārabhya vāyukoṇāntannairṛti koṇamārabhya īśānāntaṃ 
ājyādhārāpatanena vajraikīkaraṇam | muktiviṣaye | oṃ hoṃ heṃ 
huṃ hiṃ haṃ īśāna tatpuruṣāghora vāmadeva sadyojātebhya 
svāhā | īśānādi vāmadevānta vaktra catuṣṭayasya sadyojāte 
layaṃ vibhāvayeriti nityakarmaṇi vaktraikīkaraṇam | oṃ hoṃ huṃ 
haṃ hiṃ heṃ īśānasthāne vibhāvya nityanaimittikena kāmyādikam 
kāryam | vaktraikīkaraṇaṃ yasya vaktrasya mukhyatvaṃ tadvaktraṃ 
svasvadigavalokaneyutañcintayet | yadvā karmānurūpeṇa vaktra 
nirūpaṇamuktam | 

<p. 1402> 

kālottare (-) 

īśānamuktaye homapuruṣe cāṇimādikam | prāyaścittādikaṃ ghora 
tathā syāt krūrakarmaṇi || 

vaśyākarṣaṇa homārthaṃ vāmadevena homayet | nityakarma 
vidhānantu vaktresmin paścime hitam || 

evaṃ jñātvā mahāsena saṃkalpyaḥ kuṇḍamānataḥ | 
vakraikīkaraṇaṃ hyevaṃ nānyathā kārayetsutaḥ || 

homastu mukhya bhūtāsye gauṇānyānya mukhāni tu | 

tathoktam (-) 

dhyātvā vaktrāṇi pañcāgne yena yatkarma vāñcitam | 
tanmukhantūrdhva kurvītavāne cordhve gataṃ mukham || 

antarbhāvānyavaktrāṇi tacca kuṇḍapramāṇataḥ | tasmin vaktraiva 
jihvābhisāraṇaṃ vidadhyāt || 

tadyathā (-) 

hiraṇyā kanakā ratnā kṛṣṇātadanu suprabhā | atiriktā 
bahūrūpā ca saptajihvā prakīrtitā || 

hiraṇyā vāruṇī jihvā kanakā madhyame sthitā | raktā cottara 
jihvā syāt kṛṣṇā yāmyadiśisthitā || 

sūprabhā pūrva jihvā syādatiriktānile sthitā | bahurūpe ca 
jihvā syāt jihvā sthānaṃ prakīrtitam || 

<p. 1403> 

jihveti yatra nirdiṣṭā jvālā sā syāddhavirbhuja | hiraṇyā 
taptahemābhā kanakā rajata prabhā || 

suprabhā mauktika prakhyātariktā padmarāgavat | candrakānta 
śaraccandraprabhe ca bahurūpiṇī || 

hiraṇyādyāstvavijñāya yo jihvā vahni sannidhau | 
hotuścopakramenmukhassabhavet brahmaghātakaḥ || 

bījānī saptahomārthaṃ likhyate tāni tadyathā | yādirānta vinā 
rephaṣaṣṭhisvarasamanvitam || 

nedabindu śikhāyuktau jihvā bījānyanu kramāt | 

tatprakāraḥ | oṃ iṃ hiraṇyāyai svāhā | oṃ hūṃ kanakāyai 
svāhā | oṃ hūṃ raktāyai svāhā | oṃ ṣṭtaṃ kṛṣṇāyai 
svāhā | oṃ ṣaṃ suprabhāyai svāhā | oṃ huṃ atiriktāyai svāhai 
| oṃ hūṃ bahurūpāyai svāhā | oṃ lūṃ iṃ lūṃ hiraṇya 
kanakābhyāṃ svāhā | lūṃ lūṃ kanakaraktābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ 
brūṃ śrūṃ raktakṛṣṇābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ śrūṃ ṣrūṃ 
kṛṣṇasuprabhābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ hrūṃ srūṃ suprabhāti 
riktābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ srūṃ hrūṃ hrūṃ iṃ atirikta 
bahurūpābhyāṃ svāhā | oṃ suṃ iṃ iṃ atirikta bahurūpāyai 
svāhā iti saptajihvā mantrapratiyoge 
mantrapratiyogenaitairmantrairhiraṇyādi sapta jihvā iṣṭvā 
svāhāntairmantrairghṛtenaikāhuti dānena dīpanam | etai bīja 
mantrasaṃpuṭinenaikaikāhutidānena jihvāsandhānam | 

<p. 1404> 

tathoktam | 

ekaikāhuti dānena vā dīpanamācaret | dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ tu 
sandhānaṃ hutvā madhyelayaṃ nayet | 

yathābhilaṣitaṃ vaktraṃ kuṇḍapramāṇaṃ bhāvayitvā hiraṇyādi 
ṣaṭ jihvāṃ madhya jihvāyāṃ layaṃ bhāvayet | iti 
jihvaikīkaraṇam | nāmakaraṇārthaṃ vahnimadhye 
paścimānanāsīnakandhyātvā īśāne saṃpūjya 
sapuṣpamardhyandatvā svāhāntāstreṇāhuti pañcakaṃ datvā oṃ 
hāṃ śivāgnistvaṃ hutāśaneti nāmakaraṇaṃ kṛtvā pitarau 
saṃpūjya svāhāntena tanmantreṇa pratyekaṃ daśāhutiṃ hutvā 
hṛdayenābhyarcya pitarau visṛjet | iti nāmakaraṇam | 
upaniṣkrāmaṇānnaprāśana caulopanayana prājyatya saumyāgneya 
vaiśya devotsarga pañcatvaparāṇagodāna samāvartana vivāhānta 
śarīrasaṃskāra karma sidhyarthaṃ hṛdātilaiḥ pratyeka māhuti 
trayaṃ hutvā mūlena pūrṇāṃ vidadhyāt | pūrṇāhuti lakṣaṇam | 
ajite pratipāditam | 

abhyukṣya sruvamastreṇa sarpiṣāpūrya tadbilam | praṇavena tataḥ 
puṣpaṃ sākṣataṃ sakuśaṃ sṛci || 

vinyasya sruvamāropya tanmadhye cāpyathomukham | daṇḍamūlāgrayoḥ 
paścāt gṛhītvā sṛksruveṇa yuk || 

sevyatākarābhyāṃ pāṇibhyāṃ vinyasyāsyatu śaṃkhavat | 
ṛjukāyassamutthāya sthitāssaṃpanna satva yuk || 

<p. 1405> 

nābhidaghnatayoḥ kṛtvā tanmūlaṃ kārayettataḥ | 
dakṣiṇāntarayoḥ kuryāt navamyāvanatantayoḥ || 

yavadhārāgnimadhye tu pātayetvekadhā sudhīḥ | pūrvāhutintu 
mūlena itya samyak samācaret || 

etatpūrṇāhutipradānena aunnatya mutta mādibhedena trividhaṃ 
kālottare pratipāditam | tadyathā | 

dvātriṃśaduṃgulotsedha māhutiścottamaṃ bhavet | ṣoḍaśāṃgula 
mātrantu cāhutirmadhyamaṃ bhavet || 

aṣṭāṃgulantu cotsedhaṃ avicchinnaṃ ghṛtāhuti | adhamaṃ 
tadvijānīyā sruveṇa ca ṣaḍānana || 

tadanu paviśya ca sarvārthaṃ dhūpadīpārtha modanārthañca | 
kuṇḍatāgniṃ vibhajya sthānāntare saṃrakṣaśivāgnerakārādi 
ṣoḍaśasvaraiḥ palāśādinā ṣoḍaśāṃgula yuktān satmān 
ājyaktānidhmān ṣoḍaśān juhuyāt | taduktaṃ kāmeke (-) 

idhmāssatva ca sā prokta ṣoḍaśāṃgula daivikā | 

iti samillakṣaṇamatraivoktam | 

yājñīya vṛkṣajāśśastā samidhodvādaśāṃgulā | 
satvacāssamaccheda vakragranthyādi varjitā || 

tathā kāraṇe (-) 

samitkaniṣṭhikā mātrā daśāṃgula dairdhikā | 

<p. 1406> 

sāndrasnigdhā samacchinnā kṛmilokodaravarjitā || 

iti śaivāgni dhyānam | kāmike (-) 

śaivāgniḥ kathyate vipra śṛṇu tasmin samāhitā | pañcavaktra 
samāyuktaṃ saptajihvā virājitam || 

daśahastaṃ triṇetrañca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam | 
raktavastraparidhānāṃ paṃkajopari saṃsthitām || 

baddhapadmāsanāsīnandaśāyudha samanvitam | kanakā bahurūpā ca 
atiriktā tataḥ param || 

suprabhā caiva kṛṣṇā ca raktā cānyā hiraṇmayī | ūrdhvavaktra 
sthitāstisro śeṣā prāgāditaḥ kramāt || 

vaidikamiśrānyo svarūpamantyeṣṭi prakaraṇe vakṣyāmaḥ | iti 
śivāgniṃ dhyātvā oṃ hāṃ śivāgnaye namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
agnetvamaiśvarantejaḥ pāvanaṃ paramaṃ mataḥ | 

tasmāt tvadīya hṛtpadme saṃsthāpya tarpayāmyaham | 

iti prārthayitvā (-) 

taṃ devaṃ hṛdayaṃbuje yogapīṭhaṃ prapūjayet | vinyasya kalaye 
mūrtiṃ bhāsvarāṃ saparāparām || 

āvāhanādibhistasyāṃ sannidhīkṛtya kāraṇam | pūjayitvā 
bahistasmin bhogāṃgāni prapūjayet || 

āśrayo bādhite jñātvā bhāsvarāṇi pṛthak pṛthak | 

<p. 1407> 

praropya paramīkṛtya śivavaktrāgni vaktrayoḥ || 

kṛtvā sandhānamagnestu jyotirnāsā vinirgatam | 

anuditena viśāntitā nirgatā muditena tu | ātmanonuditenaiva 
viśantiṃ cintayedguruḥ || 

evaṃ kuṃbhasthayāgāgni śivenātmānaṃ aikyasthaṃ 
nādīsandhānaṃ kṛtvā sāmānya viśeṣa tarpaṇārthaṃ 
mūlamantrasvāhāntenāṣṭottaraśataṃ pratyekaṃ hutvā 
brahmāṃgānāṃ taddaśāṃśaṃ vauṣaḍantamūlena pūrṇāṃ 
vidhāya deśāpātana kālāpatana divyāntarikṣa bhaugatadurnimitta 
protsāraṇāya sunimittāpātanārthaṃ mūlena phaṭkāra sahitaṃ 
bahurūpeṇa vā śataṃ śataṃ pūrṇā sahitaṃ juhuyāt | 

tathā kālottare (-) 

devāvimānairdṛśyante nityaṃ tat śubhadaṃ matam | asāmāni 
vicitrāṇi yadā vyomni patanti ca || 

śastracchenda dhanuḥ puṃsāṃsau viśiṣṭa viśeṣataḥ | 
pāṃsupātanavarṣaṃ vā ākāśo śakunāhitam || 

śikhi haṃsa śukādīnāṃ madhurālāpa iṣyate | bhānuragni 
samāyogāt aṃbhasaḥ patanaṃśubham || 

śaṃkha dundubhijīmūta vaklakīnādhvaniśśubham | ācārya vipra 
nārīṇānnarendrāṇāñca darśanam || 

hemantu tatsadāśastaṃ madhumāṃsādi yatnataḥ | 

<p. 1408> 

aṃbujānāñca puṣpāṇā praṣabhasyaścadarśanam || 

tathā hasta turaṃgāṇāṃ darśanañcāti śasyate | 
kharoṣṭramahiṣavyāla vṛtīnannādaśe śubhā || 

vākpraśastaṃ yadā duṣṭo neṣyateddhani | akasmātkalaho neṣṭaḥ 
pramādāddāruṇerava || 

prasādākāravṛkṣāṇāṃ sādhūnāndarśanantathā | yāgakaryāṃ 
śubheṣvevamaśubhe tu gṛhasya tu || 

aghoreṇa śataṃ homya phaṭkārāntena śāntayet | astreṇaiva 
śataṃ hutvā taddoṣa vinivṛttaye || 

tathā mohaśūrottare (-) 

deśakāla nimittārthaṃ durnimitta praśāntayet | śataṃ śatantu 
hotavyaṃ pūrṇācchinnā śatakrato || 

iti tataśśiṣya praveśārthaṃ pratiśiṣyaṃ mūlena śataṃ śataṃ 
pūrṇāhuti sahitaṃ hutvā svāhāmūlādyastrakāntaraikaikāhuti 
dānena mantratarpaṇaṃ śikhā saṃpuṭitārā huṃphaḍanta 
mūlādyastrāntaistisṛstisṛbhi rājyāhutibhirmantradīpanañca 
vidadhyāt | 

tadyathā (-) 

oṃ hāṃ śivāya svāhā | oṃ hoṃ īśānamūrddhāya svāhā | oṃ 
heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya svāhā | oṃ haṃ aghora hṛdayāya svāhā | 
oṃ hiṃ vāmadeva guhyāya svāhā | oṃ haṃ sadyojāta mūrtaye 
svāhā | 

<p. 1409> 

oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya svāhā | oṃ hiṃ śirase svāhā oṃ hāṃ 
śikhāyai svāhā | oṃ haiṃ kavacāya svāhā | oṃ hauṃ netrebhya 
svāhā | oṃ haḥ śastrāya svāhā | iti tarpaṇam | oṃ hūṃ hauṃ 
hūṃ śivāya huṃ phaḍ | oṃ hūṃ hoṃ hūṃ īśānamūrddhāya 
huṃ phaṭ | oṃ hūṃ heṃ hūṃ tatpuruṣa vaktrāya huṃ phaṭ | oṃ 
hūṃ haṃ hūṃ aghora hṛdayāya huṃ phaṭ | oṃ hūṃ hīṃ hūṃ 
vāmadeva guhyāya huṃ phaṭ | oṃ hūṃ haṃ hūṃ sadyojāta mūrtaye 
huṃ phaṭ | oṃ hūṃ hāṃ huṃ hūṃ astrāya huṃ phaṭ | itthaṃ 
mūlādyastrāntadīpana krethyāt | tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

śikhādyastrāntamantrāṇāṃ svāhāntaṃ tarpaṇaṃ sakṛt | śikhā 
saṃpuṭitairmantrairhuṃ phaḍantaiśca dīpanam || 

mohaśūrottare (-) 

mantratarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā pūrṇāndadyānnivedya ca | || [atha 
sthālīpākavidhiḥ] || 

tataḥ pātralakṣaṇandīpta tantre (-) 

carupātravidhiṃ vakṣye jaṭharantu ṣaḍaṃgulam | 
aṣṭādaśāṃgulannāhaṃ gaṃbhīraṃ caturaṃgulam || 

oṣṭhamekāṃgulaṃ proktaṃ kaṇṭhamekāṃgulocchrayam | 
kaṇṭhānāhaṃ daśāṃgulyaṃ pidhānaṃ pūrvavadbhavet || 

<p. 1410> 

śarāva mukhavistāraṃ pañcāṃgulamudīritam | 
dvayaṃgulassyāttadutsedhaṃ oṣṭhamadhyāṃgulaṃ bhavet || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇayuktāṃ sthālī sāpidhānāntāmramayī mṛṇmayīṃ 
vā vraṇādi doṣarahitāṃ astreṇa vāriṇā prakṣālya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhya nirīkṣaṇādi catussaṃskārai ssaṃskṛtya 
caṃdanādibhirālikhya dhūpadīpayitvā śastrakavacādibhirjaptvā 
trisūtrī kṛtasūtra kuśābhyāntatkaṃṭhairvarmaṇā saṃveṣṭhaya 
vedyā dakṣiṇa dikbhāgeyaṃ devasya saṃnidhau (-) 

bhudvaya samāyuktā pūrve śirasi saṃyutā | paścimābhimukhī 
kāryā caikaika parvatāṃgulā || 

agretvaṃgula vistārā culliratra vicitritā | 

itthaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktāṃ cullikāṃ saṃsthāpya tanmadhye 
kuṇḍavadullekhanādikaṃ kṛtvā paścā carupuroḍāśa pañca 
saṃskāra saṃskṛte | śivāgnepūrvaka ghṛtamagnekadeśaṃ vinyasya 
tatsamīpe gomayenopaliptamaṇḍale astre prokṣite kavacenā 
vakuṇṭhite stravinyastadarbhe ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ pūjya tasmin 
mūrtibhūtā sthālīṃ vinyasya tadgarbhe vastraveṣṭhita mukhe 
sāṃgaṃ śivaṃ layāntaparyanta mabhyarcya puṣpaṃ 
nissāryāstrajaptagavyājyenālabhya vastrapūte nirīkṣaṇādi 
śuddhena śivamantrāṣṭaśatañjaptvā kāpilena tadanyena dugdhena 
cāpūrya yājñīya taṇḍulān śyāmādikānyā ekaśiṣya 
dīkṣāyāṃ kiṃ vā pañca (-) 

<p. 1411> 

prasṛti sammitān dvitīyādiṣu śiṣyeṣu ekai prasṛti vṛddhi 
yuktān anyasmin pātre tānpragṛhya hṛdayena ṣaṭprakāraṃ 
kṣālayitvā tatkukṣau nikṣipyāstreṇa culliṃ saṃprokṣya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhaya saṃmṛjyopalipya tasmin oṃ hāṃ cullikāyai 
namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya taddakṣiṇavāmabāhyo oṃ hāṃ dharmāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ adharmāya namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya paścimāsyāyāṃ 
cullikāyāṃ praṇavāsanaṃ datvā | bhū pūrvāsyo bhūtvā 
sthālīmāropyāstreṇa vidhāya krimikoṭarādi varjitakāṣṭhena 
saṃdīpya cālanoddhāranamastreṇa kṛtvā aṃbhuṃ smaran vilokanaṃ 
netramantreṇa punaḥ kavacenāvakurvan | oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ | 
ityucārya caruṃ svapakvaṃ pacet | yadvā hṛcchirāśśivā 
gāyatryā vā pākasyātipakvāpakvatve maraṇaṃ vyādhiśca bhavati | 
tacchāntyarthamastreṇa śatāhutiṃ hutvā tataḥ svāhāntaṃ 
saṃhitayā streṇājyena sveti pākaśivāgnau heti cullikāstha carau 
śītābhidhāraṃ kṛtvā śītalo bhavetyuktvā hṛdayena 
saṃhāriṇyā cullikā madhyasthamagniṃ visṛjet | tathā kāmike (-) 

uṣṇe taptābhidhāraṃ syāt śīte śītobhidhāraṇam | 
svāhāntayā mantrasaṃhṛtyāmagniṃ vyavahe purā || 

haviṣyagne ca hetyuktvā svisvinno bhava ityapi | taptābhi dhārameva 
syāt dvitīye maṇḍale tataḥ || 

<p. 1412> 

tasmābhi dhārameva syāt dvitīye maṇḍale tataḥ | prokṣaṇādi 
samāyukte pūjitetyavaropyataḥ || 

suśītalo bhavetyevaṃ ṣaṭpallavayā tathā | śītābhidhāramevaṃ 
syāt mantrasaṃhitayā labhet || 

tataḥ sthālīṃ bahirmṛjjalābhyāmunmṛjya kṣālayitvā 
tripuṇḍraṃ dhṛtvā kuṇḍa paścimabhāgakṛtamaṇḍale pūrvavat 
ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ saṃkalpayate sthālīṃ saṃsthāpya hṛdā 
saṃpūjya oṃ hoṃ heṃ huṃ hiṃ haṃ hāṃ hiṃ hūṃ hoṃ haṃ 
śivāya svāhetyagnau heti carapura pariśeṣamājyaṃ sruvaṃ dhūnvan 
evamaṣṭottaraśatamekaśatameka viṃśati vāraṃ saṃpātahomaṃ 
vidhāyādhivāsana pakṣe kāmike (-) 

kanyā vinirmitaṃ sūtraṃ triguṇaṃ triguṇī kṛtam | 
astraprokṣitaṃ varmakuṇṭhitaṃ mūlāmarcitam || 

dīpte (-) 

ṣaḍaṃgulamathāyāmaṃ tarddhaṃ vistṛtaṃ śubham | āyasane tu 
kartavyaṃ nālaṃ tu caturaṃgulam || 

dvādaśāṃgulamānena vivakamatra saṃyutam | kṣurakartarike proktau 
dīkṣākarmaṇi yojayet || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktantadanu sūtrakartṛbhyāñca pūrvoktamaṇḍala 
nirmāṇārthi pañcavarṇarājāśca homadravyādi pañcasaṃpātena 
saṃskuryāt | tathā mṛgendre (-) 

dharvikāṃ kusūtrāṇāṃ kartarī rajasā sahā | 

<p. 1413> 

kāryastathaiva saṃpāta tilabrīhyādikasya ca || 

evaṃ saṃpātasaṃskṛtān sarvānvauṣaḍanta saṃgenābhimantrya 
rakṣāvakuṇṭhanādikaṃ kṛtvā siddhoyamiti bhāvya sthaṇḍilestha 
kuṃbhastha calaliṃge parivāra vahnyātmārthaṃ 
samudāyenavantricaturbhāgaṃ vā darvyā vibhajya trapakṣasthaṇḍila 
kuṃbheśayerekabhāgañcalaliṃga parivārayorekaṃ evaṃ madhuplutam | 

devārthaṃ kasya homārthaṃ śīghrata madhusammiśram | ātmabhāgaṃ 
kevalaṃ ghṛtamiśritamiśraṃ kuryāt || 

tathā kiraṇe (-) 

śivāgne śivakuṃbhasya kalpyaśeṣa yathātmanaḥ | kṛtvā homaṃ 
praṇamyeśaṃ baliṃ tatra samācaret || 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

(**) bhāgatrayaṃ kṛtvā bhāgameva madhuplutam | śivāya śiva 
kuṃbhāya vardhanyaiśca nivedayet || 

dvitīyaṃ saghṛtaṃ bhāgaṃ svaśiṣyebhyaśca kalpayet | tṛtīyaṃ 
carubhāgaṃ tat saghṛtaṃ samadhuplutam || 

hutvā cāntarbalindadyāt samācamya prasannadhīḥ | 

caturbhāgapakṣe maṇḍalasthādi devāṃśa mekabhāgāṃ 
homakarmārthaṃ dvitīyaṃ bhāgaṃ parivārārthaṃ ekabhāgadeśika 
śiṣyayorekabhāgaṃ nivedya pādyaṃ datvā dhūpādi japāntaṃ karma 
nirvartya śeṣamekabhāgamācārya śiṣya prāśanārthaṃ 
saṃrakṣayet | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

<p. 1414> 

śiṣya praveśam (-) 

ādyāṃśo devikaṃ proktaḥ dvitīye homa karmaṇī | parivāre 
tṛtīyaṃ syāt caturthāṃ deśikā hi || 

pṛthak caraścennaivedyaṃ deveśāya nidāpayet | 

prāyaścittārthamastreṇāṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā pūrṇāṃ datvā 
balidvayaṃ kṛtvā praṇamya kṣamāpayet | 

cintye (-) 

kuṇḍadakṣiṇa pārśve tu maṇḍaladvitaye pi ca | antarbalirbahiṃ 
kuryāt pūrvoktena vidhānataḥ || 

caruprāśanavidhāna nirvāṇa dīkṣāyāṃ vakṣyamāṇavat 
prāśayet | iṣṭaliṃgāntikaṃ gatvā vahnisthaṃ 
kalaśasthañcāṣṭapuṣpikayā saṃpūjya śivaṃ vijñāpayet | 

yadarthoyaṃ mahādeva bhagavanyāga vartitaḥ | ta ime 
paśavaśśāntaḥ dvāritiṣṭhantavāritā || 

kṛtyetyatrāhamājñapto bhavatā gurumūrtinā | 
eṣāmanugrahantasmāt māmatiṣṭhāya saṃprata || 

karotu bhagavāneva mutkimukti pradaḥ prabhuḥ | 

ityevaṃ vijñāpayet | tadanu śivahastamakalpayet | tato 
dakṣiṇahastena svargandhairnirmalaṃ guruḥ | 

tanmadhye vinyasedyatān brahmāṃga sahitaṃ śivam | 
gandhapuṣpapavitrādyaiḥ pūjayetparameśvaram || 

tasmintenaparandhyātvā pūjayetparameśvaram | 

<p. 1415> 

śivamantreṇa tanyastvā teṣṭhānnijamastake || 

śivahastamiti proktaṃ pāśānāṃ nāśane śubham | 
īśādvibhinnāmātmānaṃ kartāraṃ bhāvayettadā || 

sākṣibhūto nirīkṣeta karmāṇyapi ca maṇḍale | kuṃbhemāntu 
plavayati vahnāvadhikaraṇantathā || 

pāśau dhamocanaṃ kuryāt śiṣye tatra viśeṣataḥ | 
evamastvityanujñātaḥ śivenādhiṣṭhitasvayam || 

advaitaṃ bhāvayettena pañcādhikaraṇa mātmanā | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

atasnātaṃ viśuddhaṃ ca śuddhavastraiśca saṃyutam | nirāhārañca 
śraddhāluṃ śiṣyamagre nidhāpya ca || 

astramantraṃ samuccārya prokṣayecchiṣyavigrahe | tasya dakṣiṇa 
haste tu rakṣāsūtraṃ prakalpayet || 

yāgeśvo bhāvite nyādau kartavyamadhivāsanam | 

pauṣkare (-) 

vacanādyāgasya pūrvedyuśśiṣyādhivāsanārthaṃ maṇṭapa pūjāṃ 
kṛtvā kautukaṃ dhṛtvā vivāsayet | 

tathā cintye (-) 

nirdiṣṭa divasātpūrva rātraudhivāsanam | abhāve taddine vāpi 
kriyāpūrvethavā sudhī || 

suvarṇa kṣauma kārpāsamuttamādīni sūtrakam | 

tadvidhānamuttamam | sūkṣme (-) 

<p. 1416> 

sthālikāṃ sthaṇḍilaiḥ pūrva tāṃbulañcopadaṃśakam | tanmadhye 
vinyasetsūtraṃ bhasmadhāra samanvitam || 

śvetatāṃbūla saṃyuktaṃ pūṭhābīja samanvitam | 
nālikeraphalopetaṃ taṇḍulordhve tu vinyaset || 

astramantramuccāryaprokṣayettu śivāṃ bhasā | ātmatatvaṃ 
nyasetpātre vidyā tatvākṣate nyaset || 

bhasmadhāre tu māyākhyaṃ bhasite lakulīśvaram | anantaṃ sūtrake 
nyastvā gaṇḍyādyaircayetkramāt || 

kāmike (-) 

pādaprakṣālanaṃ kṛtvā maṇṭape nairṛte diśī | śiṣyaṃ 
sthitvā tu tatkāle rakṣāsūtraṃ prabandhayet || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

astramantraṃ samuccārya prokṣayettu śivāṃbhasā | uttarābhimukho 
bhūtvā naiṣṭhikotkuṭikāsanam || 

bhautikaṃ pūrva dikvaktraṃ paścimāsyamathāpi vā | 
taṇḍulairdīkṣitakaraṃ pūrya sūtrantu bhasmanā || 

abhimantryaguruspṛśya sarvāṃguṣṭhavivarjitam | tatvantu 
triguṇīkṛtya śiṣya haste tu varddhayet || 

kavacenaiva taddhāma bhasmanā rakṣaṇaṃ bhavet | brahmādi 
kāraṇānpūjya hṛdayenaiva śāstravai || 

naiṣikatvīśamantreṇa bhautikaṃ puruṣeṇa tu | 

<p.1417> 

makuṭe (-) 

āpādayet striyaśśūdrān savya haste tu bandhayet | savya 
dakṣiṇavāmayorityamarakośe uktatvāt tadvā hastena vadvarjanaṃ 
kāryaṃ taduktaṃ kāmike (-) 

agni kāryantu saṃpūjya kautukaṃ bandhayetkramāt | caruṃ hutvā 
cayenaiva kārayedarivāsanam || 

śiṣyāṇāndakṣiṇa hastenārī (*) vāmahastake | 

gurustataḥ paśvakare gṛhītvā yāgamandirāt vahirniṇatya 
viprādīnāmuttaraṃ ityuttaradvāre vā sarvasādhāraṇa paścima 
dvāre vā maṇḍalaṃ kuryāt | tathoktam | 

viprasya cottaradvāraṃ pūrvadvāraṃ nṛpasya tu | yāmye vaiśyasya 
vijñeyaṃ śūdrasyaiva tu vāruṇam || 

sarveṣāṃ paścimadvāraṃ athavā samyagācaret | 

makuṭe śeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

pūrvadvāraṃ praśastantu brāhmaṇānāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
kṣatriyadakṣiṇadvāraṃ vaiśyānāmuttaraṃ śubham || 

śūdrāṇāṃ paścimadvāraṃ viśeṣantu maheśvara | sarveṣāmapi 
varṇānāṃ dakṣiṇa dvāramuttamam || 

evaṃ dvāraniyamasyoktatvāṃ kāmike sāmudāyikena noktam | tathā 
dvārasya sammukhe tatra praṇave kuśamaṇḍale iti | tattadanuguṇye 
dvārāgre tasya mukhaṃ karamānaṃ kāntaṃ caturaśra (-) 

<p. 1418> 

dakṣiṇottarasthaṃ sthānamaṇḍaladvayaṃ gomayenāstramuccārya 
vilipyo dagagrān kuśākṣatān pūrvāgrānvā vinyasyātra 
ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ praṇavāsanaṃ vā prakalpayet | yadvā suprabhede (-) 

samālipya śivāgre tu caturaśra samantataḥ | 
piṣṭacūrṇairalaṃkṛtya darbhairāstīrya puṣpakaiḥ || 

īśānamadhyame sthāne vaktramaindre tu buddhimān | aghoraṃ 
dakṣiṇe caiva paścime sadyameva tu || 

uttare vāmadevantu āgneyyāṃ hṛdayena tu | devaśiṣyastu 
naiṛtyāṃ śimāstu vāyudeśake || 

kavacatvīśa digbhāge tattannāmnā samarcayet | eteṣāñcaiva 
śiṣyāṇāṃ ekaikantu pṛthak pṛthak || 

tadūrdhve sthāpayecchiṣyān śivadhyāna parāyaṇāniti | 

bhautikaśiṣyaṃ pūrvānanaṃ paścimānanaṃ vā 
naiṣṭhikaścottarānanam | vinyasya svayaṃ tadanyābhimukhāsthitvā 
śiṣya śarīraśudhyarthaṃ sakuśaṃ pañcagavyaṃ tridhā 
prāśayitvānyamaṇḍala cācamya guru mūlamantreṇa divyadṛṣṭayā 
mūrdhādipādāntaṃ bhuktikāmālokayet | pādādimūrddhānāṃ 
muktikāmamavalokya huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa mantrasthānārthaṃ 
ardhyāṃbunā saṃprokṣya vauṣaḍanta kavacenābhyakṣyāstreṇa 
darbhāgreṇa nābherūrdhvī mārjanāya trivāramullekhayet | 
nābhyathastātkuśamūlenāstreṇā ghamarṣaṇāya trivāramullikhya 
śiṣya (-) 

<p. 1419> 

hṛtpadme maṇḍalatrayaṃ vibhāvya tatrasphuratārakāraṃ 
jīvamādivāhika dehāsthitaṃ vibhāvya huṃ phaḍantāstreṇa 
sarvaguṇasaṃpatyarthaṃ ātmānaṃ saṃtāḍya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
ātmamūrtaye nama iti tannirudhya tat śarīraṃ saṃhitayā vinyasya 
śiṣyamastaka śiamaṣṭapuṣpikayā arcayitvā lalāṭe tilakandadyāt 
| santāne (-) 

devāṃgaiśca dukūlairvā raktapaṭaṭena vā punaḥ | atha 
kārpāsakairvāpi atra baddhantu kārayet || 

netra bandhantu kartavyaṃ prāsādena tu mantrataḥ | 
śvetañcaivottamaṃ vidyāt raktavasa santumadhyamam || 

adhamaṃ kṛṣṇavastrantu tasmāt kṛṣṇaṃ vivarjayet | 

kālottare (-) 

jīrṇena sphuṭitenaiva dagdhena maraṇaṃ bhavet | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena śuddhavastreṇa bandhayet || 

vīratantre (-) 

uttamadvādaśaṃ hastaṃ madhyamaṃ daśahastakam | 
adhamañcāṣṭahastañca pañcatālantu vismṛtam || 

sadā daśāhavastreṇa netra baddhantu kārayet | 

tallakṣaṇa matrocyate (-) 

īsaddhautaṃ navaṃ śvetaṃ sadaśaṃ yattadhāritam | ahataṃ 
tadvijīyārca sarvakarmasupācanam || 

<p. 1420> 

santāne (-) 

ṣaḍaṃgena tu mantreṇa prokṣayettu śivāṃbhasā | netramantraṃ 
japettatranavavastretu deśikaḥ || 

vastrayugmena deveśi netrabaddhantu kārayet | 

itthaṃ paṭaṃnirīkṣaṇādiśuddhivihāya mūlenābhimantrya 
ṣaḍaṃgena varmaṇāvakuṇṭhayāstreṇa saṃrakṣya netre 
samācchādayet | tadanu (-) 

uttamandaśa niṣkañca madhyamañcāṣṭaniṣkakam | adhamaṃ pañca 
niṣkañca svarṇa puṣpantu kārayet || 

daridrāṇāntu sarveṣāṃ yathā lābhena yojayet | 

cintyaveśve (-) 

śiṣyāñjali puṭe puṣpaṃ kṣipyasyaiva suvarṇakam | 

evaṃ kṛtamekatamaṃ svarṇapuṣpādikaṃ taddhaste nikṣipya 
dakṣiṇahastaṃ gṛhītvā gururyāgamaṇṭapaṃ tridhā pradakṣiṇī 
kṛtya tattajjātītyucita dvāreṇa taṃ praviśya devasya dhāmne 
ṣaḍutthāsane praṇavāsane vātve (*) ktavya vasitaṃ 
śiṣyamariyopaveśayet | sadā netrapaṭṭoyastadanyeṣāṃ darśayet 
paśmanadvāsanāyai vapāśabījāyate punaḥ | tena tantetraṃ 
badhyāt paśupāśa vighaṭṭanam | iti smṛtvā netrapaṭaṃ 
prasārayet | ayamātmā śivatvāhaśśithilī tatrabandhanaḥ | 

nijaśaktyā mayevāyaṃ pāśavṛtopi madvaśaḥ | 

<p. 1421> 

tadamṛt tāmrasaṃsthānaṃ svaguṇodayaṃ yogyakam || 

sparśayai maṇi prakhyaśśivohañca paraṃ prabhuḥ | 
saṃsparśādvimalīkṛtya kaladhautamivācirāt || 

karomi guṇasaṃpannayathā śāstramaninditam | 

iti vijñāpya maṇḍaleśasya dakṣiṇe viprakṣatriyosthitam | vāme 
vaiśyaśūdrayoḥ kuryāt | taduktaṃ brahmaśaṃbhuvādaiḥ | 

taddakṣiṇe tatastiṣṭhet brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyastathā | 
vāmāṃgabhāge vaiśyastu śūdraścaivājñayo guroriti || 

viṣāsottare viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

īśānyāṃ yatayaḥ sthāpya viprācottaratasthitā | 
śivāddakṣiṇatasthāpya kṣatravarṇasamudbhavam || 

vaiśyāḥ paścima digbhāge śūdrāvai nir(-)ṛtena tu | śivā 
dvardhyasya digbhāge saṃsthāpya yojayedayam || 

evaṃ saṃsthāpya vidhivat kuryāt puṣpāñjalikriyām | evamukta 
krameṇa sthitvā puṣpakṣepaṃ kārayitvā śiṣyāya maṇḍalaṃ 
darśayet | 

īśānena tu mantreṇa puṣpāñjali samāharet | pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ 
kṛtvā vāmamantreṇa dāpayet || 

yasmin vaktre vasetpuṣpaṃ nāmagotraṃ tadātmakam | tanmantraṃ 
sidhyate tasmāt kurute vā pyatugraham || 

<p. 1422> 

īśānasya dale vyadhī(*) gneyyāṃ śokajantu vā | nairṛtyāṃ 
śrīkaraṃ proktamanāyuṣyantu vāyave || 

caturdikṣu ca viprendra taccharīramiti karṇike patite puṣpe 
sukhañcaiva bhavettadā | 

ekādhvarīka saṃskāramihatāṃ gṛhamedhinām | 
sadārāpatyapatyānāṃ niyogaḥ parikīrtitā || 

gṛhamedhimaye yāge puṣpapātaṃ vivarjayet | atraiva viniyuktasya 
tridhā ca natu kārayet || 

svānine patite puṣpe striyasvapataye yadā | mahādoṣamavāpnoti 
makhena paripālite || 

sarpiṣā homayedagnau śivenatu śatā hunet | anena vidhinā devī 
doṣahīnā bhavedguruḥ || 

tatpāta sthānamantrādyaṃ śivadevakaṇṭhagaṇāntaka manulomānāṃ 
tadupajītamasacchūdrāṇāñca sarveṣāṃ śivanāmāthavāpitṛvat 
sarvāsāṃ strīṇāṃ nāmakaraṇaṃ vidadhyāt | tathā kāmike (-) 

tatpāta sūcitasthānapūrvaṃ śivapadottaram | nāma ācārya 
viprasya devakaṇṭha gaṇāntakam || 

kṣatriya viṭchūdrajātīnāṃ strīṇāṃ śaktyantasaṃjñitam | 
śivanāmātha sarveṣāṃ sarvassarvatravā matam || 

<p. 1423> 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

devāntaṃ kulaje śūdre asat śūdre gaṇāntakam | 

śrīmanmṛgendre (-) 

śivaṃ vipranṛpandevaṃ vaiśyaṃ gaṇavibhāvayet | śūdrāṇāṃ 
sarvanāmāni kārayeddeśikottamaḥ || 

kāraṇe (-) 

śivāntaṃ brāhmaṇānāñca devāntaṃ vai nṛpasya tu | dharmāntaṃ 
vaiśyajātīnāṃ śūdrasya tu gaṇāntakam || 

sarveṣāmanulomtāñca siddhāntaṃ śivasya te | śivāntaṃ vātha 
sarveṣāṃ athavā samudīritam || 

tattajjātyukta nārīṇāṃ strīliṃgāntantu pūrvavat | 

mṛgendre (-) 

śivāntika dvijendrāṇā mitareṣāṃ gaṇāntakam | 

cintyaviśve viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

devāntaṃ sarvajātīnāṃ nāmatheyevidhirbhavet | 
brahmakṣatriyajātīnāṃ siśvāntaṃ nāmadheyakam || 

tayossañjātayogānāṃ śivāntaṃ nāmadheyakam | 
vaiśyaśūdrasutānāñca devāntannāmadheyakam || 

gaṇāntaṃ vāthayedevamanyeṣāṃ pitṛvadbhavet | akāraśca 
ikāraśca ukāraśca tathaiva ca || 

ekāraśca tathokāraṃ pañca svaramidaṃ bhavet | āyurārogya 
lakṣmīñca kṣayamaṃraṇameva ca || 

<p. 1424> 

yathāsaṃkhyaṃ bhavetsiddhi tasmāddevaṃ vicārayet | 
śisyapūrvābhidhānasya nāmādyakṣara niścayam || 

jñātvāyurāyutritaye yeṣāmekantu dāpayet | kṣayaṃ maraṇa 
kāriṇyau dvau tatra parivarjayet || 

dadyānnāma śiṣyāṇāṃ svecchayā vā guruttamaḥ | bhaktānāñca 
gaṇānāñca nāmadheyañca kārayet || 

aṃganānāṃ viśeṣeṇa śaktī nāma ca dāpayet | 
hṛdayādyāvaraṇañca tatsthāne puṣpapātanañcet || 

tattadanu guṇyena viprādīnāṃ nāmadheyaṃ kuryāt | 

itthaṃ nāmadheyaṃ kṛtvā śivasya dakṣiṇe pūrve vā maṇḍalaṃ 
vidhāya tatra praṇavāsanaṃ kalpya devasyābhimukhaṃ 
śiṣyamunnatadehakaṃ praveśya huṃ 
phaḍantāstreṇāṃguṣṭhatarjanī preṣita puṣpeṇa śiṣya 
hṛtpadme santāḍya nāḍī mārgeṇītaddehaṃ praviśya 
saṃhāramudrayā taccaitanyaṃ saṃhṛtya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane 
namaḥ tasya hṛdaya kamala karṇikāyāṃ nirudhya saṃrakṣya 
pṛthivyādi pañca dhāraṇādibhirhṛta śuddhivacchuddhadehaṃ 
saṃśodhyāplāvya sakalīkṛtya śihastaṃ kalpayet | 

anenārabdhamātrastu paśavaḥ pāśagauravāt | niṣkāntāśivatāṃ 
yāṃti svacchandā vigatajvarā || 

iti rudreśvarapadadāyakam | śivahastaṃ śiṣyamastake vinyasya (-) 

<p. 1425> 

tejorūpaṃ dhyātvā prāsādoccāraṇena saha pāśe 
saṃhārānuguṇaṃ hṛdbinduṃ brahmabilaṃ dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
pāśasaṃhārā (**) guṇasamasta pāśanivaha nivāraṇam | 
śiṣyamastake saṃniveśya netrapaṭamāvakṣya tacchiṣyadakṣiṇa 
karṇe śivamantramupadiśya tatpaṭamavasārya sarvāṃgālaṃbanaṃ 
kṛtvā | tataḥ maṇḍalaṃ kuṇbhasthañca tenaiva 
puṣpāñjalindāpayitvā pradakṣiṇa trayasahitaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ 
praṇamya kuṇḍasamīpaṃ śiṣyaṃ nītvā dakṣiṇadigbhāge gomayena 
maṇḍalaṃ kalpya tatra praṇavāsane bhautikaṃ śiṣyaṃ sthāpya 
nāḍīsandhānarthaṃ mūlamantreṇa darbhamūlaṃ śiṣyahastaṃ 
datvā tadagraṃ deśika svajaṃghāsandhau saṃyojayet | 
naiṣṭhikaścet kuśmmūlaṃ svajaṃghāyāṃ vinyasya 
mūlamaṃtrābhimantritaṃ kuśa tadaddhaistena datvā kuśacchalena 
bisatantu nibhāṃ śiṣya nāḍīṃ pigalayā vinirgatya svānāḍyā 
miḍayā praviśya kuṃbhakena vilīneti vibhāvya svasmin tān recake 
kuṃbhasthaṇḍila bāhyaṃ śairapi parayā nāḍīṃ sandhāya 
tatsandhānārthaṃ mūlena oṃ hāṃ iḍāyai svāhā oṃ hāṃ 
piṃgalāyai svāhā oṃ hāṃ suṣmnāyai svāhā iti nāḍatrayaṃ 
santarpya śiṣyaśirasi saṃhitāyā saṃpāta homaṃ vidhāya 
śivakarakalpanusthoryārthaṃ mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā brahmān 
gāntaddaśāṃśato hutvā pūrṇāṃ vidhāya prayaścittārthaṃ 
mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ pūrṇāntaṃ hutvā saṃhitayā 
mantrānupadiśya tena 

<p. 1426> 

śivārcanaṃ kārayitvā tato guruṃ namaskṛtvā paścāt 
śarīrādīn samarpitasyānuṣṭheyārthān samayān brūyāt | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

vinītaṃ śiṣyamācārya karuṇādavalokayet | madīyājñā 
prasādena kartavyaṃ tritayastu tat || 

dāna dharma tapaścaryāt kurvītyete dadedguruḥ | vaṃśaṃ 
vṛkṣañca gotrañca gocarañca tathaiva ca || 

santānaṃ pañcakañcaiva mevaṃ śiṣyāya sadguruḥ | marmāmardakaṃ 
vṛkṣaṃ vaṭaṃ gotraṃ tathaiva ca || 

śuddhatatvā samākhyātaṃ gocaraṃ śivamucyate | santānaṃ 
tandikeśāravyaṃ śrāvayet śiṣyakān prati || 

āmardakamaṭhātrīṇi maṭhānirabhadragolakīpuṣpa girītyeta 
trayāṇāṃ tattatsantānuguṇyena śiṣyamaṭhādi pañcakaṃ 
śrāvayet | prokṣayet kuṃbhatoyādi tattanmantreṇa deśikaḥ | 

kāmike (-) 

sāmānya samaya (*) stu tastu māheśvara smṛtā | jātyuddhāra vihīno 
yassāmānyassamayī bhavet || 

śivalokaṃ nabho gacchecchivahasta prabhāvataḥ | 

yathā dīkṣāyāṃ śivārcanasya śiṣyaśuśrūṣaṇāyāṃ yogyo 
bhavati | sāmānya dīkṣeti kathyate | 

tathā bālajñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

sāmānyassamayītyevaṃ kuryāt śuśrūṣaṇārcane | 

<p. 1427> 

tathā sau śarvayāgeṣu praveśādyadhikārabhāk || 

[iti vyāghrapuravāsi vāmadevātmaja vedajñānaviracita dīkṣādarśe 
samaya dīkṣāvidhiḥ] | || [atha saṃskāradīkṣā vidhiḥ ucyate] | 

yathā tu nirṇātyuddhāraṇe vā boddhāraṇe vā śiṣya saṃskṛyate 
sāṃsaṃskāra dīkṣāyatonairvāṇakīnasyādvijatvāpātanaṃ va nā 
| atastasya dvijatvañca yathāśāstraṃ nigadyate | 

uktañca nāḍijo yujyate si (*) nna ca nirvāṇamaśnute | nanu yasya 
vaidikaṃ dvijatvaṃ nāsti tasya dvijatvamiha yuktamapādayitum | yasya 
punarvaidikadvijatvaṃ vidyate tasya punarapi dvijatvāpātanamayuktam | 
avyavasthā hetutvāt | satyam | tadvaidikadvijatvaṃ 
śarīrasyaivoktaṃ tanna cātmanastathā ca smṛtiḥ | 

kāryaśśarīrasaṃskāra pāvana pretyahāditi ca | 

gāhaihomaijātakarmavaulamaujāti bandhanairiti śrīmat parākhye | 

asaṃskṛtasya viprasya yatonādhyayanaṃ bhavet | tāvat 
śūdrasamastasya yāvaccāsau na saṃskṛtaḥ || 

jātimānapi yo vipro yasmānnātra svapākaga | (***) 
patanācārastadgatastatsamo bhavet || 

<p. 1428> 

tena saṃskāramukhyatvaṃ vede vipratipāditam | kiṃ 
punaśśivaśāstresmin apekṣā rahitā pare || 

tatastatsaṃskāreṇātra prayojanannasti yatastasmin vaidikadvijatve 
satyapi karmāyattāgatirityathā ca smṛtiḥ | 

janmanā brāhmaṇo vā syāt śūdrajo vāntyajopi vā | 
bhaviṣyakarmaṇā krāntā tatkarma kṛtavṛddhayaḥ || 

śāntā krūrāśca ceṣṭante svargāya narakāya ca | mṛto prasava 
caṇḍālo brāhmaṇo vā bhavetsa ca || 

tathā mahābhārate (-) 

paśavopi yathā deva devāśca paśavastathā | brāhmaṇāśca tathā 
śvān śvānaśca brāhmaṇāstatheti || 

tasmādatrātmasaṃskāropyabhimata na śrīrasya itthaṃ śaivena 
dehasya saṃskāridetasya jaḍatvānnasaṃyogaviyogayoḥ 
nikṛṣṭabāndhavādi saṃbandhāsaṃbandhayorna saṃskāraḥ | 
jātyantara pariṇāmāt | na cotpatti nāśābhyāṃ 
sādhakaviśiṣṭasya śarīrāderutpatyarthannikṛṣṭasya ca 
vināśārthanna saṃskāraḥ | nāpi jāte ssaṃskāro vidhīyate 
tadetasmin kṣitekhiladīkṣā saṃbhavāt | api tu brāhmaṇyaṃ na 
cātmanaḥ devādirūpatā svabhāvāt saṃbhavati na jātiyukta 
śrīrasaṃyogācca cetanasya cittcchakti yuktasyāpi 
śuddhasyāṇvādimalatraya yuktasya kṣetrasya śarīriṇa 
svabhāvātmakartustasyaiva saṃskāra iti | 

<p. 1429> 

tathā kiraṇe (-) 

bhagavānuvāca (-) 

na jānerna śarīrasya saṃskārapraṇano mataḥ | yadi jāte 
tadekasmin dīkṣite khiladīkṣitaḥ || 

tena jāterna vaktavya statvānāṃ na tanormataḥ | cidrūpānugrahaḥ 
prokta sarvānugrāhakāśśivaḥ || 

tathā śrīmadraurave (-) 

na śarīrasya saṃskāro na saṃyogaviyogayoḥ | na cotpatti 
vināśābhyāṃ nāpi jātervidhīyate || 

cetanāpi śuddhasya kṣetrajñasya śarīriṇaḥ | 
jñasvabhāvātmanaḥ kartustasya saṃskāra iṣyate || 

tathā kālottare (-) 

na śarīrasya saṃskāro na jāterna ca karmaṇaḥ | ātmanaḥ 
kārayeddīkṣā manādimalakuṇṭhitaḥ || 

śirodhastasya kartavyo mantraiśca viṣaśaktivat | dīkṣaiva 
mokṣadāpuṃsāṃ cidacidvayakti kāriṇī || 

evaṃ viśiṣṭasyātmanaḥ śivatatvābhivyaktaye saṃskāraḥ | atha 
saṃskāradīkṣārthaṃ dināntarapakṣe samayoktavat || 

śiṣyapraveśādi nāḍi sandhānārthaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣadīkṣāṃ 
ārabhet | ekāhapakṣe samayadīkṣānantaraṃ kāryam | 

<p. 1430> 

cintyaviśve (-) 

atha krameṇa saṃskāra dīkṣālakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu | maṇṭapaṃ 
maṇḍalaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ liṃgapūjanam || 

yathā samayadīkṣā ca kalaśetvābhiṣecanam | 
aṣṭavidyeśvarādbāhye śeṣaṃ pūrvavadācaret || 

pūrvaśiṣyoktasaṃskāra (*) vādaṃ śraddhāpūrvaṃ kṛtaṃ yadi | 

akrodha bhaktiviśvāsa gurvājñāpālanaṃ sadā | catuṣṭaya 
samāyuktassarvakleśa vivarjitaḥ || 

gurudroha śivadroha samayadrohakarmakṛt | adīkṣitena bandhutvaṃ 
kṛtaghnatvā vivekataḥ || 

gurudoṣāvaloñca etairaṣṭaguṇairhīnāśśiṣyassaṃskāramarhati | 

viparītaguṇaṃ śiṣyaṃ dīkṣayet samaye punaḥ | paścātsaṃskāra 
dīkṣāyāṃ ante vāsi bhaviṣyati || 

maṇḍalādyagni pūjāntaṃ kṛtvā vai deśikottamaḥ | 
athamadhīyaparyaṃke śuddhatatvopadhānake || 

kuṭilāstaraṇe śuddhavidyādīpakriyātmikam | śaktiṃ 
vāgīśvarīndevīṃ vāgīśañca sadāsadāśivaḥ || 

ityuktatvādīdṛkbhūtau pitarautvā śiṣyamastrāṃbunāstreṇa 
prokṣya oṃ haṃ huṃ phaḍiti saptābhimantrita kusumena śiṣyahṛt 
pradeśe pāśānāṃ śaithilya hetave tāḍayitvā oṃ huṃ iti 

<p. 1431> 

vāmanāsya hṛdayena bhedanañca recakeṇa śiṣyahṛdayaṃ praviśya 
tattaṃ sphurattārakāraśiṣyacaitanyaṃ vicintya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hūṃ 
phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā viśleṣya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama 
ityaṃkuśa mudrayā gṛhītvā tadīyaṃ caitanyaṃ dvādaśāntaṃ 
nītvā tṛṇāgra bindurūpaṃ jīvaṃ vibhāvya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
ātmane nama iti saṃhāramudrayā saṃhṛtya pūrakeṇa svahṛdi 
saṃniveśya kuṃbhakenātma śiro samarasīkṛtya hṛdādigranthi 
bhedena jvala jvalanakiraṇopetaṃ mūlamantrāgrastha 
mūrdhvaśaktyantaṃ nītvā tṛṇā brahmādi kāraṇatyāga 
purassaraṃgatvā dvādaśānte samarasīkṛtya pūrakeṇa 
saṃhāriṇyā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama ityudbhavamudrayā 
dvādaśāntāt saṃgṛhya sṛṣṭayā (***) mānīya dakṣiṇa nāḍyā 
nissārya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti vāgīśi yonau 
vāgīśvareṇa śivabījamityātmānaṃ dhyātvākṣipyamāṇaṃ 
vibhāvya garbhādhānādi saṃskārānāpādanāya śivaṃ saṃpūjya 
śiṣyasya bhū (*) ni bhaviṣyanti ca | śubhāśubhākarmāṇyagni 
varṇaśabdagandhaśikhena lakṣaṇairūhyate taduktaṃ śrī kālottare 
(-) 

ādityo bhayavarṇābhaṃ sindūrasadṛśa prabham | indrakopi nibhaṃ 
prakhyaṃ kāśmīra sadṛśa prabham || 

ete ṣoḍaśasadvastu siddhidājātavedasā | 

<p. 1432> 

vīṇā kinnaravacchabdaṃ murajadhvanireva ca | 
uḍukāsvarapradhānantu phalakāsvaramuttamam || 

vaṃśadhvani pradhānantu ghaṇṭādhvani śubhaṃ bhavet | 
karpūrāgarugandhantu candanaṃ pūrakeśakam || 

kāśmīra mṛganālañca kuṣṭhaṃ pālakameva ca | jātitake kāla 
kaṭuka kuṭī ca mīna gandhakam || 

patraṃ kusumagandhañca śubhagandha hutāśanam | arciṣmāt 
piṇḍitaśikhī śuddhakāñcana saprabham || 

snigdhapradakṣiṇāvarto jātavedāstu siddhidam | arciṣmān 
piṇḍitaśikhī śuddhamāṇikkasa prabhaḥ || 

mahāsiddhimavāpnoti mṛtyuṃ jitvā na saṃśayaḥ | pūrve vā 
vāruṇe vāpi saumye vāpi śikhā bhavet || 

pūrve tu cārthasiddhistu vāruṇe śāntikaṃ bhavet | saumye vai 
mṛtyunāśantu ūrdhve sarvārthakāmadaḥ || 

āgneyyāmagni dagdhantu śikhā yāmyantu mṛtyudā | naiṛtyāṃ 
yuddhamaraṇaṃ vāyavyāṃ kalaho bhavet || 

jñānoyoga pradaiśānyaṃ śikhā niṣkrānti lakṣaṇam | 
ṛṣabhadhvaniko vanhiragamyāgamane bhavet || 

mṛgadūrdhvaravacchabdaṃ snaṣayāgamane bhavet | 
maṇḍūkavadbhavecchabdaṃ duhitrāgamanaṃ bhavet || 

<p. 1433> 

kha vacchabdo bhavedvanhi mātrā ca gamanaṃ bhavet | 
bilāladhvanibhacchabdo gurutalpamavāpnuyāt || 

cakaṭadhvanite vanhi suputrī maraṇaṃ bhavet | suvarṇasya 
bhavecchabdaṃ varṇasaptameva ca || 

taṭinnibhadhvane vanhi śrutvāhuti ca karmaṇi | bhāryā 
maraṇamāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā || 

samudraghoṣavacchabdaṃ mahāśabdamathāpi vā | yā sā 
maraṇamāpnoti iti satyaṣaḍānana || 

laśunaṃ gandhasyāgnikṣayarogamāvāpnuyāt | hiṃgugandho bhavedagni 
pāṇḍurogamavāpnuyāt || 

śubhāśubhamihaproktaṃ evaṃ śiṣyasya ṣaṇmukha | 

tathā dīpte (-) 

varṇagandhañca śabdañca dhūmañcāgniśikhe raṇam | ṣaṭcinhāni 
ca vanhestu jñātvā karmasamācaret || 

varṇamekādaśa jñeyaṃ gandhañcaiva trayodaśa | śabdañca 
pañcadhā jñeyā caturthaddhūmalakṣaṇam || 

pañcadhā vai śikhāñcaiva īṇadvādaśaṃ smṛtam | 
siddhāsiddhiñca liṃgāni pañcādaśabhidhīyate || 

grantha vistarabhītyā tu lakṣaṇaṃ nātra likhyate | 

ityevamādi cinhaiśśiṣyakalamaṣaṃ gurujñāya pāpabhakṣaṇaṃ 
devaṃ dhyātvā tanmantreṇa juhuyāt | 

<p. 1434> 

tathā | 

pāpabhakṣaṇa devasya rūpaṃ bhinnāñjana prabham | 
lelihānandurādharṣaṃ meghanāda sudurjayam || 

vivratāsyaṃ mahādaṃṣṭraṃ raktavastraṃ trilocanam | raktamukta 
jaṭā cūḍa sarpamaṇḍalamaṇḍitam || 

śūlakāsidharaṃ bhītaṃ varadābhayapāṇinam | 
vyāghracarmaparīdhānaṃ nāgayajñopavītinam || 

baddhapadmāsanāsīnaṃ dhyāyeddhorāghanāśanam | 

iti dhyātvā (-) 

oṃ sakṣahaṃ vidhāya svāhā | iti navātmamantreṇa laghu 
pāpanāśanārthaṃ śataṃ juhuyāt | guruñcet | oṃ khaḍgahasta 
kamalaṃ rūṇa khaṭ paṭ pāpabhakṣaṇāya svāhā | ityanena 
mantreṇa sahasrañjuhuyāt | śithilī bhūta baddhasyātmana 
śśaktādutkarṣaṇaṃ rudraputratvaṃ garbhādhānaṃ 
svātantryātmaguṇābhivyakti puṃsavanamāyātmanorvivekaṃ 
sīmantonnayanam | śivādivastuvīkaraṇañjananaṃ śivatvāhasya 
śivatvana bodhanam | nama ityābhiśśiva vākyairuktatvāt 
viprādīnāṃ tattajjātyukta mantreṇa jātyuddhāraṃ vidadhyāt | 
saṃkīrṇa jāyaśśodhyāśśivāstreṇa mahaujasā 
varmaṇāśūdraśśatistu viṭjātiśikhayā hunet | saṃśodhyaṃ 
kṣatrajātistu śirasāṇorvipaścitā pañcāhuti samāyogā 
dviprajāti stu janmanām | 

<p. 1435> 

skandakālottare (-) 

avāntaraśaivānāṃ jātyuddhāraṇānantaraṃ ṣoḍaśakriyākāryā 
ityuktam | 

jātyuddhāraṇa homantu ekaikantu śataṃ śatam | duhedvai 
śūdrajātistu analena tu ṣaṇmukha || 

sat śūdratvaṃ yojayitvā kriyāṃ vai ṣoḍaśaṃ kuru | 
sākṣādvipratvamāpnoti paścāddīkṣāṃ kuruṣvatha || 

varṇānāñcaiva mevantu kārayedvidhinā budhaḥ | 

iti tatprakārastu kāmike (-) 

viprādayopi śūdrā syāt guṇatastasmātsamuddharet | 
śūdrajātisamuddhṛtya svāhāntenaiva mūlataḥ || 

hutvā hutitrayaṃ paścāt śivaṃ pratipadeditam | āhārabhāva 
doṣābhyāṃ yonibījaśarīrataḥ || 

śuddhādvijo bhavatvātmā bhagavan parameśvara | 
śūdrāṃśāpatanetyevamāhuti trayamā caret || 

ayaṃ rudro bhavatvātmā bhagavan tvatprasādataḥ | iti vijñapya 
śūdrābhāvaṃ dvijatvāpātanayā rudrāṃśatvā pātanayā pṛthak 
pṛthak svāhānta mūlenāhutitrayaṃ vā pañca brahmaśataṃ vā 
juhuyāt | tasmacchiva dharmānuṣṭhātānāṃ pṛthak pṛthak 
jātyudīraṇannārakī bhavati | tathā svacchande (-) 

putrakāṇāṃ dhāyakānāṃ samayināmapi | 

<p.1436> 

prākjātyudīraṇādevī prayaścittaṃ bhavennaraḥ || 

dinatrayantu rudrasya pañcāhaṃ keśavasya tu | pitāmahasya pakṣena 
pāke pacyate tu saḥ || 

brāhmaṇakṣatriyā vaiśyāśśūdrā vā parameśvarī | ācāryatva 
niyuktāśca te sarve tu śivā smṛtā || 

anyathā prāk svarūpeṇa ye paśyanti narādhamāḥ | narake te 
prapacyante sadārairvatsara trayam || 

devikālottare (-) 

varṇāvaṇa vicāro yassanaraḥ pātakī bhavet | 

śivadharme (-) 

sthavaraṃ jaṃgamañceti dvividhaṃ liṃgamucyate | sthāvaraṃ 
sthāpitaṃ liṃgaṃ jaṃgamaṃ dīkṣitaṃ viduḥ || 

jaṃgasyāvamānena sthāvare niṣphalaṃ bhavet | tasmālliṃgadvayaṃ 
prājño nāvamanyeta sarvadā || 

kṛtāvamāno yo mohāt sa paśurnātra saṃśayaḥ | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamañcaiva dvividhaṃ liṃgaṃ pūjanam | liṃgādi 
pūjanaṃ tatra sthāvaraṃ nandikeśvara || 

liṃgādipūjanaṃ tatra jaṃgamārādhanaṃ param | pūjākāle tu 
sānnidhyaṃ sthāvare śivatejasi || 

<p. 1437> 

jaṃgame sarvakāleva sānnidhyaṃ kurute śivaḥ | jaṃgamasyāvamāne 
tu sthāvaraṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 

dīkṣā yogyastu jātīnāṃ dīkṣitasya viśeṣataḥ | jāti 
bhedaviśeṣosti dīkṣitānāntu sarvadā || 

vāgīśvarīgarbhagehāt gatatvācchiva putrata | tasyāpatyatva 
siddhitvācchaiva ityabhidhīyate || 

śivaliṃge śilā buddhiṃ kurvāṇa iva pātakī | śreṣṭhatvaṃ 
vidyate tasya dīkṣitasya viśeṣataḥ || 

yasya cittaṃ śiveliṃge tasya jātyādina smaret | rajataṃ 
tāmrakañcāpi sīsamāyasakantathā || 

pūrvarūpantu saṃjñānaṃ cinhatvaṃ nāmabhedakam | hematva siddhau 
sarvañca samānatvaṃ prapadyate || 

tasmādviprādiśūdrānta dīkṣitānāntajātikam | 

cintye (-) 

jātibhedo na vidyante sarvaṃ mānuṣadīkṣayā | 
samudromatsyakūrmāśca kuṃbhīkakaṭameva ca || 

sarveṣāṃ jantugarbhasya jale caivodbhavantathā | evaṃ vai 
mānuṣañcaiva dīkṣitānāṃ vidhīyate || 

lakṣaṇa samuccaye (-) 

vāgīśīñjananaī yasya vyomavyāptāyā śivamantrai śśivādhavare 
jātaḥ sa śūdraḥ syāt | 

<p. 1438> 

kathaṃ bhavet mṛdbāvānāṃ ghaṭādīnāṃ saṃskārānnamṛdo 
yathā | 

tathaiva pāśahānāśca na prākṛtyastu jātayaḥ | narāṇāṃ 
śivasaṃskārāt śivatva na bhavedyadi || 

na bhaveyuktadā nūnaṃ dvijadevādi deśikaḥ | 
mantrasaṃskāradīkṣābhissaṃskṛtaṃ guruṇā sadā || 

carācaraṃ prapadyeta śivatvaṃ tat kṣaṇaddhruvam | 

alamati vistāreṇa | itthaṃ saṃskāra dīkṣāyāṃ 
jātyuddhāreṇāśuddhajātau gatāyām | punarvyavahārāya 
tattajjāti mantreṇa hutvā śuddhajātiṃ pakalpayet | tathā 
kālottare (-) 

vyavahārāya sarveṣāṃ śuddhajāti prakalpate | aśuddhiṃ 
pūrvajātīnāṃ nāśayitvā ṣaḍānana || 

brāhmaṇyaṃ kalpaye śuddhiṃ kṣatriyañca vaiśyatām | 
śūdrātāñceti sarveṣāṃ phalabheda vyavasthayā || 

kaivalyaṃ kevalaṃ rājyaṃ vittaṃ dhānyādi varddhanam | 
kramādetatphalaṃ jñeyaṃ mokṣasādhāraṇaḥ punaḥ || 

śaktipātastataḥ śuddhāṃ jātireṣāñca saṃkrame | udbhavastu 
punastasyāṃ sarveṣāṃ sāṃprataṃ guha || 

puruṣeṇāṣṭaśataṃ hutvā brāhmaṇyaṃ tatra kalpayet | 
kṣatriyatva madhoreṇa vāmadevena vaiśrutam || 

<p. 1439> 

sadyena śūdratā yojyā pūrvoktāhuti kalpanā | 

tathā brahmaśaṃbhupādopyuktam (-) 

agrāmādyamupādānaṃ śaktiḥ kuṇḍalinī purā | tasyāṃ 
yasyātmano janma sāgrajanmehanetarā || 

śūdratvaṃ pāśabṛṃhitvāśoka drohabhavātmakam | brāhmaṇaḥ 
paramo sadyo jāyate mantrasaṃskṛtaḥ || 

brahmatvādbrahmassadāśivī tanuḥ | tat janmā brāhmaṇastatjño 
jānātīti sa yastataḥ | evaṃ śuddhajātyudaye sati prākṛtaṃ 
kulaṃ naśyati | śivādi catuṣkalaṃ viprādīnāñcaturṇāṃ 
dīkṣitānāṃ krameṇa bhaviṣyati | 

tathā kālottare (-) 

śivaśśākhā tathā jyotinnādātsāvitra saṃjñitam | dīkṣākāle 
yathā mantro līyate ca śivādiṣu || 

tattadvaravaśāntattat kramātkula catuṣṭayam | kramādetatrayaṃ 
jñeyaṃ brāhmaṇādi catuṣṭayam || 

śuddhajātyudaye naśyet prākṛtaṃ yatkulasthitam | 

lakṣaṇa samuccaye (-) 

śivo vipra śivā rājā jyotirviṭcchūdrajātikā | savitra ityamī 
varṇā prākṛtāno śivāgame || 

mohaśūrottare (-) 

śivākulasthitaṃ śākhe kule sāvitra saṃjñitam | 

<p. 1440> 

caturṇāṃ saṃsthitaṃ krauñce cāturvarṇa vyavasthayā | 

śivākhyaṃ śālmalidvīpe puṣkaraṃ jyoti saṃjñitaḥ | 
prajānugraha hetvarthaṃ evaṃ kula catuṣṭayam || 

śaiva purāṇe vā īśvaraḥ | 

gataṃ śūdrasya śūdratvaṃ dvijatvaṃ brāhmaṇasya tu | śiva 
saṃskārasaṃbandhāt jātibhedo na vidyate || 

na jīvasyeha vipratvaṃ viprasyāpyatha manyase | mṛde 
nirddahanādeddehe brahmahatyā tadā bhavet || 

tepi pūrva vicāreṇa tatvato dvijatā nahi | tasmānnaivaṃ vicāryaṃ 
vai pūrvajātiśśivājñayā || 

jātibhedaḥ kṛtoyena nāyastena śivājñayā | tasmājjāti 
vibhedastu kartavyo na śivāśrame || 

kulīnaṃ akulīnaṃ vā bhūtirudrākṣa dhāraṇam | 
dṛṣṭvonnatāsanosthitvā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 

śivadīkṣābhijātasya pūrvajātiṃ na cintayet | supratiṣṭhita 
liṃge tu na yathā pūrvabhāvanā || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

naiṣṭhikasya viśeṣeṇa jātibhedaṃ na cintayet | 

tatraiva jātinirṇaye (-) 

dīkṣito vidhināliṃgī naiṣṭhikopi viśeṣataḥ | 

<p. 1441> 

tasya jātestu saṃbandhāstyevaṃ nandikeśvara || 

bhautikasya viśeṣeṇa lokācārasamanvayāt | pūrvajātyā tu 
vaktavyamiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ || 

tadanu viprādīnāṃ svasva jātyabhimantritam | varṇānuguṇasāraṃ 
vā yajñopavītaṃ datvā mūlena śataṃ sahasraṃ vā juhuyāt | 

kāmike (-) 

dadyāt yajñopavītantu mūlamantrābhimantritam | śataṃ sahasraṃ 
vā hutvā pūrṇāṃ datvā śivena tu || 

tallakṣaṇaṃ tatraivoktam | 

kārpāsanirmitaṃ sūtraṃ triguṇaṃ triguṇīkṛtam | sūtraṃ 
tadekaṃ śūdrāṇāṃ vaiśyānāṃ dvitīyā bhavet || 

trisaraṃ kṣatriyāṇāntu viprāṇāṃ saptasaṃkhyakam | yadvā 
pañcaśaranteṣāṃ nava sūtramathāpi vā || 

puruṣāghora vāmajā mantrā viprādiṣu kramāt | 
svasvajātyuktamantreṇa dhāryantadupavītakam || 

kṣatraviṭchūdrajātīnāṃ yaduktaṃ copavītakam | 
pūjādimātrakāle tu kāryaṃ no dhārṇameva vā || 

anulomādi varṇānāṃ yuktāyuktaṃ vicārya tu | 

tathā ṣaṭsahasrikāyām | 

(****) nṛpādīnāṃ tridvedyekasaraṃ kramāt | 

<p. 1442> 

pūjātaṃ mātṛkaṃ dhāryaṃ noktaṃ teṣāṃ vidhāraṇam || 

aṃśumān bhede māhendre (-) 

yajñasūtraṃ pradātavyaṃ brahmavargairhi śiṣyaśeḥ | 
kṣatriyāṇāṃ tritantu vaiśyajātidvitantukam || 

śūdrāṇāmekatantuśca dīkṣākāle vidhīyate | anyakāle tu 
kartavyaṃ śūdrajātīnviśeṣataḥ || 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

yajñopavītasūtrantu dhārayedyajñasūtrantu tejobalavivardhanam | 

nābherurdhvamanāyuṣyamadhastāttu tapakṣayaḥ | tasmānnābhisamaṃ 
kuryāt upavītandvijottamāḥ || 

tatra śūdrasya yajñopadhāraṇasya sāmānyaśāstre prāptatvāt | 
gṛhasthaśūdrasya dhāraṇe tatraiva kālaniyame uktaḥ || 

tadyathā (-) 

arcanāyāmagnikārye vā sandhyākāle ca nānyathā | 

suprabhede (-) 

brāhmaṇī rājaputrī vā vaiśyakanyā yathā punaḥ | 
tisṛbhirnirmitaṃ sūtramathavā śūdrakanyayā || 

anyatra nirmitaṃ sūtraṃ varjjitavyaṃ prayatnataḥ | yajñasūtrañca 
śūdrastu karmopi paridhārayet || 

gotragocarasantāna nā carettān prayatnataḥ | naiṣṭhikastu sado 
kuryāt gṛhasthasya sadā nahi || 

ityuktatvāt asya gṛhasthasya santatandhāryaṃ cintyaṃ 
gotranirṇayamasmābhiḥ kṛtaśaivasamayācārapaddhatyāṃ 
prapañcitantrāvadhāryatām | 

<p. 1443> 

kiñca kālottare (-) 

dvijātīnāṃ ayaṃ dharmastrīṇāmevaṃ prakalpayet | 
strīṇāñcaiva tu sarveṣā manugrahārthaṃ śivo bhavet || 

umāṃśatvāt striya sarvā dvijatvādayaṃ viduḥ | upanayanañca 
dīkṣāyāṃ kālecaiva vivāhakam || 

upanayanantu kārayettu ṣaḍānana | 

ārādhana vidhānena śikhā yajñopavītakam | dvijastrīṇāñca 
sarvāsāṃ śikhā caivopavītakam || 

adhikāraṃśivenoktaṃ dvistrīṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena nṛṇāñcaivo pavītakam || 

agniṣṭomādibhiryajñai yajamānaḥ patnibhissaha | mantreṇa 
samidhākṣepaṃ mantreṇaiva carubhakṣaṇam || 

vayovrataśca mantreṇa sarvayajñeṣu caiva hi | śikhā 
yajñopavītābhyāṃ vināyajña kriyāśritaḥ || 

mūlamantre ca deve ca adhikāraścopavītakam | upavītaṃ vinā 
sarvaṃ strīṇāṃ yāgantu niṣphalam || 

śikhā yajñopavītaña sarvamevaṃ vidhīyate | evaṃ vidhiṃ 
pragṛhyātha paścādyajñañca kārayet || 

atra prasaṃgācchikhāsthāna lakṣaṇañca nirūpyate | ta (**) cā | 

<p. 1444> 

bhrūmadhyādi navāṃgulya datre pūrvaśikhāsthalam | 
śikhāsthānamiti proktaṃ śivaḥ pūrvāparakrame || 

etatsāmānyamuddiṣṭa pratinaśca viśeṣataḥ | 

tatsaṃkhyā pramāṇamuktam | 

tathā śatānāṃ strīguṇāmaṣṭottaraśatā vā āpivā | 
keśānamapi saṃkhyānāṃ śikhaikā parikīrtitā || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vaidikaṃ śaivamityevaṃ vrataṃ hi dvividhaṃ bhavet | 
traivarṇikānāṃ kartavya mupavītādi vaidikam || 

śivadīkṣā pradhānantu śaivamatyantamuttamam | 

tasmācchivāśramamanuprevaśābhilāṣiṇe vratine vastropavītājina 
dantakāṣṭha daṇḍakaupīna bhasmaśikhāmaṇi jaṭādikā 
nirīkṣaṇādi viśuddhāni pṛthak pṛthak pātreṣveka 
pātrevamantamuktam | saṃsthāpya sadyādimantrairabhimantrya 
svāhānta saṃhitayā saṃpātāhutyā śuddhiṃ kṛtvāṃgadravyaṃ 
sthaṇḍileśasya saṃnidhau darśayitvā kuṃbhasyāgredhivāsayet 
sadyodhivāsa pakṣe kṣaṇamātraṃ saṃsthāpya sadyādimantrai 
rabhimantrya bhagavantantvasmai vrataṃ dadyāhi ājñāpya dehīti 
vijñāpya labdhānujña tasmai vratāṃgāni dadyāt | 

tathā jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

vratinetha vratāṃgāni pañcabhūta jigīṣayā | 

<p. 1445> 

daṇḍakaupīna bhasmāni saṃyamañca śiromaṇim || 

vīkṣaṇādi śuddhāni mantritāni pavitrakaiḥ | saṃpātāhuti 
śuddhāni kuṃbhādyaḥ kṣaṇamātrakam || 

nidhāya dāyaśuddhāya praṇatāya nivedayet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vratāṃgameṣāsarvepi yogyameva jaṭājinam | bhasmadaṇḍañca 
kaupīnantathaiva ca kamaṇḍalu || 

pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṃgaiśca parijapya yathoditam | ndihāya pātre 
svāhānta sahitāmanta saṃhitān || 

tathā kālottare (-) 

vastakañcopavītañca ajinaṃ dantakāṣṭhakam | mekhaloṣṇīṣa 
kañcaiva kaupīnaṃ bhasma caiva hi || 

vratābhivyakta hetutvā vratametattapasvinā | vāmadevena mantreṇa (*) 
(**) sṛñca mekhalām || 

aghoreṇa tu mantreṇa upavītañca dāpayet | tatpuruṣeṇaiva 
mantreṇa dantakāṣṭhañca dāpayet || 

kaupīnaṃ vāmadevena bhasma īśena dāpayet | tatpuruṣeṇa tu 
mantreṇa rudrākṣaṃ dhārayetsvayam || 

dvijādīnāmayaṃ dharma strīṇāmevaṃ prakalpayet | 

sopi mahāprasāda mityuktvā nandāśrupūrṇadṛk gṛhītvā dhṛtvā 
praṇamet | 

<p. 1446> 

praṇamya daṇḍavadbhūmau bhaktiyukto dṛḍhavrataḥ | samādāya 
vratāṃgāni dhārayet śiṣyopi saṃyutā || 

[atha jaṭādhara vidhiḥ] | viprādīnāñcaturṇāṃ krameṇa 
jaṭādhāraṇa kramamucyate | 

sarva jñānottare (-) 

brāhmaṇasya jaṭāślakṣaṇāḥ kanakā parikīrtitāḥ | sthūla 
tadviguṇā jñeyā kṣatriyasya vyayantarā || 

vaiśyasyekā śikhāsthāne tathā śūdrasya kīrtitāḥ | hṛtvā 
ślakṣṇākṣa saṃyuktā saṃyatasya jitendriyaḥ || 

nanu brāhmaṇānāṃ jaṭābhasma dhārādināstīti kecidvadanti | 
tadasat | śrutismṛtipurāṇa virodhāt | tathā gautamīyasūtre | 
caulakarma dvijādīnāṃ trayāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 

prathamābde jaṭā vāpi kartavyā śruti coditā | 

tathā vāyaviye sāvarṇya saṃhitāyāṃ (-) 

svāyaṃ bhuvādyāmanavaścaturdaśamahodayām | 
kanakānaddhasarvāṃgā śubhra yajñopavītinaḥ || 

tripuṃḍrālaṃ kṛtāścāṃga jaṭārudrākṣa dhāriṇā | 
kamaṇḍalu dharāssarve hyakṣamālāvirājitā || 

iti lokākṣisūtre | 

mānastokena mantreṇa mantritaṃ bhasmadhārayet | tripuṇḍraṃ 
brāhmaṇo vidvān manasāpi na laṃghayet || 

<p. 1447> 

śrutyā vadhīyate tasmāt tatyāgī patito bhavet | 

iti vacanairjaṭābhasmādikamavaśyandhāryameva | 

mṛgendre (-) 

jaṭā na śūdro vinayonnājño na pi pramādavat | na 
yoṣinnavayontastho na rogī vipulo hi vā || 

jaṭā caikā śiro deśe śūdrasyāvarṇa nirṇaye | na rudrasya 
jaṭā kāryā kuryādekāmathāpi vā || 

aṣṭatālasamāyāmaṃ vistārañcāṃgulitrayam | śṛṇudevī paraṃ 
guhyaṃ jaṭālakṣaṇamuttamam || 

śiraḥ keśavihīnānāṃ kabarī keśamucyate | jaṭā 
vicchaktiruddiṣṭā jagataḥ kāraṇātmikā || 

yo vettisajaṭītyukto na jaṭā bandhanājjaṭī | kālatatva 
pavitrāṇi śaktimantreśa saṃkhyayā || 

vibhajya śokan saṃpādya pratyekaṃ saṃhitāṇubhiḥ | mateśvarasya 
purato badhnīyā (*) va tejasā || 

kalā śabdenāṣṭatriṃśaducyate | tatvaśabdena ṣaṭtriṃśat 
pavitrāṇuśabdena śuddhāna sadyojātādi pañcakam | śaktiśabdena 
vāmādi navaraktayaḥ mantreśaḥ viśveśaḥ ekādaśa īśāḥ | 
mantrāṇāmīśvaraḥ jñātvā guruttamassamyagatyathā doṣabhāk 
bhavet | mantriṇassādhyamantreṇa hṛdāputraka yogyayoḥ | aha 
vratīnāṃ jaṭāvṛdhyarthaṃ tatraiva viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

<p. 1448> 

krimivana dravyamiśreṇa bhasmanā traiphalocana | sādhuvarṇena vā 
puṣṭiṃ na yoktāṃ bhautika vrati || 

asyārthaḥ kaṭutaila viṭaṃka vaṭādi dravya rasantat kukṣau 
nikṣipyāstreṇa saṃprokṣya kavacenāvakuṇṭhaya samṛjyopalapya 
tasmin oṃ hāṃ cullikāyai namaḥ iti saṃpūjya taddakṣiṇa vāma (*) 
(**) oṃ hāṃ dharmāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ adharmāya namaḥ | iti 
saṃpūjya paścimāsyāyāṃ cullikāyāṃ praṇavāsanaṃ datvā 
pūrvāsyo bhūtvā sthālimāropyāstreṇa vidhāya krimikīyadi 
varjitakāṣṭhena saṃdīpya cānalotpāda mastreṇa kṛtvā śaṃbhuṃ 
sāraṃ vilokanaṃ netramantreṇa punaḥ kavacena kurvan oṃ hāṃ 
śivāya namaḥ ityuccārya carusvapakvaṃ pacet | yadvā 
yacchiraśśikhā gāyatryā vā pākasyātipakvāpakvatve maraṇaṃ 
vyādhiṃśca bhavati | tacchāntyarthaṃ astreṇa śataṃ hutvā tata 
svāhāntaṃ saṃhitayāstreṇājyena svāheti pākaśivāgnaiti 
cullikāsthacarau pātahomaṃ taptābhihārya svasvaṃ no 
bhavetyabhidhāya narmaṇḍalāntare saṃskṛte kṛta praṇavāsane 
sthālī (*) ropyanidhāya vauṣaḍantayā mantre saṃhitayā carau 
śītābhidhāraṃ kṛtvā śītalo bhavetyuktvā hṛdayena 
saṃhāriṇyā cullikāmadhyasthamagniṃ visṛjet | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

uṣṇe taptābidhāraṃ syāt śīte śītābhidhāraṇam | 

<p. 1449> 

svāhāntaṃ mantrasaṃhṛtyāmagniṃ vyavahe purā || 

haviṣyañceva hetyuktvā svasminno bhava ityapi | taptābhi 
dhāramevāsya dvitīye maṇḍale tataḥ || 

prokṣaṇādi samāyukte pūjitepyavaropyatam | 

suśītalo bhavetyuktvā hṛdayena saṃhāriṇyā 
cullikāmadhyasthamagniṃ visṛjet | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

uṣṇe taptābhidhāraṃ syāt śīte śītobhidhāraṃ 
svāhāntamantrasaṃhṛtya bhavetyeva vai ṣaṭpallavatāyā tathā | 

śītābhidhāramevaṃ syānmantrasaṃhitayā labhet | 

tata sthālīṃ bahirmṛjjalābhyāmunmṛjya kṣālayitvā tripuṇḍraṃ 
dhṛtvā kuṇḍapaścima bhāgakṛta maṇḍale pūrvavat 
ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ saṃkalpyate | sthālīṃ saṃsthāpya hṛdā 
saṃpūjya oṃ hoṃ heṃ huṃ hiṃ hāṃ hīṃ hāṃ hīṃ haiḥ hoṃ 
haḥ | śivāya svāhetyagnau heti carupariśeṣa mājyaṃ sruvaṃ 
dhūnvan evamaṣṭottaraśataṃ ekaviṃśati vāraṃ saṃpāta homaṃ 
vidhāyādhi vāsana pakṣe kāmike (-) 

kanyāvinirmitaṃ sūtraṃ triguṇaṃ triguṇī kṛtam | astra 
prokṣitamadvarma kuṇṭhita (*) lamarcitam || 

ṣaḍaṃgulamathāyāmaṃ tadardhaṃ vismṛtaṃ śubham | āsanena tu 
kartavyaṃ nālantu caturaṃgulam || 

dvādaśāṃgula mānena vivakrāmatra saṃyutam | 

<p. 1450> 

kṣurikartarike proktau dīkṣākarmaṇi yojayet || 

evaṃ lakṣaṇayukta tadanusūtra kartarībhyāñca pūrvoktamaṇḍala 
nirmāṇārthaṃ pañcavarṇarajāśca homadravyādikañca yukte na 
harītakyāṃ bala vihītakabhasmanā śastrapūrṇāmiśreṇa bhautiko 
pratītaviśeṣa saṃskārasidhyarthaṃ tataḥ pūrṇāṃ pradāpayet | 
paścājvālāgni koṇopamātmānaṃ saṃhāramudrayā samādāya 
pūrvavannijahṛdayāṃbuje vidhāya kuṃbhakena mūlamantramudīrayan 
ātmaśivayoḥssamāsī bhāvaṃ vidhāya śiṣya punassaṃhāriṇyā 
gṛhītvā brahmādikāraṇatyāgakramā drejayogena 
śivāntamātmānaṃ nītvā udbhavamudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
ātmane namaḥ ityante vāsitana dehe hṛdayāṃ bhoja karṇike 
nikṣipyāpyanāya śiṣyaśirasi jalabinduṃ kṣiptvā caruṃ hutvā 
pitarau saṃpūjya pūrṇāṃ datvā prāyaścittārthaṃ mūlena 
vāstreṇa śataṃ sahasramardhaṃvā pūrṇāntaṃ hutvāgnistha 
śivamarcāpathitvā praṇitiñcātmane kārayitvā śirābhaṃ (**) ya 
śivagurupūjāsu śivāgamādhyāyane ca nirvāṇadīkṣāyāñca 
yogyatvaṃ jāta ityuktvā śiṣyahaste śivaliṃgaṃ dadyāt | 
pūrvokta samayāṃśca yathāśramaṃ śrāvayet | 

gurusattama śiṣyāya dā (**) liṃgamantramudrā samanvitam | 

taddina māṇāntantu pratijñāṃ kuru pūjanam | trikālaṃ vā 
dvikālaṃ vā ekakālamathāpi vā || 

<p. 1451> 

pūjayettu viśeṣeṇa arcanoktaṃ kramādvidhiḥ | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śiṣya sa (***) yān pūrvān śrāvayet gurusattam | na nindet 
kāraṇamevaṃ jñānaṃ nindāntathā caret || 

sādhakaṃ jñānavṛddhaṃ ca jyeṣṭhe bhakti samanvitaḥ | ācārya 
jyeṣṭhagecchāyāṃ liṃgacchāyāṃ na laṃghayet || 

nirmālyantu na bhuñjīta śibhaktaṃ na bhojayet | śivāgni 
gurupūjā ca kartavyaṃ jīvitāvadhi || 

akrodha bhakta viśvāso gurvājñā pālanantathā | niyamena tu 
kartavyaṃ catuṣṭayamapi (**) t || 

tadanu samayācārānuṣṭhānāṃ śaktasya dīkṣānantaraṃ 
bālabālīśa vṛddha strī bhogabhuk | vyādhitātmānāṃ yathā 
śakti samāṃ pāśān śodhayet | tadyathā (-) oṃ hāṃ nandaye namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ mahākālāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhūriṇe namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vṛṣabhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
devyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ caṇḍāya namaḥ | ityagnau saṃpūjya 
svāhāntayā ekaikayā saṃtarpyāgni śiṣya samayācāra pāśān 
śodhayet | tathāgamaḥ | 

agnau caṇḍādi nadyādi caṇḍāntān gaṇān saṃpūjya tarpayet | 

hutvā pañcaśataṃ mūlaṃ pūrṇānte tāṃ nirodhayet | 

<p. 1452> 

bhagavanna kṣamaścāyaṃ samayācārapālanam || 

tasmādānena homo tatsarvañca kṣamāpaya | vidyeśvaragaṇeśān 
lokapālāśca sākṣiṇaḥ || 

kṛtvaivaṃ śodhayettasya samayādeśikottamaḥ | yenāsau samayī 
bhūtvā kriyā saṃskāramarhati || 

śravaṇedhyayane yogyaḥ pūjāyāmahayettathā | evaṃ 
niṣṭhāpratiṣṭhasya śaktipātasu niścalaḥ || 

iti jñātvā parādīkṣāṃ kuryāntirvāṇadāmatha | evaṃ 
samayasaṃskārayukto yastu śivārcane || 

home cādhyayane caiva tantrāṇāṃ śravaṇepi ca | 
yogyasyādaiśvaraṃ rudrapadaṃ prāpnoti mānavaḥ || 

tānirvāṇadīkṣāyāṃ adhikārī bhavedvijaḥ | 

[iti śrīmadvayāghrapuravāsi vāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita 
dīkṣādarśe viśeṣa dīkṣāvidhiḥ] || || [atha karmanirvāṇa 
dīkṣā vidhiḥ] || 

kāmike (-) 

nirvāṇākhyāṃ pravakṣyāmi dīkṣāṃ paramamokṣadām | 

atha ubhābhyāndīkṣā (-) saṃskṛtaśiṣyasya malaparipākaṃ 
śaktipātaṃ ca jñātvā saṃpūrṇa kalpitārthān viprādikrameṇa (-) 

<p. 1453> 

parīkṣā saṃyuktān punassaṃskāradīkṣāṃ kṛtvā 
ekakālīnaścet pūrvavattarpaṇadīkṣāpānāntaṃ nirvatyācāryo 
nirvāṇadīkṣāṃ kuryāt | cintyaviśve adhikāraṇamuktam | 

tadyathā (-) 

saṃskāradīkṣā śiṣyāṇāṃ varjitañcāṣṭakantathā | ekona 
viṃśatkartavya mityuktaṃ sadguṇādikam || 

kartavyaṃ guṇasaṃyukto dvijātyādyābhimānikaiḥ | vihino 
rudraputratva bhavayuktobhiyogyakam || 

etairguṇairvihīnaścet nirvāṇasyātyayogyakaḥ | 
punassaṃskāradīkṣāñca kṛtvā nirvāṇamācaret || 

atha pṛthak karmaścet maṇṭapapurassaraṃ kuryāt | pṛthak 
maṇḍalaṃ kuryādalaṃ kārairalaṃkṛtaḥ || 

saptāhe pañcarātre vā tridine sadya vā bhavet | dīkṣā pūrve tu 
kartavya mayugmanyaṃ kurārpaṇam || 

kāmike (-) 

ācāryaḥ kṛtanityastu tato mantrādi tarpaṇam | kṛta 
sūryārcanaśśuddhaḥ sakalīkṛta vigrahaḥ || 

sāmānyārdhya karodvāra dvārāpaścān saṃyutaḥ | 
paścimadvāramārgeṇa sa praviśyamukhālayam || 

kṛtabrahmārcanakṣetre rakṣāṃ kṛtvā vidhānataḥ | 

<p. 1454> 

bhūtaśuddhamaṇo nyāsaṃ viśeṣārdhyañca nityavat || 

kṛtvā jñānākhya khaḍgañca pañcagavyaṃ vidhāya ca | 
vikrirānabhi mantryātha bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāya ca || 

vikṣipya ca vihārāścakraśairīśe samāharet | kuṃbhañca 
vardhanīntatra saṃpūjya parito guruḥ || 

lokapālanathābhyarcya teṣāmājñāntu sāvayan | bhrāmayitvā 
ghaṭāstrāṃbu jñānakhaḍgaṃ samardhya ca || 

agnyādhānādikaṃ sarvaṃ agni kāryoktamācaret | caruṃ 
saṃpātayettatra homāgnau tena vanhinā || 

kāmike (-) 

ātmanassaya bhāge tu kṛtvā śiṣyasya veśanam | nāḍī 
sandhānakaṃ karma tarpaṇaṃ pūrṇayā saha || 

kṛtvā śivādimantreṇa dīpanaṃ samyagācaret | aghore saṃpuṭaṃ 
kṛtvā śivaṃ saṃgaṃ phaḍantakam || 

kuṭilabhrūsamāyuktaṃ karālavadanānvitam | āhutīnāṃ trayaṃ 
kuryāt mantrāṇāṃ dīpanañcayat || 

kriyākāṇḍe (-) 

ityevaṃ dīpanaṃ kuryāt sarvasmin krūrakarmaṇi | śāntike 
pauṣṭike vaśye vauṣaḍantādināṇunā || 

vaṣaḍdhvauṣaṭ samopetau (*) kārasyoparisthite | 

<p. 1455> 

bhuvanaṃ śaṃbaraiḥ kuryāt sarvatrātyayanādiṣu || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

dīkṣā tu pāśacchedaṃ hi tatkāryaṃ krūrakaṃ bhavet | 
krūrakāryeṣu sarveṣu mantrāṇāṃdīpanaṃ mukhe || 

pauṣṭike vaśyake śāntau vauṣaṭkārāntamantrakaiḥ | 
vausaṭdhvauṣaṭsamopetaisudho bījoparisthitaiḥ || 

mantraiśca homakartavyaṃ sarvatrāpyayanādike | 

dviśati kālottare (-) 

uddhāre prokṣaṇe caiva tāḍaneva tathaiva ca | huṃ phaṭ 
kārasamāyuktaṃ kartavyañcānupūrvaśaḥ || 

tathā mataṃgadīkṣā prakaraṇe pratipāditam | tadyathā | 

(*) mantriṇe saṃnidhāne paśukārye ca nityaśaḥ | huṃ kāraścātra 
saṃhāre grahaṇeṣu prakalpayet || 

śirasā hi tathā śastaṃ phaṭkāre koviyojayet | saṃyojane 
vaṣaṭkāro vauṣaḍayātyāyane mataḥ || 

svadhākāraṃ pitṝṇāṃ syāt tatastaṃ sa prapūjayet | 
balyopahāradhūpeṣu pradīpeṣu ca nityaśaḥ || 

yoktavyā deśikendreṇa svāhāntāmantra nāyakā | nyāsārcana 
japadhyāna karmāhyaktā mahāmune || 

namaskṛ (*) rāvasānāntu mantrāssarvārthasādhakāḥ | 

<p. 1456> 

tataḥ pradakṣiṇakrameṇa śivāntikaṃ siśyeṇasārddhaṃ gatvā 
śivamabhyarcya taddarśayitvā tatsannidhau vijñāpayet | 
parīkṣitasamartheyaṃ nirvāṇārthamupasthitaṃ utkṛṣṭa 
jātirīśāṃ samayeṣu vyavasthitaḥ | kliṣṭo nirvāṇa kāṃkṣīva 
bhava dukhārthaśśiṣuḥ | tadetasmin vimokṣāya 
prasādakriyatāmmama | evaṃ bhavatvanujñātaḥ pareśeneti bhāvayet 
| dvijakanyā vinirmitaṃ sūtrañca nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃskṛtya 
saṃpātāhutyā saṃśodhya kuṃbhastha śivāya saṃnidhau 
sthāpyāstreṇa prokṣya kavacenāvakuṇṭhaya mūlena pūjayet | 
kāmike (-) 

kanyāvinirmitaṃ sūtraṃ triguṇaṃ triguṇī kṛtam | astreṇa 
prokṣitaṃ varma makuṇṭhitaṃ mūlamantritam || 

mṛgendre (-) 

akleśādimadagranthi kanyayā krīrtitaṃ samam | 
prasārayecchikhāprānta maṃguṣṭha dvitīyāvadhi || 

dīpte (-) 

ṣaḍaṃgula samāyāmantadardhā vismṛtaṃ bhavet | āyasena tu 
kartavyaṃ nālañca caturaṃgulam || 

kaścidviśeṣassuprabhede uktaḥ 

aṣṭāṃgulamathāyāmantadardhaṃ vismṛtaṃ tathā | āyasena tu 
kartavyaṃ tannālañcaturaṃgulam || 

dvādurāṃgulamānena vivakramagra saṃyutam | 

<p. 1457> 

kṣurakartarikau proktau dīkṣākarmaṇi yojayet || 

mṛgendre (-) 

gh'tikāśaṃ kusūtrāṇāṃ kartarī rajasā tathā | kāryastathaiva 
saṃpātastrilavrīhyādikasya ca || 

tadanu śivagneddakṣiṇamaṇḍale darbhakṛta praṇavāsane 
ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ kalpyo daṅmukhasvodhvakāya mañjali hastaṃ 
śiṣyaṃ saṃsthāpya śirovaktra hṛdiguhyapādeṣu śāntyatītāt 
kalābījaṃ saṃhārakrameṇa nyasya suṣumnāmayaṃ sūtraṃ vibhāvya 
pūrvāparaśikhāṃ jñātvā dvādaśāṃgulāyāṃ śikhāyāmagre 
caturaṃgulodayāṃ gulaṃ vākyatvā saṃhāriṇyā saṃgṛhya 
pādāṃguṣṭhādi śikhāntaṃ mūlena badhvā dakṣabhāge 
pralaṃbayet | muktyai saṃhārakrameṇa badhvā vāme pralaṃbayet | 
oṃ hāṃ śaktaye namaḥ | iti sūtre saṃpūjya tenaiva badhvā vāme 
pralaṃbayet | sadyodhivāsana pakṣe sūtrañca kartavyādiñca 
saṃpātāhutiñca hutvā saṃskṛtya kuṃbhasthāya śivāya niveśya 
pūrvavat badhvā dantakāṣṭha caru vinākuryāt | 

tathā pauṣkare (-) 

sadyodhivāsakaṃ kāryaṃ tvatkṛtodhivāsane | pūrvoktavidhānena 
dantakāṣṭhakarurjitam || 

yāgaśśobhāvitenyādau kartavyamadhivāsanam | tatastat śiṣyadehe 
oṃ hāṃ iḍāyai namaḥ || 

oṃ hāṃ piṃgalāyai namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya suṣumnāyāṃ padmantu 
nibhāṃ vibhāvya | oṃ hāṃ sumnāyai namaḥ | ityanena śiṣya (-) 

<p. 1458> 

dehādādāya sūtre saṃyojyābhyarcya nirudhyāvakuṇṭhaya 
saṃnidhānārthaṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā tasāṃ oṃ hāṃ 
vāmāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ | oṃ hūṃ raudryai 
namaḥ | iti saccintyābhyarcyāgnāvapi saṃpūjya santarpaṇārthaṃ 
sānnidhyārthañca svāhāntena pratyekaṃ pañcāhutyā hutvā 
punassūtre nirodhyavakuṇṭhaya tābhi pāśaviśleṣādikaṃ smṛtvā 
tata stadbhāvita nikhila dehasantāna pratirūpa sūtrehṛt pradeśe 
oṃ hāṃ sūrya somāgnimaṇḍalānvitahṛt padmāya namaḥ 
tasminmahākartaye namaḥ iti 
vinyasyābhyarcyahanadhyāvakuṇṭhayāgnau vapi santarpya oṃ hāṃ 
vidyādehāya namaḥ | vyakta jyotirūpaṃ vibhāvyābhyarcya 
tataśśiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya saptastra japtapuṣpeṇa 
taddhṛdayaṃ praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane namaḥ | haṃ huṃ 
phaḍiti saṃtāḍya huṃ kāramuccaran ātmano recakeṇa nisṛtya 
śiṣyahṛt padmakośāt kiñciccalitamātmānaṃ vibhāvya tasya 
vāmanāḍyā pūrakeṇa taddhṛdayaṃ praviśya tacchetadyaṃ 
sphurattārakākāra saṃsabījasvaṃ oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmānāṃ 
gṛṇhāmi haḥ huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhā viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
svāhetyaṃ kuśamudrayotkṛṣya dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tṛṇāgra 
bindurūpaṃ jīvaṃ sañcintya ātmamantreṇa saṃhāriṇyā saṃgṛhya 
pūrakeṇa svahṛdi saṃniveśya kuṃbhakena samassīvibhāvya 

<p. 1459> 

mūlamantra manusmaran ātmamantreṇa mantrādikāraṇa tyāgakrameṇa 
svasya dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tataśśivya sṛṭyā bhrūmadhyādīni 
yaddakṣiṇanāḍyareka cakeṇa nissārya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane 
namaḥ | iti sūtre saṃyojya ātmānaṃ sūtre vyāpakaṃ saṃbhāṣyā 
vakuṇṭhaya sannidhānārthaṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ juhuyāt | 

tathā tāḍanaṃ deha viśleṣa karṣaṇaṃ gṛhaṇaṃ tathā | yojanā 
tantu vāgīśyāṃ māyāyāṃ jananaṃ punaḥ || 

adhikārastato bhogo layo niṣkṛtireva ca | pāśakṣedotha 
nikṣepaddhastāmuddhāraṇaṃ pacet || 

chedyā bhedyāstu te pāśā sūtrasthā na tu vigrahe | 
tasmātsūtramayaṃ dehaṃ bhāvanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ || 

punastadānīṃ śiṣyasya śirasi kṛṣṇarūpamaṇo malamiti vicintye 
| oṃ hāṃ laukikādi karma pāśebhya sukhaduḥkhabhoktṛtva 
kāraṇebhyo namaḥ | atha māyākāryaṃ karburañcitrarūpaṃ 
vibhāvya oṃ hāṃ māyāpāśāya śarīrendraviṣaya kāraṇāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pāśādhiṣṭhātryai śivaśaktaye namaḥ | 
ityupādhibhedena tato rūpaṃ dhyātvā śiṣya dehādādāya 
sūtrasyai saṃyojyābhyarcya nirudhyā vakuṇṭhayāvagnau 
grāvabhyarcya sannidhānārthaṃ pratyekaṃ svāhāntenāhutitrayaṃ 
dadyāt | atra śivaśakti kathaṃ pāśarūpatvaṃ bhavati satyaṃ 
śodhya śodhakatvena anuraktāpāśa ityupacāreṇoktam | 

<p. 1460> 

tathā mṛgendre (-) 

tāsāṃ māheśvarī śakti sarvānugrāhikaśśivā | 
dharmānuvartmanādeva pāśa ityupacaryate || 

tataḥ vidyādehaṃ | oṃ hāṃ vidyādehāya namaḥ | iti sūtre 
vinyasya tatsannidhānārthaṃ vidyādehāya svavahetyā hutitrayaṃ 
hutvā śāntyātīta kalādīnimantriṇa padavarṇādīn vyāpya 
vyāpakabhāvaṃ jñātvā sūtrasthatva caitanyaṃ yojayet | 

tathā jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

vyāpya vyāpakato jñeyo dīkṣākālepyupasthite | 
pateṣvantargatāmantrāḥ padādhvā varṇamadhyagā || 

bhuvanāntargatā varṇā tānitatvoṣadhāni ca | 
kalāvantargatānihatāni tatvānyanukramāt || 

kalayato vivayaṃ yatra vyāpnuvantīti tā kalāḥ | śaktastā 
parāśakteḥ pañca bheda vyavasthitāḥ || 

kāmike (-) 

vyāpya vyāpakabhāvañca kuryāttatra vicakṣaṇam | mantrāḥ padāni 
varṇāśca tatvāni bhuvanāni ca || 

vyāpyāni vyāpakā karmamalamādheya bandhanā | 
vyāpyāmalādayaścāpi vyāpakastu kalāsmṛtā || 

tāsāñca saṃgrahe tasmāt sarvesyu svīkṛtā iha | 

<p. 1461> 

sthāpitā viśvaśuddhābhi rihopasthāpitā api śuddhā bhavanti 
sarvesyustasmācchuddhiritīpyate || 

svāyaṃ bhuve asya prayojanamuktam | 

athātmabaddhasantāna paśutvasya nivṛttaye | vyaktaye ca śivatvasya 
ṣaḍvidhordhvevakīrtyate || 

tatvādhvā ca padādhvā ca varṇādhvā bhuvanātmikā | mantrādhvā 
ca kalādhvā ca viṃśatyekaṃ śivaṃpadam || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tatvādhvā ca padādhvā ca varṇādhvā varṇa eva ca | bhuvanādhvā 
ca kalādhvā ca ṣaḍadhvānāṃ kramānnyaset || 

tāraṃ hṛdbījamādyeṣu caturthyanta namontakam | sūtre 
ṣaḍadhvamadhvānāṃ vinyasya śivabhāvayuk || 

tathā kālottare (-) 

padādhvā tatpuruṣenyasya tatta dbrāhmāṇa saṃyutam | 
praṇavādipadaṃ madhye namaskārāntakaṃ yajet | 

atra sūtre puruṣabhāvanāya bandhanīyatvāt puruṣa ityuktam | atra 
sṛṣṭikrameṇa sūtrasthāne bandhaṃ kāryam | oṃ hāṃ 
śāntyātīta kalāyai namaḥ | ityavalokayet | oṃ hāṃ śivatatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śaktitatvāya namaḥ | iti tatve dve | oṃ hrāṃ 
anāśritāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anāthāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
anantāyai namaḥ | 

<p. 1462> 

oṃ hāṃ vyomarūpāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vyāpinyai namaḥ | iti 
