<p. 1463> 

iti nāḍī dvau | oṃ hāṃ sañjayāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ devadattāya 
namaḥ | rutadvau | oṃ hāṃ śrotrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vācāya 
namaḥ | itīndriyau dvau | oṃ hāṃ śabdaviṣayāya namaḥ | oṃ 
