śāntyatītakalāyai haḥ huṃ phaḍiti puṣpeṇa śiṣyaśirasi 
santāḍya pūrakavṛtyā saṃhāriṇyā gṛhītvā | oṃ hāṃ 
śāntyatītakalāyai namaḥ | iti cūḍādilalāṭāntaṃ sūtre 
saṃyojyābhyarcya nirudhyāvakuṇṭhaya tatsannidhānārthaṃ oṃ hāṃ 
śāntyātīta kalāyai svāhetyāhutitrayaṃ juhuyāt | tadanu 
śāntikalāyām | oṃ aiṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ | oṃ sadāśiva 
tatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ īśvaratatvāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śuddhavidyātatvāyai namaḥ | etāni tatvatrayāṇi teṣu krameṇa 
bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ sadāśivatatva bhuvanāya namaḥ | ityeka 
