hāṃ śivotthāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sūkṣmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
anantāya namaḥ | iti īśvaratatve bhuvanāṣṭakam | oṃ hāṃ 
manonmanyai namaḥ | 

<p. 1464> 

oṃ hāṃ sarvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ balavikariṇyai namaḥ 
