<p. 1465> 

ṣaṭbindu kalānvita maṇḍalāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śabdāyai namaḥ 
| kāraṇeśa etaissahitāṃ śāntikalāṃ vibhāvya oṃ hyai 
śāntikalāpāśāya huṃ phaḍiti lalāṭāt galānta pradeśe 
santāḍya pūrakavṛtyayā saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya iti mukha 
sūtre saṃyojyābhyarcyavaṣṭhaya svāhāntaṃ sannidhānāhutitrayaṃ 
juhuyāt | tadanu vidhyakalāyāṃ | oṃ hrūṃ vidyākalāyai namaḥ | 
ityavalokayet | oṃ hāṃ māyāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kālāyai namaḥ 
oṃ hāṃ niyatyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kālāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
vidyāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rāgāya namaḥ | puruṣāya namaḥ | iti 
sapta vidyākalāyām tatvāni | oṃ hāṃ tvaṣṭamatrāya namaḥ | 
īśānāya namaḥ | etatpiṃgalekṣaṇāya namaḥ | udbhāvāyai namaḥ 
| vidyāyai namaḥ | bhavāyai namaḥ | vāmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
mahātejāya namaḥ | iti māyāyāṃ bhuvanāṣṭakam | oṃ hāṃ 
śikhedāya namaḥ | ekavīrāya namaḥ | iti kālatatve bhuvanādvau | 
pañcāntakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ (**) yāntakāya namaḥ iti niyati 
tatve bhuvanau dvau | oṃ hāṃ saṃvartakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
jyotiṣikāyai namaḥ | iti kalānta tatva bhuvanau dvau | oṃ hāṃ 
piṇḍāya namaḥ | krodhāya namaḥ | iti vidyātatva bhuvanau dvau | 
ekaśikhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ajāya 
namaḥ | umāpataye namaḥ | pracaṇḍāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1466> 

iti rāgatatvabhuvanāni pañca | oṃ hāṃ (*) ka vīrāya namaḥ | 
