hāṃ śubhrārdhacandra padmāṃkamaṃḍalāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
svapnāvasthāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ viṣṇukāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | 
etaissamopetā pratiṣṭhākalāmavalokya oṃ hiṃ pratiṣṭhākalāyai 
haḥ huṃ phaḍiti śiṣyasya nābhyadhastājjānvante puṣpeṇa 
saṃtāḍya pūraka saṃhāriṇyā gṛhītvā oṃ hlīṃ pratiṣṭhā 
kalāyai namaḥ | iti sūtre saṃyojyābhyarcyāvakuṇṭhaya 
saṃnidhānāhutitrayaṃ juhuyāt | tadanu | oṃ hāṃ nivṛttikalāyai 
namaḥ | ityavalikayet | oṃ hāṃ pṛthivītatvāya namaḥ | ekam | oṃ 
hāṃ bhadrakālyai namaḥ | iti brahmāṇdasyopari bhuvanadvayaṃ oṃ 
hāṃ trilocanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ lipsāye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
nabhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vivāhāya namaḥ | svāhāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ tridaśeśvarāya namaḥ | triyakṣāya namaḥ | gaṇādhyakṣāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vibhave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śaṃbhave namaḥ | 
ityūrdhvedaśa | oṃ hāṃ daṃṣṭrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ indrāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ phaṇīndrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ auduṃbarāya 
namaḥ | īśānāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ grasanāya namaḥ | 
mārutāśanāya namaḥ | krodhāya namaḥ | anantāya namaḥ | 
viṣadharāya namaḥ | ityadho daśa | oṃ balipriyāya namaḥ | 
bhūtapālāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jyeṣṭhāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1472> 

śarvāya namaḥ | sureśāya namaḥ | vedapāragāya namaḥ | 
jñānabhugeśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sarvajñāya namaḥ | prasādāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ īśānāya namaḥ | vidyādhipāya namaḥ | 
itīśāne daśa oṃ hāṃ prakāmadāya namaḥ | prasādāya namaḥ | 
śrīdharāya namaḥ | raktadharāya namaḥ | lakṣmīdharāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ jaṭādharāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ samyadehāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ dhānyāya namaḥ | rūpāya namaḥ | nidhīśāya namaḥ | 
ityuttare daśa | oṃ hāṃ medhavāhanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kapardine 
namaḥ | pañcaśikhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pañcāntakāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ kṣayāntakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ tīkṣṇa sūkṣmāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ vāyuvegāya namaḥ | laghuśrīghrāya namaḥ | iti 
vāyudaśa | oṃ hāṃ sunādāya namaḥ | meghanādāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ jalāntakāya namaḥ | dīrghabāhave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
jayabhadrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śvetāya namaḥ | mahābalāya namaḥ 
| pāśahastāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ atibalāya namaḥ | balāya namaḥ | 
iti vāruṇe daśa | oṃ hāṃ daṃṣṭrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
lohitāya namaḥ | dhūmrāya namaḥ virūpākṣāya namaḥ 
ūrdhvaśeṣāya namaḥ | bhayānakāya namaḥ | krūradaṃṣṭraye 
namaḥ | oṃ hantre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ māraṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
nirṛtaye namaḥ | iti nairṛte daśa | oṃ hāṃ dharmapataye namaḥ | 

<p. 1473> 

oṃ hāṃ dharmāya namaḥ | viyoktre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ saṃyoktre 
namaḥ | kartre namaḥ | vidhātre namaḥ | dhātre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
hārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ mṛtyave namaḥ | yāmyāya namaḥ | iti 
yāmye daśa | oṃ hāṃ kṣayāntakāya namaḥ | bhasmāntakāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ babhrāya namaḥ | dāhanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jvalanāya 
namaḥ | harāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ khādakāya namaḥ | piṃgalāya 
namaḥ | hutāśanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ agnirudrāya namaḥ | ityagni 
daśa | oṃ hāṃ tridaśādhipāya namaḥ | pinākine namaḥ | 
śāstrāya namaḥ | avyayāya namaḥ | vibhṛtyai namaḥ | 
pramardanāya namaḥ | vajradehāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ buddhaye namaḥ | 
ajāya namaḥ | kapālīśvarāya namaḥ | iti pūrve daśa | oṃ hāṃ 
rudrāya namaḥ | viṣṇave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | 
hāṭakeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kūśmāṇḍāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
kālāgnaye namaḥ | iti daśakam | brahmaṇḍamadhye eva maṣṭā (**) 
vanaśatam | rudrasamānābhidhānam | oṃ hāṃ kṣakārāya namaḥ | 
iti varṇaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhavabhavāya namaḥ | bhavodbhavāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ sarvabhūta saṃpradāya namaḥ | sarva sānnidhyakarāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaviṣṇurudraparāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
anarcitārcitāya namaḥ | astutāstutāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
pūrvasthita pūrvasthitāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sākṣit sāksinnamaḥ | 

<p. 1474> 

oṃ hāṃ kururu namaḥ | pataṃga pataṃgāya namaḥ | piṃgapiṃgāya 
namaḥ | jñānajñānāya namaḥ | śabda śabda namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sūkṣma sūkṣma namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śarvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ | onnamo namaḥ | 
ityaṣṭāviṃśati padāni | oṃ sadyojātāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
hṛdayāya namaḥ | iti mantradvayam | oṃ hāṃ akārabījāya namaḥ | 
lakārabījāya namaḥ | iti cau dvau | oṃ hāṃ piṃgalāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ iḍāya namaḥ | iti nāḍī dvau | oṃ hāṃ apānāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ prāṇāya namaḥ | vāyau | oṃ hāṃ ghrāṇāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ upasthāya namaḥ | indriye dvau | gandho viṣaya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ śabdāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sparśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
rūpāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rasasaya namaḥ | gandhāya namaḥ | 
guṇapītañcaturaśraṃ va kamaṇḍalaṃ jāgradavasthā | oṃ hāṃ 
brahmākāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | etairvyāptigni vṛttikalāṃ 
sañcintya oṃ hāṃ nivṛttikalāyai haṃ huṃ phaḍiti śānvadhaḥ | 
puṣpeṇa saṃtāḍya pūrakeṇa saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya oṃ hāṃ 
nivṛttikalāyai namaḥ | iti sūtre saṃyojyābhyarcyāvakuṇṭhya 
saṃnidhānāhutitrayaṃ datvā somasūryāśraya vāmadakṣiṇa 
pravāha parityāgaṃ suṣumnamayīṃ pāśātmikā mātmana 
sannidhisthāna bhūtāntāsanādi (-) 

<p.1475> 

sakalakarmārhakāṃ sūtramayīṃ smṛtvā na tu dehe tasmāttasmin 
evaṃ kalānāmavalokanatāḍanagrahaṇagrahaṇa saṃyojanāni kuryāt | 
sabīja dīkṣāyāṃ vartamāna śarīrāraṃbhadharmādiṣṭā 
pūrtādikān sānuṣaṃgotsamayācārapāśāccānyat bandhakaṃ 
karmakalānāṃ antasmṛtvā sūtragataṃ bhāvayet | ni 
bījadīkṣāyā dehāraṃbhakadharmān sānuṣaṃgi kāñcānyat 
samayācārasahitaṃ sarvasūtragataṃ bhāvayet | tathā soma 
śaṃbhupādairapyuktam | 

sa bījāntu dīkṣāyāṃ samayācārapāśataḥ | dehāraṃbhaka 
dharmācca mantrasiddhi phalādapi || 

iṣṭā pūrtādidharmācca vyatiriktaṃ prabandhakam | caitanya 
rodhakaṃ sūkṣmakalānāmantare smaret || 

samānatantre (-) 

pāśacchedyā tathādyāhya sūtrasthā na tu vigrahe | 

itthaṃ vyāpyaṃ vyāpakabhāvaṃ sūtragatam bhāvyā bubhukṣuḥ | 
dīkṣāyāśāntyādi kalādīpanārthaṃ pratyeka māhutiṃ kuryāt | 
tathā | 

tāsāñca dīpanaṃ kāryaṃ oṃ kārādi phaḍāntakam | oṃ hrūṃ 
hauṃ hūṃ śāntyatīta kalāyai huṃ phaḍiti tatsūtraṃ 
kaladisthāneṣu kuṃkumena vā gorocane na vā lañcchayitvā tasmin 
sāṃgaṃ śivaṃ saṃpūjya oṃ hāṃ astrāya huṃ phaḍiti 

<p. 1476> 

śiṣyaśirasi sūtre sapuṣpa nārācamudrayā saṃtāḍya oṃ hāṃ 
śāntyātīta kalāyai namaḥ iti praviśya gṛhītvā tammantreṇa 
svāhāntenāhutitrayandatvā oṃ hauṃ hauṃ hauṃ bhagavan 
śāntyatīta kalāpāśa malakarmamayaśāktatatva bhuvanādi 
vyāpakaṃ baddhabaddha huṃ phaḍiti sūtre granthiṃ kṛtvā ityaṃ 
śānti kalādi kalādisthāneṣu pratyekaṃ granthiṃ kuryāt | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

bhagavan śāntyatītākhyaṃ malakarma samanvitam | vyāpakaṃ śākta 
tatvādeḥ pāśabaddhapadadvayam || 

huṃ phaḍantaṃ samuccārya sūtre granthiṃ samācaret | śivaṃ saṃ 
puṭitaṃ svaṃ svaṃ bījañca bhagavanpadam || 

kalā catuṣṭayaṃ pāśaṃ malatatvādi vyāpakam | baddha baddha 
padañcoktvā huṃ phaḍanta samanvitam || 

pṛthak pṛthak samuccārya sūtre granthiṃ samācaret | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tatsūtre mupadeśyātha śiṣyaṃ se ca niveśayet | vismṛtādya 
ghanāśāya mūlena ca śataṃ hunet || 

puruṣasya śatāvantastāḍyāstu parito haret | hṛdāstra saṃpuṭe 
naiva nidhāya tadanantaram || 

mṛgendre (-) 

tatastātkṛta saṃpātān pāśānāvedya śaṃbhavet | 

<p. 1477> 

rakṣasveti pate vidvān nidadhyāt kuṃbhasaṃnidhau || 

muktvā dabhāṃsamutthāya vanhidhāmne ghaṭe gurau | śivaṃ 
saṃpūjayet śiṣya sapraṇāma pradakṣiṇam || 

kāmike (-) 

ācārya śiṣya sahito makhamaṇṭapāt | pañcagavyaṃ caruntebhya 
pradadyāddanta dhāvanam || 

nirṇiktapādapāṇibhyāṃ prayatebhyo yathākramam | antarjape 
viśeṣebhyassakuśe dakṣiṇe kare || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

praṇavārdhyaṃ gṛhītvā tu deśiko yāgamandirāt | bahirgatvā 
tataḥ kuryānmaṇṭapa tritayaṃ kramāt || 

naiṣṭhikān bhautikāṃścaiva saumyāsyaignaindra vaktṛkān | 
krameṇāveśya śiṣyāṃśca prāśayecchṛṇu kartayam || 

pañcagavyantu pūrvaṃ syāt pāṇinā kuśayā saha | madhye madhye 
cācamanaṃ vita (**) nnakeśvara || 

dvitīyaṃ carukaṃ proktaṃ grāsatraya samanvitam | 
aṣṭagrāsamitirvāpi darśanasparśa varjitam || 

pālāśapatrairmṛktyarthaṃ bhuktyarthaṃ pippalairdalaiḥ | 

kāraṇe viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

pratyekaṃ pañcapiṇḍāni grāsamātra pramāṇataḥ | 

<p. 1478> 

abhimantrya ca piṇḍāni brahmāṃgaiśca sakṛt sakṛt || 

ācamyā camyavidhinā dantairaspṛśya bhojayet | 
prāṇāpānādimantraiśca pañcakena samanvitam || 

kāmike (-) 

prathañcakañca naivedya (****) niveśayet | prāṇāgni hotraṃ 
kartavyaṃ sadhakaiḥ kālakāṃkṣibhiḥ || 

eteṣā manyathā bhāve śarvo bhavati nānyathā | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

paścādācamanaṃ kuryāt śuddhaireva jale punaḥ | śuddhijño 
dantakāṣṭhañca kṣa (**) kṣasamanvitam || 

kaniṣṭhāṃ gulaṃ sthūlaṃ ṛjussatvamanirghṛṇam | 
maṃgalākāṃgulandairdhyaṃ pakṣeyedantadhāvanam || 

dantakāṣṭha hṛdā datvā dantaśodhanakaṃ tathā | jalena 
śodhayetpaścāt dhautamūrdhvamukhaṃ kṣipet || 

patitādikṣu jānīyāniṣṭāniṣṭa vivekavān | 
harīndravaruṇeśāna dīkṣvābhīṣṭa phalodaya || 

vinā vighnamatonyāsyurjuhuyāsinā śatam | tatastrayonyantarāya 
śamanāya śatatrayam || 

śivena vā satāṃgena vighnadhvaṃsinā sinā | tarpaṇe 
mantramumukhyānāṃ pūrṇāhutyāntikaṃ matam || 

<p. 1479> 

atra prasaṃgāt guruṇāsanotthānādikaṃ pramādādeke 
kutañcedvayāhṛti homaṃ bhīma saṃhitāyāṃ pratipāditam | 
tadyathā | 

āsanotthāpane krodhe kṣute niṣṭhīvane kramāt | vāyu cāre 
bhayotpanne vāsane vyāpyadīkṣite || 

loṣṭotkāre ca santapte kriyābhūsmṛti saṃbhave | mantrokte 
mantrakārye tu vyāhṛtyāhuti mācaret || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

mūlena bhūmiṃ saṃśodhya caruṣeśantu homayet | loka pālāśca 
kalaśān pūjayitvā nirudhya ca || 

bāhya rakṣā bhavedyastu visṛjedgaṇa pālakān | saṃkṣepeṇa 
krameṇaiva lokapālabaliṃ kṣipet || 

āgneye vāruṇe vāpi snātvā yāgālayaṃ viśet | 

suprabhede (-) 

daśākṣaraṃ japayitvā tu vidyāṃgairbrahmābhiryutam | 
bījamukhyaṃ tato japtvā kṣurikāyāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 

tataḥ pratisarandhṛtvā śiṣyācāryakaṃ pṛthak | 
gandhapuṣpādinābhyarcya śiva pārśve svapenniśi || 

ayāgakarmasantānaparyantoyaṃ tvayā vibho | paśūnāṃ 
pāśanāśāya hotavyo nātra saṃnidhiḥ || 

devasya dakṣiṇe bhāge gomayenopalepite | 

<p. 1480> 

śiṣyāṃstu vāsayermantrairmaṇṭapasya ca dakṣiṇe || 

kuśabhasma paṭacchanne bhuktimuktivyapekṣayā | pūrvadakṣiṇa 
śīrṣāntaṃ saṃniveśya śiśuṃ guru || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

naiṣṭhikān bhasmaśayyāṃśca hṛdādakṣiṇeśīrṣakān | 
bhautikāndarbhaśayyāyāṃ pūrvamālyastra rakṣitān || 

śikhābaddhaśikhān sarvān tinvā rakṣitān punaḥ | 
svapnādhipatimantrañca gurustatropadeśayet || 

hili hiliṃ śūlapāṇaye svāhā namaḥ | evaṃ mantrañca 
śiṣyāṇāṃ (*) ntañcāpi paścimam | oṃ hiṃ hili hili 
śūlapāṇaye svāhā | 

khaṭvāṃgaṃ varamudrāñca triśūlamabhayandadhat | 
svapnamāṇavakaṃ piṅgo jaṭācandrārdhaśekharaḥ || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

onnamaśśaṃbho triṇetrāya piṃgalāya mahātmane | vāmāya 
śaṃbhurūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ || 

ācakṣva devadeveśa prasannosmi tayāntikam | svapne sarvāṇi 
kāryāṇi hṛdisthāni ihāni me || 

oṃ hili hiline śūlapāṇaye namaḥ | evaṃ mantrañca śiṣyāṇāṃ 
upadiśyātha śodhayet || yadvā kāśmīratantre (-) 

śiṣyopavāsake naiva śataṃ kuṇḍasya pūrvake | 

<p. 1481> 

kāmike (-) 

vastraiśacchāditān śiṣyān tilasarṣapabhūtibhiḥ | 
astrābhyamabhimantritā sati so (*) rekhā saṃkalpya bāhyataḥ || 

kālottare viśeṣa uktaḥ (-) 

śiṣyodhivāsayettatra maṇḍalasya tu dakṣiṇe | kalaśaṃ nava 
vinyasya navaratnantu vinyaset || 

svastrāṃ sāpidhānāṃśca sa kūrcānsūtraveṣṭitān | 
dhānyarāśau nidhātavyaṃ (**) nodakaṃ puritān || 

darbha śayyā samā imāḥ śivadhyānaparāyaṇaḥ | 
svapnamāṇavakañjaptvā (**) drātrau gurossaha || 

tathā mataṃge (-) 

yāgabhūmau svapedvidvān śiṣyaissārddhaṃ mahītale | tiladarbha 
pravistīrṇe kṛtakṣetre pradhūpite || 

sakalīkṛta sarvāṃgyo maunamāsthāya deśikaḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

saṃrakṣyāropayecchiṣyaṃ śikhāptaṃ śikhahṛdā | vāsavā 
varmajaptena pracchādya bahiśalikhet || 

rekhātisrostra dīptaistaistrilasarṣapa bhasmābhiḥ | 

kāmike (-) 

datvā bāhyabalidikṣu dik patibhyo yathākramam | 

<p. 1482> 

carundantadhavāriṣṭa pratikūlopaśāntaye | viṣamā viṣmādīpya 
hutvā caikaikataśśatam || 

prāyaścittaṃ tato hutvā mūlenāṣṭottaraśatam | 
prakṣālitāṃghrihastantu svācānta snānamaṃbhasā || 

nirva (*) bhasmanā vā vāpi parivartyasitāṃ śuke | śivīkṛtatanuṃ 
dhyātvā samastādhvatanuṃ śivam || 

parukaṃ pañcagavyañca prāśayeddantadhāvanam | pūrvavat prayato 
bhūtvā śuddhasvayamapi svapet || 

ācamyātha (**) nvā kuryāddantairaspṛśya bhojanam | prāṇāpānādi 
mantraiśca pañcabrahmamanusmaran || 

bhojayitvā krameṇaiva śayanaṃ kārayettataḥ | 

vintyaviśve (-) 

yadvā | 

hṛdā tu sakalāgrā sabhojayeddeśikottama | paścādāvamanaṃ 
kāryaṃ śuddhaireva jalaiḥ punaḥ || 

niśvāse (-) 

agninā tapyamānasya śṛṇu tasya upadravat | kaṇṭhe śoṣa 
smṛtārttasya mūcchātīvrāśca jāyate || 

tenārto na labhettatvaṃ mantratatvaṃ paśorapi | 
tasmāttṛṣādibhūtasya dīkṣāhomaṃ na kārayet || 

haviṣya bhojanaṃ kṛtvā ghṛtakṣīra pariplutam | 

<p. 1483> 

pāyasaṃ vā sa bhuktvā tu tato dīkṣāṃ samācaret || 

mṛgendre (-) 

gavyapūrṇañcaruprāśya śuddhavastraśucigrahe | tatraiva 
śayyāmāstīrya prāguktavidhinā svapet || 

svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

carame sthaṇḍile bhūmau sa śiṣyastu gurusvapet | 
śiṣyādhivāsanaṃ vipra kathitantu ma (***) || 

nṛttagīta samāyuktaṃ vinodaṃ kārayetsadā | 

[iti vāmadevātmaja vedajñānaviracita dīkṣādarśe nirvāna 
dīkṣādhivāsana vidhiḥ] | athotthāya gurutyakta pratisaraṃ snātaṃ 
sandhyādvayaṃ nirvartitaṃ śiṣyamāhūyaśubhāśubhasvapna śrutvā 
sa śubhe śāntiṃ kuryāt | kāraṇe (-) 

tyaktvā pratisaraṃ dhīmān kṛtvā snānantu śiṣyakam | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

nityanaimittikaṃ kṛtvā praviśedyāgamaṇṭapam | ācamya 
vidhivacchuddhiṃ soṣṇaṣobhūṣaṇānvitam || 

maṇṭapaṃ pūvavatpūjya vardhanī bhramaṇaṃ vinā | 
toraṇadvārapālānāṃ kalaśasyādhidaivatā || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

yathādrakṣantu svapnaṃ hi pṛcchecchiṣyaṃ tadā guruḥ | 

<p. 1484> 

dhvajaścakraṃ ca padmañca gajaṃ vṛṣabhamuttamam || 

kṣītaṃ māṃsa dadhiñcaiva madhumadyaṃ jalaṃ tathā | 
gajādhārohaṇañcāpi śukla mālyānulepanam || 

dīpamujvalamagniñca brāhmaṇaṃ vedapāragam | samānañca vadhūṃ 
vāpi viśyāṃ vā sarvalakṣaṇām || 

pitrośca darśanaṃ vāpi gurordarśanamuttamam | 
ratnahemāṃgulīyādi bhūṣaṇaṃ svapnamuttamam || 

tailābhyaṃgamaṣīlepamaṃ gacchedantathaiva ca | vidhavā 
darśanañcāpi navavastrā vakuṇṭhanam || 

mṛdbhāṇḍanavakañcāpi paitriko mahiṣādibhiḥ | 
mardanandarśanañcāpi kṛṣṇapuruṣa darśanam || 

bhujagadarśanaṃ vāpi bādhakāścaiva mādiśet | kākaṃ karoti 
dīnānāṃ darśanaṃ tvaśubhāvaham || 

kālottare śubhaviṣaye viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

narāṇāṃ brāhmaṇa śreṣṭha nṛpamadhyamamādiśet | pakṣīṇāṃ 
cāpi sarveṣāṃśukaṃ hasya praśaṃsyate || 

mṛgāṇāmapi sarveṣāṃ hariṇī siṃhamuttamam | paśūnāmapi 
sarveṣā vṛṣabhaṃ gajauttamam || 

<p. 1485> 

sarīsṛpānāṃ sarveṣāṃ śvetaṃ sarvaṃ praśasyate | 
gandhapuṣpaphalaṃ sakhyaṃ vastramābharaṇaṃ śubham || 

yastu paśyati svapnānte tasya cintāṃ vinirdiśet | svapnastu 
prathame yāme vatsaratrayapākina || 

dvitīyenadvaye pāka tṛtīyepyekavatsaraḥ | yāme sa paścime vatsa 
ṣaṇmāsātsidhyati dhruvam || 

usaḥ pūrve dvādaśāhāt brāhme pañcadaśadinam | aruṇodaya 
belāyāṃsaptahātsiddhimāpnuyāt || 

sudusvapnaṃ śrāvayedbāhu susvapnaṃ gṛhayennaraḥ | 
śubhañcetpraviśeddīkṣāṃ śubhāhomaṃ samācaret || 

śiṣyān pṛṣṭvā nirīsvapnān susvapne śāntimācaret | ghṛta 
dūrvāmadhukṣīrai śatahomañca kāpilaiḥ || 

śubhe tu praviśeddīkṣāmaśubhe homamācaret | iti mantraṃ japitvā 
tu dūrvā śirasi nikṣipet || 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

sa dusvapnadarśane mantraṃ homenāṣṭa sahasrakam | kṛtvā 
dīkṣāṃ prakurvīta bhautikassiddhivarjitāḥ || 

deśikaśśodhyamadhvānaṃ pūrvoktañcātmanāṃ nyaset | bhāsvaraṃ 
śivahastaña bhāvayennandikeśvara || 

kuṃbhe śivañca saṃpūjya sarvāvaraṇa saṃyutaḥ | 

<p. 1486> 

indrādīśāpi dikpālān pūjayitvā samahitaḥ || 

sthaṇḍile maṇḍale vāpi pūjayecchivamavyayam | pāvakaṃ 
pūjayetpaścāttarpaṇapūrvakāvadhi || 

dusvapnaṃ śāntayetpaścānmūlamantraṃśataṃ hunet | huṃkāraṃ 
saṃpuṭenaiva hutvā mantrasya dīpanam || 

kuṃbhamaṃḍalayormadhye cāntarbali vidhīyate | śiṣyāṇāñca 
praveśāya labdhvā cājñāṃ bahirbhavet || 

pūrvavanmaṇḍalārohaṃ kuryāt sayavattadā | saṃpātahomatannāḍī 
rūpamakarāṃgakam || 

mūlena sannidhānārthaṃ juhuyādāhuti trayam | 
sthaṇḍileśamathābhyarcya pāśasūtramayāharet || 

ācārya dakṣiṇe bhāge cotthāpyābhyutthitaśśubham | 
nāḍīsūtrañca badhnīyāt keśāt pādāntalaṃbitān || 

tataḥ paśoranu (**) karomīti vijñāpya śivādanujñāṃ śirasā 
vāhayitvā ādehavanhimaṇḍala kuṃbhaśiṣyeṣu bodhyamadhvānaṃ 
paradhvanopi vyāpakaṃ mṛtvā anyonya sandhānārthaṃ mūlena śataṃ 
juhuyāt | tadanu oṃ hāṃ ādhāra śaktaye namaḥ | iti vanhau 
vinyasya pūjya saṃnidhānāhutitrayaṃ datvā śiṣyadehasūtrabhedena 
jānvadho nivṛttisthānīyabhūte tadvayāptimālo bhavet | oṃ hāṃ 
nivṛttikalāyai namaḥ | 

<p. 1487> 

