| oṃ hāṃ kālāgnirudrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kūśmāṇḍāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ hāṭakeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ viṣṇave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rudrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
kapālīśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ajāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ buddhāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vrajadehāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pramardanāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ vibhūtaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ avyāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śāstre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pinākine namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śrī 
daśādhipāya namaḥ | agnirudrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ hutāśanāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ piṃgalāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ khādayitvāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ harāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jvalanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
dahanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ babhrave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhasmāntakāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kṣayāntakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dharmāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ mṛtyave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ harāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhātre 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vidhātre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kartre saṃjñāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ savyoktre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pitre namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
dharmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ adharmapataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ nirṛtaye 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ māraṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ mantre namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ krūradṛṣṭaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhayānakāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ ūrdhveśāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1488> 

oṃ hāṃ virūpākṣāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhūmrāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ lohitāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ daṃṣtrāya namaḥ | balāya namaḥ 
| oṃ atibalāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pāśahastāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
balāya namaḥ | śvetākṣāya namaḥ | jayabhadrāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ dīrghabāhave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jalāntakāya namaḥ | 
meghanādāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sunādāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śīghrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ laghave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāyuvargāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sūkṣmāya namaḥ | tīkṣṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
kṣayāntakāya namaḥ | pañcāntakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śivāntakāya namaḥ | kapardine namaḥ | meghavāhanāya namaḥ | 
nidhīśāya namaḥ | rūpavate namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhanyāya namaḥ | 
saumyadehāya namaḥ | jaṭādhārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ lakṣmīghṛte 
namaḥ | ratnaghṛte namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śrī ghṛte namaḥ | 
prāsādāya namaḥ | vidyārdhipeśāya namaḥ | īśāya namaḥ | 
sarvajñāya namaḥ | jñānabhuje namaḥ | vedapāragāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ suṣumnaśāya namaḥ | śarvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jyeṣṭhāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhūtapālāya namaḥ | balipriyāya namaḥ | 
vṛṣāya namaḥ | vṛṣadharāya namaḥ | anantāya namaḥ | krodhāya 
namaḥ | marutārśanāya namaḥ | grasanāya namaḥ | uduṃbarīśāya 
namaḥ | phaṇīndrāya namaḥ | vajrāya namaḥ | daṃṣṭre namaḥ | 
śaṃbhave namaḥ | vibhave namaḥ | gaṇādhyakṣāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1489> 

triyakṣāya namaḥ | tridaśeśvarāya namaḥ | saṃvāhanāya namaḥ | 
vivāhanāya namaḥ | nabhase namaḥ | lipsave namaḥ | trilocanāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vīrabhadrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhadrakālyai 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kṣakārāya namaḥ | iti tatvam | oṃ hāṃ oṃ namo 
namaḥ | śivāya namaḥ | oṃ namaḥ sarvadāya namaḥ | śarvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ | sūkṣmasūkṣmāya namaḥ | 
śabdāya namaḥ | jñānajñānāya namaḥ | piṃgapiṃgāya | pataṃga 
pataṃgāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kuru kuru namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sākṣin 
sakṣin namaḥ | pūrvasthita pūrvasthitāya namaḥ | astutastutāya 
namaḥ | ananvivārcitaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrapadāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sarvasānnidhyakarāya namaḥ | sarvabhūta 
sukhapradāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhavodbhavāya namaḥ | bhavabhavāya 
namaḥ | śarvaśarvāya namaḥ | prathama prathamāya namaḥ | 
muñcamuñcāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ yogādhipataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
devāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ tejase namaḥ | sadbhāveśvarāya namaḥ | 
iti padārthānāṃ viṃśati | oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sadyojātamūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ lakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
lakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ iḍāya namaḥ | piṃgalāya namaḥ | 
prāṇāya namaḥ | apānāya namaḥ | upasthāya namaḥ | 
jñānendriyāya namaḥ | gandhaviṣayāya namaḥ | gandhaguṇāya 
namaḥ | rasaguṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rūpaguṇāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1490> 

sparśaguṇāya namaḥ | śabdaguṇāya namaḥ | brahmaṇe 
kāraṇeśāya namaḥ jāgrāvasthāya namaḥ | 
pītañcaturaśranvakitāya namaḥ | pṛthivīmaṇḍalāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ (**) na yo (*) namaḥ | prakṣayonaye namaḥ | paśuyonaye namaḥ | 
sarīsṛpāya namaḥ | sthāvarayonaye namaḥ | mānuṣya yonaye namaḥ 
| paiśāca yonaye namaḥ | rākṣasayonaye namaḥ | yakṣayonaye namaḥ 
| (*) rve yonaye namaḥ | aindrayonaye namaḥ | saumya yonaye namaḥ | 
prajeśa yonaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmayonaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
caturdarśaye namaḥ | etaissamastairgarbhitāntivṛttikalāyai vilokya 
śodhayet | athavā narayone dvijaśśodhyā mṛgayonermṛgādhipaḥ | 

paśuyone kāmadhenu pakṣiyone khageśvaraḥ | vāsukī sarpayone syāt 
sthāvarasaptavarṇakaḥ || 

oṃ hāṃ nivṛtti kalāyai haḥ huṃ phaḍiti jānvadhaḥ | puṣpeṇa 
saṃtāḍya | oṃ hāṃ hlāṃ nivṛttikalāyai svāhetyaṃkuśa 
mudrayā pūrakeṇākṛṣya oṃ hāṃ hāṃ hāṃ hlāṃ hāṃ hauṃ 
nivṛtti kalāyai huṃ phaḍiti saṃhāramudrayā kuṃbhakena saṃgṛhya 
oṃ hāṃ hlāṃ hāṃ nivṛttikalāyai namaḥ | recakeṇodbhavamudrayā 
kuṇḍeśaktāvadhāra rūpiṇyānniveśayet | oṃ hāṃ hlāṃ nivṛtti 
kalāyai namaḥ | iti saṃpūjyārdhyandatvā anena 
sannidhānāhutitrayandatvā pāśatrayamalakarma māyā dhārarūpaṃ 
bhoktṛtva bhoga śarīrādi janakaṃ bhāvayet | 

<p. 1491> 

tadanu | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | iti brahmāṇamāvāhya saṃpūjya 
sannidhānāhuti trayaṃ svāhāntena datvā 

oṃ brahmantavādhikārisminmukṣirdīkṣayāmyaham | bhāvyaṃ 
tvayānukūlena vidhiṃ vijñāpayediti || 

iti śivājñāṃ śrāvya tatastasyāṃ kalāyāṃ sthāvarādi ye 
niranantāssaṃkalpya tadvyāpinīṃ vāgīśvaraṃ (-) 

āvāhayettato devīṃ raktāṃ vāgīśvarīntayā | icchā jñāna 
kriyāṃ rūpāṃ ṣaḍvidhādhvaika kāriṇīm || 

pūjayettarpayeddevīṃ bhaktibhāva samanvitaḥ | tathā 
vāgīśvarandevaṃ yonisaṃkṣobhadakṣakam || 

iti dhyātvābhyarcya santidhānāhutitrayandatvā bhagavantau 
paśoranugrahāya sannidhī bhavatamiti prārthya śiṣyamastreṇa 
saṃprokṣya oṃ hāṃ hāṃ hāṃ huṃ phaḍiti hṛddeśe 
sapuṣpānārāca mudrayā saṃtāḍyātmano recakena tasya dehe huṃ 
kāreṇa praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā 
viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṃ kuśamudrayā pūrakeṇā 
kṛsya ātmamūlamantra manusmaran tadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
tṛṇāgrabindurūpaṃ jīvaṃ sañcintya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane 
nama iti saṃhāra mudrayā saṃgṛhya pūrakeṇa vṛtyā svahṛdi 
sanniveśya kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantra manusmaran oṃ hāṃ haṃ 
hāṃ ātmane namaḥ | 

<p. 1492> 

iti brahmādi kāraṇatyāgena krameṇa svadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
saṃgṛhya pūrvokta krameṇa nissārye pirtrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya 
vāmayodbhavamudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti 
sarvayoniṣvaneka vyaktirūpeṇātmano yugapadgarbha niṣpattiṃ kuru 
kurviti tatastajjananārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayam vidhāya 
bhagavannasyātmanassarvagarbhāṇāñjananaṃ kuru kurviti 
tatodhikārārthaṃ saśarīrāṇāṃ yugapadvṛddhiṃ saṃbhāvya 
bhoganispattaye vyāpi kūpataṭā prapādilaukika karmaphalaṃ 
prāgāgamī ca karmaikasthaṃ sarva yoniśarīreṣṭabhogānnasyātmano 
nānābhogadāyakaṃ karmārjanaṃ kuru kurviti | tadanu deśakāla 
śarīraviṣayabhede nānārūpaṃ prāgāgāmikarmavāsanā janitaṃ 
bhoktṛtvaliṃginyātmani suḥkhaduḥkha vedanātmakaṃ bhogaṃ 
sañcintya mūlenāhutitrayaṃ dadyāt | bhagavantasyātmanassarvatra 
bhoganiṣpattiṃ kuru kurviti vijñāpayet | atrāntare 
bhūlokagarbhādhānādināmnāyoktān catvāriṃśat saṃskārān 
ghṛtāhutibhistisṛbhistisṛbhiḥ pañcabhirvā āpādayet | tadyathā 
(-) 

garbhādhānādi puṃsavanaṃ sīmantonnanayanaṃ tathā | 
jātakarmanāmakaraṇaṃ upaniṣkrāmaṇaṃ tathā || 

anna prāśanakādīni pūrvannava prabhāṣitam | 

<p. 1493> 

itthaṃ saṃskārānāpādya tatpratibandhakaṃ hṛdāhuti trayeṇa 
tathaiva vinivartayet | tadanu bhogeṣu paramāprīti yogaṃ 
layamanusandhāya mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavantasyātmano 
bhogeṣu paramāprītiyogaṃ layaṃ kurukurviti māyākāryāraṃbha 
pravāharūpāṇāṃ bhuktasyānnapathāṃ srotasāṃ śuddhaye 
mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmano māyākāryāraṃbhe 
pravāhaśuddhiṃ kurukurviti vijñāpayet | bhogahetau karmaṇi 
bhuktepi punastadaprasatvahetave nivṛttitatvaśuddhau 
hṛdayāhutitrayaṃ kāryam | niṣkṛtau jāti bhogasaṃskārādi 
śudhyarthaṃ sarvadāmūlena sapāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ datvā 
bhoktṛtvaviṣayāsakti rūpaṃ malakāryaṃ vibhāvya 
tattirodhānārthaṃ mūlena pāśupatenāhutidaśakaṃ 
huṃkāramalādviśleṣaṃ saṃkalpya punarmūlena tathaivāhuti 
tathaivāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt | karmaṇo bhuktasyātyantarbhāva 
rūpaviśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya mūlena sapāśupatenāhutitrayandatvā 
māyā karmarūpasya viśleṣaṃ kurukurviti tadanu saptadhāstajaptayā 
kartaryā oṃ hāṃ hlāṃ hau nivṛttikalāpāśāya huṃ phaḍiti 
anena mantreṇa svasvaranivṛtti kalāpāśavadhau vidyāt | tato 
bandhaka nivṛttaye hastābhyā mastreṇa vimṛjyavartulī kṛtya 
ghṛtapūrṇāyāṃ sruci dhyātvā ājya sahitaṃ tenaiva 
mantreṇāgnau dahet | kevalāstreṇāṣṭā hutvā 
śeṣaśarīravināśe caitanyasyaikatvaṃ saṃbhāvayet | 

<p. 1494> 

tadanu bījaṃ dīkṣāyāntatra brahmāṇamābāhya saṃpūjya 
saṃtarpya śivapadagamana prabandhakāraṇārthaṃ vijñāpya visṛjet 
| evaṃ pratiṣṭhā kalāyāṃ kuryāt | yadvā brahmāṇamāvāhya 
saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ datvā puryaṣṭakaśudhyarthaṃ oṃ hāṃ 
brahman śabdasparśau śuṣkaṃ gṛhāṇeti svāhāhuti trayaṃ hutvā 
vijñāpayet | 

bho bho brahmantvayā nāḍyā cāpadaṃ nāmayaṃ prati | 

bandho vidhātavya ityājñā pārameśvarīti śivaśrāvya 
brahmāṇaṃ visṛjet | evaṃ śuddhatatvāgra saṃsthitaṃ 
śuddhasphaṭika maṇinibhaṃ nivṛttikalā jālanirmuktamātmānaṃ 
sañcintyoddhāraṇārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā 
nivṛttipāśanduddhāra bhagavantasya (*) va kuru kuru kurviti 
saṃhāramudrayā pūrakeṇa oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti 
raudrātmānaṃ saṃhāriṇyāgneruddhṛtya vāmayā pūrakeṇa 
rāhumuktaikadeśa candrabiṃba sadṛśamātmānaṃ hūyamānīya 
pūrvadvādaśāntasthaṃ kṛtvā recakeṇodbhavamudrayā śiṣya dehe 
sūtre niyojya saṃpūjyāpyāyanāya mūlena vauṣaḍantenārdhya 
jalabinduṃ śirasi datvā sthirīkaraṇārthaṃ mūlena vāhuti trayaṃ 
datvā paścāt pitarau saṃpūjyāhuti trayeṇa saṃtāḍyārdhyayitvā 
vauṣaḍantamūlena pūrṇāṃ vidadhyāt iti nivṛttikalā śuddhiḥ | 

<p. 1495> 

pratiṣṭhākalā śodhanam (-) 

cintyaviśve (-) 

nivṛttiṃ śodhanaṃ hyetat pratiṣṭhāmārabhate kramāt | 
tattadvayasya sandhānaṃ śuddhāśuddhasya vai bhavet || 

hrasvadīrgha prayogeṇa sāntāntandānta saṃyutam | 
śuddhāmāyāntamuccārya śuddhānnādānta muccaret || 

oṃ hāṃ hlīṃ nivṛtti pratiṣṭhā kalābhyāṃ namaḥ | iti 
saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ datvā śuddhamaśuddhe vimānaṃ saṃbhāvya 
dvitīyāṃ kalāmupasthāpayet | oṃ hāṃ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | 
iti saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ hutvā sūtradehe pratiṣṭhā sthāne 
tadvayāptiṃ vicintya oṃ hlīṃ pratiṣṭhā kalāyai namaḥ | 
ityavalokayet | oṃ hāṃ aptatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ tejastatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ākāśatatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ gandhatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rūpatatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sparśatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śabdatatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ upasthatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pādatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāṇitatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāktatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ghrāṇatatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jihvātatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ cakṣustatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ tvak tatvāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1496> 

oṃ hāṃ śrotratatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ manastatvāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ ahaṃkāratatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ buddhitatvāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ guṇatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ prakṛtitatvāya namaḥ | iti 
caturviṃśati tatvāni | oṃ hāṃ amareśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
prabhāsāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ naimiśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
puṣkarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ āṣāḍhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
muṇḍaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhārabhūtāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
lakulīśāya namaḥ | ityaṣṭabhuvanāni aptatve | oṃ hāṃ 
hariścandrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śrīśailāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
jalpeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ āmrādikeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
madhyameśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ mahādevāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
kedārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ mahādevāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kedārāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhairavāya namaḥ | ityaṣṭa tejastatvabhuvanāni 
oṃ hāṃ gayāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kurukṣetrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
nākhalāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ na khalāya namaḥ | vimaleśvarāya 
namaḥ | aṭṭahāsāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ mahendrāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ bhīmeśvarāya namaḥ | ityaṣṭau vāyutatva bhuvanāni | oṃ 
hāṃ vastrāpadāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rudrakoṭyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
avimuktāya namaḥ | mahālayāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ gokarṇāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ bhadrakarṇāya namaḥ | svarṇākṣāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sthāṇave namaḥ | 

<p. 1497> 

ityaṣṭau ākāśatatva bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ caṇḍāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ dviraṇḍāya namaḥ | mahākoṭāya namaḥ | maṇḍaleśvarāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kālāñjanāya namaḥ | iti tanmātra pañcake | 
pañcabhuvanāni oṃ hāṃ śaṃkukaṇṭhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sthaleśvarāya namaḥ | iti karmendriya pañcake | oṃ hāṃ 
sthūleśvarāya namaḥ | iti buddhindriya pañcake | oṃ hāṃ 
sthaleśvarāya namaḥ | ityahaṃkāratatvabhuvane | oṃ hāṃ 
paiśācāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rākṣasāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
yakṣāya namaḥ | gandharvāya namaḥ | aindrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
saumyāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ prajeśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe 
namaḥ | iti yonyaṣṭakaṃ buddhi tatva bhuvane | oṃ hāṃ akṛtāya 
namaḥ | kṛtāya namaḥ | bhairavāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe 
namaḥ | viṣṇave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kaumārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
aumāya namaḥ | śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ | iti devayonyaṣṭakaṃ 
prakṛtau iti ṣaṭpañcāśat bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ hakārāya namaḥ 
| ṣakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śakārāya namaḥ | vakārāya namaḥ 
| lakārāya namaḥ | rephāya namaḥ | yakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
makārāya namaḥ | bhakārāya namaḥ | bakārāya namaḥ | phakārāya 
namaḥ | pakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ nakārāya namaḥ | dhakārāya 
namaḥ | dakārāya namaḥ | dhakārāya namaḥ | takārāya namaḥ | 
ṇakārāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1498> 

ḍhakārāya namaḥ | ḍakārāya namaḥ | ṭhakārāya namaḥ | 
ṭakārāya namaḥ | iti varṇā trayoviṃśati | oṃ hāṃ 
śarvaśarvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ prathama prathamāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ muñca muñcāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ yogādhipataye namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ mahātejase namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sadbhāveśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ mahādevāya namaḥ | paramātmane namaḥ | śarvāya namaḥ | 
śivāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ nidhanodbhavāya namaḥ | nidhanāya namaḥ 
| anidhanāya namaḥ | svadhāya namaḥ | bhuvāya namaḥ | bhuve namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ dhū dhū dhū dhū namaḥ | nā nā nā nā namaḥ | anāde 
namaḥ | abhasmāya namaḥ | adhūmāya namaḥ | anagne namaḥ | 
arūpāya namaḥ jyotirjyotinnamaḥ | tejastejāya namaḥ | prathama 
prathamāya namaḥ | arūpinnarūpinnamaḥ | vyāpin vyāpinnamaḥ | 
ityaṣṭaviṃśatpadāni | oṃ hāṃ hiṃ śirase namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
hiṃ vāmadevāya namaḥ | iti mantrau dvau | oṃ hāṃ ukārāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ vakārāya namaḥ | iti bījau dvau | oṃ hāṃ suṣumnāya 
namaḥ | gāndhārāya namaḥ | iti nāḍī dvau | oṃ hāṃ samānāya 
namaḥ | śabdaguṇāya namaḥ | udānāya namaḥ | vā dvau | oṃ hāṃ 
īśāsanāya namaḥ | itīndriye | oṃ hāṃ svapnāvasthāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave kāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | ityetaiḥ 
samastrairgarbhitāṃ pratiṣṭhākalāṃ śiṣyadehaṃ (-) 

<p. 1499> 

sūtrabhedena manasā sañcintya oṃ hāṃ hlīṃ hāṃ pratiṣṭhā 
kalāyai huṃ phaḍiti saṃhāriṇyā kuṃbhakena saṃgṛhya oṃ hrāṃ 
hlīṃ pratiṣṭhākalāyai namaḥ iti recakeṇodbhavamudrayā kuṇḍe 
śaktāvādhārarūpiṇyā niveśayet | oṃ hāṃ hlīṃ 
pratiṣṭhākalāyai namaḥ | ityabhyarcyārdhyandatvā svāhāntena 
sannidhānāhuti trayandatvā pāśatrayamalakarmāyā rūpaṃ 
bhoktṛtva bhoga śarīrādijanakaṃ bhāvayet | tadanu oṃ hāṃ 
viṣṇave namaḥ | iti viṣṇumāvāhyābhyarcya saṃnidhānāhuti 
trayandatvā oṃ viṣṇave tavādhikāresminmumukṣurdīkṣayāmyaham | 

bhāvyantvayānukūlena pārameśani yogataḥ | iti śivaṃ 
śrāvayitvā tasyāṃ kalāyāṃ nānāyonirūpaṃ saṃkalpya 
tadvayāpakaṃ vāgīśvarīṃ vāgīśvarañca pūrvavadabhyarcya 
sannidhānāhuti trayandatvā bhagavanto paśoranugrahāya saṃnidhī 
bhavatāmiti prārthya śiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya oṃ hāṃ huṃ 
phaḍiti hṛddeśe sapuṣpānārā ca mudrayā saṃtāḍyātmano 
recakeṇa tasya dehe huṃ kāreṇa praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ 
huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṃkuśa 
mudrayā cotkṛṣya mūlamantra manusmaran tadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
saṃgṛhya pūrvokta krameṇa nissārya pitrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya 
vāmayodbhavamudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane namaḥ | 

<p. 1500> 

iti sarvayoniṣu aneka vyaktirūpeṇa ātmano yugapatsaṃyogaṃ kṛtvā 
mūlena saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ datvā | bhagavannasyātmanassarvāsu 
yoniṣu yugapadgarbhaniṣpatti kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya 
sarvagarbhaniṣpattaye mūlenāhutiṃ datvā | bhagavanna 
syātmanassarvassasrvāsu yoniṣu yugapadgarbha niṣpatti kuru kurviti 
vijñāpayet tatastu jananārthaṃ prasādenāhuti trayaṃ vidhāya 
bhagavannasyātmanassarva garbhāṇāṃ jananaṃ kuru kurviti 
tatodhikārārthaṃ sarvaśarīrāṇāṃ yugapadvṛddhiṃ saṃbhāvya 
bhoganiṣpattaye somasaṃsthādi vaidikakarma kṛcchra jātyaṃ 
prāgāmi ca karmaikasaṃsthaṃ sarvayoni śarīreṣu bhogadāyakaṃ 
karmārjanañca bhāvayitvā mūlenāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt | 
bhagavannasyātmano nānā bhogadāyakaṃ karmārjanañca kuru kuru 
kurviti | tadanu deśakālaśarīraviṣaya bhedena nānārūpa 
prāgādikarma vāsanā janitaṃ bhoktṛtva liṃginyātmani sukha 
duḥkha vedanātmakaṃ sañcintya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā 
bhagavannasyātmana ssarvāsu bhoganiṣpattiṃ kuru kuru kuriti 
bhogyeṣu parama prītirūpaṃ layaṃ sañcintya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ 
datvā bhagavannasyātmano bhogyeṣu paramaprītirūpaṃ layaṃ kuru 
kuru kurviti māyākāryāraṃbha pravāharūpāṇāṃ bhoktṛsthāna 
pāśāṃ srotasāṃ śuddhaye mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā 
bhagavanasyānnasyātmano (-) 

<p. 1501> 

māyā kāryāraṃbha pravāhaśuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhoga hetau 
karmaṇi bhuṃktepi punastadaprasavitva hetave pratiṣṭhātatva 
hṛtikāryaṃ niṣkṛtau jātyāyurbhoga saṃskārādi śudhyarthaṃ 
śirasā mūlena śatāhutiṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano niṣkṛtya 
sarva karmasu śuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogābhāve māyā pāśāt 
bahirniṣkramaṇarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya mūlena 
pāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhotṛtva viṣayāsakti rūpaṃ mala (*) 
(*) bhovya tattirodhānārthaṃ sa pāśupatena mūlenāhuti daśakaṃ 
hutvā malādviśleṣaṃ saṃkalpya punarmūlena tathaivāhuti trayaṃ 
juhuyā karmaṇo bhuktasyāpyatyantābhāvarūpa viśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya 
mūlena sapāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano 
māyāmalakarmarūpasya pāśatrayasya viśleṣaṃ kuru kuru kurviti 
vijñāpayet | tadanu saptadhābhra japtayā kartaryā oṃ hāṃ hvīṃ 
hauṃ pratiṣṭhākalāpāśāya haḥ huṃ phaḍityanena mantreṇa 
sasvaraṃ pratiṣṭhākalā kalaśāvayaucchidyāt | tato bandhakatva 
nivṛttaye hastābhyāṃ vastreṇa vimṛjyā vartulīkṛtya 
ghṛtapūrṇāyāṃ srucanyastvājyasahitaṃ tenaiva mantreṇa hutvā 
dahet | kevalāstrāhuti trayeṇa bhasmasātkuryāt | 
bhagavannasyātmana pratiṣṭhākalā (-) 

<p. 1502> 

pāśacchedaṃ kuru kurviti vijñāpya punaḥ pāśāṃkura nivṛttaye 
huṃ phaḍantāstreṇāhuti pañcakaṃ hutvā prāyaścittārthaṃ 
astreṇāhuti trayandatvā vijñāpayet | 

bho bho viṣṇotvayā nāsyā yā tu padamanāmayam | pratibandho 
vidhātavya ityājñā pārameśvarīti || 

viṣṇuṃ visrjet | evaṃ śuddhatatvāgrasthaṃ śuddhasphaṭika maṇi 
nibhaprakhyaṃ pratiṣṭhākalājāla nirmuktamātmānaṃ 
vicintyoddhārāya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmanaḥ | 
pratiṣṭhā kalāpāśaddhāraṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya oṃ hāṃ 
ātmane namaḥ | iti raudrātmānaṃ saṃhāriṇyāgneruddhṛtya 
vāmayā pūrakeṇāhutirarddha candra nibhāmātmāna mātmani 
hṛdayaṃ recakeṇodbhavamudrayā śiṣyasūtradehe 
niyojyābhyarcyāpyāya nāya mūlenārdhyajalabinduṃ śirasidatvā 
sthirīkaraṇārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā tadanu pitarau 
saṃpūjyāhutitrayaṃ datvārdhyayitvā visṛjya vauṣaḍantamūlena 
pūrṇāndadyāt | iti pratiṣṭhākalā śuddhiḥ || cintyaviśve (-) 

vidyā sandhāna kāryatvaṃ pūrvokta kalayā saha | tatva 
varṇādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavannandikeśvara || 

atra kramaḥ | śuddhāṃ pratiṣṭhākalāṃ hrasvamuccārya śuddhāṃ 
vidyākalādīrgha muccārayet | 

<p. 1503> 

oṃ hāṃ hūṃ pratiṣṭhā vidyā kalābhyāṃ namaḥ | iti 
saṃpūjyābhyarcyāhuti trayaṃ datvā śuklaṃ śuddhe vilīnaṃ 
saṃbhāvya vidyākalāmupasthāpayet | oṃ hāṃ ādhāraśaktaye 
namaḥ | ityavalokayet | oṃ hāṃ puruṣa tatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
rāgatatvāya namaḥ | tadvayāptiṃ vicintya | oṃ hrūṃ 
vidyākalāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kālatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
niyati tatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kalātatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
māyā tatvāya namaḥ | iti saptatatvāni | oṃ hāṃ vāmāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ bhīmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ugrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
bhavāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ īśānāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ekavīrāya 
namaḥ | iti puruṣatatvāni bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ pracaṇḍāya namaḥ 
| oṃ hāṃ umāpataye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ajāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
ekaśikhāya namaḥ | iti rāgatatva bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ krodhāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ caṇḍāya namaḥ | iti vidyātatva bhuvane dvau | 
oṃ hāṃ mahātejase namaḥ | jyotiṣe namaḥ | saṃvartāya namaḥ iti 
kalātatva bhuvane dve | oṃ hāṃ śūrāya namaḥ | pañcāntakāya 
namaḥ | iti niyati tatva bhuvane dve ekavīrāya namaḥ | śivodayāya 
namaḥ | iti kalātatva bhuvane dve | oṃ hāṃ mahātejase namaḥ | 
vāmadevāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ bhavāya namaḥ | udbhavāya namaḥ | 
piṃgekṣaṇāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1504> 

oṃ hāṃ īśānāya namaḥ | bhuvaneśāya namaḥ | aṣṭamātrāya 
namaḥ | iti māyā tatva bhuvanāṣṭakani | tathā kāmike (-) 

ṣaṭ pañca pañcakañcaiva yugme mayugmadvayam | aṣṭakaṃ 
puruṣādau tu māyānte tu purāṇi tu | 

oṃ hāṃ ñakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ lakārāya namaḥ | jakārāya 
namaḥ | chakārāya namaḥ | cakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dakārāya 
namaḥ | oṃ dhakārāya namaḥ | iti varṇāssapta | oṃ hāṃ vyomin 
vyominnamaḥ | acetanā cetanāya namaḥ | oṃ parameśvarāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ jyotirūpāya namaḥ | sarvavidyādhipāya namaḥ | 
sarvayogādhikṛtāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anidhanāya namaḥ | gopte 
namaḥ | guhyāti guhyāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ onnamo namaḥ | om hāṃ 
sadyojātamūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāmaguhyāya namaḥ | 
aghorahṛdayāya namaḥ | tatpuruṣa vaktrāya namaḥ | 
īśānamūrddhāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sarvaprabhave namaḥ | śivāya namaḥ | namo namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
onnamaḥ | iti viṃśatpadāni oṃ hāṃ hūṃ śikhāyai namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ aghorāya namaḥ | iti mantrau dvau | oṃ hāṃ makārāya namaḥ 
| rephāya namaḥ | iti bījau dvau | oṃ hāṃ puruṣāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ hasti jihvāya namaḥ | iti nāḍī dvau | oṃ hāṃ vidhāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sparśaguṇāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1505> 

śabdaguṇāya namaḥ | rudrāya kāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
raktagrayaśraṃ svastikāñcitāya namaḥ | maṇḍalāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ suṣuptyavasthāya namaḥ | ityetaissarvairgarbhitāṃ 
vidyākalāṃ śiṣyadehe sūtraikyena cetasāvalokya oṃ hāṃ hraṃ 
vidyākalāyai haḥ huṃ phaḍiti saṃhāriṇyā kuṃbhakena saṃgṛhya 
oṃ hrāṃ hrūṃ hāṃ vidyākalāyai iti recakeṇodbhavamudrayā | 
kuṇṭhe śaktāvādhāra rūpiṇyāṃ niveśayet | oṃ hāṃ hrūṃ 
hāṃ vidyākalāyai namaḥ | ityabhyarcyārdhyayitvā 
saṃnidhānāhutirhutvā pāśatrayammalatrayakarmāya rūpaṃ 
bhoktṛtva bhogaśarīrādi janakaṃ bhāvayet | tadanu | oṃ hāṃ 
rudrāya namaḥ | iti rudrāvāhyābhyarcya saṃnidhānāhutirhutvā | 

rudrastvadhikāresmin mumukṣurdīkṣayāmyaham | bhāvyaṃ 
tvayānukūlena sadāśiva niyogataḥ || 

iti śrāvayitvā tasyāṃ nānārūpāyonissaṃ kalpya tadvayāpikāṃ 
vāgīśvarīṃ vāgīśvarañca pūrvavadabhyarcya 
saṃnidhānāhutirhutvā bhagavantau paśoranugrahaya saṃnidhī 
bhavatāmiti prārthya śiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya oṃ hāṃ huṃ 
phaḍiti hṛddeśe sa puṣpa nārāca mudrayā saṃtāḍyātmano 
recakeṇa tasya dehaṃ huṃ kāreṇa praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ 
huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā niyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṃ 
kuśamudrayā cotkṛṣya (-) 

<p. 1505> 

mūlamantra manusmaran dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tṛṇāgrabindurūpaṃ 
jīvaṃ sañcintya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti 
saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya pūrakavṛtyā svahṛdiṃniveśya 
kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantra manusmaran oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane 
nama iti brahmādi kāraṇatyāga krameṇa dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
saṃgṛhya dakṣiṇa nāḍyā nissārya pitrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya 
vamayodbhava mudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane namaḥ iti 
sarvayoniṣu naika vyaktirūpeṇātmano yugapatsaṃyogaṃ kṛtvā 
mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmanassarvāsu yoniṣu 
yugapatsaṃyogaṃ kuru kuru kuviti vijñāpya sarvagarbhaniṣpattaye 
mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā tatastu jananārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ 
hutvā tatodhikārārthaṃ śarīrāṇāṃ yugapadvṛddhiṃ saṃbhāvya 
bhoganiṣpattaye ādhyātmikaṃ vairāgya janyaṃ prāgāgāmi ca 
karmaikasyaṃ sarva yoni śarīreṣu nānābhoga dāyakaṃ karmārjanaṃ 
bhāvayitvā mūlenāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt | bhagavannasyātmano nānā 
bhogadāyaka karmārjanaṃ kuru kuru kurviti tadanu 
deśakālaśarīraviṣayabehdena nānārūpaṃ prāgāgāmikarma 
vāsanājanitaṃ bhoktṛtvaliṃgātmani sukha duḥkhenātmakarmabhogaṃ 
sañcintya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano sarvatra 
bhoganiṣpattiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogyeṣu paramaprītirūpaṃ 
saṃbhāvya mūlenā (-) 

<p. 1506> 

huti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano bhogyeṣu paramaprītirūpaṃ 
layaṃ kuru kurviti māyākāryāraṃbha pravāharūpāṇāṃ srotasāṃ 
śuddhaye mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmano māyāraṃbha 
pravāhaśuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogahetu karmaṇi bhuñktepi 
punastadaprasavitvahatave vidyātatvaśuddhahṛdāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt 
| niṣkṛtau jātyādi bhoga saṃskārādi śudhyarthaṃ śikhā 
purassaraṃ mūlenāhutiśataṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano niṣkṛtya 
sarvakarmāsu śuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogābhāve māyā pāśāt 
bahiniṣkramaṇarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya mūlena sa 
pāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhoktṛtva viṣayāsakti rūpaṃ 
malakāryaṃ vibhāvya tannirodhāya pāśupatenāhuti daśakaṃ hutvā 
malādviśleṣaṃ saṃkalpya mūlena tathaivāhutitrayaṃ juhuyāt | 
karmaṇo bhuktasyātyatyantābhāvaṃ viśleṣaṃ vibhāvya mūlena 
pāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhavaganna syātmano 
māyāmalakarmarūpasya pāśatrayasya viśleṣaṃ kuru kuru kurviti 
vijñāpayet | tadanu saptadhāstrajaptayā kartryā oṃ hāṃ hrūṃ 
haṃ vidyākalā pāśāya haṃ huṃ phaḍiti mantreṇānena sasvaraṃ 
vidyākalā pāśāvadhau chitvā bandhaka nivṛtyarthaṃ 
hastābhyāmastreṇa vimṛjya vartulīkṛtya ghṛtapūrṇāyāṃ sruci 
nyastvājyasahitantenaiva mantreṇāhuti hunet kevalāstrāhuti trayeṇa 
bhasmasātkuryāt | bhagavannasyātmano vidyākalāpāśacchedaṃ (-) 

<p. 1507> 

kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya punaḥ pāśāṃkuranivṛttaye huṃ 
phaḍantā streṇāhuti pañcakaṃ hutvā prrāyaścittārthaṃ 
astreṇāṣṭāhutiṃ kṛtvā śeṣa śarīra vināśa 
vaitanyasyaikatvaṃ vibhāvyarudramāvāhya saṃpūjyāhutitrayaṃ 
datvā puryaṣṭakaviśudhyarthaṃ oṃ hāṃ rudrarūpa gandhau śulkaṃ 
gṛhāṇa svāhetyāhutitrayaṃ datvā bho bhorudratvayā nasyā yātu 
padamanāmayam | pratibandho vidhātavya ityājñāpārameśvarīti 
vijñāpya visṛjet | evaṃ śuddha tatvāgrasthaṃ 
śuddhasphaṭikamaṇinibhaṃ vidyākalājāla nirmukta mātmānaṃ 
vibhāvyoddhārāya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano 
vidyākalāpāśāduddhāraṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya oṃ hāṃ 
haṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti rudrātmānamagne ruddhṛtya vāmayā 
pūrakeṇa saṃhāriṇyā rāhumuktārdha 
candrasadṛśamātmānamātmahṛdayamānīya recakeṇodbhavamudrayā 
śiṣyadehe niyojyābhyarcyāpyāyana śiṣyāśirasimūlenārdhyodaka 
vinduṃ śirasi kṣiptvāsthirī karaṇārthaṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ 
datvā pitarau saṃpūjyāhutīnāndatvārdhyayitvā visṛjya 
vauṣaḍanta mūlena pūrṇā dadyāt | iti vidyā kalāśuddhiḥ | || 
atha śāntikalā śuddhiḥ || 

śuddhāṃ vidyā kalāṃ hrasva muccārya śuddhāṃ śāntikalā 
dīrghamuccārayet | oṃ hrūṃ hyaiṃ vidyā śāntibhyāṃ namaḥ | 

<p. 1508> 

iti samabhyarcya svāhāntenāhuti trayaṃ datvā śuddhaṃ śuddhe 
vilīnaṃ vibhāvya śāntikalāmupasthāpayet | oṃ hāṃ 
ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | ityabhyarcyāhutitrayaṃ datvā sūtradehe 
śāntikalāsthāne tadvyāpti oṃ hyaiṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ | 
ityavalokayet oṃ hāṃ śuddhavidyātatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
īśvaratatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sadāśivatatvāya namaḥ | iti 
tatvāni trīṇi | oṃ hāṃ vāmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ jyeṣṭhāyai 
namaḥ | raudryai namaḥ | kālye namaḥ | kalavikaraṇayai namaḥ | 
balavikaraṇayai namaḥ | balapramathanyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
sarvabhūtadamanayi namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ manonmanyai namaḥ | iti 
śuddhavidyā tatvenavāni bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ | 
sūkṣmāya namaḥ śivottamāya namaḥ | ekanetrāya namaḥ | 
trimūrtaye namaḥ | śrī kaṇṭhāya namaḥ | śikhaṇḍine namaḥ | 
iti īśvaratatve bhuvanāni | oṃ hāṃ sadāśiva tatva bhuvanāya 
namaḥ | iti trayo varṇā | oṃ dhyānāhārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃa 
hakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ khakārāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kakārāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śāśvatāya namaḥ | oṃ dhruvāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ anāśritāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anāthāya namaḥ | nityayogine 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ yogapīṭhasaṃsthāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śāśvatāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhruvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anantāya 
namaḥ | śivāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sarvavyāpine namaḥ | 

<p. 1509> 

vyomarūpāya namaḥ | vyomavyāpine namaḥ | iti dvādaśapadāni | oṃ 
hāṃ haiṃ kavacāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ haiṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya 
namaḥ | iti mantre dve | oṃ hāṃ bindave namaḥ | vakārāya namaḥ | 
iti bīje dve | oṃ hāṃ yaśase namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ alaṃ puruṣāya 
namaḥ | iti nāḍīdve | oṃ hāṃ kurmāya namaḥ | kṛkarāya namaḥ 
| iti vāyūdve | oṃ hāṃ pāṇaye namaḥ | tvagīndrāya namaḥ | 
indriye dve | oṃ hāṃ sparśaviṣayāya namaḥ | sparśaguṇāya 
namaḥ | śabdaguṇāya namaḥ | īśvarakāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | 
turyāvasthāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kṛṣṇaṣaḍaśraṃ 
ṣaṭbindukalāñcita maṇḍalāya namaḥ | ityetaissamastairgarbhitāṃ 
śāntikalāṃ śiṣyadeha sūtraikyena cetasā balokya oṃ hāṃ hyaiṃ 
hāṃ śāntikalāyai haḥ huṃ phaḍiti bhrūmadhyādhastāt puṣpeṇa 
santāḍya oṃ hāṃ hyaiṃ hāṃ śāntikalāyai svāhetyaṃ 
kuśamudrayā pūrakeṇā kṛṣya oṃ hauṃ hāṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ 
ityabhyarcya huṃ phaḍiti saṃhāramudrayā kuṃbhakena saṃgṛhya oṃ 
hāṃ haiṃ hāṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ | iti recakeṇodbhavamudrayā 
kuṇḍeśaktamādhārarūpiṇyānniveśayet | oṃ hāṃ hyaiṃ hāṃ 
śāntikalāyai namaḥ | ityarbhyacyārdhyayitvā svāhentanāhuti 
trayaṃ datvā pāśatrayamadhikāramala suviśuddhakaṃ mahā 
māyārūpaṃ bhoktṛtva bhogaśarīrādi janakaṃ bhāvayet | tadanu | 
oṃ hāṃ īśvara kāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | ityabhyarcyāhutitrayaṃ 
datvā (-) 

<p. 1510> 

īśatvadadhikāresmin mumukṣurdīkṣayāmyaham | bhāvyaṃ 
tvayānukūlena sadāśiva niyogataḥ || 

iti vijñāpya tasyāṃ kalāyāṃ nānāyonissaṃkalpya tadvayāpakaṃ 
vāgīśvarī vāgīśvarañca pūrvavadabhyarcya 
sannidhānāhutirhutvā bhagavantau paśoranugrahāya 
saṃnidhībhavatamiti prārthyā śiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya oṃ hāṃ 
huṃ phaḍiti hṛddeśe sapuṣpanārā ca mudrayā saṃtāḍya ātmano 
recakeṇa tasya dehe huṃkāreṇa praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ 
huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṃkuśa 
mudrayā cotkṛṣya mūlamantramanusmaran dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
tṛṇāgrabindurūpaṃ jīvaṃ sañcintya oṃ hāṃ ātmane nama iti 
saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya pūrakavṛtyā sva hṛdi saṃniveśya 
kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantramanusmaran 
brahmādityāgakāraṇadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā saṃgṛhya 
pitrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya vāmayodbhavamudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
ātmane namaḥ | sarvayoniṣu nekavyaktirūpeṇātmano yugapat 
saṃyogaṃ kṛtvā mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā 
bhagavannasyātmanassarvāsu yoniṣu yugapatsaṃyogaṃ kuru kuru kurviti 
sarvagarbhanispattaye mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmano 
sarvāsu yoniṣu yugapadgarbhaniṣpattiṃ kuru kuru kurviti tatastu 
jananārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmana 
ssarvagarbhāṇāṃ jananaṃ kuru kuru kurviti tatodhikārārthaṃ 

<p.1511> 

sarvaśuddhaśarīrāṇāṃ yugapadvṛddhiṃ saṃbhāvya 
bhoganiṣpattaye atimārgakaṃ yogajanyaṃ prāgāgāmi ca 
karmaikasthaṃ sarvayoni śarīreṣu | bhogadāyakaṃ karma jananañca 
bhāvayitvā mūlenāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt bhagavannasyātmanā 
nānābhogadāyakaṃ śuddhakarmajanaṃ kuru kuru kurviti | tadanu | 
deśakāla śarīra viṣaye bhede nānārūpaṃ prāgāgami karma 
vāsanā janitaṃ bhoktṛtvaliṃga (*) tmani sukha duḥkha vedanātmakam | 
bhogaṃ sañcintya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmanassarva 
bhoganiṣpattiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogyeṣu paramaprītirūpaṃ layaṃ 
sañcintyamūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano bhogyeṣu 
paramaprītirūpaṃ layaṃ kuru kuru kurviti mahāmāyā kāryāraṃbha 
pravāharūpāṇāṃ bhuktasthānapathāṃ srotasāṃ śuddhaye 
mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmanaḥ mahāmāyā 
kāryāraṃbhapravāhaśuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogahetau karmaṇi 
bhuktepi punastadaprasavitvahetave śāntitatva śuddhau hṛdāhutiṃ 
kāryam | niṣkṛtau jātyāyurbhoga saṃskārādi śudhyarthaṃ 
kavacapūrva prāsādenāhutiśataṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano 
niṣkṛtyā sarvakarmasu śuddhiṃ kuru kurviti bhogabhāvānmāyā 
pāśāt bahiniṣkramaṇarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya mūlena 
sapāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhoktṛtva viṣayāsaktirūpaṃ 
adhikāra malakāryaṃ vibhāvya tattirodhānārthaṃ mūlena 
sapāśupatenāhutiśataṃ hutvā tasmādviśleṣaṃ saṃkalpya 
sapāśupatenāhutitrayañjuhuyāt | 

<p. 1512> 

śuddhakarmaṇobhuktasyātyatyantābhāvarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ saṃbhāvya 
mūlena pāśupatenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano 
mahāmāyādhikāramalaṃ śuddhakarma rūpasya pāśatrayasya 
viśleṣaṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpayet | tadanu | 
saptadhāstrajaptayā kartaryā oṃ hāṃ hyaiṃ hauṃ 
śāntikalāpāśāya haḥ huṃ phaḍiti mantreṇāgnena 
saṃsparśaśāntikalāvadhauchidyāt | tato bandhaka nivṛttaye 
hastābhyāmantreṇa vimṛjya vartulīkṛtya ghṛtapūrṇāyāṃ 
srucinyastvājyasahitaṃ tenaiva mantreṇa hutvā dahet | 
kevalāstreṇāhuti trayeṇa bhasmasātkuryāt | bhagavannasyātmano 
śāntikalāpāśacchedaṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpayet | 
paścātpāśāṃkura nivṛttaye huṃ phaḍantāstreṇāhuti pañcakaṃ 
hutvā prāyaścittārtha mastreṇāṣṭākṛtiṃ kṛtvā śeṣa 
śarīra nāśe caitanyasyaikatvaṃ vibhāvya īśvaramāvāhya 
saṃpūjya sannidhānāhutīrhutvā śarīraśudhyarthaṃ oṃ hāṃ 
īśvara budhyahaṃkārau śulkaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhetyāhuti trayandatvā 
vijñāpayet | 

bho bho īśa tvayā nāsya yātuḥ padamanāmayam | pratibandho 
vidyātavyaṃ ityājñāpārameśvarīti || 

visṛjya evaṃ śuddhatatvāgrasthaṃ śuddhasphaṭika maṇiprakhyaṃ 
śānti kalā jālanirmuktaṃ ātmānaṃ saṃcintyoddhāraya 
mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmanaśśānti 
kalāpāśāduddhāraṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya oṃ hāṃ haṃ 
hāṃ ātmane namaḥ | 

<p. 1513> 

ityātmānaṃ saṃhāriṇyā raughrāgneruddhṛtya vāmayā pūrakeṇai 
vātmānañcandramaṇḍala sadṛśamātmānamātma hṛdayamānīya 
recakeṇodbhavamudrayā śiṣyasūtradehe 
niyojyābhyarcyāpyāyanāyaśiṣyaśirasimūlenārdhyodaka binduṃ 
nikṣipya sthirīkaraṇārthaṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ dadyāt | tatastu 
pitarau saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ hutvārdhyayitvā vauṣaḍantamūlena 
pūrṇāṃ santarpayet | 

iti śāntikalā śuddhiḥ | || atha śāntyātīta kalā śuddhiḥ | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śāntyāyāṃ śāntyatītakalāyāṃ sandhānāttu viśuddhayā | 
pūrvavattatra kurvīta tatra varṇādikaṃ kramāt | 

atra kramaḥ | śuddhāṃ śāntiṃ hrasvamuccārya aśuddhāṃ 
śāntyatītāṃ dīrghamuccaret | oṃ hyaiṃ hauṃ śānti 
śāntyatītābhyāṃ namaḥ | iti saṃpūjyāhuti trayaṃ hutvā 
śuddhamaśuddhavilīnaṃ saṃbhāvya śāntyatīta kalāmupasthāpayet 
| oṃ hāṃ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | iti saṃpūjyā huti trayaṃ 
datvā sūtradehe śāntyātīta kalāyāsthā tadvayāpti oṃ hauṃ 
śāntyatīta kalāyai namaḥ | ityavalokayet | oṃ hāṃ saktitatvāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivatatvābhyāṃ namaḥ | 

<p. 1514> 

iti tatvau dve | oṃ hāṃ nivṛttikalābhuvanāya namaḥ | 
pratiṣṭhākalābhuvanāya namaḥ | vidyākalābhuvanāya namaḥ | 
śāntikalā bhuvanāya namaḥ | śāntyātīta kalā bhuvanāya namaḥ 
| śāntyātīta kalā bhuvanāni pañca | oṃ hāṃ indhikāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ dīptikāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rocikāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
mocikāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ūrdhvagāminyai namaḥ | iti nādakalā 
bhuvanāni pañca | oṃ hāṃ vyāpinyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
vyomarūpāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anāthāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anāśritāya namaḥ | iti śaktikalā bhuvanāni 
pañca | etaddaśakaṃ śivatatve | oṃ hāṃ anamaḥ | oṃ hāṃ aṃ 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ auṃ namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ o namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ai 
namaḥ | e namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ lu namaḥ | ḷ namaḥ | ṛ namaḥ | ṝ 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ū namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ unnamaḥ īnnamaḥ | innamaḥ 
oṃ hāṃ ā namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ anamaḥ | iti ṣoḍaśavarṇāni | oṃ 
hāṃ onnamaḥ | iti padamekam | oṃ hāṃ hoṃ īśānāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hoṃ haṃ astrāya phaṭ (**) śivāya namaḥ | iti mantrāstrayaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ nādāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ hakārāya namaḥ | iti bīje dve | 
oṃ hāṃ kuhave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śaṃkhinyai namaḥ | iti nāḍī 
dve | oṃ hāṃ devadattāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhanañjanāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1515> 

iti vāyū dve | oṃ hāṃ vacanāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śrotrāya 
namaḥ | itīndriye dve | oṃ hāṃ śabdaviṣayāya namaḥ | 
śabdaguṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sadāśivakāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | 
turyātītāvasthāya namaḥ | iti śvetarūpaṃ vṛttaṃ 
amṛtabindubhūṣita maṇḍalāya namaḥ | iti garbhitāṃ 
śāntyātītaśāntyāṃ kalāṃ sañcintya oṃ hāṃ hauṃ hāṃ 
śāntyātita kalāyai haḥ huṃ phaḍiti brahmarandhrādhastāt 
puṣpeṇa saṃtāḍya oṃ hāṃ hauṃ śāntyātītakalāyai namaḥ 
svāhetyaṃkuśamudrayā pūrakeṇākṛṣya oṃ hāṃ hauṃ hāṃ 
śāntayatīta kalāyai huṃ phaḍiti saṃhāramudrayā kuṃbhakau 
saṃgṛhya oṃ hāṃ hauṃ hāṃ śāntyātītakalāyai namaḥ | iti 
recakeṇodbhavamudrayā kuṇḍe śaktāmādhāra rūpiṇyānniveśayet 
oṃ hāṃ hauṃ hāṃ śāntyatīta kalāyai namaḥ | 
ityabhyarcyārdhyayitvā svāhāntenāhutiṃ hutvā 
pāśatrayamadhikāramalaṃ suviśuddhakaṃ mahāmāyā rūpaṃ 
bhoktṛtvaṃ bhogaśarīrādi janakaṃ vicintayet | oṃ hāṃ sadāśiva 
kāraṇeśvarāya namaḥ | iti sadāśiva māvāhyābhyarcya 
sannidhānāhutirhutvā (-) 

sa deśato dhikāresmin mumukṣurdīkṣayāmyaham | bhāvyaṃ 
tvayānukūlena bhaktyā vijñāpayediti || 

iti vijñāpya tasyāṃ kalāyāṃ nānārūpayoniranantārasaṃkalpya (-) 

<p. 1516> 

tadvayāpakaṃ vāgīśvarī vāgīśvarañcāvāhyābhyarcya 
sannidhānāhutīrhutvā bhagavantau paśoranugrahāya sannidhī 
bhavatamiti prārthya śiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya oṃ hāṃ huṃ 
phaḍiti hṛddeśe sapuṣpanārā ca mudrayā saṃtāḍyātmano 
recakeṇa tasya dehe huṃ kāreṇa praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ 
huṃ phaḍiti jyeṣṭhayā viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
svāhetyaṃkuśamudrayā cotkṛsya mūlamantramanusmaran dvādaśantaṃ 
nītvā tṛṇāgrabindurūpaṃ jīvaṃ sañcintyātmamantreṇa 
saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya pūrakavṛtyā svahṛdi saṃniveśya 
kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantramanusmaran ātmamantreṇa 
brahmādikāraṇatyāgakrameṇa dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā saṃgṛhya 
pitrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya vāmayodbhavamudrayā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
ātmane namaḥ | iti sarvayoniṣvanekavyaktirūpeṇātmano 
yugapatsaṃyogaṃ kṛtvā mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā 
bhagavannasyātmanassarvāsu yoniṣu yugapat saṃyogaṃ kuru kuru 
kurviti vijñāpya sarvagarbhanispattiṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā 
bhagavantasyātmanassarvāsu yoniṣu yugapadgarbhaniṣpattiṃ kuru kuru 
kurviti vijñāpayet | tatastu jananārthaṃ mūlenāhutitrayaṃ 
vidhāya bhagavantasyātmanassarvāsu yoniṣu tatodhikārārthaṃ 
sarvaśarīrāṇāṃ yugapadvṛddhiṃ saṃbhāvya bhoganiṣpattaye 
śaivajñānajanyaṃ prāgāgāmi ca karmaikasthaṃ sarvayoni 
śarīreṣu bhogadāyakaṃ karmārthanaṃ ca bhāvayitvā mūlenāhuti 
trayaṃ juhuyāt | 

<p. 1517> 

bhagavannasyātmano nānā bhogadāyakaṃ karmārjanañca kuru kuru 
kurviti tadanu deśakāla śrīraviṣaya bhedena nānārūpaṃ 
prāgāgāmikarmavāsanājanitaṃ bhoktṛtva liṃginyātmani 
sukhaduḥkha vedanātmakaṃ bhogaṃ sañcintya mūlenāhuti trayaṃ 
datvā bhagavannasyātmanassarvabhoga niṣpattiṃ kuru kuru kurviti 
bhogyeṣu paramaprītirūpaṃ layaṃ kuru kuru kurviti mahāmāyā 
kāryāraṃbha pravāharūpāṇāṃ bhukta sthānapathāṃ srotasāṃ 
śuddhaye mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano māyāraṃbha 
pravāha śuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogahetau karmaṇi bhuktepi 
punastada prasavitva hetave śāntyātīta tatvaśuddhau 
hṛdāhutitrayaṃ kāryaṃ niṣkṛti jātyāyurbhoga saṃskārādi 
śudhyarthaṃ mūlenāhutiśataṃ hutvā bhagavannasyātmano niṣkṛtyā 
sarvakarmasu viśuddhiṃ kuru kuru kurviti bhogābhāve mahāmāyā 
pāśāt bahiniṣkramaṇarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ vibhāvya sa 
pāśupatāstreṇa mūlenāhutitrayaṃ hutvā bhoktṛtvarūpaviṣayā 
saśaktirūpamadhikāramalpakāṃ vibhāvya tattirodhānārthaṃ mūlena 
pāśupatenāhutidaśakaṃ hutvādhikāramalādviśleṣaṃ saṃkalpya 
mūlena sapāśupatenāhutitrayaṃ kṛtvā śuddhakarmaṇo 
bhuktasyāpyatyantābhāvarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ vibhāvya mūlena 
sapāśupatenāhuti daśakaṃ hutvā dhikāramalādviśleṣaṃ (-) 

<p. 1518> 

saṃkalpya mūlena sapāśupatenāhutitrayaṃ kṛtvā śuddhakarmaṇā 
bhuktasyāpyatyantābhāvarūpaṃ viśleṣaṃ vibhāvya mūlena sa 
pāśupatenāhutitrayaṃ hutvā bhagavantasyātmano mahāmāyādhi 
kāryamalakarmarūpasya pāśatrayasya viśleṣaṃ kuru kuru kurviti 
vijñāpayet | tadanu saptadhāstrajaptakartaryā oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
śāntyātīta kalāpāśāya haḥ huṃ phaḍityanena sasvaraṃ 
śāntyātīta kalāpāśāvadhauchindyāt | tato bandhaka nivṛttaye 
hastābhyāmastreṇa vimṛjya vartulīkṛtya ghṛtapūrṇāyāṃ 
srucinyastvājyasahitaṃ tenaiva mantreṇāgnau hutvā dahet 
kevalāstrāhutitrayeṇa bhasmasātkuryāt | bhagavānnātmano 
śāntyatītakalāpāśacchedaṃ kuru kuru kurviti vijñāpya 
pāśāṃkura nivṛttaye huṃ phaḍantāstreṇāhuti pañcakaṃ vidhāya 
prāyaścittārthaṃ astreṇāṣṭāhutīrhutvā aśeṣaśarīra vinā (*) 
(*) caitanyasyaikatvaṃ vibhāvayet | tato nirbījadīkṣāyāṃ 
pūrṇāndakārayet | 

samayaṃ samayācāraśaktau pāśātmakaṃ nyaset | samayaṃ samayā 
cāra pāśādhipagaṇāñjapan || 

caturthamayajeddhīmān namonta praṇavādikam | āhutīnāṃ 
trayaṃdadyāt saṃnidhānāya deśikaḥ || 

śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hutvā śiamantreṇa pūrṇayā | samayaṃ 
samayācāra pāśaśuddhiṃ maheśvara || 

<p. 1519> 

śiṣyasya kuru kurvītetyaktyāśulkaṃ samarpayet | śivabījaṃ 
samuccārya sadāśiva punaḥ punaḥ || 

mano gṛhāṇāsvāheti āhutitrayamācaret | 

itthaṃ śulkaṃ datvā vijñāpayet | ayaṃ śivakarotkṛṣṭo 
vilaṃghita bhavodbhavaḥ | kṛtakṛtyodhunānvāṇuṃ 
niroddhavyonukaṃpayā | evaṃ 
śuddhatatvograsyamatyantanirmalamātmānaṃ vibhāvya 
paścāduddhārāya mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā bhagavannasyātmanaṃ 
brahmahṛdaya mānīya recakeṇodbhavamudrayā śiṣya sūtradehe 
niyojyābhyarcyāpyāyanāyanā śiṣyaśirasi mūlenārdhyajala 
bindukṣiptvā sthirīkaraṇārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt | 
tadanu pitarāvabhyarcyāhuti trayaṃ datvā kheditau śiṣyadīkṣāyai 
yamayā pitarau yama kāruṇyāttat kṣamitvāme prajātāṃ 
sthānamātmanaḥ | iti vijñāpyavisṛjya vauṣaḍanta mūlena 
pūrṇāndadyāt | 

|| [iti śāntyātīta kalāśodhanam] || || [atha śikhācchedavidhiḥ] || 

nirvāṇadīkṣā śivadharmiṇī lokadharmiṇī ceti dvividhā 
nirvāṇa dīkṣā dvividhā laukikī śivadharmiṇī gṛhiṇāṃ 
laukikī jñeyā liṃgiṇāṃ śivadharmiṇī | 

<p. 1520> 

śikhācchedo na yatrāsti dīkṣā sā lokadharmiṇī | 
prāgvadkhaṇḍena saṃyuktā dīkṣā sā śivadharmiṇī || 

oṃ hāṃ hauṃ hāṃ śāntyatītakalāṃ śaktibhyāṃ namaḥ | 

iti śuddhāṃ śāntyātītāṃ śuddhayā śikhārupiṇyā 
tirodhānaṃ śaktyā saṃdhāya pāścātmāyā tatvāntamātmatatvaṃ 
oṃ hāṃ ātmatatvāya śivāya namaḥ | ityupasthāpyābhyarcya 
mūlena bhāṣyoccāreṇa vidhivaikalyaṃ śudhyarthaṃ 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā sadāśivatatvaṃ vidyātatvaṃ oṃ hīṃ 
vidyātatvāya namaḥ | 
ityupasthāpyabhyarcyamūlenopāṃśūccāraṇena mantroccāra 
vaikalyaṃ śuddhayeṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śaktitatvāntaṃ 
śivatatvaṃ oṃ hāṃ śivatatvāya namaḥ | ityupasthāpyābhyarcya 
mūlenamānasavaikalyaṃ śuddhaye sāṣṭāśataṃ juhuyāt | 
tattirodhānaśaktesritodhāyakatva nivṛttaye mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ 
juhuyāt | kāmike (-) 

ardhāntastha ca sarvādhva padavī kāmakāraṇām | dhyātvā śivāṃ 
tadagrasthāṃ śuddhasphaṭika sannibhām || 

sa cintya śiṣya caitanyaṃ kartarīṃ śivayā labhet | 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

kartarī jñānaśakti syāt tayā pāśacchinatyasau | sā śikhā 
paramā sūkṣmā mantrāṇāṃ bodhanī parām || 

kartarī kartṛrūpeṇa jñātavyā deśikottamaiḥ | 

<p. 1521> 

niśvāse (-) 

saptadhā śikhayā mantrī kartarīmabhimantrayet | tadeva mudrayā 
gṛhya chedye tacca vicakṣaṇaḥ || 

aṃguṣṭhādyā ca catvāro codanīyāstu suvrate | śikhā 
cchidyāttathā śaktyā rodhaśaktisvarūpiṇīm || 

kāraṇaṃ sarvapāśānāṃ sāvayedvādaśāṃgulāt | 
anyasyāṣṭāṃgulādūrdhvā nibījākhya sa bījayet || 

madhvājya sājya saṃyuktaṃ nītvāgopiśa golakaḥ | pūrṇāhutyā 
śikhāndatvā śastreṇāhuti pañcakaiḥ || 

ājyena huṃ phaḍantena śikhā kuryācca bhasmasāt | śikhāñca bahi 
nssṛtya sruksruvau kartarīmapi || 

prakṣālyā camya śuddhastu śiṣya snānaṃ samācaret | kuryāttatra 
viśeṣeṇa bhāvabhakti samanvitaḥ || 

gururantaḥ praviśyātha śivaṃ dṛṣṭvā ca vadnitam | adhvaśuddhi 
śikhācchedatvatprasādānmayā kṛtaḥ || 

yatvayaṃ paramandhāma bhagavanparameśvara | śiṣyaṃ 
saṃyojayāmyena ājyedānīṃ vidhīyate || 

evaṃ kurvītyanujñātaḥ prahṛṣṭordhyakaro guruḥ | samāhūya 
śiśuṃ yāyāt śiyayuktogni saṃmukham || 

sruk sruvau cāpi saṃskṛtya yojanārthaṃ svadīpya ca | śiṣyasya 
prokṣaṇañcaiva sakalīkaraṇantathā || 

<p. 1522> 

tato nāmañca sandhāya sandhānaṃ mantratarpaṇam | sakalīkaraṇaṃ 
mantramekaikāhutidānataḥ || 

sakalīkaraṇaṃ śuddhiṃ ca kṛtvā saṃyojayecchive | 

tadanyācāryo pūrṇāhutyārthaṃśivabhāvā (*) ttaṃ vidhivat | 
sadācāryo bindu kṣiptāsanasthitā | 

indhikādīpikāścaiva rocikā mocikā tathā | tatordhva gāminī ceti 
sūkṣmā sūkṣmā mṛtā mṛtā || 

binduśaktiriti prokta nādaśakti kalā dvijā | 
abhikalābhisaṃkḷptā dehayuk deśikottamaḥ || 

vyāpinī vyomarūpā ca anantāhya parāmatā | 
ātmatatvonmanāśśaive samāpūrita deha yuk || 

kṛtvā kumbhakapūrau ca jīvāsaṃbandhatā ca yuk | 
īṣadvayavartitāssan dantairdantā na saṃspṛśan || 

samyagunnatakāyastu śivaṃ saṃyojya cātmani | nāḍīṃ suṣumnāṃ 
prāṇākhyaṃ vāyumenakīkṛtāṃ smaran || 

samantraṃ śiṣya caitanyaṃ śuddhasphaṭika saṃnnibham | saṃbhāvya 
mantramuccārya kāraṇatyāga yogataḥ || 

śive saṃyojayecchiṣyaṃ pūrṇāyāṃ kuṃbhakena tu | 

atra yojanāvasare sruksruvayoḥ pañcādhikaraṇastha tatvaṃ 
kalābhāvanā (**) yat | pañcādhikaraṇo devo sohameva sadāśiva 
daṇḍāya kalaśo yoyaṃ daṇḍa daṇḍaḥ kalāntaka | 

<p. 1523> 

daṇḍāgra saṃpuṭāmāyā veavidyānvita smṛtā | citra patra 
gatāmantrā koṇāsroto nibandhanā || 

suṣiraṃ yattadādhāraṃ padmamāsana saṃsthitam | tatkarṇo 
nādasaṃsthāna sruṅmukhaṃ śaktirūpakam || 

sarvādhvā vyāpikāśaktireṣāṃ sṛgiti kalpitaḥ | sruk 
sūtrākṛtipaddaṇḍo binduvṛtti paribhramaḥ || 

sruk sruva vyapadeśe na śaktipiṇḍasadāśivaḥ | 

yadvā mṛgendre (-) 

srucimadhvāna māropya kalaśa skandha gaṇḍimā | vedigrīvā 
mukhāśeṣu nivṛtyātidi vibhāgaśaḥ || 

itthaṃ sruk sruvaṃ vibhāvya śaṃkhasaṃnibha mudrayā gṛhya 
gurupadiṣṭa prakāreṇa saptadviṣuvaṃ jñātvā 
saptametatvaviṣuvānta śāntyātīte dvādaśānte 
paramānandasvarūpe pralīnamātmānaṃ bhāvayet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

prathamaṃ prāṇaviṣuvanmantrasya viṣuvattataḥ | nāḍikā viṣuvaṃ 
paścāt praśānta viṣuvantataḥ || 

pañcamaṃ śaktiviṣuvaṃ kalākhyaṃ viṣuvantu ṣaṭ | saptamaṃ 
tatvaviṣuvaṃ layākhyaṃ paramaṃ viduḥ || 

mūlamantroccāra prakārastu prāsādamantragatānāṃ madhye haukāra 
sahitasya kālasya mūlādhārā dārabhya hṛtpuṇḍarīkāvadhi 
vyaptiḥ | 

<p.1524> 

tadanantaraṃ brahmaṇepi vyaptiḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ yāgaṣaṣṭhasya 
vyāptiḥ | viṣṇostadanantara vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ sakadrasya 
tālu madhyetyāgataḥ tata ūrdhvamīśvarasya bindo bhrūmadhya 
dhyāntaṃ vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhva mekāṃgula lalāṭamadhye 
ardhacandrasya vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ ekāṃgulannirodhivyāpyantyā 
vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ brahma bilāntannādasya sadāśiva vācakasya 
vyaptiḥ | brahmabilādekāṃ gulamānena nādāntasya vyāptiḥ | 
tadūrdhvatryaṃgule śakti vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhve dvayaṃgule 
vyāpinyā vyāptiḥ | tadūrdhva dvayaṃgulenāmānā vyāptiḥ | 
nādādārabhya unmanyantaśaktisthānantadūrdhva svaniṣṭa 
ghanacinmayaṃ śivaṃ sthānaṃ cintyaviśve (-) 

viṣuvaṃ tatva saṃjñātaṃ tasmintasyāṃ viyojayet | pūrakaṃ 
kuṃbhakaṃ dhyātvā pyādāya mukha murutān || 

uccaretkramaśomūlaṃ śiṣyādāśumanolayam | manolayāttadā 
muktiriti śāstrasya niścayaḥ || 

di (*) pipilikāsparśaṃ tasmin saṃbhūyati kṣaṇāt | anubhūya ca 
tatsarvaṃ dvādaśāntaṃ tataḥ kramāt || 

nirguṇe nirmale śuddhe vācya vācaka varjite | nityānantamaye 
sūkṣme bhāvābhāvavivarjite || 

kaivalya ciddhane śānte śive tu paribhāṣayet | 

<p. 1525> 

śiṣyātmānañca tatraiva yajamānaṃ vibhāvayet | ājyadhārañca 
juhuyāt jvālānte tu pareśive || 

sāyujyasya sthiratvāya mūlena juhuyāttadā | vauṣaḍantaṃ 
samuccārya pūrṇāñca vidhinā hunet || 

kāmike (-) 

vyāvṛttatanmanaḥ prāṇa nādaśakti kalātmanaḥ | samīpe 
sruksruvau muñca drutaṃ saṃhāramudrayā || 

śuddhamudyacchikhā kalpaṃ vande nādāya pudgalaḥ | pūjaye 
dastrabījena śarīre tasya pūrvavat || 

tatra yuktopyasau tena na samānaguṇīkṛtaḥ | 
yāvattāvatpradhānasya tatva vyāpti yathā vibhuḥ || 

sāmrajyāgamopyuccairnṛpasūno kṛtārthataḥ | 
ṣāṭguṇyānanabhijñasya śatasyāpi na rājate || 

ṣaṭguṇa vyaktaye tena sruvenājyāhutistu ṣaṭ | guṇāṃstu 
homayeddhīmān prayogeṇā munā tathā || 

oṃ hāṃ ātman sarvajño bhava svāhā | oṃ hīṃ hīṃ paritṛpto 
bhava svāhā | oṃ hāṃ ātman anādibodhe bhavasvāhā | oṃ haiṃ 
ātman svatantro bhava svāhā | oṃ hauṃ ātman apta śaktirbhava 
svāhā | oṃ hiṃ ātman anantaśaktirbhava svāhā | itthaṃ 
ṣaṭguṇamātmānaṃ gṛhītvā paramākṣarāt | vidhāna 
bhāvenopetaśśiṣya dehena yojayet | 

<p. 1526> 

tadanu sūryabiṃbo paramaṃ nirmalamātmanaṃ divyadṛśāvalokya 
saṃhāramudrayā hṛdānīya recakeṇodbhava mudrayā śiṣyahṛdi 
dehāraṃbhakarmaphalabhogāya punassaṃyojayet | tīvraśakti nipātena 
janita śrāntiśāntaye | 

ardhyāmṛtodabindūni śiṣyamūrdhnī ca secayet | śivakuṃbhādikān 
sarvān padayecca kramādguruḥ || 

īśasya dakṣiṇe bhāge maṇḍale tanniveśya ca | uttarāsya 
svayañcāpi dakṣiṇetu vibhāvayet || 

tathā cānugṛhītoyaṃ mūlamāsthāyamāha kim | deve vanha (*) śai 
tasmāt bhaktināthāsya vadhvayā || 

avyaṃ chinna kriyā niṣṭhastvatprasādādayaṃ bhavet | bhoḥ 
pramādā parādho syāmabhūdbandhana kāraṇam || 

iti devasya vijñāpya praṇamya ca gurusvayam | 

śreyastāvasviti brūyāttadā śiṣyamādarāt | 
gurussaśakteruddīpyaisttvāgṛhādyupaśāntaye || 

dīkṣaye svaṃ yathā jñānāt kalāpāśālyaṃ smaran | sakṛnmūla 
samuccārācchive yogaṃ vibhāvayet || 

tatognisthaṃ śivaṃ saṃtarpya prāyaścittāya 
mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā naivedyaṃ nama kaṭukāṃ hutvā 
camana candana tāṃbūlādīni 
vedyāṣṭapuṣpāsaṃpūjyārdhyandatvā pūrvavat śivaṃ (-) 

<p. 1527> 

visṛjyāntarbahirbaliṃ kṛtvā punarmaṇḍalastha śivamaṣṭapuṣpyā 
saṃpūjyānuṣṭhitaṃ karmaphalaṃ nivedya praṇipatyoktavat 
saṃgṛhya kuṃbhasthe saṃyojya tanmantrācchive saṃyojya sāpekṣaṃ 
kṣamasvetyuktvā niruddhayet || || [atha caṇḍayāgavidhiḥ] || 

caṇḍayāgārthaṃ caṇḍakuṃbhāgre ardhacandrākāra maṇḍale 
sthaṇḍile va praṇavāsane nityavaccaṇḍaṃ saṃpūjya 
nirmālyannivedayet | 

bhīmasaṃhitāyām (-) 

caṇḍayāgamatho vakṣye sarvakarmārtha sādhanam | gaṇānāmapi 
sarveṣāṃ tasya pūjā phalapradā || 

padmaṃ vā sarvato bhadraṃ svastiṃ vāpi ca kārayet | 

tathā mṛgendre (-) 

tataścaṇḍeśanāthasya puraṃ pañcāṃgavarjitam | vidhāya 
maṇḍalaṃ yāgaḥ kāryaśśiva padena tu || 

asyārthaḥ | pañcāṃgavarjitañcaturaśraṃ kṣetramānaṃ gṛhītvā 
tāvatā sūtreṇarddhanukrameṇa maṇḍalantanmadhye padmaṃ kṛtvā 
mukhya yāgavidhinā caṇḍayāgaḥ kāryaḥ | tathoktaṃ svāyaṃbhuve 
(-) 

ātmātasya himānasya bhāgaṃ tyaktvā tu pañcamam | śeṣamānaṃ 
samaṃ kṣetraṃ bhrāmayedardhavedavat || 

tasamadhye likhet padmamaṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam | 

<p. 1528> 

dvātriṃśadaṃgula samaṃ karamāna mathāpi vā || 

yogapīṭhaṃ vinyasya vinyaset | 

sarva śarva padasthantu evaṃ caṇḍeśvaraṃ kuru | vidyāṃgāni tata 
stasya vinyasedvidhigatpunaḥ || 

āgneyādi daleṣveva dikṣvastraṃ vinyasetpunaḥ | saṃpūjya 
gandhapuṣpādyairbhakṣya bhojya vibhūṣaṇaiḥ || 

tarpayedyajñaśeṣeṇa aṣṭottaraśatena tu | hṛdiyādīni sarvāṇi 
paścādekaikaśaḥ kramāt || 

viṃśatyāhuti homena tarpayitvā kṣamāpayet | caṇḍeśvarocitaṃ 
yastu pūjayaiva prakalpayet || 

rajoreśentarassantu bhojyaṃ siddhimicchatām | tasmādanyadapi 
dravyaṃ devāya viniveśayet || 

agādheṃbhasi tatpuṣpaṃ caṇḍeśāya vinikṣipet | athonyathā 
pravṛttānāṃśivājñābhaṃgakāriṇam || 

śāstā caṇḍeśvarasteṣāṃ dīkṣitānāmapi prabhuḥ | 
caṇḍeśvaraṃ prapañcāyena teṣāṃ bhayakāraṇam || 

tasmādārādhanakṣuṇṇā śaivaṃ patthānamāśritā | 

tathā kālottare (-) 

caṇḍayāgantataḥ kṛtvā śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā | 
caṇḍeśvarasya yāgena nirvyādhinirupadravam || 

<p. 1529> 

dīkṣānte yatnataḥ kuryāt yāgaṃ caṇḍeśvarasya tu | śiṣyaṃ 
tadagre saṃsthāpya samayān śrāvayettataḥ || 

na śivaṃ śivaśāstrañca śivāgniṃ sādhakaṃ guruḥ | 
nindyānalamarpayetteṣāṃ (*) yāmapi viśeṣataḥ || 

nirmālya bhojanaṃ dānaṃ laṃghanañca vivarjayet | sūtikaṃ 
pratikaṃñcānnaṃ puṣpavatyā ca varjayet || 

ahiṃsā satyamasteyaṃ brahmacarya makalkatā | akrodho 
guruśaśrūṣā śauca santoṣa mārjavam || 

ityācāraṃ gaṇeśaiva sarvasādhāraṇepi san | pālanīyo yathā 
śakti bhukti mukti phalārthinā || 

atra heturmṛgendra pratipāditam | 

tathā yena vipratimāpannaṃ brahmādivyakti śaktikā | 
caṇḍarūpasvarūpaṃniruṇaddhi viniṣkṛtim || 

laṃghanandīkṣitacchāyāśivārcāṃgabalisṛjām | taddāna 
bhakṣaṇe ceśaṃ svaśabdādhigatasya ca || 

tañjīvī sūtikāpreta puṣpavatyaṃ na śobhanam | 
mahāsamagartāsyurimāṃ patanabhīruṇā parihṛtya vibhaktavya 
mitīśasvayamabravīt | 

atonye samayācārā śaive cātmanitiṣṭhatām | 
caryāpādebhidhāstyante caryā vai caraṇaṃ yataḥ || 

<p. 1530> 

tatogne yajñaśeṣeṇa sahasro ca śatena vā | tarpayitvā kṣamasveti 
caṇḍanāthaṃ vivarjayet || 

tato bhūrādibhirhutvā śivāgniṃ visṛjya lokapālayi visṛjet | 
śiṣyaṃ svastikite praśasta dakṛte maṇḍale vardhanito pūrvakaṃ 
śivakuṃbhenāvabhṛtasnānārtha mabhiṣiñcet | tatraiva | 

tataḥ praśastadigbhāge bhūtale (*) stikāṃkite | kuryādavabhṛtaṃ 
śaṃbhukuṃbhenāstrāṃbu pūrakam || 

tadāstāṃ duritadhvaṃsi mantroccārābhisiddhimat | vipraṣopi 
tadudbhūtānukūlyāṃ paśuśāntibhihiḥ || 

tathā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

tato yāgasamāpte tu bhūdeśe svastikāṃkite | 
kuryādavabhṛthasnānaṃ ātmano dīkṣitaḥ san || 

atha guru yāgaṃ kuryāt | tathā ṣaṭsahasrikāyām | 

guruyāgaṃ pravakṣyāmi saṃkṣepārvatī sutaḥ | devatā darśane 
kāryaṃ tathā sau siddhisādhane || 

vivāhayātrasamaye tathā dusvapnadarśane | svapne prāpte tathā 
mantre yāgāraṃbhe tadantake || 

kartavyamiti śeṣaḥ | 

ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulāśanaṃ yogapīṭhaṃ puroditam | tasyāsanantu 
saṃkalpya mūrtitasyopari nyaset || 

<p. 1531> 

śivamāvāhayettatra sabrahmāṃga samanvitam | gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ 
pūjya hṛnmantreṇa prayatnataḥ || 

guru sadāśivaṃ dhyātvā praṇipatya punaḥ punaḥ | 

yadvā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

sātaṃ saṃpūjayetpaścāt guruṃ cānucaraṃ budhaḥ | 

kālottare (-) 

ācāryaṃ pūjayettatra makuṭaṃ kuṇḍalādibhiḥ | 
gṛhopakaraṇaiścānyairhṛdayena tu dāpayet || 

īśānena tu mantreṇa pūjayeddeśikottamaḥ | evaṃ pūjyavidhānena 
praṇipatya kṣamāpayet || 

kiraṇe (-) 

yāgānte guru yāgaṃ syāt yāgādāvā prapūjayet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

sarva dīkṣā ca jñānañca gurvanugrahato bhavet | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena guruśaśruṣaṇaṃ param || 

nairyantaryeṇa bhaktyā ca śuśrūṣā ca bhavetpunaḥ | 
gurvanugrahaṇaṃ paścāt śaśrūṣā cedbhavetparam || 

nirvāṇa dīkṣitaśśiṣyo gurusaṃsṛṣṭiyogyakaḥ | parārthaliṃga 
pūjāyāṃ adhikāro savidyate || 

mataṃge (-) 

dīkṣānalaṃ paṣṭamanasya jantosvākhyaṃ vyaktimupeti yogāt | 
śaktyāvibhoścuṃbitahṛt deśenānyepuṃsopi nivṛttimeti || 

|| [iti nirvāṇa dīkṣā vidhiḥ] || 

<p. 1533> 

atra pratiṣṭhāśabdena calaliṃga pratiṣṭhāmātra 
evādhikāriṇeti bodhya eteṣu na pi kalpoyaṃ kartavyaṃ 
nayānmanīṣibhiḥ śiva eveti taṃ dhyāyet pratipattiṃ samāvaśet | 
tathā kālottare (-) 

gṛhasthassarvavarṇeṣu śreṣṭho gururudāhṛtā | 

tathoktaṃ siddhānte (-) 

caturṇāmapi varṇānāṃ liṃgināṃ grahiṇāmapi | ācāryatvaṃ 
śivenāsmin siddhānte pratipāditam || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vijñānadīkṣā rahito gurubhaktivivarjitaḥ | ahaṃkārī 
kṛtaghnaśca samayācāradūṣakaḥ || 

evamādiguṇairyukto na pūjyohi mahītale | asyaivācārya 
nāmatvamabhiṣekaṃ na kārayet || 

pramādādabhiṣekantu kṛtañceddoṣamāpnuyāt | 

tathā tridhāsārapaddhatyām (-) 

vyobhicāraṇadīkṣā śiṣye dīkṣayet svecchayā guruḥ | 
ācāryassanna śiṣyaistu pacyate narakārṇave || 

śiṣyā śivaguṇopetamācārya svaguṇacyutam | 
dīkṣitānāntamucyante dīkṣā ko narakaṃ vrajet || 

ācārya svaguṇo peto dīkṣitā vyabhicāriṇaḥ | dīkṣitā narakaṃ 
yānti deśikaśśivatāṃ vrajet || 

<p. 1534> 

tadanu gurusssakāśāt nirvāṇadīkṣitasya vikalācārasya 
śiṣṭasya punarnirvāṇadīkṣā purasssaramācāryabhiṣekaṃ kuryāt 
| tathā kāmike (-) 

lulapta kriyānvite śiṣya yadi saṃstutya dīkṣayā | 
bahirantarbalindatvā vidhānamiṣṭa mācaret || 

svasvakāśānnirvāṇadīkṣitasyācāra 
vaikalyarahitasyoktānuṣṭhāna pūrṇasyābhiṣekamārabhet | ekasmin 
kāle nirvāṇa dīkṣābhiṣekadvayakāmasyā śiṣyasyāpi prathamaṃ 
pṛthak nirvāṇa dīkṣā samāpya tanmaṇṭape dīkṣopa yuktaṃ 
sarvakalaśādikaṃ canḍayāgakṛtatvāt || 

|| [athābhiṣekārthaṃ maṇṭapa nirmāṇavidhiḥ] || 

parityajya puṇyāhapurassaraṃ maṇṭapaśuddhiṃ vidhāyā punaḥ 
pūrvavat nūta na kalaśādikaṃ saṃhṛtya maṇṭapa 
pūjādhivāsamabhiṣeka dīkṣāmārabhet | tathā suprabhede (-) 

evaṃ samāpyatāṃ dīkṣāmabhiṣekamathā caret | tathā 
jñānaratnāvalyāmapyuktam | tathā cāryaśubhadeśe kāle lagne 
kṛtakriyā | yāgaṃ pūrvavadāpādya iti | tathā bālaratnāvalyām 
| aparadine nityādikaṃ nirvartya naimitti pūjāñca kṛtvā 
saṃhitāpāragaṃ śiṣyamabhiṣecayet | 

yāgaṃ kṛtvā yathoddiṣṭaṃ dīkṣāṃ nirvatyamantravit | 

<p. 1535> 

tatobhiṣecayettantuyuktyā yuktyavicārakam || 

devālaye maṭhe caiva guruśiṣyagṛhe tathā | dīkṣā sthāne tu 
kartavyaṃ maṇṭapantu prakalpayet || 

raurave (-) 

devālaye maṇṭapañca prapāṃvāpi viśeṣyataḥ | madhyame vedikāṃ 
kuṇḍaṃ pūrvoktantu yathākramam || 

niśvāse (-) 

maṇṭapasyeśa digbhāge kuryādvai caturaśrakam | 

tathā kāmike (-) śatābhiṣeka prakaraṇe | 

kūṭe vāpi prapāyāṃ vā śuddhadeśe manorame | pañcādi 
pañcapañcāśat karasīmā samanvite || 

mukhāyāmayute vāpi catudvārasamanvite | ekādi pañcapañcāśat 
bhaktibhiḥ parimaṇḍite || 

brāhmaṇaṃ kṣatriyaṃ vāpi vaiśyaṃ śūdramathāpi vā | 
tattajjāti samudbhūtāṃ striyaṃ vā śivapūjakam || 

tatraiva (-) 

pūrvasyāya caiśānyaṃ paścimāyāntu diśyatha | maṇṭape saumya 
vaktre tu vitānādyupaśobhite || 

jñānaratnāvalyāṃ viśeṣaḥ | 

evaṃ kurvītyanujñāto bahiḥ pūrvetha cottare | īśāne paścime 
vāpi maṇṭape pratyagānane || 

pañcāgaṃ bhūṣaṇopetastvabhiṣekaṃ samācaret | 

tathā santāne (-) 

maṇṭapaṃ vā trapāṃ vāpi dvātriṃśaddhastameva vā | 

<p. 1536> 

ṣoḍaśa daśahastaṃ vā navahastāṣṭahastakam || 

staṃbhaissamanvitaṃ devi vitānopariśobhitam | 
darbhamālābhirāveṣṭaya digdhvajaiśca pralaṃbhayet || 

mataṃge (-) 

saṃsitena vitānena pravisārita khetale | 
patākābhirvicitrābhidhvajaiścadhavalaiśśubhaiḥ || 

dikvidik saṃsthitaiścaiva toraṇaiścāpi ninditaiḥ | 

niśvāsakārikāyām | 

caturbhistoraṇaiścaiva patākadhvajaśobhitaiḥ | 
vitānabudbudaiścaiva vedisthānaṃ suśobhitam || 

maṇḍitaṃ puṣpapatraiśca cūtapallavaśobhitam | 
svastikaipadmakaiścaiva siddhārthaka samanvitam || 

kāmike (-) 

ardhahastocchṛtaṃ tadvat yugaśraṃ vedikāśrayam | caturhasta 
pravistāraṃ dakṣiṇottaradiggatam || 

svastikena caturdikṣu rājitañca parājitam | 

yadvā cintyaviśve (-) 

aṣṭāṃgulocchritāvedī dvau dvau hastau ca kārayet | 

raurave (-) 

utsedhaṃ caturaṃgulyaṃ dvihastāyāmataṃ bhavet | yadvā 
kriyāsārapaddhatyām | 

pūrvapaśscima saṃsthānāṃ vedikādvitayaṃ śubham | caturhasto 
kvacitproktaṃ dvādaśāṃgulamunnatam || 

<p. 1537> 

liptaṃ svasika padmādi puṣpaprakāra śobhitam | 

|| abhiṣekapīṭhanirmāṇa vidhirucyate | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

dvātriṃśāṃgula vistāramucchrāyaṃ tāvadeva hi | caturaśraṃ 
samaṃ śuddhaṃ madhyekajala bhūṣitam || 

pūrvavatpīṭhavinyāsaṃ tasmin saṃsthāpya pūjayet | 

mataṃge (-) 

sāradārumaye pīṭhe śīparṇī tarusaṃbhave | 
śvetavastrakṛtāṭope saṃniveśya purākṛtam || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

śrīparṇādyāsanaṃ tatra vinyasyānantamāsanam | 
adīvadagṛhītānya dāravaḥ kathitaḥ || 

tathā kāmike | 

bhadrapīṭhe payo vṛkṣa jātevānya samudbhavet | panase bilvaje 
brahmavṛkṣaje vābhiṣecayet || 

niśvāse mānaviśeṣa uktaḥ | 

caturhastaṃ bhavetpīṭhaṃ samantādupaśobhitam | ucchrāyaṃ 
hastamātrantu kartavyaṃ susamāhitaiḥ || 

pūrvoktayāgamaṇṭapavedikāyāṃ anantavijaya maṇḍalaṃ kuryāt | 

tathā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

athācāryābhiṣekārthamanantavijayaṃ yajet | kāmyānāñca 
prasidhyarthaṃ nidhihūtamidaṃ yataḥ || 

<p. 1538> 

dvihastapīṭhagarbhasyaṃ madhye padmaṃ samālikhet | ṣaḍaṃgule 
purobhāge prathame karṇikāṃ likhet || 

kesarāṇi dvitīye tu dalānāṃ sandhayo pare | caturthe tu 
dalāgrāṇi padmameva prakalpyatu || 

dvihastamālikhedvidhiṃ pīṭhasya paritasthitām | vīthyarddhena 
pṛthakkāryandevatāvaruṇaṃ bahi || 

vīthīmukhyāṣṭaviccheda bhāgāṣṭakavikalpitā | 
vithīmukhādhvānirvartta bahirdvārārddha saṃyutam || 

sūtrayitvā tataḥ paścit tvacāṃsi ca nipātayet | tāni saṃprati 
tānyeva yathārthaṃ vibhavāni tu || 

pātayetsūtramārgeṇa sitādīnyanupūrvaśaḥ | sitarekhāstu 
nirvṛttaṃ raktādibhibahiṣkṛtam || 

ṛjumārgāṣṭakopetaṃ anantavijayaṃ bhavam | asya darśanamātreṇa 
mahāpātakinopi ye || 

nirmalāsteparudratvaṃ pāpyāmoddiśya śaṃkitā | deva 
dānavagandharva yakṣarakṣogaṇeśvara || 

paśyantyanantyavijayaṃ yāgabhūme bahisthitāḥ | sādhakābhiṣeka 
maṇṭapa nirmāṇe vidikāyāṃ nava nābhamaṇḍalaṃ kuryāt | tathā 
ṣaṭsahasrikāyām | 

athācāryābhiṣekārthaṃ nava nābhaṃ vartayet | 

<p. 1539> 

kāmyānāmapi sarveṣāṃ navanābhaṃ phala pradam || 

maṇḍalaṃ navanābhākhya kabhyamānaṃ śṛṇuṣvamat | aṣṭahastaṃ 
samakṣetraṃ daśahastamathāpi vā || 

catussaptati darbhākhyaissamantādvibhajetpuram | 
samantādaṣṭabhirgātrairmadhyame kalahaṃ bhavet || 

pathikā vīthikāryādvāraṃ padmārddhamānataḥ | 
karṇopakarṇayukta kaṇṭhavatyaddipaṭṭikam || 

ityekaṃ kamalaṃ vīthīdvārasamanvitam | kathitaṃ tenamāsena 
tadbāhye vīthikā matā || 

pañcabhāgamitā sā tu samantāddaśabhāgikam | digvidukṣuvataḥ 
kāryamaṣṭapadmaṃ pūroktavat || 

padmāṣṭakavidhānena vīthidvārasamanvitam | madhye tatkamalaṃ 
śuklamāpītaṃ pūrvapaṃkajam || 

tadbāhye pañcapaṭikā vīthikā patrabhūṣitā | padmavadvāra 
kaṇṭhantu paṭṭikaṃ nṛpakaṇṭakam || 

kapolapaṭṭikaṃ kāryadikṣudvāratrayaṃ sphuṭam | koṇabandhaṃ 
tripadikāpadaṃ vajravadbhavet || 

madhye tatkamalaṃ śukla māpītaṃ pūrvapaṃkajam | padmagauramatho 
vāpi raktagauramathāpi vā || 

<p. 1540> 

vyomavyāpi śivasyaiva navādhvaravidhau hitam | navanābhaṃ 
samākhyātaṃ prāsākhyaṃ śivasya tu || 

yadvā mataṃgokta prakāreṇa kuryāt | 

vibhajya satabhirbhāgairmadhye padmaṃ prakalpayet | 
dvātriṃśadaṃgulasamaṃ suvibhaktantu pūrvavat || 

bhāgamekaṃ parityajya dikṣvaṣṭāsu yathākramam | madhyāṃbuja 
pramāṇāni padmānyaṣṭasamālikhet || 

caturvīthyujvalaṃ bhadraṃ aṣṭadvāramathoditaiḥ | rajobhipūraye 
samyak yathā bhavati śobhanam || 

tathācāryai rapyuktam | 

kṣetre saptadīkṛtena śivapadā vīthī samantāt 
padairdikṣvaṣṭāsu ca paṃkajāti parito vīthīntu bhāgena ca | 

dvārāṣṭakajāntarasthitapadairantasthite gātrakam | padmaṃ 
syānnava nābhamaṇḍalamitavaṃ śrīmanmataṃgoditam || 

atha kalaśasthāpanam | tathā kāraṇe (-) 

sahasra kalaśairvāya tadardhakalaśairapi | śatārddhakalaśairvāpi 
itthaṃ kuṃbhantu kalpayet || 

tathā santāna saṃhitāyām | 

sahasraṃ (***) rdvāvātadardhaṃ vāpi kāryet | aṣṭottaraśataṃ 
vāpi ekāśītirathāpi vā || 

<p. 1541> 

pañcaviṃśatibhirvāpi navabhiḥ pañcabhistu vā suprabhede (-) 

sahasrā caikaparyantaṃ yathā vittānusārataḥ | snapanasya 
vidhānena sthāpayetkalaśāni vai | 

vīratantre (-) 

madhyame śivakuṃbhantu sthāpayecchivamantrataḥ | vardhanīṃ tasya 
vāme tu sthāpayedgauribījataḥ || 

pūrvādīśānaparyantaṃ sthāpayedaṣṭa kuṃbhakān | 
pradhānakāṃśe īśañca vardhanyāñca manonmanīm || 

a (*) nteśca sūkṣmaśca śivottamaścaika netrakam | 
rudrastrimūrtiśca śrīkaṇṭhaśca śikhaṇḍikaḥ || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

sthaṇḍiloparimadhye tu vinyasecchiva kuṃbhakam | vardhanīntasya 
vāme tu vinyasecchiva saṃyutām || 

vidyeśānuṣṭa kuṃbheṣu tasya bāhye tu vinyaset | 
kṣārakṣīrodadhissarpirikṣu kādambarī rasā || 

garbho (*) śca (*) mādaṣṭau nyastavyā teṣu sindhavaḥ | 
caturdikṣvathavā kuṃbhe raktanīla sitāruṇān || 

anantādyeka netrāntān āgneyyādi ghaṭepunaḥ | ekanetrān 
śikhaṇḍyantān sitāsṛṅnīlalohitān || 

<p. 1542> 

pañcāsyāścaturāsyānvā śivāyudha dharānyajet | vardhanī 
sahitasthāpanaṃ bhukti kāmaviṣayam | vīratantre (-) 

adhidevāssamākhyātā dravyāṇi ca tataśśṛṇu | pradhānakalaśe 
vipra nava (*) kṣayaścitta (*) || 

vardhanīṃ gaurībījena svarṇantatra vinikṣipet | sauvarṇaṃ 
rājatantāmra māyasantrapusīsakam || 

ārakūṭañca vipulaṃ kāṃsya pūrve nyasettataḥ | āgneya kalaśe 
tatra navadhānañca vinyaset || 

haritālaśca gandhaśca gandhañcaiva manaśśilā | 
mākṣikañcaivarāṣṭrañca rasaṃ vai gaurīkantathā || 

rasendra navamañcaiva vinyasettu viśeṣataḥ | akṣatvacañca 
viprendra dakṣiṇe kalaśe nyaset || 

pālāśāmrañca khadiraṃ plakṣanyagrodhameva ca | pippalaṃ panasaṃ 
bilvaṃśirīṣatvacameva ca || 

nairṛte sthāpite kuṃbhe mṛdantu nava vinyaset | nadyāścobhayatīre 
ca nākavalmīka goṣṭhake || 

kṣetre hṛde girau caiva (*) grahe caivasāgare | vāruṇe sthāpite 
kuṃbhe puṣpāṇi navakanyaset || 

canda (**) paṅkajaṃ candanañcaiva kumudaṃ nīlamutpalam | pāṭalaṃ 
karavīrañca raktañcotpalameva ca || 

<p. 1543> 

nandyāvartañca vyāghātaṃ nava puṣpamihocyate | vāyavye sthāpite 
kuṃbhe gandhānāṃ navakaṃ nyaset || 

candanaṃ kuṃkumaṃ lohaṃ khaṭagajātivānaram | takkolaṃ kaṭakaṃ 
patraṃ vinyasetsvasva nāmataḥ || 

saumyāyāṃ sthāpite kuṃbhe nava bījāni vinyaset | yavaveṇu 
priyaṃguśca śāli nīvārameva ca || 

godhūme tilamudgañca sarṣapañca yathākramam | aiśānyāṃ 
sthāpite kuṃbhe auṣadhīnnava vinyaset || 

lakṣmīñca sahadevīñca viṣṇukrāntaṃ nṛpaṃ balāt | 
indravalliśaṃkhapuṣpī sūryāvartañca gaṇḍikā || 

vinyasettu viśeṣeṇa svasvanāme tu mantrataḥ | ratnābhāve 
nyasedvajraṃ lohabhāve tu kāñcanam || 

bījābhāve yamasva standhātvā bhāve ca tālakam | 
oṣadhīnāmabhāve tu sahadevīṃ vinikṣipet || 

atha daridrāṇāṃ abhiṣekavidhānetvanu kalpavidhānamuktam | 
kāraṇe (-) 

daridrāṇāntu sarveṣāṃ yathālābhaghaṭaṃ bhavet | 
pañaviṃśatibhiḥ kṛtvā athavā navapañcakaiḥ || 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

pañcabhiḥ kalaśairvāpi pūrvoktavidhikalpitaiḥ | 

<p. 1544> 

tatra kuṃbhānyathāpūrvaṃ pūrvādārabhya kalpayet | śivakuṃbha 
vidhānena mantradevata saṃyutam || 

aṣṭavidyeśvarāmantrīnekasmin viniyojayet | dvitīye 
pañcabrahmāṇi tṛtīyeṃgu catuṣṭayam || 

astrayuktaṃ caturthantu śivakuṃbhantu pañcamam | abhimantrya yathā 
saṃpūrvavat snānamācaret || 

pa (*) pakṣe sahadevyādi punarnatvā tān viṃśatimauṣadhīñca 
brahmādidhānyānāñca svarṇalohādīni ca hritāladhātūṃśca 
rasādigandhaśaśca sarvapūrvokta 
pañcauṣadhīpañcarutpañcaśālinyā ekaikaśaḥ krameṇa 
pañcakuṃbheṣu nikṣipya nivṛtyādi kalānyāsapūrvaṃ sadyādi 
brahma pañcakaṃ nyaset | tathā mṛgendre (-) 

prāgvadikṣvāmaheśādi dikṣukuṃbheṣu vinyaset | sahadevyāmatha 
brāhmīṃ trāyantīṃ lakṣaṇāvatīm || 

śaṃkhapuṣpī balābījā jyotismatyaparājitā | 
viṣṇukrāntabalāmoṭā bilvadhātrī bhayāmṛtā || 

śatāhvā pāribādūrvā kuśabhyāghrī punarnavā | yavādīni ca 
bījāni rasāṃśca lavaṇādikān || 

ratnāni sarvagandhāṃśca lohānyapi ca śāstravat | 

rasaśabdena lavaṇādiṣaḍrasa muktam | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

pañca kuṃbheṣu vidyeśān dvau dvau kuṃbhaṃpratinyaset | 

<p. 1545> 

samudrāṇāṃ dvayañcāpi tadvaddevantu vinyaset || 

madhye ca śivakuṃbhe tu śivāṃbhodhiṃ tathaiva ca | tatpārśve 
vardhanīñcāpi śaktyaṃbhodhi samanvitam || 

sarvajñānottare prakārāntaramuktam | 

caturbhiryā yathā kuṃbhairabhiṣekaṃ samācaret | 
vidyeśvarānyathā pūrvaṃ brahmāṃgāni ca mantravit || 

ekasmin kalaśe yojyamastrayuktaṃ tṛtīyakam | 

niśvāse (-) 

eka kuṃbhamuktam | athavā kalaśaikena abhiṣekantu kārayet | 
sarvatatvaiśca mantraiśca samudraiśca samanvitān | 

ekasmin kalaśenaiva vidhireṣotra kārayet | athavātyeka kuṃbhena 
tādṛśenābhivecanam || 

abhāvetvekamevaṃ vā ācāryasyābhiṣecanam | brahmapatrapuṭe vāpi 
śaṃkhaśuktyathavā bhavet || 

abhiṣekaṃ prakurvīta tato na jñāpayet | 

kāraṇe (-) 

maṇṭape kalpite vedyāṃ sthaṇḍile śālinirmite | 
karṇikāṣṭadalopetaṃ nalinantu samālikhet || 

taṇḍulaiśca tilaiścaiva tamāstīrya kuśaistathā | droṇārdhatoya 
saṃpūrṇāṃ mṛṇmayā doṣavarjitān || 

trisūtra viṣṭitān kuṃbhān nava vardhani saṃyutān | 
sarvagandhāṃbu toyaiśca saṃpūrṇān kūrcasaṃyutān || 

<p. 1546> 

kāmike (-) 

navadhā pañcadhā vāpi sarvadhānyopari sthitān | ghaṭānvā 
kalaśānvātha sakūrcān sapidhānakān || 

sannaddhān sodakān gandhān ratnasvarṇavirājitān | 
cūtāśvatthapalāśāsyān bījapuṣpaphalānvitān || 

sadeśākhyena vidyeśainnavapakṣe pavitrakaiḥ | pañcapakṣe 
nivṛtyādi kalābhirvābhimantrayet || 

śivena śatadhālabdhān pūjitān snapanocitān | 

kāraṇe (-) 

pūvavatsthāpya kalaśān pūrvavacchivapūjanam || 

itthaṃ yāgasaṃbhāraṃ saṃhṛtya pūrvasmin dine aṃkurānarpayet | 
kāmike (-) 

abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kuryādaṃkurārpaṇapūrvakam | 

raurave (-) 

pūrvedineṃ kurañcaiva aiśānyāñcottarepi vā | tadanu pañcāṃga 
bhūṣastvācāryassūrya pūjāṃ nirvatya samānāsyahasto maṇṭapāt 
bahisthitvā toraṇa dvārapālānabhyarcyāntaḥ praviśyācārya 
pūjāntaṃ kṛtvā gurumadhye śiṣyamaṇḍaleśvaraṃ pūjayet | 
anantavijaye madhya padmamārabhya paramaśivādīn pūjye | tathā 
svāyaṃbhuve | 

tasya madhye nyaseddevaṃ karṇikāyāṃ paraṃ śivam | īśānaṃ 
mūrdhni vinyasya vaktraṃ pūrvadale nyaset || 

<p. 1547> 

dakṣiṇe tu tathāghoraṃ vāmadevaṃ tathottarem | paścime tu dale 
sadya padavyūha dalakramāt || 

aṃgādīnāmanenaiva vidiśo susamārabhet | āgneya dalamūle tu 
praṇavaṃ hṛdaye nyaset || 

īśānena śiraścaiva nir(-)ṛte ca śikhānyaset | vāyavyāṃ 
kavacantadvat dalāgresmin tathottare || 

sarvātmānaṃ śiroṣṭārṇaṃ jvālinīṃ piṃgalantathā | netraṃ 
pūrvadalāgre tu dakṣiṇestraṃ pravinyaset || 

gāyatrīṃ paścimesthāpya vidyāṃgāni tu pūrvavat | dalāntareṣu 
sarveṣu tataḥ pāśupataṃ nyaset || 

aindre pīṭhaṃ tatonantaṃ yāmye sūkṣmantu vinyaset | āvāhyā 
dardhyapātraiśca vāruṇe ca śivottamaḥ || 

ekanetraṃ tato devamuttare sthāpya pūjya ca | aiśānye tu 
nyaseddimān ekarudraṃ samāhitam || 

trimūrtimagnikoṇe tu śrīkaṇṭhaṃ nair(-)ṛte tathā | śikhaṇḍine 
ca vāyavye pīṭhe saṃpūjayetkramāt || 

tathā to vidyeśvarī śaktiṃ mūlavidyeśvaraśrutaḥ | 
ādyāmūrtiśśivasyaiṣā mapūjyā yāgakarmaṇi || 

<p. 1548> 

vargadvayamanantasya dakṣiṇottarapārśvayoḥ | vibhinnāṃ 
pūjayeddevīṃ sūkṣmādīnāṃ tataḥ kramāt || 

evaṃ vargāṣṭakāvasthā caturdikṣu vyavasthitā | saṃpūjya 
pūjayedastra dvārasyānāṣṭaka sthitim || 

athavā navamaṇḍale madhyapadmādi navapadmeṣu krameṇa śivañca 
lokapālān astrāṇi ca pūjayet | tathā ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

madhyapadme śivaṃ pūjya lokeśāñcāpareṣu ca | astrāṇi 
bāhyavīthau tu bhaktyā saṃpūjya yatnataḥ || 

tadanu kuṇḍāntikaṃ gatvā mantratarpaṇāntaṃ kuryāt | deśakāla 
doṣadannimittaśāntaye prāyaścitta homaṃ kṛtvā śivaṃ jñāpayet 
| 

bhavataivamahannātha ādiṣṭo gurumūrtinaḥ | dīkṣā vyākhyā 
niyogoyamavicchedāya suvrata || 

samyak jātiparijñāna vṛttākāravate (*) ya | dātavyo nijaśiṣyoyaṃ 
śivasyekādanantaram || 

tadānubhāvatassoyaṃ mamedānī mupasthitam | tadetasmai prayacchāmi 
na yogaṃ bhavatājñayā || 

evaṃ kurvītyanu jñātaṃ śiṣyaṃ praveśya ca | tena 
śivamarcāyitvā pūrvoktavat pratisarabandhanaṃ vidhāya darbhāgre 
navavastraparivṛte śālibhiḥ kṛte sthaṇḍile śiva sannidhau 
pūrvavacchayanaṃ kārayet | tathā raurave (-) 

<p. 1549> 

(svapnañca tathā caiva susvapnañca) 

śivenamūlamantreṇa pratiśiṣyantu bandhayet | dānena śayanañcaiva 
navavastreṇa veṣṭayet || 

śivamantraṃ śatañjaptvā nidrāñcaiva ca kārayet | yadvā 
sadyāṃkuraṃ kṛtvā śiṣyaṃ sadyādhivāsayet || 

|| [ityabhiṣekadīkṣādhivāsana vidhiḥ] || 

tato guruśiṣyau kāle samutthāya snānādi nityaśśiṣya 
dusvapnanāśayedaṣṭottaraśatamastreṇa kṛtvā pūrvamaṇṭapa 
pūjāṃ vidhāya indrādi pañcabrahma ṣaḍaṃgamūla vyāhṛti 
homānvidhāya mūlenādi dravyādi (**) 

raurave (-) 

dusvapnañca tathā caiva susvapnañca parīkṣayet | taddoṣa 
śamanārthāya homamaṣṭaśataṃ kuru || 

uṣaḥ kāle dine caiva nityakarma samācaret | 

indrādīśānta (****) vidhāya paścāt pūrvakṛta 
yāgamaṇṭapakṛtavedikāyāṃ kalaśān vaṃśat (**) tvā 
vyāhṛtiñca hunetkramāt | 

yavataṇḍulalājaiścāpūpasiddhārthasarṣapaiḥ sthāpayitvā teṣu 
vāyavyavedikā saṃsthadravyāṇi nikṣipya tattadānuguṇyena devān 
saṃpūjya sadyādikrameṇa prāda (***) ṣakārthaṃ (-) 

<p. 1550> 

maṇṭapavidhāna purassaraṃ vidhāya tatra vidyātatvānta vyāptikaṃ 
bhadrapīṭhaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ vā vinyasya tasmin śvetavastraṃ 
prasārya viprādīn krameṇa saṃsthāpya abhiṣiñcedvijānātha 
pūrvasyān kṣa (***) śyāndiśi yamasya tu | 

śūdrāṃstu paścimāśāyāṃ sarvānvā aiśadik sthitān | yadvā 
sarvānyāgamaṇṭapadīnyāndiśyabhiṣekārthaṃ maṇṭapaṃ vidhāya 
tatra vedikādvaya dakṣiṇottaramuktavat | (***) ṇa kalaśa 
saṃsthāpyottare śiṣyamavasthāpya bhiṣiñcet | tathā mṛgendre (-) 

aiśānyāṃ kalpite pīṭhe savitānesttvalaṃ kṛte | 
mantrapīṭhatvamāpanne lagnāṃśe saumya vīkṣite || 

kāmike (-) 

navapañca ghaṭānena (***) śiva saṃyutam | dakṣavedyāntu 
saṃsthāpya saumyayāyāntu śiśunyaset || 

bhadrapīṭhe śivenaiva sāṃgenādhiṣṭhitantathā | 

raurave (-) 

tato siṃhāsanañcaiva ūrdhve padmāsanantathā | āsanaṃ 
pūjayettatra yojayecchiṣyameva ca || 

pūrvāśābhimukhaṃ sthāpya saṃprokṣya sthāpya mantritam | 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

nikṛtatyakṛtasnānaṃ sita vastramupoṣitam | bhukteḥ pūrvānanaṃ 
śiṣyaṃ mukyai saumyānana sthitaḥ || 

<p. 1551> 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śiṣyaṃ niveśya pūrvāsyaṃ sakalīkṛta vigraham | 
dehaśudhyarthaṃ prathamamaśvatthādirlepanaṃ paścāt 
kāñcikodanāṣṭa dravyāṇi pratyekamāhṛtya 
vajrādyastrātmakandhyātvā varmaṇā nirmānadravyaṃ nikṣipet | 
tathā raurave (-) 

aśvatthaṃ vaṭabilvañca kuśamūlamṛdāṃgrahet | gomūtreṇa tu 
sammiśraṃ lepayetsadyamantrataḥ || 

tadanu nirmārjanaṃ kuryāt | 

kāñcikodakbhasma dūrvāgolakaiḥ gomayagolakam | siddhārthaṃ dadhi 
toyaiśca vajradaṃṣṭraistrātmakaiḥ kramāt || 

tadanu tanutrāṇaiśca nirmārjyaṃ kṣipetpūrvādidikṣuga | (*) 
maṃgalyervividhaistena nirmarjya ca punaḥ punaḥ || 

kāmikenīrājana prakaraṇe | 

deśikasyābhiṣekantu dīpādīpavivarjitam | taṇḍulā vihitāstatra 
raudrāceddīpasaṃyutam || 

ācāryasyottarāsyo vā bhūtvā suṣumnāyāṃ iḍāyāṃ vā 
prāṇaśaktisvarūpeṇa yajamānātmani parameśvare prasakta 
samyagamṛtadhāraṇayāyuktaśśivamantramuccaran | kṣibdhaśakti 
parisruvasrabahalāmṛtarūpeṇa kalaśānnisṛtajalaṃ smaran | 
navakalaśapakṣe vighnanirharaṇāya prathamamastreṇa vardhanī 
toyamabhiṣicyapañca (-) 

<p. 1552> 

kalaśa pakṣe sadyojātādīśāntaṃ 
brahmamabhimantritairghaṭaissāṃgaṃ śivamuccaran | 
tantanmantrairabhiṣiñcet | caturādhekāntapakṣe tu tammṛta 
tatranyastamantrairevābhiṣiñcet | tathā mṛgendre | 
suṣumnāyamiḍāyāṃ vā pravṛttoparameśvaraḥ | 

niveśya secayed kubhe sadyādyairīśapaścimaiḥ | śivaṃ 
samuccaransāṃgaṃ tanmantreṇa pṛthak sudhīḥ || 

kālottare (-) 

nirvikalpena bhāvena sarvamantraiṣṣaḍhānana | abhiṣekaṃ 
prakurvīran deśiko pūrva saṃsthitaḥ || 

tatkāle pūrvadigbhāge yastu stotraṃ paṭhettu yat | 
itthamadhyayanaṃ kṛtvā śaṃkhakāhalaghoṣakaiḥ || 

abhighoṣairninādaiśca tathā maṃgalāvācakaiḥ | 
jayaśabdastathāstutyairnṛttagān samanvitaiḥ || 

viśeṣādbrāhmaṇānāntu stotramaṃgalavācakaiḥ | śaivān 
pāśupatāṃścaiva mahāvratadharāntathā || 

bauddhamārhatānāñca sarvapāṣaṇḍināmapi | kṛpaṇānāntathā 
caiva anenaparighopet || 

<p. 1553> 

raurave (-) 

śaṃkhaghoṣañcaśṛṃgañca vīṇāveṇu samākulam | kāhalī dhvani 
saṃyuktaṃ stotramaṃgala vācakaiḥ || 

maddalī paṭahādmalli ghaṃṭā ḍhaṃkkañca ghoṣayet | 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

uddhṛtya kalaśātpūrvaṃ kṣārodādyairanukramāt | 
sādhakādibhirāryaiśca aṣṭavidyeśamūrtibhiḥ || 

rathārāṇāya sekaḥ kāryoyaṃ śivadharmiṇaḥ | 
anantādimakhaṇḍayanta kalaśairlokadharmiṇaḥ || 

śivakuṃbhāmbunā paścāt guruṇā śivamūrtinā | 

raurave (-) 

sumaṃgalī vācasaṃyuktaṃ gotrābhiṣekān | anyaiśca vividhaiḥ 
sthāpya kuṃbhaiścevābhiṣecayet || 

kāmike (-) 

śu (**) dake saṃsthāpya tasmāddeśāntare punaḥ | 
parivartitavastrādyaṃ sottarīyaṃ sumālakam || 

sitacandanaliptāṃgo bhasmoddhūlitameva vā | 

raurave (-) 

svarṇa yajñopavītañca athavā rajataṃ bhavet | lābhe kārpāsa 
tantūnāṃ dviguṇaṃ triguṇīkṛtam || 

divyāṃ baraṃ parīdhāya bhūṣayedbhūṣaṇairapi | makuṭaṃ 
kuṇḍalañcaiva hārakeyūrameva ca || 

kaṭakañca navīrañca tathā codarabandhanam | divyagandhaṃ 
samappaivaṃ gandhamā (*) mavalaṃbayet || 

<p. 1554> 

dhūpayeddīpayedvatsa jayaghoṣakhānvitam | śivohamiti sopyatra 
cintayetsatataṃ guruḥ || 

jñānaratnāvalyām | 

alaṃkṛtya yajecchiṣyamārātryādi pravistaraiḥ | hāridrodana 
piṇḍāni dadhidūrvākṣatāni ca || 

samuttāya kṣipeddikṣu tridhāveṣṭayaṃ budhā syāt | 
rocanācamanandūrvā kusumaṃ dadhipāyasam || 

sakṣaumaśvetasiddhartha maṃgalāyābhivandayet | tasya savyakaraṃ 
savyaṃ pāṇinā grhyadeśikaḥ || 

sapradakṣina mādāya gāya sadmaniyojayet | 

mṛgendre (-) 

śivapīṭhābhidhe yāmye praṇavāsana saṃsthitam | vāriṇā 
śaṃkhamāpūrya lohadhāturasau sudhīḥ || 

sa ratnāni ca bījāni gandhāṃścādāya vinyaset | kalāḥ pañca 
nivṛtyādyā brahmādyai rasahakāriṇaiḥ || 

mūlavidyā śivaṃ sāṃgaṃ pañcakṛtya nidhāya ca | oṃ 
sṛṣṭikṛtyāya namaḥ | oṃ sthiti kṛtyāya namaḥ | oṃ saṃhāra 
kṛtyāya namaḥ | oṃ tirobhāvakṛtyāya namaḥ | oṃ anugraha 
kṛtyāya namaḥ | 

pūrvokta bhāvanā yukto śaṃkhamuddhṛtya gururabhiṣiñcet | tadanu 
| devasya vāruṇyāṃ maṇḍala mālikhya tanmadhyādikrameṇa 
parāparasantānikān guru saṃpūjayet | 

<p. 1555> 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

śāstropadiṣṭamārgeṇa vāruṇyāmīśvarasya tu | padmasaṃsthā 
nyasenmantrimaṇḍale dṛṣṭamāsanam || 

sadāśivamanantañca vidyārudraṃ sahomayā | viṣṇudevaṃ tathā 
deva brahmāṇaṃ skandameva ca || 

svaguruṃ śāstropadiṣṭena mārgeṇaiva samarcayet | kāraṇe (-) 

śarīramarthaṃ prāṇañca sadgurubhyo nivedayet | praṇamya 
daṇḍavat bhūmau uttare śirasi sthitaḥ || 

kṛtaśiṣyasya mūrdhnīha śivapādaṃ pradāpayet | 
pradāpayettatkāle śivahastaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 

tasya dakṣiṇakarṇe tu śivamantraṃ samuccaran | sarvamantraṃ 
samuccārya tin śiṣyan kṛtāñjalī || 

tadanu śivaṃ vijñāpayet (-) 

abhiṣiktāṃ tvayā nātha kṛpayā gurumūrtinā | śiṣyorṣayaṃ 
bhavatastasmai dīkṣāyāma śikāritā || 

dāvyayogyamāpekṣā preritāya vibhodhunā | ityājñātogururdadyāt 
| adhikāramihocyate | evamadhikārayukta śiṣyasya 
uṣṇīṣādīndadyāt | kāmike (-) 

tato dadyādācāryaśśiṣyasyoṣṇīṣakādibhiḥ | karaṇīṃ 
kartarīntadvat ghaṭikā sruvatsruvau punaḥ || 

<p. 1556> 

darbhañca pustakānyakṣasūtrānmakuṭa kuṇḍalaḥ | pādukaṃ 
cāmarachatraṃ hastyaśvaṃ śibikādikam || 

rājāṃ kamanyattatkāle dadyāt śraddhāsamanvitaḥ | 
cintyaviśvebhuktimuktivyapekṣāyāṃ viśesa uktaḥ || 

uṣṇīṣamakuṭañchatraṃ pādukā cāmarāṇi vai | 
naiṣṭhikācārya varyāya dadettatra tu bhautikaiḥ || 

gajāścākañcakaraṇīṃ kartarīṃ ghaṭikāntathā | 
ubhayoryogakañcaiva manyantasmāttu dāpayet || 

akṣamālāṃ kuśañcāpi sruksruvau pustakādikam | 

suprabhede (-) 

uṣṇīṣaṃ bandhayetsūkṣmaṃ sitaṃ śuddhena vāsā | 
lalāṭapaṭṭaṃ dātavyaṃ yathā rājñā prakīrtitam || 

makuṭaṃ kuṇḍalādyaistu sarvairābharaṇairyutam | 
chatrañcoparisandhāñca cāmarañca vidhānavit || 

daridrāṇāmapyabhāve tu darbhairetāni kalpayet | athavā 
mānasassarvaṃ śivamantreṇa cintayet || 

kālottare (-) 

tata ārabhya coṣṇīṣaṃ galakaṇṭhāvṛtaṃ śubham | ācaretsopi 
nityañca uttarāsaṃgameva ca || 

upavīta dvayañcaiva uttarīyeṇa saṃyutam | 

<p. 1557> 

dhārayītassadāyā navahanannāti dūṣyati || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

adhikāragurustasmai śiṣyāya vinivedayet | tatrācārāṇi śrāvayet 
| kāmike (-) 

ājñāñca śraddhayā yāvadadyapradutiśikaiḥ | 
dīkṣāvyākhyādikaṃ jñātvā parīkṣā vidhinā kuru || 

suprabhede (-) 

śivārcanādikāryañca japadhyānañca śaktitaḥ | 
vyākhyāmāgrahaḥ kāryamevamevatu sarvadā || 

kāraṇe (-) 

ādīkṣitānāndvijātīnāṃ sarveṣāñca na saṃspṛśet | 
ādīkṣitānāṃ prayatnena caṇḍālī na samaṃspṛśet || 

gurossannidhānaina patrapāduka (*) na dhāyamatiśaktitaḥ | 

sarvajñānottare pradipāditam | tadyathā (-) 

chatraṃ naivāgratodhāryañcoṣṇīṣaṃ na ca pāduke | 
kirīṭādyujvalañcaiva na kuryāt guru sannaidhau || 

nādhyāpanaṃ prakurvītaṃ vyākhyānaṃ śiṣya vigrahau | 
guroścaiva samīpastho guruśiṣya prabodhanam || 

āsanaṃ śayanaṃ yānaṃ nārohodguru saṃnidhau | gurunimnāsano 
bhūtvā satiṣṭhettatparāyaṇam || 

eteṣāṃ varjyāni kānniyācāra paddhatyāṃ 
vistareṇoktantatrāvadhāryatām | suprabhede (-) 

mamarūpaṃ sadā smṛtya śivamantraṃ sadā japet | 

<p. 1558> 

rudrākṣamupavītañca vārayocchiṣyameva ca || 

upavītañcottarīyañca strī śūdrāṇāṃ vivarjayet | 

evaṃ kāraṇoktaniṣedha vacanañcaturthasya kathamupavīta 
dhāraṇamiticet | daivaṃ devamantrai śikhāsūtraṃ śūdro 
dhāraṇamātratā | 

vaiparītya kramāntena rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati | asya niṣedhasya 
vedamantrasya vedadhāraṇa viṣayatvameva na tvāgamamantreṇa 
dhāraṇaviṣayatvam | yathā kāmike (-) 

puruṣāghoravāmājā mantrā viprādiṣu kramāt | svasva 
jātyuktamantreṇa dhārayantadupavītakam || 

atha śiṣyān prabodhayet | tathā niśvāse (-) 

adyaprabhṛtirātmīyācāryaśśivamantrasya mataḥ | kartavyonugraho 
nityaṃ caturāśrama vāsinām || 

vyākhyānamarcanañcaiva guruśiṣya prabodhanam | sopi prativacana 
tathetyuktvā tamājñāṃ śirasā hiyāt || 

adhikāra samarpaṇañcettaṃ śiṣyamabhisāṃdhyātmaīya karaṇī 
kartaripustakam | vyādinā supūjyatame divārpayet | 

adya prabhṛti saṃkrānto yodhikāro mayāstvayi | sa kartavyastvā 
tāvat yāgasaṃkramatonyataḥ || 

niśvāse (-) 

karaṇīṃ kartarīñcaiva sahitā srukasruvādikam | 
asyādibhissamabhyarcya adhikāraṃ samarpayet || 

<p. 1559> 

adhikārasamarpaṇasyā cāryasya viśeṣaṃ sarvajñānottare uktam | 

evaṃ karodhikāro ye yāvat saṃkramatenyataḥ | 
saṃkrāmitādhikārastu karmasañcāsamācaret || 

taduktaṃ kālottare (-) 

svādhikāraṃ samarpyātha svayāyoga sadābhyaset | śūnyākāre vane 
vāpi saṃgṛhītoya nispṛhā || 

sāpekṣa samarpaṇe tu anya prabhṛtiyaścitādhikāra iti śloka 
pāṭhanīyantatra tu namaskāro na vidheyaḥ | adhikāra samarpaṇa 
kṛtopi punarapyadhikāranirharaṇe icchāsecchavajraṃ labdhvā 
ātmadīkṣatvā kṛtvā śivena sahasraṃ hutvānenalabdhvākāro 
bhūtvā dīkṣāntamācaret | 

āhutīnāṃ sahasrantu juhuyādvā śi (*) ṇunā | adhikāraṃ 
punardatvā śaṃkareṇa tu vartmanā || 

tvayā yatsatu kartavya madhikāraṃ yathecchayā | 
yāvaddehāvasānānte mayā dattaṃ yathā vidhi || 

jñānaratnāvalyām | adhikārasamarpita adhikārayoḥ phalaṃ uktam | 
tasmādadhikārasya sāyujyaṃ parame pade | 

adhikārapadastasya bhogassadāśive pade | tadante śāśvatīmuktaṃ 
iti śāstrasya niścaye || 

tato guru śivaṃ praṇamya (-) 

<p. 1560> 

abhiṣekatvamādiṣṭatvayāntaṃ gurumūrtinā | saṃhitāpāragassoya 
mabhiṣikto mayā śiva || 

tvatprasādādavippne madhikārakarotviti | 

vijñāpayet | sopi śivamabhyarcyā vighnamastviti vijñāpayet | tato 
gurustamagni sannidhinnītvā saṃhitayā pañca 
pañcāhutibhissaṃtarpya nivṛtyādi kalāpañcakaṃ seśvaramavaloka 
pañcapañcāhutirhutvā caivaṃ brūyāt | tathā mṛgendre (-) 

idhāya bhūmayassarve bhavantyasyādhikāriṇaḥ | viṣayatvaṃ 
prapadyadhvamanujānīta nāyakaḥ || 

tataḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ dadyāt | kṛtamomasya deśikaḥ | asyārthaḥ (-) 

he hasva bhūtamayatatvaṃ bhuvanādhikalārūpā asyādhikāriṇam | 
īśvarānujñayā yūyaṃ viṣayatvaddiṣṭa dīkṣādi 
vyāpārajiṣṭorasya gocaralataṃ bhajadhvam | tathā he kalātatva 
bhuvanādhipata evaṃ svakarmādyasantamamanujānī kurutvamiti 
mantravya pūrṇāndatvā śivamantra sahitābhikarāṃgulista 
ūṣaratvanivṛtyarthaṃ dulamukāgreṇa pāsacchedādi hetave 
mantrasandīptyai khaṭgavaddagddha hastasyoddīpanaṃ kuryāt | tathā 
mṛgendre (-) 

śivādibhikarasyāgra mūlamukāgreṇa saṃspṛśet | khaṭgavanmantra 
sandīptyai pāśacchedādi hetutaḥ || 

<p. 1561> 

tasmātteneha hastena homayitvācāryassamagre homakarmatāyai 
pūrṇāhutirdatvā taddhaste kusumādīttadatvā kuṃbhanale maṇḍale 
svasmin praṇāmaṃ kārayitvā śivāgre nītvā tannāmagotrādika 
mādiśet | suprabhede (-) 

praktipya maṇḍale puṣpa prāsādaṃ samanusmaran | yasminmantre 
patetpuṣpaṃ nāmagotrā tadātmakam || 

īśānavaktra vidyeśa ghorabrahmasyasadyakaḥ | rudrovāmaśca 
huṃkāro navadhā nava ucyate || 

śvetādīnāṃ samantāhi rudrāṇāntu gaṇāntakam | 

raurave (-) 

pāṃ (*) paryāya nāmābhikīrtanīyā yathākramam | 
strīlīnnapuṃsakañcaiva varjayettu viśeṣataḥ || 

pulliṃgaṃ naiva sarveṣāṃ ghoṣayedbudha vācakaiḥ | śvetānāntu 
viśeṣosti (*) paraṃ gotra sūtrakam || 

śiveśśikhā tahā jyotissāvitrī vyomagocaraḥ | kāśyapādi 
ṛṣīṇāntu tadvargaṃ gotramuyate || 

cayāpāte tu yatproktaṃ tatpūrvaṃ śivabhāṣayā | (*) paryāgocaraṃ 
gotraṃ sūtraṃ tasyaṃ vidhīyate || 

kāmike (-) 

kṣatriyāṇāntu vaiśyānāṃ gotramācārya lakṣaṇam | 
naivaśūdrasya gotraḥ syāt evaṃ gotravidhau matam || 

<p. 1562> 

anugrāhyastvayā (**) śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā | śrotavyañca 
śivaṃ jñānaṃ śrāvaṇīyaṃ tadarthinām || 

saṃvatsaroṣate śiṣye dīkṣā nirvarttayedbudhaḥ | 

mṛgendre (-) 

vyākhyeyaṃ śrutamarthibhyaḥ śrotavyañcatvayānvitaḥ | bahuyā 
bahuca jñānaṃ kṛtyaṃ kāryaṃ suvarcatam || 

tyaktvālasyañca yācārya kāryobhakteṣvanugrahe | pratiṣṭhāya 
śivādīnāṃ teṣāṃ prarthanavā bhṛśam || 

svalpahoma japejyābhiralupta niyamonvaham | vaset laukikenāpi 
svāmodaśca virodhinā || 

dhanyaña vihitaṃ kiñcit niṣiddhañcopadeṣyate | 
tatsarvamanusartavyaṃ yattavyānuvartiṣu || 

raurave (-) 

kṣaṇādi pratiṣṭhāntaṃ pratiṣṭhādutsavāntakam | utsavādi 
niśātyantaṃ kartavyantu śivājñayā || 

satatheti pratijñāya deśikānumatassudhīḥ | pūrṇāhutiṃ 
tadārabhya prāyaścittantu kārayet || 

atra yāgaṃ visṛjet | 

agniṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā acāryantu namaskāret | 

suprabhede (-) 

dakṣināṃ gukhe datā vittaśāmyavivarjitam | vajramābharaṇañcaiva 
makuṭaṃ kuṇḍalantayā || 

hemayajñopavītañca hemapuṣpopakārakam | 

<p. 1563> 

mṛgaśayyāsanādīni ācāryāya pradāpayet || 

raṃge vā śibikāyāṃ vā hayenāge narethavā | grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ 
kṛtvā svagṛhaṃ praviśettadā || 

mauna maunī tṛṣavaṇa snāyīdvārabhijñassusaṃ yadi | śaṃkaraṃ 
varadharaśśānta śśuklāmālyānulepanaḥ || 

yogapaṭṭākṣasūtrī ca mauñjyājina pavitrasat | 

santāne (-) 

śaivān supūjayettatra vastrahemāṃgulīyakaiḥ | brāhmaṇān 
bhojayettatra śaivān saṃbhojayettadā || 

samayān bhojaye ddevījanānsarvāṃśca bhojayet | 

evaṃ prāptābhiṣekañca ācāryo mantrasidhyarthamācaret | 

tathā svāyaṃ bhuve (-) 

ācārya vratamācaretsarva vratottamam | 

sadyādi śivaparyanta dabhyasenmantra saṃhitām | 
pakṣatrayamayaśāyī naktāśī caru bhuksadā || 

japañca nityahaṃ kuryādanudvighna sahasrakam | homaṃ pratidinaṃ 
kuryāt japānte rakṣitaḥ kramāt || 

ghṛtena vā ghṛtāktai vā tilakṣīreṇa taṇḍulaiḥ | vrīhibhirvā 
samidbhirvā daghnā vāpi yavaistu vā || 

śrīphalairbilvapatrairvā puṣpairvā yājñikaiśśubhaiḥ | tato 
vratasamāptau tu pūrvantu maṇḍalaṃ yajet || 

prāraṃbhāvasāne ca tridinaṃ pañcagavyakam | 

<p. 1564> 

kāmike (-) 

śaktimūrtiṃ śivaṃ sāṃgaṃ abhyaset śaktito guruḥ ācārya 
vratameva syāt vratānāmuktottamam | 

tadante anantavijayaṃ maṇḍale śivamiṣṭvātmānamekena 
śivakuṃbhenābhiṣekoktavadabhiṣiñcet | tadā tatphalamāpnuyuḥ | 
tathā kriyāre vratagrahaṇakāle ca deśikassādhakastathā | 
abhiṣicyātmānamananta vijaye budhaḥ | 
tathābhiṣekayogyāsānānyadhā tu kadācana | pāśān 
hasāmarthyādguśestena praśasyate | vratametatpuṇyaṃ siddhāśca 
viniyojayet | [iti dīkṣādarśe ācāryābhiṣeka vidhiḥ] || 

|| [atha sādhakābhiṣeka vidhirucyate] || 

taduktaṃ sarvajñānottare (-) 

ācāryassādhakaścaiva dvauvetau tulyamaṃgalau | samāptavidyā 
kartavyau gurusādhaka eva ca || 

sa (*) massādhako jñeyo niṣkāmo deśikasmṛtaḥ | eka evakriyākāro 
bhāva eva pṛthak tayoḥ || 

svalpa homa japadhyānaṃ kurute deśikassadā | karmaniṣṭhā 
pratiṣṭhā hi satataṃ sādhakottamam || 

kāmike (-) 

anenaiva prakāreṇa sādhakasyābhiṣecanam | kintu 
sādhyāṇusaṃlabdhairghaṭairasyābhiṣecanam || 

tahā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

sādhakasyābhiṣekantu mantrahomādanantaram | 

<p. 1565> 

kāryasiddhividhānajñassiddhikāmasya deśikaḥ || 

niśvāsottaresādhakalakṣaṇamuktam | 

sa evamantra kalpajño mantrimantravidhāna vit | mantrakalpasavettā ca 
deśakālavidhānavit || 

japayoga vidhānajñastatvasyāsya vidhānavit | sarvajñaśca 
kṛtajñaśca śaucācāra samanvitaḥ || 

samarthaśca parityāgī japasakta sadāmanā | catuṣpāt 
saṃhitābhijñaḥ saṃkaraproktalakṣaṇam || 

tadravyamānaṃ saṃkṣepāt nibodhadvijasattama | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

abhiṣekaṃ sādhakānāṃ vakṣyehaṃ nandikeśvara | 
pūrvavanmaṇṭapādīṃśca pūjanañcāgni kāryakam || 

atra pūvoktavartmannava nāgamaṇḍalaṃ nirmāya tasyārcanaṃ kuryāt 
| sādhakaṃ dīkṣāyāṃ nivṛtyādi kalātrayaṃ 
pūrvavacchāntikālāntañca viśodhya sadāśiva māhyeṣvā santarpya 
visṛjya śāntyātītā śāntikalādvayaṃ sandhāya śuddhaśastau 
śiṣya caitanyaṃ saṃyojyāṇimādyaṣṭaśaktisthaṃ mantroccārya 
uktaḥ | pūrṇāhutyātmānaṃ svābhilaṣitabhoga prāpti 
sthānabhuvana sādhya mantradevatāyāṃ niyojya 
śiṣyānnaiṣṭhikātmanoṣṭaguṇānāpādya sadāśivaṃ dhyātvā 
mūlena pūrṇāṃ vidadhyāt | tathā 

<p.1566> 

cintyaviśve (-) 

nivṛtyādi kalānāñca trayaṃ vidyāntameva ca | 
śāntyātītāntamānīya śodhayennandi keśvara || 

tatassadāśivaṃ dhyātvā mūlamantreṇa pūrṇāyāśaktau saṃyojya 
kurvīta guṇāpādānamaṣṭadhā rāmanātha paddhatyām | 

yasmin vā bhuvane bhoganātmābhogānātmābhoktuṃ pañcapāñchati | 
tallokādhikasāyujyaṃ tannītvā ghṛtiśodhite | 

āpādayedguṇānaṣṭau pratyekaṃ pūrṇayā saha | 
stravammūlamudīryātmanyaṇimādo bhavantviti || 

svāhetyantaguṇānanyānapyevaṃ mantramuccaran | 

atra homakramaḥ | oṃ hāṃ ātman aṇimādo bhavantu svāhā | 
prākāmyante bhavatu svāhā | oṃ hāṃ ātman lipimādhi (*) te bhavatu 
svāhā | oṃ hāṃ ātmana prāptiste bhavatu svāhā prākāmyante 
bhavatu | mahimā te bhavatu svāhā | oṃ hāṃ ātman prāptiste 
bhavatu svāhā | īśitvaṃ te bhavatu svāhā | vaśitvaṃ te bhavatu 
svāhā | kāmānante bhavatu svāhā | evamāpaditātmānāṃ 
sādhakābhiṣeka vidhinābhiṣiñcet | niśvāsottare (-) 

kalaśāṣṭadalenaiva pañcadaśena vā | abhiṣekaṃ pradātavyaṃ 
deśikena mahātmanā || 

<p. 1567> 

saṃpuṭīkṛtya vidyā (*) kalaśaṃ surasundarī | 
abhiṣiñcettataśśiṣyaṃ vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 

guru vatsādhakasya sarvamabhiṣeka vidhānaṃ samānaṃ kintu pañca 
kuṃbhapakṣe nivṛtyādi kalāpañca kuṃbheṣu vinyasya sādhya 
mantreṇa saṃpūjya mūlenāṣṭottara śatamālabhyañjapitvā 
nivṛtyādimantraissādhyamantreṇa ca pratyekaṃ śataṃ śatañjaptvā 
bhadrapīṭhasya śiṣyasādhyamantranyāsaṃ vidhāya nivṛtyā 
tribhiḥ kuṃbhaistribhiḥ | prathamamabhiṣicya śāntyātīta 
kuṃbhenābhiṣicyānte śāntikuṃbhenāṇimādikaṃ smaran | 
sādhyamantreṇa recakodbhavamudrayābhiṣiñcet | tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

nivṛtyādikalā prāgvannyaset kuṃbheṣu pañcasu | sādhyāṇuñca 
tathābhyarcya mūlenāṣṭottaraśatam || 

ālabhyāya nivṛtyādi kramātsādhyaṇukāśatam | 
sādhyamantrāsanasthaṃ sādhyaika gatamānasam || 

abhiṣiñcetribhi kuṃbhaiḥ śāntyātītātmakena ca | 
paśyantaśśānti kuṃbhena hṛdi smṛtvāṇimādikam || 

vinyasyāṣṭasamudrairvā sādhyāṇi śatamantritaiḥ | 
pūrvoktairabhikuṃbhai recakodbhavamudrayā || 

udaṅmukhāsanasthasya citte kṛtvāṇimādikam | tadidaṃ 
sādhyamantreṇa sādhakasyābhiṣecanam || 

<p. 1568> 

devasya dakṣiṇe prāgvat saṃsthāpya tadudaṅmukham | uṣṇīṣa 
kartarīhīnaṃ sarvamanyutsamarpayet || 

adhikārañca tatraiva dāpayennandikeśvara | sādhyamantraṃ 
samuccārya praṇavādyantadīpanam || 

recakodbhavayā dadyāt puṣpādi yutamañjalim | 
mahatprasādyamityuktvā śaradindu samujvalam || 

pūrakeṇa hṛdāṃbhoje sādhakastanniveśayet | santarpya pāvake 
bhaktyā sādhyaśaṃbarasaṃhitām || 

navanābha maṇḍalañcaiva arcayetpūrvavattadā | tanmadhye 
sādhyamantrāṇi pūjayennandikeśvara || 

gurorājñāṃ samāsādya prāṇāyāma kramātpunaḥ | sulagne 
śobhane kāle mantrārādhana mācaret || 

aṇimādi prasidhyarthaṃ guḍgulā pāyasothavā | ghṛtasya vā 
sahasrantu śataṃ vā homamācaret || 

tathā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

aṣṭottaraśatahomaṃ tadardhaṃ pādameva ca | āhutīnāntu vijñeyo 
mantrāṇāmanurūpataḥ || 

ājyakṣīraṃ tilaṃ vātha ghṛtena madhunāplutam | śrīphalāni 
ghṛtāktāni samayo brahmavṛkṣajān || 

āmalī phalamantrantu mahā (*) sya ca gulgulot | 

<p. 1569> 

hutāktagulakau śreṣṭha homayetsiddhabhākbhavet || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

uttamādhamasiddhīnāṃ japtavyā siddhimicchatā | asya 
lakṣārdhakalpena rudratulyo bhavennara || 

nityahānugrahe śaktassabhavennānyathā suta | homastu japavatkārya 
mastrajāpeṣu sarvadā || 

tadā samartho bhavati sādhakassiddhi sādhakoguru | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

sādhakasyābhiṣekastu evaṃ vatsa vidhīyate | yathā pūrvaṃ yāgaṃ 
visṛjet pūrvavatsante (**) t || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

āgamārthānuyāyī ca pāraṃ paryakramānugaḥ | sadguropadeśena 
sarvaṃ sidhyati tatkṣaṇāt || 

|| [atha sādhakavrata vidhiḥ] || 

ācārya vratamācaryaścarodācārya sannidhau | (**) mantravrataṃ 
mantraliṃgāgre maṇḍalethavā || 

jñānaratnāvalyām | 

śrīśailādi girau puṇye kṣetre vā saritāntaṭe | patrapuṣpa 
phalopeta mṛtkuśo pacite śubhe || 

śrī māheśvara saṃkīrṇe sthāpyotha manorame | 

<p. 1570> 

vyādhi coramṛgopete dhūrtastrī nāsti kānvitam || 

baddhādanyāśramakṣetraṃ siddhisthānaṃ parityajet | tatra 
pratyaṅmukhaṃ liṃgaṃ prāṅmukhaṃ tadabhāvataḥ || 

sarvāvayava saṃpūrṇaṃ svayaṃ bhūtaṃ samāśrayet | sthāpitaṃ 
munisiddhāyai svayaṃ vā parikalpitam || 

kīlitaṃ varjayeddhīmān brahmaviṣṇvindra mātṛbhiḥ | 
umāmaheśvaraskandakṣetrapāla gaṇeśvaraiḥ || 

śataliṃgaṃ sahasrāṃgaṃ mukhaliṃgañca varjayet | 
yāmyakauberavaktrañca varjayettatkṣaṇairyutam || 

parigṛhyepsitaṃ liṃgaṃ tadyāmyai jagatī bahi | maṭhe manorame 
sthitvā sāyaṃ (*) ya prasannadhīḥ || 

spheṭaliṃgaṃ samīpe vā kāyasiddhiṃ samācaret | 

mṛgendre (-) 

guroranujñāmāsādya bhaktyā saṃpraṇamya ca | puṇyakāle muhūrte 
ca mantrārādhana mācaret || 

aṇimādi prasidhyarthaṃ guḍgulopayaso (**) | ghṛtasya vā sahasrantu 
śataṃ vā homamācaret || 

tathā svāyaṃbhuve (-) 

aṣṭottaraśataṃ homa mardhañcamevavā | āhutīnāntu vijñeyo 
mantrāṇāmanurūpata || 

ājyaṃ kṣīraṃ tilaṃvātha ghṛtena madhunāplutam | 

<p. 1571> 

śrī phalāni ghṛtāktāni samidho brahmavṛkṣajām || 

āmalī phalamātrantu mahiṣākṣasya gulgulo | 
ghṛtāktāgulakāśreṣṭhā homayet siddhibhāk bhavet || 

āgamārthānuyāyī ca pāraṃparyakramānugam | sadgurorupadeśena 
sarvaṃ sidhyati tatkṣaṇāt || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām | 

uttamādhamasiddhīnāṃ japtavyā siddikāṃkṣiṇaḥ | asya 
lakṣārthadāpena rudratulyo bhavennaraḥ || 

nigrahānugraheśaktassabhavedanyayā suta | homastu japavatkārya 
śāstrajāpeṣu sarvadā || 

tadā samartho bhavati sādhakassiddhi sādhane | 

tathā kālottare (-) 

śivaṃ brahmāṇi cāṃgāni japtavyāni śivālaye | 
saṃnidhāmyendriyā śyāmaṃ varṣamekaṃ śuciṣmata || 

nityaṃ bhaktaṃ bhujāśuddhakuśaprastaraśāyinā | 
pūjāgnihavanādyukta cetasā bhāvitātmanā || 

vidyāṃga varṇalakṣe tu samāpte maṇḍalaṃ guruḥ | nava 
padmakṛtaṃ hyevaṃ yajanīyañca pūrvavat || 

sādhakaścātmaśudhyarthaṃ sarvadāvṛtamācaret | 

[iti vyāghrapuranivāsivāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita 
dīkṣādarśe 

|| sādhakābhiṣeka vidhiḥ] || 

<p. 1572> 

|| [athāstrābhiṣekavidhiḥ rucyate] || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa astreṇaivābhiṣecanam | vadhyānāṃ 
mṛtavatsānāṃ strī prasūnāñcayoṣitām || 

durbhagānāmabījānāṃ puṃsāmapihitā (*) hā | nṛpāṇāṃ bhogya 
hīnānāṃ ripubhiḥ pīḍitātmanāṃ || 

lakṣmī vijayasaubhāgya dharmakarmatva kāraṇam | 
pūrvavadyāgamāpādya sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuru || 

tathā sārdhatriṃśatikāyām | 

pūrvoktabhūtale śuddhe gomayenopalepite | mantradravya samāyuktaṃ 
kalaśaṃ vāripūritam || 

digyaiśānyāṃ sthāpayettannicchidraṃkāraṇaṃ param | tataḥ 
padmaṃ samālikhya sthaṇḍile vā samarayet || 

rajassubahavo vighno nirvighnāsthaṇḍile guha | tasmātsarva 
prayatnena kāryostasya mahātmanā || 

sarvatra vistṛtaśśāstraṃ sthaṇḍile yāgauttamam | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

padmamaṣṭadalayuktaṃ dhyātvā cāstrā samarcayet | itthaṃ 
kṛtamaṇḍale ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ pūjya tasyopari oṃ pāśupatāstrāya 
namaḥ | ityāsanaṃ saṃpūjya pañcāsyaṃ daśakarṇañca 
prativaktraṃ trilocanam | 

<p. 1573> 

durddarśamatibhīmañca daśabāhusamaprabham | 

sarvāṃgaṃ bhujagopetaṃ nāgayajño pavītinam | dakṣiṇegniñca 
vetālaṃ śūlaṃ śaktiṃ tathāṃkuśam || 

vāme sarpañca kundañca cakrañcakrañcamudvaram | evaṃ 
pāśupatāstrañca vighnasaṃghāta nāśanam || 

oṃ pāśupatāstramūrtaye namaḥ | aṣṭatriṃśatkalāṃ nyastvā | 
iti saṃpūjya oṃ huṃ netrebhyo huṃ phaḍiti netraṃ saṃpūjya 
prathamaṃ praṇavaṃ bījaṃ śrīkaṇṭhaṃ śakraṃ īśvaraḥ | 

bījanādasamāyuktaṃ vinātābhyāñca pa (*) kam | 
binduṣaṣṭhasvaropetaṃ śrīkaṇṭhaṃ mantra nāyakam || 

huṃ phaṭkāra samāyuktaṃ navabījamidaṃ guha | 

iti mahāpāśupataṃ mantraṃ samuccāryā vāhinyā vāhya 
sthāpanādikaṃ vidhāya oṃ astrahṛdayāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ 
hrīṃ astra hṛdaye huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ paṃ astraśikhāyai huṃ 
phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ hūṃ astrakavacāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ hūṃ 
astranetrebhyo huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ phaṭ astrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ 
| ityaṃgāni vinyasya rakṣāvakuṇṭhanāmṛtī karaṇa 
pādyādibhissaṃpūjya tadbāhye vastrādīn diśadikṣu samarcayet | 
oṃ vajrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ śaktaye huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ 
daṇḍāya huṃ phaṭ | oṃ (*) gāya huṃ phaṭ | oṃ pāśāya huṃ 
phaṭ | 

<p. 1574> 

oṃ aṃkuśāya phaṭ | oṃ gadāya phaṭ | oṃ triśūlāya phaṭ | oṃ 
padmāya phaṭ | evamāvaraṇaṃ japāntaṃ saṃpūjayet | 

vṛttaṃ kurvantu kuṇḍantu tasyordhve caturaṃgulam | caturnemi 
samāyuktaṃ hastamātrasamaṃ tataḥ || 

pūrve kāmapradaṃ vṛttamastrayāge viśeṣataḥ | sthaṇḍilaṃ vā 
prakartavyaṃ kuṇḍaṃ vātha salakṣaṇam || 

śodhanaṃ tasya kurvīta prāguktena tu ṣaṇmukha | jananaṃ 
niṣkṛtāntañca vidhiṃ kuryādvi cakṣaṇam || 

homaṃ kurvīta matimān śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā | 

tatassaṃhitāya mantratarpaṇaṃ vidhāya trimadhunā 
rājenāṣṭottaraśataṃ sāṃgānāndaśāṃśato homaṃ kuryāt | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tathāvidhaṃ vidhānena pūrvaṃ kalaśapūraṇam | praṇavāsanañca 
saṃpūjya pūrvavannandikeśvara || 

aṣṭottaraśatāstreṇa abhimantryāstra pūjitam | 
pūrvavaddhayānayuktastu snāpayecchiṣyamūrdhani || 

vedaghoṣaiśca vāditraistotrairmaṃgala vācakaiḥ | dade śiṣyasya 
vastrādi hemaratnādi bhūṣitam || 

deśikāya namaskṛtya (**) prītyarthasiddhaye | 

sārdhatriśatikāyām | 

<p. 1575> 

astradīkṣāṃ samāpyevaṃ sarvaṃ chidranikṛntanam | yojanīyaṃ 
śivartve tu nirvāṇakaraṇīṃ param || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

evamastrābhiṣekañca mahāpāpaughanāśanam | 

|| [iti dīkṣādarśe abhiṣekavidhiḥ] || || [ātmadīkṣāvidhirucyate] 
|| 

śūdraṃ hi dīkṣayitvā tu vidhānenāgrajanmanaḥ | sopi 
śūdratvamāpnoti dīkṣādātmānamātmanā || 

kāmika sūtroktatvādācāryastat śāntyarthamātmadīkṣāṃ 
rauravokta prakāreṇa vidadhyāt | tadyathā | 

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi ātmadīkṣā vidhikramam | bhāṣitandeva 
devena śrīkaṇṭhena māhātmanā || 

etatpavitraṃ paramaṃ mahāpātakanāśanam | strīśūdrā 
dīkṣayedyasya vidhānenāgra janmanā || 

nirmālyaṃ bhakṣayitvā tu āpatsu śivayajñavit | ātmānaṃ vā 
samatikramya śāsvatīṃ pārameśvarī || 

ātmadīkṣāmimāṃ kuryādvidhivatsaṃśitavrata | 
pūrvamaṇṭapakalpena śivamāvāhayetsadā || 

brahmabhissahitandevaṃ vidyāṃgaiśca saṃyutaḥ | 

<p. 1576> 

yathoktena vidhānena ātmadīkṣāṃ samārabhet || 

pūrvoktena vidhānena iṣṭvā śivamananyayā | sannigṛhye ca 
yadgrāmaṃ paścāddīkṣāṃ prayojayet || 

vaṣaṭ kāreṇa saṃyojya yajñaṃ samyak prayojayet | vauṣaṭ 
kāreṇa kartavyaṃ maṇḍalasya niveśanam || 

svasya yatnena nirdiṣṭaṃ kalpanañcātmanassadā | svadhākāreṇa 
sandhānamātmani pratikalpayet || 

ālokyamāmapāṃgena paśoḥ kuyādvicakṣaṇaḥ | vyomena sādhanaṃ 
kuyāt viṣṭanaṃ sakalasya tu || 

niṣkalasya tu yuñjīta tadbhūrityeva bandhanam | spṛśet ghoreṇa 
manasā śauryādevātma yajñavit || 

vyomacakre padādardhyamādhūpapavitrakam | udveṣṭanañca kartavya 
majarāyeti nityaśaḥ || 

chindabhindeti pāśādi dīpanaṃ parikalpayet | ulkāyeti ca mantreṇa 
garbhādhāna vidhikramam || 

damanīśena saṃyogo vāgīśvaryāḥ prakīrtitāḥ | avalokanaṃ 
śivenaiva brahmabhirhomameva ca || 

ātmadīkṣāvidhiprokto ācāryaśśivasaṃbhavaḥ | 

jñānaratnāvalyām (-) 

ajñātvā śā (*) saṃbhāvaṃ jñānatatva samuccayam | 

<p. 1577> 

dīkṣāṃ karotu yo mohāt paścāttāpaṃ karoti cet || 

pañcalakṣaṇaṃ japeddhoraṃ yadivāñchati bhojanam | svaguroryo 
bhavedbhrātā guruputro viśeṣataḥ || 

dīkṣā taireva kartavyā pavitrārohaṇantathā | guruputraṃ 
yathāyogyaṃ tyaktvānyaṃ parikalpayet || 

niṣphalā tasya vai dīkṣā mahākalpaṃ vrejatyathā | 

[iti vedajñāna viracita dīkṣādarśe āmadīkṣā vidhiḥ] || atra 
pūrvānuṣṭhitaiśśaivadhurandharairācāryai 
śaivasanyāsadīpikāyāṃ prapañcitam | tathāpi leśādatra 
saṃlikhyate | atrādhikāriṇaḥ | ācāryābhiṣeka sama (**) dhikāra 
samarpita gururadhikāravirāgyāt tasya śaivasanyāsaṃ vidadhyāt iti 
kālottare | śrūyamāṇatvat śaiva sanyāsaṃ kuryāt | tathā 
cintyaviśve (-) 

yatayaḥ trividhā jñeyāstapasvī vida (**) thā | vidvāniti 
tridhāproktā teṣāṃ lakṣaṇamucyate || 

taponiṣṭhastapasvīti tasya vṛttistu suvrata | nādhyetavyanta 
saṃkalpo na śrotavyaṃ kathañcana || 

śiṣyāṇāṃ saṃgrahañcaiva śaiva vidyā (**) śanam | na 
vadetsaṃskṛtāṃ bhāṣāṃ na ca daṇḍikamaṇḍalaḥ || 

liṃgaṃ kṣaṇikamabhyarcya bhaktimantreṇa saṃyutaḥ | 

<p. 1578> 

ekākī vṛkṣamūle vā vane vā janavarjayet || 

janāt bhīti samāyuktā (*) sedbāhūpadhānakaḥ | vasanaṃ yena 
kenāpi tathaivāśanapānakaiḥ || 

pāṇi pātrodare pāno yācitānnena jīvanam | ityuktastapasvī syāt 
sādhako yatināmavān || 

viduṣañca yateścāpi vartate nandikeśvara | 
adhyāpanañcādhyayanaṃ śravaṇaṃ cintanantayā || 

etaccatuṣṭayantasya viduṣośca viśeṣataḥ | vidvadyaterviśeṣosti 
vyākhyānaṃ cintanaṃ bhavet || 

sadācāryābhiṣeka (*) yukto vidvatsamākhyaka | yatīnāṃ trividhaṃ 
proktaṃ śaivānāñcaturāśrame || 

tatraiva tadvidhānamuktam | 

pūrvoktaṃ pañcapadmeṣu pūjāṃ kṛtvā viśeṣataḥ | 
īśānādikrameṇaiva madhyapadma pañcake || 

pañcabrahmasvarūpeṇa pūjayeddeśikottamaḥ | pādādi 
mūrtiparyantaṃ divyadṛṣṭayā nirīkṣayet || 

śiṣyaṃ vimuktisidhyarthaṃ saṃhāranyāsa pūrvakam | jaṭinaṃ 
śikhinaṃ vāpi kuṇḍinaṃ vā vidhāyatam || 

upavīta nyasedbhūmau jale sanyasta mantrataḥ | mātaraṃ pitaraṃ 
putraṃ kalatramupavītakam || 

<p. 1579> 

śivaṃ vihāyañca sanyasta mihatānmayā | evaṃ mantraṃ paṭhan 
pañcavāraṃ sadgurusannidhau || 

sadhomantreṇa kaupīnaṃ kāṣāya vasanantathā | vaiṇavaṃ 
dagdhamastreṇa bhūtikośaṃ śivena ca || 

bhikṣāpātrañca śirasā kavacenāvakuṇṭhanam | etairmantraiśca 
saṃsādhya śiṣyāya pradedguruḥ || 

kaupīnādikramāya dhārayecchiṣyamādarāt | bāṇaliṃgaṃ 
śivajñāna pustakañca pradāpayet || 

yāvatkālaṃ śivajñānaṃ bhavati tasyavai | tāvatkālañca 
kartavyaṃ śravaṇādi viśeṣataḥ || 

evaṃ vadettu taṃ śiṣyaṃ deśikaṃ kṛpayā yutaḥ | praṇāmaṃ 
kārayetpaścāt tasya nāmacakārayet || 

abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pūrvannandikeśvara | 

|| [iti śaivasanyāsa vidhiḥ] || 

|| [atha yogadīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

kālottare (-) 

yogadīkṣāṃ pravakṣyāmi saṃkṣepānnatu vistarāt | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

yujiryogeti dhātvarthe yajjīvaśśivayorapi | 

<p. 1580> 

saṃśleṣo yogaityuktassahamārga iti sphuṭaḥ | 

asadbhāvakṣayakaraṃ jñāna sadbhāvabhāvakam | śivatatveti 
saṃyogo yogadīkṣeti kathyate || 

maṇḍalammaṇḍapaṃ kuṃbhaṃ devārcanādikam | pūrvokta 
vidhisaṃyuktaṃ yamairnayamabhirgatam || 

atyanta śivasaṃprāpti vāñcāyuktamalolupam | evaṃ 
vidhaguṇairyuktaṃ dīkṣayecchiṣyamuttamam || 

mantradīpanatṛptādi pūrvavannandikeśvara | agnikāryantu yatsarvaṃ 
pūrvoktavidhinācaret || 

vāgīśvarañca vāgīśaṃ pūrvavatpūjayedguruḥ | śiṣyavakṣasi 
puṣpeṇa bhedanādi ca pūrvavat || 

garbhādhānādi saṃskāraṃ pūrvavadvidhinā caret | 
tataśiṣyasyadehepi daśanāḍīśca cintayet || 

iḍā ca piṃgalācaiva suṣumnā ca tathā bhavet | gāndhārī hasti 
jihvā ca pūṣācaiva yaśasvinī || 

alaṃbuṣā kuhaścaiva śaṃkhinī daśamīstathā | prāṇādi 
vāyavaścaiva caturdaśa samanvitā || 

prāṇaśca prathamo vāyurapāno vyāna eva ca | udānaśca samānaśca 
nāgakūrmaśca saptamaḥ || 

kṛkaro devadattaśca dhanañjaya itīritā | 

<p. 1581> 

vaiśānto mukhyakaścaivamantaryāmi prapañcakam | 

evañcaturdaśaproktāḥ prāṇādyā vāyavasvamī | tāsāṃ 
nāḍīṣu (***) vāyavo vicaranti ca || 

svasvasthāneṣu vāyūnāṃ nāḍīnāṃ sthāpanaṃ bhavet | 
praṇavena ca śaktyā ca śivabīja japādibhiḥ || 

sthāpayetpūjayeddhayātvā śivarūpantu bhāvayet | nāḍīnāñca 
trayomukhyā suṣumneḍācapiṃgalā || 

tāsāmapi suṣumnāyāṃ mukhyatvañca prakīrtitam | tanmadhye 
brahmanādīti śivaśaktyālayaṃ param || 

mūlādhāraṃ samārabhya brahmarandhrāvasānkam | asyāsthitiśca 
vijñeyā navādhāropalakṣitā || 

gudameḍrāntarañcaiva liṃgamūlamanantaram | nābhiśca hṛdayaṃ 
paścāt kaṇṭhamūlamanantaram || 

tālumūlañca kodaṇḍe bhruvomardhyamanantaram | lalāṭaṃ 
brahmarandhrañca navadhārā itīritā || 

mūlādhārañcatuṣpatraṃ tadūrdhvaṃ ṣaṭdalaṃ bhavet | 
aṣṭapatrantu tatsthāna manārhṛta mitirmatam || 

kaṇṭhañca dvādaśaṃ proktaṃ ṣoḍaśaṃ tālu mūlakam | 
tadvallalāṭaṃ bhrūmadhyaṃ śivasthānamanantaram || 

ṣaṣṭhayuttaraṃ triśatakaṃ varṇabhedāt kramāt smaret | 

<p.1582> 

hemābhaṃ sphaṭikābhañca vanhirūpamanantaram || 

taruṇāditya saṃkāśaṃ bhāskaradyuti sannibham | 
varṣatejomayāpaścāt manopacāramagocaram || 

sthāneṣu brahmahatyādīn kāraṇāṃśca prakalpayet | 
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ || 

kriyāśaktijñānaśaktiricchāśaktiśivaṃ param | 
vanhisūryendubimbānāṃ sthānaṃ tatraiva bhāvayet || 

vanhimaṇḍalakaṃ nāgau hṛdaye sūryamaṇḍalam | kodaṇḍadvaya 
madhye ca candamaṇḍalamīritam || 

kriyāśakitāñca binduñca na śaktau tu nādakam | icchāśaktau 
kalā proktā tatraiva paramāmṛtam || 

tadūrdhvantu śivasthāne cānandāmṛtamuttamam | evaṃ dhyātvā tu 
tanmadhye mantrāṇāṃ navakaṃ smaret || 

asya toyena saṃprokṣya śiṣya dehe tu deśikaḥ | 
kuṇḍasthavanhijavalanaṃ vāyunā tu yathā bhavet || 

tadvadādhāradeśasthitantanmantramudīrayet | mālādhāre ca 
tārañca marālaṃ śaktiśaṃbhuyuk || 

navadarbhāgrakoṇe vā navavāraṃ japetkramāt | 
bindunādakalāyuktaṃ brahmarandhrāvasānakam || 

bisatantu nibhājyotiruccareddeśikottamaḥ | 

<p. 1583> 

jvaladdīpaśikhākāraṃ mantrarūpaṃ vibhāvayet || 

anyonyaṃ vidyutadyotaṃ sūtraprotāparismaret | evaṃ dhyātvā tu 
saṃpūjya svasmin pūjya ca śiṣyake || 

pūjayitvā vidhānena sūtra vinyāsamācaret | śikhādi pañca 
sūtrāṇāṃ parimāṇañca bhāvayet || 

bindukāntaṃ hṛdāntañca nābhyantaṃ viṣṇudehakam | 
brahmadeśagatañcaiva pañca sūtrāṇi vinyaset || 

evaṃ pañcavidhaṃ sūtraṃ śiṣyasya hṛdayānvitam | śrotrādicaiva 
vāgādi śabdādi vacanādikam || 

tatvānāṃ viṃśatiñcaiva mukhasūtretu vinyaset | hṛtsūtre tu mano 
buddhimahaṃkāratrayaṃ nyaset || 

cittañca rāgamāyāñca kalātraṃ nābhisūtrake | vidhāñca 
niyatiṃ kālaṃ sadādhiṣṭhānasūtrake || 

śuddhamāyā śuddhakalāṃ dvitatvaṃ vinyasetkramāt | prokṣaṇaṃ 
tāḍanañcaiva hetinā ca viśeṣataḥ || 

saṃpraviśya ca kāraṃ yuktarecaka yogataḥ | ajapāntaṃ 
svacaitanyaṃ viśeṣaṃ pūrvavadbhavet || 

saṃhāramudrayā (*) trai mukhe caiva niyojayet | 

oṃ hāṃ hāṃ ātmane namaḥ vyāpakaṃ rakṣaṇañcaiva 
saṃnidhānāhutintathā | 

<p. 1584> 

nirvartyālokanañcaiva pūjanaṃ pūrvavadbhavet | evamanyeṣu 
sūtreṣu nāḍībhūteṣu yojayet || 

śiṣya caitanyamākṛṣya svātmanyeva niyojayet | 
pūrvavatpātrasaṃyogo bhāvayennandikeśvara || 

garbhādhānādi saṃskāraṃ pūrvavadvidhinā caret | tato visṛjya 
vāgīṃ vāgīśañca tathaiva ca || 

kamalāsanamāvāhya brahmāṇaṃ pūjayettataḥ | tasmai śuklāyavai 
dadyāt śrotrādyānandakāvadhi || 

tatvānāṃ viṃśatiścaiva mukhasūtre tu vinyaset | 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ sabrahmaṇe ghrāṇaṃ sohaṃ svāhā oṃ hrīṃ haṃ 
sabrahmaṇe tvacasohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ sabrahmaṇe 
cakṣustvohaṃ svāhā oṃ hrīṃ haṃ sabrahmaṇe sohaṃ svāhā | oṃ 
hrīṃ haṃ sabrahmaṇe tvacasohaṃ svāhā | vāksohaṃ svāhā | 
pāṇisohaṃ svāhā | pādau sohaṃ svāhā | pāyussohaṃ svāhā | 
oṃ sohaṃ svāhāgamanassohaṃ svāhā | visargassohaṃ svāhā | 
sparśassohaṃ svāhā | rūpassohaṃ svāhā | rasassohaṃ svāhā | 
gandhassohaṃ svāhā | vacassohaṃ svāhā | ādānassohaṃ svāhā 
gamanassohaṃ svāhā | visargassomaṃ svāhā | ānandassohaṃ svāhā 
| etairviṃśatibhirmantrairbrahmaśulkaṃ nivedayet | 

<p. 1585> 

niśśeṣadagdhapāśasya śiśostvihana | budhāya punasseyaṃ 
śivājñāṃ śrāvayediti || 

mukhasūtraṃ samādāya vartulīkṛtyapūrvavat | ājyapūrṇassruve 
datvā cāstramantreṇa homayet || 

kuṃbhasta savyanāḍyā ca brahmāṇaṃ visṛjettadā | mūlādhāre ca 
saṃsthāpya pūjayennandikeśvara || 

kalaṃkapañcamāṃśena vimuktañcandramaṇḍalam | jāgrat 
sthānātpunasvapne viṣṇusūtre niyojayet || 

pūrvavattāḍanaṃ veśavāgīśīgarbhaveśanam | saṃskāraṃ 
pūrvavatkuryāt viṣṇumāvāhayetpunaḥ || 

pūjanaṃ tarpaṇaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavannandikeśvara | 
viṣṇostavādhikāreṇa mumukṣurdīkṣayāmyaham || 

bhāvyaṃ tvayānukūlena viṣṇuṃ vijñāpayediti | viṣṇuṃ tataḥ 
kuryāt manobuddhamahaṃ kṛtim || 

oṃ hrīṃ saṃ saḥ viṣṇave namassohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ 
saḥ viṣṇave buddhiḥ sohaṃ svāhā | haṃ kārassohaṃ svāhā | 
evaṃ śulkaṃ pradadyāt | govindaṃ visṛjettadā | 

adhiṣṭhāne māvāhya sthāpayetpūjayetkramāt | 
hṛdantasūtramānīya vatulīkṛtya pūrvavat || 

ghṛtapūrṇe sruve datvā hetimantreṇa homayet | 

<p. 1586> 

kalaṃka pañcakaṃśamukta candranibhaṃ śubhaṃ bhāvayet | 

tato yena suṣuptau tu niyojayet | 

nābhisūtreṇa caitanyamardhyatoyena pūjayet | tāsānādikaṃ sarvaṃ 
saṃskārantu pūrvavat || 

rudramāvāhya sthiratvāsa (********) taḥ | niśśeṣadagdhapāśasya 
śiśostvayā || 

na baddhā punassoyaṃ śivājñāṃ śrāvayediti | bhadrāya pūrvavat 
śulkaṃ bhaktiyuktaṃ pradāpayet || 

cittarāgamamāyāñca kalāṃ tatraiva dāpayet | 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ rudrāya cittaṃ sohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃsaḥ 
rudrāya rāgaṃ sohaṃ svāhā | 

evaṃ mantraiṣkañca dāpayet bhakti saṃyutam | maṇipūrakadeśe tu 
rudrantaṃ sthāpayetkramāt || 

kalaṃkatrayaṃśa hīneñca candrabiṃba samaprabham | 
suṣuptāvaṇarmāvāhya pūjayeddhṛdayoṇunā || 

niśśeṣa dagdhapāśasya paśorasya śiśostvayā | vaddhanāya 
punasseyaṃ śivājñāṃ śrāvayettaditi || 

īśvara (*) punaśśulkaṃ dāpayenandikeśvara | vidyāñca 
niyatikālaṃ pūrvavanmantrasaṃpuṭam || 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ vidyā sohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ 
īśvarāya niyatiṃ svohaṃ svāhā || 

<p. 1587> 

oṃ hrīṃ haḥ saḥ kālaṃ sohaṃ sva (**) etaiśśulkapradānañca 
kuryāt bhakti samanvitaḥ | tasmādīśvara māvāhya 
svāpayeddhṛdayāṃbhaje | 

sthāpayitvā vidhānena bhaktiyukto jitendriyaḥ | adhiṣṭhānagataṃ 
sūtramādāyoanmṛjya pūrvavat || 

ājya pūrṇasṛgagre tu nidhāyāstreṇa homayet | pāśāṃkura 
nivṛtyādi pūrṇāhutividhiṃ caret || 

kalaṃka caturañcaiva hīnaṃ candrasamaprabham | turīyāttu tadante 
tu yojayedātmarūpakam || 

tāḍanādi vidhānañca saṃskāra (**) pūrvavat | 
sadāśivāntamāvāhya pūjayedbhaktipūrvakam || 

śuddhamāyāṃ śuddhakalāṃ śulkaṃ dadyātsamāhitaḥ | 
mūlamantreṇa saṃyojya pūrvaṃ mantraiśca homayet || 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ oṃ hauṃ sadāśivāya śuddhamāyā sohaṃ 
svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ hauṃ sadāśivāya śuddhakalāsohaṃ 
svāhā | evaṃ śulkapradānañca kartavyaṃ nandikeśvara | 

dagdha niśśeṣapāpasya paśorasya śiśostvayā | sandhāya na 
punastheyaṃ śivājñāṃ śrāvayediti || 

viśuddhadehe cāvāhya sadāvantatvamuttamam | sthāpanaṃ 
pūjanañcaiva kārayedbhakti saṃyutam || 

<p. 1588> 

atha sūtraṃ samādāya vatulīkṛtya pūrvavat | sṛgagre 
ghṛtapūrṇe tu juhuyāddhṛdayāṇunā || 

kalaṃkai rakhilairmuktaśśaradrājasamaprabham | 
śuddhatejoghanamayaṃ caitanyaṃ bhāvayetpunaḥ || 

haṃsamantrānsamādāya praṇavena tu yojayet | praṇavacchaktibīje tu 
tasmānmūlena yojayet || 

oṃ saḥ oṃ hrīṃ hauṃ caitanyāya hauṃ etanmantraṃ samuccārya 
mūlādhāre niyojayet | oṃ saḥ oṃ hrīṃ hauṃ caitanyāya hauṃ 
etanmantraṃ samuccārya mūlādhāre niyojayet | 

ciddhane nirmale śānte nitye sarvavivarjite | 
śuddhamātmānamapyasanyojayecchivabhāva yuk || 

mūlādhāraṃ samārabhya dvādaśāntāntakaṃ smaret | 
navātmamantrakaṃ rūpamuccarannāda saṃyutam || 

anenaiva tu mantreṇa darbhāgreṇa saṃspṛśet | mūlādhāraṃ 
samārabhya dvādaśānte niyojayet || 

gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ pūjya praṇāmādiṃśca kārayet | abhiṣekaṃ 
tataḥ kṛtvā śivohaṃ bhāvayedguruḥ || 

punargandhādibhiḥ pūjya śeṣāpūrvavadācaret | yogapaṭṭādikaṃ 
dadyutkavacena vidhānavit || 

jñānena yogadīkṣāyāmadhivāso na vidyate | 

<p. 1589> 

śivayāgañca visṛjet gurupādaṃ samarcayet || 

yogadīkṣā samāyuktaśśivassākṣānmahītale | 

[iti vāmadevātmajavedajñānaviracitadīkṣādarśe (*) kṣā vidhiḥ] || 
|| [atha yogajñānadīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

jñānadīkṣāṃ pravakṣyāmi satyamuktilaikṛtam | yatnañca 
śivavyāptabodhakaṃmmohavarjitam || 

pūrvadīkṣā samopetaṃ śiṣyāṇāmuttamaṃ tathā | 
śrīrabhedakamātraṃ yaṃ prāṇabhedo na kiñcana || 

evaṃ gurubhaktyā ca jñānadīkṣāñca kārayet | āṇavaṃ 
śaktisaṃbhūtaṃ śāṃbhavaṃ trividhaṃ bhavet || 

śāktaśaṃbhava dīkṣā tu kriyate tatvayamayā | 
anyairāṇavadīkṣā tu mandatīvrādi bhedataḥ || 

maṇḍapaṃ maṇḍalādiña pūrvavannandikeśvara | vicitramaṇṭapaṃ 
kṛtvā coktadravyairviśeṣataḥ || 

adhivāsanavarjaṃ vai dadhyarātre viśeṣataḥ | 
sugandhapuṣpairdhūpaiścaṃ śiṣyamābharaṇādibhiḥ || 

sugandhamakṣataṃ puṣpaṃ dhūpadīpaṃ caruntathā | sarvadravya 
samāyuktaṃ satsaṃgaiśca samanvitam || 

<p. 1590> 

dravyaśuddhiṃ tathā kṛtvā pūrvoktena vidhānataḥ | maṇḍalaṃ 
pūjayettatra madhyarātre viśeṣataḥ || 

alaṃkṛtyāsane sthāpya vajrākhyeva viśeṣataḥ | śivacittaṃ 
yathālabdhaṃ kālādhvāntaṃ tathaiva ca || 

bhūtavidyā praveṣṭavyā tato yatenana deśikaḥ | śivabhakti sadā 
yogāt sthāpanañcāmṛtantadā || 

śivamantreṇa śaktyā ca japetsammārga nāyaka | yāvat jñānamive 
budhyā sthiratvaṃ tāvadantakam || 

japitvā paramānandaṃ gurundūrāsanā param | bhāvanādyatra 
tadbūutaṃ śiṣyavaktre nidhāpayet || 

kāritañcaiva tantraiva sarasaṃ śiṣyagocaram | prāsādaṃ 
śivamantraṃ syāt vāgīśī śaktimantrakam || 

pūrvameva tu saṃsādhya māsāmmantreṇa homayet | 
svasaṃvedyādbahvet jñānaṃ saderadamakhadyutim || 

yogā rasasamāyuktā maṇḍalaṃ mudrayānvitam | nṛttagītañca 
vādyañca svecchā krīḍā pravartate || 

sadānandodbhave dehe kṣudho nidrā tathā nahi | nṛttaṃ 
kṣālitāyañca dhāvanaṃ svacchayā caret || 

saptasopāna saṃpannaṃ sopānaguṇa saṃyadam | prathamaṃ triguṇaṃ 
proktaṃ dvitīyamartha pañcakam || 

<p. 1591> 

pañcābhijñāstritīyantu caturthaṃ siddhiraṣṭakam | dvipañca 
pratyaraṃ pañca ṣaṣṭhandaśapalaṃ bhavet || 

ānandaṃ saptamaṃ sidhyaṃ te ca vicintayā | āṇavaṃ kaṃpanādi 
syāt śāntantu kavitā dvayam || 

keśādivarjitaṃ cittaṃ śāṃbhavaṃ trividhaṃ matam | 
marīciprathamukhado pradīpagamanantathā || 

svayañcameṣaṇātsarvaṃ praveśedīpapañcakam | varddhaparyayo 
jñāna smṛtipūrveṣitasya ca || 

divya cakṣuśca śrotrañca pañcābhijñānavandi ca | 
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhiñca jñānarūpeṇa sidhyati || 

nirbījakāraṇañcaiva va viṣātpraharaṇantathā | 
vanhairujvalanañcaiva nāḍyā vāyorjayantathā || 

yadbindunādamamalaṃ dehaṃ saṃkramaṇantathā | 
dhūmajyotirdarśanañca svacchandaṃ mṛtyukāryakam || 

daśapratyamevāhi aṣṭādaśabalaṃ śṛṇu | āyuṣkarma pariṣkāre 
mukti praṇatiruddhayā || 

utpattiñca balantāvat dharmacintaparaṃ phalam | tatparañca 
mahattādi sādhya satyakrameṇa vai || 

labhete jñānavaddhāderetairdaśaguṇaṃ viduḥ | sahajaṃ 
vāñcanotītaṃ akhaṇḍitaṃ ghodayam || 

<p. 1592> 

sarasi (***) sarvaṃ trailokyaitvasunāyakṣu | yogasiddhiñca 
śiṣyasya tīvrātīvrataraṃ bhavet || 

nipatiścāpi daṇḍe ca kalāvati guṇena ca | vidyādharasya vedena 
nāśamārabdhakarmaṇa || 

śāktopāyamidaṃ proktaṃ śāṃbhavaṃ (****) te | sadākhya 
cāpadaṇḍe vai va samau tu virājate || 

śuddhavidyādharādvedhā śāṃbhavopāyamīritam | śiṣyasya 
yādṛśī bhaktistādṛśīyapradāyaka || 

enairedvijanīyāka pratyayairāṇavādikān | jñātvālokya tu 
kṛpayā śivahastañca dāpayet || 

praṇāmaṃ kārayetpaścāttasya nāma ca dāpayet | 
padmadaṇḍādanādiśca pūrvavaddāpayedguruḥ || 

agnikāryaṃ kṛtāvāpi nāgnikāryakṛtaṃ bhavet | 
śarīramaṇḍalaṃ prāṇañca gurave sannivedayet || 

śarīraprāṇakañcaiva gurvanujñāsapurassaram | 
tadājñayāvānubhavaṃ satataṃ bhaktisaṃyutaḥ || 

vittantu sakalantasmai gurave tu samarpayet | svasvātantryañca 
vibhajyane sā tadā || 

vācā ca karmaṇā caiva gurvarthantu caredbudhaḥ | abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ 
kṛtvā pūrvavannandikeśvara || 

<p. 1593> 

sarvābharaṇagandhādi vastrādyābharaṇāni ca | 
alaṃkuryātpunaśśiṣyaṃ praṇatiṃ kārayedguruḥ || 

yāgadevādikāñcaiva visṛjenandikeśvara | 

|| [iti yogajñānadīkṣā vidhiḥ] || || [atha 
vijñānadīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi dīkṣāṃ vijñāna saṃyutaḥ | 
viśeṣajñānapūrvatvāt vīcītatvavijṛmbhaṇāt || 

vijñānadīkṣā sā proktā dīkṣāmuttamottamām | mantrahīnaṃ 
kriyā hīnaṃ dhyānahīnādi dīkṣite || 

paripūrṇatva siddhitvāt dīkṣāṇāntu pavitriṇī | dīyate 
tacchivatvaṃ hi sarvadā śravaṇotsukam || 

sarvadā guruśuśrūṣā vāñcchā yuktammalālupam | ājñāpālana 
saṃyuktaṃ sukhe vā duḥkha eva vā || 

asvātantryañca taddeśe kaulālīkamṛdādivat | samudrapatane caiva 
vanhau saṃpatanepi ca || 

vyāghrasarpātipatanepyājñā vedavi cāritam | sarvasvajatāsāt 
kṣiptuṃ bhakti cettena bhāṣitam || 

tatkāryeṣu pravīṇatvaṃ kartavyo nirasaṃ sadā | 

<p. 1594> 

bhūmau nikṣipya vittādīnanuyāt jñanamārgaṇam || 

mātaraṃ pitaraṃ putraṃ bhātṝñjādī (**) | yatkṛpayā pūrṇo 
gurussarvārgadāyakaḥ || 

manovyāpāramantreṇa yā (**) vidyate kramāt | sā 
dīkṣājñānadīkṣā tu vijñānākhyā savaibhavet || 

manoramye śubhe deśe manoramye tu kālake | manoramāsvavasthāsu 
ubhayossukhasāmyayoḥ || 

tadānīmeva sā dīkṣā (***) sāranāśinī | 
pañcādhārasthitāścāpi gururddehavyavsthitaḥ || 

śirodhvamaṇḍale caiva gurumaṇḍalamuttamam | sarvasākṣimayaṃ 
yattu śivaṃ paramakāraṇam || 

paścādguruḥ prasādena mantrānyāsa (**) rvavat | guroḥ pāṇitale 
caiva sthitassakala tīrthakam || 

aṃguṣṭhamūle brāhyaṃ hi karāgre devamantrayoḥ | devarṣistu 
susaṃsevya maṃguliparvasandhikam || 

manuṣyāṇā mṛṣīṇāñca kaniṣṭhāmlatīrthakam | hastamūle tu 
bhūtānāṃ tīrthamityabhidhīyate || 

tarjanyaṃguṣṭhayormadhye pitṛtīrthaṃ vyavasthitam | 
saptatīrthantu yaddhaste vidyā dānaṃ vibhāvayet || 

bindurūpāṇi tīrthāni bhāvayitvā (**) kṣaṇaḥ | 

<p. 1595> 

tasya dakṣiṇahastantu śivamantreṇa vyāpitam || 

vāmantu yuktimantreṇa vyāpitaṃ bhāvayedguruḥ | gandhaiḥ 
puṣpaiśca dīpaiśca rūpaiśśiṣyañca kārayet || 

sukhāsane samāveśya taddṛṣṭi (***) nasam | evaṃ vidho bhavet 
śiṣyo bhavedgururanantaram || 

mūladhārāgni kuṇḍotthaṃ śivāgniṃ bhāvayettadā | (**) sthāne 
ca sarpīṃṣi candramaṇḍalagāṃ sudhām || 

śivantu maṇḍale caiva (**) gniṃ sthāpya deśikaḥ | manussṛk 
budhyassruvaṃ samidhaśca kalāstathā || 

mūlakuṇṭhadhanurbāhutālumudyamya cordhgataḥ | śuddhañca 
piṃgalañcāpi somasūryañca bhāvayet || 

nādasvarūpadarbheṇa cājya ṛddhiṃ vidhāya ca | pūrvamevāgni 
siddhitvāt vinā cāgni mukhantathā || 

tāraśaktyajapāñcaiva śivañcātyanya saṃpuṭam | 
puṣpāntamantramevaṃ syāt jñānāhutiranuttamā || 

oṃ saṃ seṃ sūryasoma (*) śā na tatpuruṣābhyāṃ sohaṃ hauṃ 
svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ oṃ piṃgalanāḍīmārgeṇa mūlādhāre 
ca homayet | 

<p. 1596> 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ oṃ hāṃ īśvaramaya sohaṃ svāhā | 

umāya hunetpaścāt jalādhāre ca homayet | 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saṃ haṃ raṃ sūrya somāgnibhyāṃ sohaṃ hau svāhā 
| oṃ hrūṃ hauṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saṃ sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | 

oṃ oṃ haṃ haṃ sa tatpuruṣābhyāṃ sohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ 
sadahaṃ vāmadevāya sohaṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ sadaghora 
vāmadevābhyāṃ svāhā | sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ 
saṃ sadyojātāya soṃ haṃ hauṃ svāhā | 
sadyojātavāmadevāghoradevābhyāṃ svāhā | tatpuruṣeśānebhya 
svāhā | 

evaṃ vidhaiścamantraiśca ekīkṛtya tu homayet | 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saṃ sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | 

anenaiva tu mantreṇa tṛpyantaṃ homamācaret | 
daśāṃśamaṃśamantreṇa homayennandikeśvara || 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ nivṛttikalāyai sohaṃ haiṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ 
haṃ saḥ pratiṣṭhākalāyai sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ 
saḥ vidyākalāyai sohaṃ oṃ hauṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ 
śāntikalāyai sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | 

<p. 1597> 

śāntyātītakalāyai sohaṃ hau svāhā | 

vāgīśvaryāstu bījena homayennandikeśvara | prāsādena tu 
mantreṇa pūrṇāhutimathācaret || 

śiṣyacaitanyamākṛṣya mūlādhāreṇa ca homayet | 
tasmātpradeśādākṛṣya brahmanāḍyantare punaḥ || 

gurumaṇḍalamadhye ca sadānandomrdojvale | śiṣyātmā nañca 
saṃyojya kramāt saṃmā (*) nāyaka || 

śivarūpamidaṃ dhyātvā punarmūlena yojayet | talādi 
satyalokāntaṃ bhuvanāni tu homayet || 

māyādi bhūmiparyantaṃ ekatriṃśacca tatvakam | akārādi 
kakārānta makṣarāṇāñca manāmakam || 

vilomena ca tatsarvaṃ pratyekaṃ homamācaret | 
bhavādipraṇavāntañca caturṇṇavatī padam || 

oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ bhava sohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ haṃ sa 
bhavet bhavasohaṃ hauṃ svāhā | ityevamādi homañca manasā 
juhuyādguruḥ | nivṛtyādikalāścaiva homayennandikeśvara | 

pūrṇāhutiṃśive naiva homayecchiva bhāvataḥ | netratrayaṃ 
gurussākṣāt kṛpānandojvalākṛti || 

śivaśaktyādikaṃ budhvā śiṣyadehāṃ nirekṣayet | 

<p. 1598> 

sa tatraṃ śivayāgārthaṃ japamantrasaṃskṛtiḥ || 

candrārka nāśanañcāpi satataṃ yogabandhanam | jāgratasvapnato 
vāpi tiṣṭhataścagamāgame || 

satataṃ śivayā tena nityaṃ tiṣṭhati tiṣṭhati | śiṣ.ya 
caitanyamādāya gurumaṇḍalamadhyage || 

saṃyojya tatra saṃlīnaṃ śivarūpañca bhāvayet | śiṣyadehe ca 
saṃyojya śivamūrtiñca bhāvayet || 

saṃhārakramamārabhya ṣaḍadhvāno viśeṣataḥ | sarve śivepi 
līnañca kuryāt sammārgadāyaka || 

vācya vācaka śūnyantu mano vācāmagocaram | aprameya 
masādṛśyamaprapañca malakṣayam || 

ādyantaśūnyakaivalyaṃ mahānanda mānantakaḥ | 
parātparātaramaunamadvaitādvaitavarjitam || 

evaṃ dhyātvā mahājñānī śisyamālinya nirbhayam | taṃ mūrdhnyā 
prāya tatkāletyakhaṇḍitavapuṃ smaran || 

ānandastavatasyaiva jāyate ca na saṃśayaḥ | kaṃpassvedañca 
pulakassarvajñānasya codayam || 

saṃpadyate ca tatraiva śivarūpī ca śiṣyakaḥ | puṣpamālāñca 
tasyaiva mūrdhnītyādāya nikṣipet || 

hastābhyāmabhiṣekañca kuryā sanmārgadarśaka | 

<p. 1599> 

śaivasiddhāntayuktasya saṃjñāṃ samyak prabodhayet || 

mukhaṃ daivaṃ maṭhañcāpi darśanaṃ vāsanaṃ tathā | pañcamantu 
guhāṃ vāpi vṛkṣañca vanameva ca || 

gotragocara santāna dvādaśaṃjñānako bhavet | jñānāvaraṇakatve 
vā tasya nāma pṛthak pṛthak || 

mukhamīśānakañcāpi daivaṃ śivamihoditam | maṭhaṃ brahma ca 
vikhyātaṃ sanmārgaṃ darśanaṃ bhavet || 

jñānādi trayamityāhurāvāsaṃ parvataṃ tathā | manobhavā (*) 
matulaṃ siddhamantraṃ guhaṃ tathā || 

gajavṛkṣā vanaṃ bhūtaṃ gotraṃ śuddhañca satvakam | gocaraṃ 
śivasaṃjñā tu santānantanmayaṃ bhavet || 

evamādīṃśca saṃjñā tu satputrāya paraṃparām | 
bodhayetsarvavijñānamanenaiva vicāraṇāt || 

dīkṣāśatasahasrantu svarūpo na viśiṣyata | vijñānadīkṣā 
hīnaścet kuto mokṣaḥ kutaśśivaḥ || 

evaṃ vijñānadīkṣāyāṃ (-) dīkṣitaśśivaśiṣyo 
dīkṣottarakālaṃ vātuloktarītyā jñānapūjāṃ samārabhet | 
tathā vātule (-) 

ittha pūjājñānavati akārodbhakti mānnaraḥ | ihaiva dhanavān 
śrīmān sontemokṣamavāpnuyāt || 

[iti dīkṣādarśe yogajñānadīkṣāvidhiḥ] 

<p. 1600> 

|| [atha rudragaṇikādīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

kāmile (-) 

pratiṣṭhotsavakarmādau ante nityotsavastya ca | saukhya 
karmaprakartavyaṃ yathāvat śṛṇutadvijaḥ || 

saukhyañcarutkanyābhikartavyastadvinā mune | sasajātsarasorudraḥ 
kauśikaḥ prītikāraṇam || 

tasyāṃ cirantanaikañca tadrudragaṇikā kulam | aspṛśya 
pratilomādyai rajāyatasanātana || 

tā eva rudrakanyāstu kathyante vairdvijottamāḥ | devadāruvane 
pūrvaṃ vinodārthaṃ mayā purā || 

kalyāṇaṃ vapurāsthāya praviṣṭo dvijasattamā | tatrasthā 
munipalyo yā dṛṣṭā sādarakṣamā || 

viśliṣṭakeśavastrādyā babhūvurmadanā turā | tathā 
vidyāścatāssarvā dṛṣṭā khalumayā darā || 

tadālokanamātreṇa dadhire garbhalakṣaṇam | 
tattadgarbhabhavāyāśca tā rudragaṇikā matā || 

tadarcanantu yacchreṣṭhantatsaukhya sahitaṃ yadi | 

<p. 1601> 

tadeśa śuddhanṛttantallakṣaṇaṃ bharatoditam || 

pūjākāle niyojyantadyatprītyarthandine dine | strībhistadvaṃśa 
jātābhi pañcācārya samanvitam || 

ityevaṃ śaṃkareṇokte praṇemustāmahītale | mayā tuṣṭena tā 
sarvādīkṣayā dīkṣitā khalu || 

saṃkhyātastatkulotthābhiśśuddhaṃ nṛttaṃ prava (*) ta | nartako 
mardanaścaiva gāyakovāṃśakastathā || 

tathāmauravikaśvaiva pañcā cāryā prakītitā | 
cāturvaṇyānulomyotthanāṭyavedakṛtaśramā || 

punardīkṣā vidheyā syāt sā ca leśānnigadyate | ānukūlyaṃ dine 
svasya pañcasaṃvatsarādhiakāḥ || 

pañcāśadvatsarāntāśca yogyā nevetarāḥ kvacit | maṇṭapaṃ 
saukhya nṛttākhyaṃ kārayelakṣaṇānvitam || 

sarve ca maṇṭapaṃ kārya nivṛtyādi kalā mayā | tanmadhye 
vidyātavyaṃ śuddhanṛttaṃ yathā vidhi || 

naṭeśa maṇṭapebhyarcya sāṃgaṃ gandhādibhistathā | 
āhūyarudragaṇikāḥ prokṣayecchaṃkha vāriṇā || 

pañcākṣarābhijaptena devāgre lepite purā | āsanaṃ praṇavantatra 
kalpayettasya madhyame || 

kālitaṃ vetramādāya mūrddhādikramaśo nyaset | 

<p. 1602> 

śivāya nama ityeva samastaśirasi nyaset || 

gandhādinā samabhyarcya prāgvetraṃ punararcayet | nāmoktā 
nandipūrvantu saṃbudhyantaṃ yathā bhavet || 

nāmāntarañca dāsādi daṇḍāntamahattaram | tāmādāya tato 
dadyāt gurave jalasaṃyutaḥ || 

punarādāya puṣpāṇi śivāya nivedayet | madīyotsavakālādau 
tāvattasyānurūpataḥ || 

evaṃ prasādya taddhaste prakṣipetpuṣpasaṃgame | tataḥ 
pañcanaṭītyādi nṛttaṃ yadbharateditam || 

śivaprītikaraṃ saukhyaṃ kārayecchivasannidhau | evaṃ strīṇāntu 
dīkṣā syāt pañcācāryeṣu kathyate || 

deśikasya gṛhe vātha svagṛhe vā manorame | 
deśāntaravāraṃgeśaṃ samabhyārcyāgaṃ saṃyutam || 

vinyasya tatpuraḥ kuṃbhaṃ sva vastrādisaṃyutam | pañcākṣareṇa 
śataśastattoyamabhimantrayet || 

pañcāryān kṛtasnātā śuklavastrādibhiryutān | tadaṃbhasā tu 
saṃprokṣya (*) raḥ kūrcena saṃspṛśet || 

pañcākṣara samopetaṃ tadā karmādhikāritaḥ | praveśe 
rudrakanyānāṃ ādau saṃkṣipya kathyate || 

nirdiṣṭa divasetpūrvaṃ maṃgalāṃkuramācaret | 

<p. 1603> 

prāsādasya caturdikṣu pūrvaṃ syānmaṇṭapadvayam || 

vidhāya madhye pīṭhe (****) vaśānnayet | pūrvasmin maṇṭape 
kuṇḍaṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ vā tadagrataḥ || 

niṣpādya devade (********)
|| 

prāyaścintu kartavyamastreṇa vidhinā bhavet | 

oṃ hāṃ viṣṇo budhyahaṃkārarūpa śulkaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā | 

pratibandhāya vijñāpya viṣṇorvisarjanaṃ bhavet | ātmanyādāya 
caitanyaṃ savātmanyeva viśeṣataḥ || 

saśirassūtramadhye ca yojaye nandikeśvara | ardhyāmṛtāṃbu 
bindūni śiṣyamūrdhni vinikṣipet || 

vidyātatvasya śudhyarthaṃ pūrṇāhutividhiñcaret | sandhyāyā 
tadaddhena śivatatvaṃ vilokayet || 

śiracchikhāntaṃ vinyasya vyāpakaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ bhavet | santāḍya 
tatvamādāya vanhau nikṣipya tarpayet || 

śivasyāvāhanaṃ paścāt pūjanaṃ tarpaṇaṃ caret | 
tavarudrādhikāresmin mumukṣundīkṣayāmyaham || 

rudraṃ vijñāpayediti | 

śiṣyacaitanyamādāya praviśyāntato guruḥ | 

<p. 1604> 

svātmanyeva sthitaṃ kṛtvā gurummaṇḍalakaṃ yajet || 

udbhavena samādāya vāgīśī garbhanālake | niyojayetkramādbhūyo 
janasyāsyāhutitrayam || 

mūlena paśca (*) gaśca hetinā homamācaret | tirodhānāya 
pāśānāṃ śodhanāya viśeṣataḥ || 

pāśānāñcchedanārthāya prāyaścittañcapūrvavat | rudrasya 
pūjanaṃ kṛtvā tasyā śulkasamarpaṇam || 

oṃ hāṃ rudramano bindusvarūpaśulkaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā | 

saṃpūjya (**) rthāceśaṃ visṛjettadanantaram | svasmin śiṣyasya 
caitanyaṃ nivesyakṣaṇamādarāt || 

recakeṇāti saṃśuddhaṃ śiṣyadehe niyojayet | amṛtopamamardhyañca 
śiṣyamūrdhni nikṣipet || 

śivatatvasya śudhyarthaṃ pūrṇāhuti mathācaret | 

oṃ haṃ śikhāyai huṃ phaḍiti mantreṇa japtayā kartaryā hetinā 
caiva chedayet pūrvavacchikhāṃ (-) 

gomayāntaṃ niveśyaināmājyapūrṇasruci sthitām | tacchikhāñca 
vidhānena homayet kṣālayetsrucau || 

diśikopi tata snāyāt bhasmanā bhāvasaṃyutam | 
vāribhisnāpayecchiṣyaṃ kramārakta vidhānataḥ || 

yojanāya tadātmānaṃ punarājyaṃ niyojyet | pūrvokta vidhinādāya 
sruksruvādūrdhva vigrahaḥ || 

<p. 1605> 

brahmādikāraṇatyāga kramānmūlaṃ samuccaran | 
śivohamityahaṃkārī bodharūpe pareśive || 

ājyadhārāñca visṛjecchiṣyātmānaṃ niyojayet | 
ṣaṭguṇāpādānaṃ kṛtvā yathāpūrvavadācaret || 

taccaitanyaṃ śirodeśe samāptena niyojayet | pūrvoktaiśca 
guṇaissarvai prapañca cāravarjitaḥ || 

āgamoktaguṇairyukto gurudhyāna parāyaṇaḥ | evamātmani tasyoktaṃ 
bahistadabhiṣecayet || 

evaṃ tritatvapakṣānte proktantatsarvamācaret | 

samayācāra iti śeṣaḥ | [iti dīkṣādarśe tritatvakarmadīkṣā 
vidhiḥ] || 

|| [athaikatatva dīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

samayātītatatvānāṃ proktādīkṣā viśeṣataḥ | 
sādhāraṇaguṇānāñca śiṣyāṇāmabhidhīyate || 

atīva guṇasaṃpanno vratī śiṣyo viśeṣataḥ | ekatatva 
kriyāntasya kuyādvai pāśamocanam || 

yadivā sarvadīkṣāñca kārayennandikeśvara | 
prayaścittārthakatvepi deśikasvecchayāpi yā || 

maṇḍalaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kuṃbhaṃ liṃgārcana vidhistathā | 

<p. 1606> 

agnikāryañca cārdhyañca mantrāṇāndīpanādikam || 

pūrvavatkarmakurvīta deśiko bhāvasaṃyutaḥ | 
pūrvavatsūtrabandhañca kuryācchīṣyasya mūrdhni || 

kālāgnyādi śivāntantu kalpayettatvakaṃ kramāt | 
pāśādhiṣṭhātrikakṣaṃ śaktiṃ jñānarodhā tathāmataḥ || 

tataḥ pañcakalāvyāpītaṃ śivatve niyojayet | 

oṃ hāṃ hūṃ hāṃ mantrapadādigarbhitāya śivatatvapāśāya 
namaḥ | tāḍanādibhissaṃyojya sūtrebandhanamācaret | 
śivamiṣṭvā mūrdhni śataṃ hutvādhivāsayet | oṃ hāṃ hauṃ 
rudrasparśarūpaṃ budhyahaṃkāramano bindurūpaśulkaṃ gṛhāṇa 
svāhā iti prārthya nivṛtyarthamātmānaṃ yojayettataḥ | 

visṛjya pūrvāndatvā tatvaṃ śivāṇunā | oṃ hrāṃ hrūṃ hyaiṃ 
hāṃ śivatatva śivaśaktibhyānnama iti sandhāya śikhāyāṃ 
śikhāṃ hutvā vagāhayet | tatrāpi pūrvavatkṛtvā bhūta 
śudhyādikaṃ kuru | saṃyojya pūrṇamātmānaṃ guṇānāpādya 
pūrvavat | 

mūlena pūrṇāñjuhuyāt prāto pagarbhitam | pāśanirvāṇamevaṃ hi 
śivasāyujya siddhaye || 

śataṃ mūlena juhuyāt atasthitvā pāśanāśane | pūrṇāhutiṃ 
purā kuryādabhiṣeka mathācaret || 

maṇḍalasyāvalokanañca nāmācārādipūrvavat | 

<p. 1607> 

śarīramarthaṃ prāṇañca sadgurubhyo nivedayet || 

yenakena prakāreṇa gurusantoṣaṇaṃ param | yāgañca 
visṛjedekamekatatva vidhikramaḥ || 

evamādikriyā dīkṣā saṃpanno guṇasattamaḥ | 

|| [iti ekatatvadīkṣāvidhiḥ] || || [atha vratoddhāravidhirucyate] || 

adhunā sāvadhau samyak vratoddhāraśca kathyate | avadhau pūjito 
śiṣyo gurorvāpayedidam || 

yathāsāmarthyametāvat kālaṃ nirvahitaṃ vratam | mamedānī 
maśaktasya kṛpayākārya tarpaṇe || 

iti yāgaṃ vidhāyātha śiṣyābhyukṣaṇato guruḥ | 

taduktaṃ cintyaviśve (-) 

dvividhaṃ brahmacaryaṃ hi naiṣṭhikaṃ bhautikaṃ tathā | ājanma 
brahmacaryantu yathāśrammaraṇāntikam || 

satyavādyarpitaśśādhīkṣamāśakto dṛḍhavrataḥ | bhikṣāśī 
deharakṣārthamekakālaṃ guṇorgṛhe || 

gurosthāne vasennityamanyagehe na ca svapet | svasvādikaṃ hitvā 
gurusvātantrya saṃyutaḥ || 

naiṣṭhikaṃ brahmacaryaṃ hi bhautikānāṃ vidhiṃ śṛṇu | 

<p. 1608> 

kālaṃ saṃkalpyavidhinā pūrvavadbrahmacārikam || 

ante vrateśvaraṃ yāgaṃ kṛtvodvāhantu taccaret | 
gṛhasthācaraṇaṃ kuryādvividhaṃ brahmacaryakam || 

tathā niśvāsa kāriyām | 

naiṣṭhikaṃ brhmacarye tu sthitā iva ca mānavāḥ | 
teṣāmuddhāraṇārthāya mayā tu kathitantava || 

liṃgoddhāra viroddhayaiṣā kathitastava sruvrate | 
naiṣṭhikānāntukartavyaṃ liṃgoddhāraṃ samīritam || 

kālottare (-) 

liṃgoddhāraṃ pravakṣyāmi naiṣṭhikānāntu ṣaṇmukha | 
pañcārdhakālavaktrāṇāṃ sarvapāṣaṇḍināmapi || 

trirātraṃ pañcarātraṃ vā kṣapayitvādhivāsayet | hṛnmantreṇa 
tu kurvīta vratasaṃbhāra buddhimān || 

mātrakaṃ vinyasettatra vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tadvrateśvarayāgantu śṛṇutvaṃ nandikeśvara | yāgasthānamalaṃ 
kṛtya puṣpamālātiśobhitam || 

gomayālepanaṃ kṛtvā maṇṭapaṃ caturaśrakam | 

maṇṭapalakṣaṇaṃ kālottare pratipāditam | 

pañcābjaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi vratānāñca samarpaṇe | 

<p. 1609> 

liṃgoddhāre ca kartavyaṃ aṇimādikasiddhaye || 

pañcahastasamekṣetre samantādindrabhājite | dvipadaṃ kamalaṃ 
dadhye vīthikā paṭhikā tathā || 

caturdikṣu catuḥ padma madhyavatparivartayet | tadbahiḥ pathikā 
vīthī dvārāṇi dvipadāni ca || 

kaṇṭhopakaṇayuktāni vicitraṃ koṇasaṃgamam | madhyābjaṃ 
susthitaṃ kāryaṃ vītakarṇikakesaram || 

āpīnaṃ pūrvapadmantu vaiḍūryābhantu dakṣiṇam | 
uktandaradābhañca kundābhaṃ vāruṇāṃbujam || 

raktābhaṃ prathamāvīthī kāñcanābhā parāmatā | lokeśa 
pratirūpāṇi dvārāṇi śikhi vāhana || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

īśānādyakrameṇaiva madhyapadmādipañcake | pañcabrahmasvarūpeṇa 
pūjayeddeśikottamaḥ || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

dvibhujāṃstveka vaktrāśca triṇetrāḥ padmamadhyagāḥ | 
dhyātavyāssādhakendreṇa savarṇaidikṣu saṃsthitāḥ || 

tripadmanayanānyāya tathā daśabhujaṃ smaret | evaṃ vrajeśvarāḥ 
proktāḥ pūjanīyāstu pūrvavat || 

snānañcopoṣitaṃ śiṣyaṃ pañcamudrā samanvitam | 

<p. 1610> 

praveśya yāgapūjāpi tena kuṃbhena pāvakān || 

sthaṇḍileśaṃ praṇamyātha gururvijñāpayediti | bhagavan sa (*) 
dherasya vrataṃ tatvavyayā purā || 

vratoddhārañca kartavyo māmadhiṣṭhāya sāṃpratam | 
evaṃstvityanujñāya śivādhiṣṭhita vigrahaḥ || 

vratāṃgasaṃkhyayā hutvā pratyekantuśataṃ śatam | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tattanmantraṃ śataṃ japtvā bhaktiyukto vrateśvaram | vijñāpya 
vratamīśāya vratapūrṇatvaṃ (*) tave || 

pañcabhiḥ kalaśaiścaiva pañcabrahmādi sādhitaiḥ | tenaiva 
snāpayecchiṣyaṃ vratamuktyai ca deśikaḥ || 

vrateśvaraṃ namaskṛtvā atyantaṃ śrāvayedvratam | 
tadabhāvājjapelliṃgantadabhāvādviśeṣataḥ || 

añjanaṃ mṛdbhavaściava gomayodbhūtaliṃgakam | bījaṃ 
śaikatodbhūtaṃ nadītīrādikodbhavam || 

saṃpūjya bhaktisaṃyukto vrataṃ stvantakāraṇān | 
vyomavyāpyaśivenaiva jalenaiva vinikṣipet || 

vapanaṃ varjayitvā tu anyatsarvaṃ samaṃbhavet | brahmacarya 
vratasnāna mauktiratrābhidhīyate || 

pūrvokta pañcapadmeṣu sadyojātādipūjayet | 

<p. 1611a> 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

tarpayitvā praṇamyeśaṃ vratameṣāṃ samarpayet | jaṭāsamarpaṇaṃ 
kāryamīśānena prayatnataḥ || 

daṇḍañcaiva tu kaupīnaṃ puruṣe ca samarpayet | 
bhasmādhāramaghorāya bhikṣāpātrantathottare || 

brahmacaryaṃ prayatnena sadyojātāya nirvapet | vrataṃ 
samarpayitvāya tena tena visarjanam || 

vratāṃgaṃ pañcakaṃ hyetat pratyekantu śataṃ hunet | pañca brahma 
ṣaḍaṃgaiśca homayeddeśikottamaḥ || 

upoṣita śirobhṛṃgo upanīyāṃbhakāni vai | 
sadyojātādibhirmantraiścaṇḍanāthāya dāpayet || 

samarpya vidhinā caiva pravāhena tu vinyaset | 

kiraṇe (-) 

iti kriyāvidhirvāset dvitīyenhi punaḥ kramaḥ | gṛhasthasya 
yathāceha tahā tenaiva tat sthitiḥ || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

āhataṃ vastrayugmañca dadyācchiṣyāya deśikaḥ | 
kanyakāmanurūpāñca kulīnāṃ pariṇeṣyati || 

evaṃ muktvā kṛtaṃ śiṣyaṃ gārhasthye niyojayet | vānaprastho 
gṛhasthoya brahmacarya yutopi vā || 

sanyāsavrata sidhyarthaṃ pūrvāśrama vimuktaye | 

<p. 1611b> 

|| atha liṃgināṃ vratavidhirucyate || 

tathoktaṃ sarvajñānottare (-) 

yohyasminnāśrito liṃgī tadā taṃ pūjayettataḥ | tarpayitvā tu 
tatsamyak prāyaścittaṃ viśodhayet || 

pañcarātraṃ trirātraṃ vā kṣapayitvā ṣaḍānana | 
paścādaṣṭasahasrantu astrabījena homayet || 

bhūyopyaṣṭa sahasrantu mūlamantreṇa homayet | hutvā dīkṣā 
parākāryā saṃsārārṇavatāriṇī || 

eṣāṃ punarnirvāṇa dīkṣākāryetyarthaḥ | 

[iti liṃgināṃ bhūtavidhiḥ] || 

[atha bauddhādīnāṃ vratoddhāravidhirucyat] | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

śaivānāntu (**) tītau saṃkṣepāt kathitaṃ kramāt | 
bauddhādanyānyaliṃgasthāttattat samayakalpitāt || 

vratamukti viśeṣāṃśca śaivaprāptiṃ śṛṇu kraśat | buddhitatve 
sthitā bauddhā jaṭinā guṇamastake || 

vedājñāstu taddyonau puruṣa bhagavanmukha | māyā (**) pāśupatā 
vidyātatve mahāvratāḥ || 

amīṣāṃ vratacinhantu liṃgoddhāravidhīryathā | 
buddhitatvāvṛthāvantaṃ tatvaṃ vrataṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 

upasthāpya saṃjñābhirekaikaṃ vā prapūjayet | 

<p. 1612> 

svasvanāmnā ca mantreṇa hutvā snmārganāyakam || 

bahi nāmayaiteṣānnāḍī yojanapūrvakam | kṛtvā 
tāḍanaviśleṣamātmarṣaṃ svātmanisthitam || 

sahasrantena mūlena tadyotañjātavedasi | iṣṭandevārcanaṃ 
puṇyaphaladhvaṃsāya homayt || 

astreṇāṣṭasahasrāṇi liṃginaṃ liṃginaṃ prati | pañca pañca ca 
mūlena pratitatva vimuktaye || 

uddhṛtya buddhi tatvādi vyājyantattanniyojayet | pūrvācārañca 
jātañca samuddhṛtya niyojayet || 

pūrṇāntu mūlamantreṇa yajedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam | vratāṃgāni 
jalāni kṣiptvā tadā pāśupadena ca || 

paścādvastrayugandatvā dīkṣākarma samācaret | yatīnāmāśrame 
cainaṃ gārhasthyaivā niyojayet || 

pūrvācārañca jātañca samuddhṛtya niyojayet | pūrṇāntu 
mūlamantreṇa yajedaṣtottaraṃ śatam || 

tattadīikṣānusāreṇa dīkṣayettaṃ viśeṣataḥ | sthaṇḍile 
cāgramantrāṇi visṛjyāstreṇaśodhayet || 

tathā pañcārdha kālavaktādīnāṃ liṃgoddhāra vidhānaṃ 
ṣaṭsahasrikāyāṃ pradarśitam | tadyathā īśvaraḥ (-) 

<p. 1613> 

liṃgoddhāraṃ pravakṣyāmi naiṣṭhikānāntu ṣaṇmukha | 
pañcārdhakālavaktrāṇāṃ sarvapāṣaṇḍināmapi || 

pañcarātraṃ trirātraṃ vā kṣapayitvādhivāsayet | hṛnmantreṇa 
tu kurvīta vratasaṃbhārabuddhimān || 

mātṛkāṃ vinyasettatra vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā | aṣṭapatraṃ 
likhetpadmaṃ vidhikā carabhūṣitam || 

sahasrārakramayogena mātṛkāṃ tatra pūjayet | pūjayitvā 
vidhānena pūrvavaddhomamācaret || 

pañca pañcāhutirdadyāt prativarṇā yathākramam | hṛnmantreṇa 
prakurvīta saṃsāreṇātha buddhimān || 

evaṃ kṛtvā yathāpūrvaṃ janayettatra naiṣṭhikam | iti 
saṃhārikīṃ skandakṛtvā vai naiṣṭhikasya tu || 

sṛṣṭi saṃhārayogena kṛtvā budhyati naiṣṭhikam | āsakto viṣaye 
vāpi karmadoṣairna lipyate || 

iti pāṣaṇḍikānāntu yatīnāṃ bhāvitātmanām | liṃgoddhāraḥ 
prakartavyo gṛhīścāpādanāviti || 

|| [iti dīkṣādarśe vratoddhāravidhiḥ ]|| || [atha 
mṛtakīdīkṣāvidhirucyate] || 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

dīkṣāhīnasya bhaktasya mṛtau dīkṣāyutasya ca | 

<p. 1614> 

jīvantopi ca vāñcchā cet mṛtadīkṣā vidhīyate || 

tathā sarvajñānottare (-) 

nāprāptopi parāṃ dīkṣāṃ gurubhaktopāḥ nataḥ | 
kālenāṇusthito yasmāsyāntasya mokṣaḥ kathaṃ bhavet || 

kiṃ vṛthā tasya saṃkleśo mokṣamuddiśya yaḥ kṛtaḥ | 
kathañcidvidyate karma tasya yanmokṣa sādhanam || 

gurubhaktāya dāntāya satyācārāya suvrata | mṛtasyāpi 
varaṃskanda dīkṣākarma vidhīyate || 

asyaiva devāntare vipannasyā prāptadīkṣasyāpi 
mṛtakadīkṣāñcāntyeṣṭiñca prakṛtau kuryāt | 

devāntare mṛtasyāpi antyeṣṭirdīkṣitasya tu | mṛtapratikṛtiṃ 
kṛtvā kartavyā ca kuśairapi || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tataḥ kuśaiśca tarubhiḥ palāśaiśvatthaiśca pallavaiḥ | 
ṣaṭtriṃśadanvitaiḥ kuryāḥ pratimāyāntu lakṣaṇam || 

piṣṭena pañcagavyena karābhistāñca secayet | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

athavā vyomasaṃsthāne gomayena ṣaḍanana | sammiśraṃ pañcagavyena 
kṛtvā tasminniyojayet || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

madakṣiṇa bhāge tu pratimāṃkusumāsane | saṃsthāpya karavīrottha 
mukulainyāsamācaret || 

<p. 1615> 

athavā vyomasaṃstheti gomayena ca bhasmanā | pañcagavyena 
saṃsnāpya sāmnāntatra tu bhāvayet || 

vāmāṃ jyeṣṭhāñca raudrīñca śaktitrayaṃ hṛdi nyaset | 
yamadharmāśca karmāṇi sarvāṇyapi ca vinyaset || 

mahājālaka mantreṇa saṃsthitāya kutra kutracit | 

oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ hūmātmane namaḥ | anenamantreṇākṛṣya 
āṇavamāyeya karmākhya malatrayam | etattarpaṇabandhāya 
svasvanāmnā ca homayet | pañcapañcāhutīrhutvā 
vinyasenmastakāditaḥ | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

tatastu mūrdhni ārabhya yāvatpādāntikaṃ nyaset | 

sarvatatvāni tadyathā (-) 

brahmarandhrordhve oṃ hāṃ rodhaśaktaye namaḥ | 

brahmāṇḍa (-) oṃ hāṃ bindurūpāya śiva tatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śivatatvaśivāya śivāya namaḥ | 

brahmarandhrādhomurdhni oṃ hāṃśaktitatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śaktitatvādhipataye śaktimate namaḥ | 

mūrdhnāyo varṇikordhve oṃ hāṃ sadāśivatatvāya namaḥ | 
sadāśiva tatvādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ | ghaṇṭikādhaḥ 
skandaparyantam | oṃ hāmīśvara tatvāya namaḥ | 
īśvaratatvādhipataye śaktimate namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
śuddhavidyātatvādhipataye śaṃbarāya namaḥ | 

vāmapārśve oṃ hāṃ māyātatvāya namaḥ | māyātatvādhipataye 

<p.1616> 

garhaneśāya namaḥ | 

dakṣiṇapārśve (-) oṃ hāṃ kālatatvāya namaḥ | 
kālatatvādhipataye kālanāmne namaḥ | 

urasi (-) oṃ hāṃ kalātatvāya namaḥ | kalātatvādhipataye 
jñānabindave namaḥ | 

hṛdaye (-) oṃ hāṃ niyati tatvāya namaḥ | niyati tatvādhipataye 
niyāmakāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vidyātatvāya namaḥ | 
vidyātatvādhipataye vijñānāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rāgatatvāya 
namaḥ | rāgatatvādhipataye kāmadāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
puruṣatatvāya namaḥ | puruṣatatvādhipataye sūkṣmadehāya namaḥ | 

udare (-) oṃ hāṃ prakṛti tatvāya namaḥ | prakṛti tatvādhipataye 
vṛthānakāya namaḥ | 

pṛṣṭhavaṃśe (-) oṃ hāṃ guṇatatvāya namaḥ | guṇatatvādhipataye 
tridehāya namaḥ | 

nābhimeḍhrāntare (-) oṃ hāṃ buddhitatvāya namaḥ | buddhi 
tatvādhipataye buddhāya namaḥ | 

trisaṃdhiṣu oṃ ahaṃkaratatvāya namaḥ | ahaṃkāratatvādhipataye 
ahaṃkṛte namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ manastatvāya namaḥ | 
manastatvādhipataye saṃkalpāya namaḥ | 

śrotre (-) oṃ hāṃ śrotratatvāya namaḥ | śrotra tatvādhipataye 
vyomacarāya namaḥ | 

tvaci (-) oṃ hāṃ tvaktatvāya namaḥ | tvak tatvādhipataye 
sarvāṃgāya namaḥ | 

cakṣuṣi (-) oṃ hāṃ cakṣustatvāya namaḥ | cakṣustatvādhipataye 
prakāśāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1617> 

jihvāyām (-) oṃ hāṃ jihvātatvāya namaḥ | jihvā tatvādhipataye 
mahāvaktrāya namaḥ | 

nāsāyām (-) oṃ hāṃ nāsātatvāya namaḥ | mahānāsādhipataye 
viliṃpakāya namaḥ | 

vāci (-) oṃ hāṃ vāktatvāya namaḥ | vāktatvādhipataye dundubhaye 
namaḥ | 

pāṇyoḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ pāṇitatvāya namaḥ | pāṇitatvādhipataye 
samādānāya namaḥ | 

pādayoḥ (-) oṃ hāṃ pādatatvāya namaḥ | pādatatvādhipataye 
gamanāya namaḥ | 

pāyau (-) oṃ hāṃ pāyutatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvādhipataye 
kukkṛte namaḥ | 

upasthe (-) oṃ hāṃ upasthatatvāya namaḥ | upasthatatvādhipataye 
ghanānandāya namaḥ | 

nābhau (-) oṃ hāṃ śabdatatvāya namaḥ | śabdatatvāya 
sūkṣmanādāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ sparśatatvāya namaḥ | 
sparśatatvādhipāya balavattarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rūpatatvāya 
namaḥ | rūpatatvādhipāya bhānumate namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ rasatatvāya 
namaḥ | rasatatvādhipāya jaladāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ gandha tatvāya 
namaḥ | gandhatatvādhipāya gandhāṃgāya namaḥ | 

yonyām (-) oṃ hāṃ vyomatatvāya namaḥ | vyoma tatvādhipāya 
sūkṣmāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvāya namaḥ | 
vāyutatvādhipāya mātariśvane namaḥ | yonyābhyantare dik sthāne | 
oṃ hāṃ agnitatvāya namaḥ | agnitatvādhipāyatvibānnidhaye namaḥ 
| yonyadhaḥ jānumaṇḍalāvadhi | oṃ hāṃ jalatatvāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1618> 

jalatatvādhipāya jaleśāya namaḥ | 

jānvadhaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pṛthivītatvāya namaḥ | 
pṛthivītatvādhipāya śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ | 

gulpādikalake (-) oṃ hāṃ brahmalokāya namaḥ | brahmalokādhipāya 
brahmaṇe namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ viṣṇulokāya namaḥ | 
viṣṇulokādhipāya viṣṇave namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śivalokāya namaḥ | 
śivalokādhipataye śivāya namaḥ | 

gulpādyaḥ pādapṛṣṭhe (-) oṃ hāṃ pātālāya namaḥ | 
pātālādhipataye hāṭakeśvarāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ narakāya namaḥ 
| narakādhipataye kūśmāṇḍāya namaḥ 

pādāṃguṣṭhe (-) oṃ hāṃ kālāgnaye namaḥ | kālāgnyādhipataye 
īśvarāya namaḥ | paraśivādi kālāgnirudrāntaṃ vinyaset kramāt 
itthaṃ dhyātvā sṛṣṭikrameṇa pūjya śuddhistu 
prāgvatsaṃhārakrameṇa pādādārabhya karmakuryāt | tathā 
sarvajñānottare (-) 

pādādārabhya tānsarvān agnau saṃsthāpya śodhayet | yāgaṃ 
yathocitaṃ kṛtvā taistairyoni manukramāt || 

kalpayitvā yathā pūrvaṃ paṃ vaṃ saṃhṛtya yojayet | 
garbhādhānāditaḥ kṛtvā sarvakarmāṇi pūrvavat || 

kṛtvā tu sarvatatveṣu tathā saṃgacchecchive | kṣīrājya dadhi 
saṃiśrān sūcyagre sa vyavasthitān || 

kṛtvāgnau homayetpaścāt tāntu puntalikāṃ budhaḥ | arcayitvā 
krameṇaiva tasya hṛdayamadhyame || 

<p. 1619> 

bodhanānukramañcaiṣā paśumāśritya susthitam | sañcintya 
pūrvavadrūpaṃ yathā nāḍīṃ vicintaye || 

śaktitrayaṃ nyasettāsu dharmādharmā ca ṣaṇmukha | 

tadānyātmanaṃ nānā mahājāla prayogeṇāvāhya susthāpya 
pūrvavande (-) 

janikāntaṃ sarvaṃ vidhāya pūrvavaddahet | saṃdhāyatatvāgni 
yathā kṛtvā śivaṃ nayet || 

kālottare (-) 

yatra kutracidācārya padevā saṃsthitaṃ tataḥ | tadante 
mṛtajīvantu vyomaśenāṃ saha smaret || 

agniṃ visṛjya tadbhasma gaṃgeṃbhasmi nikṣipet | evaṃ 
dīkṣātrayasyoktā jīvajñīpīha ṣaṇmukha || 

|| [iti mṛtakadīkṣāvidhiḥ] || 

|| [athāntyeṣṭi vidhiḥ] || 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

evaṃ dīkṣātvayā khyātā mṛtānāmapi śaṃkaraḥ | atha 
dīkṣāsamāyukto bhavatyā cāravarjitaḥ || 

śrīkālottare (-) 

kṣatriya viṭchūdra praśceśātyanya jātiṣu | sarveṣānnaiva 
dīkṣāyā sā dīkṣā prathameṣṭikā || 

bhūtānte caivakartavyā antyeṣṭirabhidhīyate | 
prāyaścittamakṛtvā tu vipanno mucyate katham || 

<p. 1620> 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi samayācāra laṃghane | tathā viśudhyate 
dehī vipannopi ṣaḍānana || 

ajñānāt jñānato vāpi kṛtetvantyeṣṭi karmaṇi | evaṃ vimucyate 
dehī samayādi vilaṃghane || 

kāmike (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vātha vaiśyaśūdrānu lomajāḥ | 
ācāryāssādhakā vāssyuḥ putrakāssamayāsthitāḥ || 

gatāsavo yadā teṣāṃ kāryāntyeṣṭistu dīkṣite | 
ācāryāvitrayāṇāṃ syāttatva śuddhisamanvitā || 

antyeṣṭividhiranyasya tatvaśuddhi vivarjitā | 
ācāryādyāstrayaścaite yathācāravivarjitāḥ || 

prāyaścittamakurvāṇāmṛ (*) satvantyeṣṭi karmaṇā | 
tatvaśudhyādi nityādi karmasamyaganuṣṭhitam || 

parihṛtya niṣiddhañca yaisteṣāma pramādinam | tatvaśuddhi 
vihāyaiva kevalāntyeṣṭirucyate || 

deśaḥ kṛtā vidya utkrānti brahmarandhrādi bhedataḥ | 
yogavidbhinnateṣāñca kathyate tatvaśodhanam || 

atrotkrāntilakṣaṇaṃ ṣaṭsahasrikāyāmuktam | āsanaṃ padmakaṃ 
badhvā yathāsukhamathāpi vā || 

(**) kaṃ kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtā yogasidhyavasānakam | haṃsacaikabhedena 
kapālaṃ bhedayetsudhīḥ || 

<p.1621> 

kramādullaṃghya tatvāni śulkandatvā ca vanhinā | nādarecaka 
yogena praviśetpadamavyayam || 

iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktā utkrāntistavasuvrata | 

sārdhatriśatikāyām (-) 

mūrdhni cittaṃ samāsthāya manasoccārayeddharam | śanaiśśanaiḥ 
samākṛṣya bāhyanāḍyāṃ vyavasthitam || 

rudrabhaktyā sato dhyāye kuṇḍalyagreruṇaprabham | yāvṛtaṃ 
ghaṭikāmārga tato hikkāṃ ca kārayet || 

saṃpūjya prakṣipetskanda vāyuṃ śrotre vyavasthitam | 
niśśodhyordhvantu kurvīta yāvattatsvastikaṃ gatam || 

sadāśivantu tasyordhvaṃ bindunādaṃ tato pari | bindunādaṃ 
parityajya tataśśaktimanuvrajet || 

śaktiṃ tyaktvā vrajetyantaṃ śivaṃ paramakāraṇam | tatra gatvā 
na jāyeta pratijñā na tu putraka || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

na ca piṇḍakriyā kuryā na ca tasyodakakriyā | kintu 
śiṣyaissadākāryamanṛṇārthaṃ śivārcanam || 

patitānāndahanakriyā nāstīti kūrmapurāṇe pratipāditam | 

tadyathā (-) 

patitānājnadāhaṃ syāntāntyeṣṭirnāsthisañcayaḥ | nā 
cāśrupātaṃ piṇḍañca kāryaṃ śrāddhādiṣu kvacit || 

<p.1622> 

viśiṣṭasamayinopi nirvāṇa dīkṣārthino guruśūśrūṣaṇa 
parasyāprāptadīkṣasya mṛtasyādhvaśuddhi sahitā kāryā | 
taduktaṃ kāmike (-) 

viśiṣṭa samayasyasya hīnasyottaradīkṣayā | nirvāṇa 
dīkṣākartavyā mametyāhita cetasaḥ || 

vipannasyāpi pātatva śudhyantyeṣṭirihocyate | 

niśvāse (-) 

dīkṣā saṃśuddhadeho pañcatve samupāgate | samayācāradoṣasya 
pramādāt skhalitasya ca || 

antyeṣṭistu śivenaiva prāyaścittaviśuddhaye | 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

amukta saṃśayānāntu samayānāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
śāstrāntaraprapannānāṃ tathā suptakriyāsu ca || 

antyeṣṭistu tataḥ kāryā nānyathā paramāpnuyāt | 

tathā sārdhatriśati kāyām | 

dīkṣitastūttare kāle samayānyastu lāghate | devasya ca 
guruṇāñca māhāpātakabhāk bhavet || 

amuktasaṃśayā ye cānye samalātmakāḥ | teṣāṃ 
pāpāpanodārthamantyeṣṭirvihitā guha asya nirvacanaṃ vātule 
pradarśitam | 

antyantu parantatva miṣṭistatva praveśanam | vidhinā 
yogamārgeṇātyantyeṣṭirabhidhīyate || 

<p. 1623> 

kāmike (-) 

asya prāṇaviyogākhyakāle jantosssamāgate | vidhānasnānamāgneya 
mantassannaddhavigrahaḥ || 

mumukṣośca tathā jñeyaṃ mantrakāryaṃ vidhāya ca | mantrakāyasya 
śabdena aṃganyāsādirucyate || 

aṣṭapuṣpikayādeva marcayitvāsu mumukṣave | svakaronyakṛtābhyāṃ 
vā karābhyāñcandanādibhiḥ || 

susthāpya tasya hṛdaye liṃgarūpaṃ maheśvaram | 
sparśayitvāñjalintasya mastake sannidhāpya ca || 

tadarthametadvākyañca devadeveśa sannidhau | dīkṣitoyantvayā deva 
śivājñāparipālakaḥ || 

deve śivatvamācārāt sapiṇḍākaraṇottām | evaṃ vijñāpya 
deveśaṃ svasthāne viniveśayet || 

ekadhā bahudhā vāpi kriyāmenāṃ samācaret | pathedyutkrānti 
samaye karṇopānteṇu saṃhitām || 

viśeṣācchivamantrañca mantraṃ pañcākṣarantu vā | etatsarvaṃ 
vidhadhaddeśikene tareṇa vā || 

tadgotrajenānenaiva vakṣyamāṇañca karmayat | 

kālottare (-) 

mratinaṃ caiva tatkāle mantraṃ dakṣiṇakarṇake | strīṇāntu 
vāmakarṇe tu upadeśovidhīyate || 

tatraiva dattānugrahapaṭale (-) 

śivādhiṣṭhitadehastu maraṇaṃ yāti yo naraḥ | 

<p. 1624> 

sa naraśśiva eva syātsarva pāśa viniṣkṛtaḥ || 

tasmādutkrāntikāle tu spaṣṭaṃ liṃgantu saṃsppṛśet | 
prāṇānmokṣañca kuryādyassaśivo nātra saṃśayaḥ || 

kālottare (-) 

mṛtigrahantu kartavyaṃ sarvālaṃ kārasaṃyutam | saikataṃ 
taṇḍūlaṃ kṛtvā śayanandarbhasaṃyutam || 

kāraṇe (-) 

darbhamūlāgra saṃyuktandakṣiṇe mastakantayā | uttare 
pādasaṃyuktaṃ sthaṇḍile śādhayecchivam || 

vātule (-) 

tataśca pretaśudhyarthaṃ vapanaṃ kuryādviśeṣataḥ | 

kāmike (-) 

gataprāṇeśavetasya snānārthaṃ tīrthasaṃbhavam | 
jalaghaṭaśatādyaistu saṃsnātaiḥ parigṛhya ca || 

taisnāpayedgṛhasthaścellaukikaṃ snānamācaret | vividhaiva 
ghaṭānvāpi kalaśān sthāpanoktataḥ || 

saṃsthāpyavardhane hīne kevalodaka saṃyutam | sthaṇḍilādyaṃ 
savastrañca sahiraṇyaṃ sakūrcakam || 

vidhānākṣatasaṃyuktaṃ vidyāṃga hṛdayānvitam | snāpayedvā 
grahe dīkṣāṃ śmaśāne vā samācaret || 

kālottare (-) 

astramantrādijaptena gomayena mṛdā bhasā | ragandhāmalakai snāpya 
nānāpuṣpaiśca veṣṭayet || 

sarvavidhudakenavit | tathā cintye (-) 

<p. 1625> 

kṛtvā śarīraśudhyarthaṃ rajanyāmalakādibhiḥ | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

mṛdāṃbunā tu saṃśodhya astrajaptena mantravit | ālipya 
rajanyāmalakai snāpayitvā śivāṃbhasā || 

bhasmasnānaṃ vilomena kṛtvā tu paridhāpayet | 
gandhapuṣpairalaṃkṛtya udukpādannivedayet || 

kāmike (-) 

kṛtvā saṃhāramārgeṇa kaupīnaṃ vasanantu vā | 
parivṛtyākṣamālādyai bhūṣaṇairbhūṣaṇārhakaiḥ || 

candanena samālipya nānāpuṣpaiśca veṣṭayet | surakte vā site 
tatra vāsturahyadharottare || 

prayoktavyopavītantu sottarīyaṃ yathā navam | 

sarvajñānottare (-) 

uttarīyantuśūdrāṇāṃ kintu tatra vivarjitam | pavitrakañca 
yastāsmin darbhā (*) ntyaṃ guladvaye || 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

hṛdayena tato badhvā pādau hastau tathaiva ca | gandhapuṣpairalaṃ 
kṛtyā vitānairdarbhamālikaiḥ || 

(********)udakpādanniyojayet | 

vātule (-) 

gṛhāṃkaṇe prapāṃ kṛtvā gṛhāgre vīthikepa (*) | vidhinā 
darbhamālātadyeḥ prapālaṃkāra saṃyutam || 

snānaśuddhintataḥ kṛtvā gomayenānulepayet | 

<p. 1626> 

dīpaiḥ puṣpairalaṃkṛtya vitānairdarbhamālikaiḥ || 

sarvālaṃ kārasaṃyuktaṃ cūrṇotsavamathācaret | 
sikataisthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā (*) va pramāṇena deśikaḥ || 

darbhairupari vinyasya tatropari vinyaset | hṛdayena tato badhvā 
pādau hastau ca tantubhiḥ || 

|| atha cūrṇotsavavidhirucyate || 

tathāraurave (-) 

atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa cūrṇotsava vidhikramam | dīkṣitānāṃ 
yathānyeṣāṃ śivaśāsana dhāriṇām || 

anyeṣāñca yathāyogyaṃ rātricūrṇantu tailayuk | antyeṣṭiṃ 
mṛtadīkṣā syāt tat ṣaḍadhvaviśodhanāt || 

mṛtasya dīkṣitasyāpi cūrṇotsavañca kārayet | devanāmutsavānte 
tu visarjanamidaṃ bhavet || 

yāgasya śivavāgasya mṛtayāgasya tanmayam | cūrṇotsavamidaṃ 
kuryāt maṃgalā caraṇārthakam || 

na kuryāccedgurustatramaṃgalona bhavattadā | sarvamaṃgalārthantu 
cūrṇotsavañca kārayet || 

kālottare (-) 

śivotsavañca jīvānte yatra pūrṇantu dāpayet | 
pāṇḍavādyupacārantu sarvadedaśārthakam || 

antyeṣṭirmṛtadīkṣā syātṣaṣṭhadhvantu viśodhanāt | 

<p. 1627> 

guruśśivapadāprāpti śśivabhūtasya tasya ca || 

maṃgalā caraṇārthantu cūrṇotsavamidaṃ bhavet | vaidikī ca tathā 
śaivamanayaṃ kārayetkramāt || 

cintye (-) 

gṛhadvārāṃ kaṇasthāne cūrṇotsava mathācaret | athavā tu 
citāsthāne cūrṇotsavamathācaret || 

pādaprakṣālanaṃ kṛtvā ācāryo mantragrahaḥ | nava vastra (***) 
śca śuklayajñopavītakaḥ || 

apasavyopavītastu uttarīyañca buddhimān | bhasmoddhūlādikaṃ 
kṛtvā tripuṇḍraṃ vidhinā tathā || 

saṃhāranyāsamatroktaṃ sthānasaṃśodhanaṃ kuru | 
cūrṇotsavavidhiṃ vakṣye pretāgre maṇḍalatrayam || 

kālottare (-) 

ācārya hastamānena sthaṇḍulaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ | 
aṣṭadroṇaiṃśca śālībhissāṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam || 

tanmadhye ulūkhalaṃ sthāpya tatpūrve bherisaṃyutam | paścime 
kuṃbhaṃ saṃsthāpya catuṣkoṇeṣu buddhimān || 

astramūrtiñca kuṃbhe tu sthāpayeddeśikottamaḥ | indrabhasmayame 
tailaṃ varuṇe tāṃbūlameva ca || 

some tu dhautakaupīnaṃ tattaddikpālakān nyaset | 

yadvā (-) 

dūrvākṣatañca tāṃbūlaṃ tailaṃ haridra cūrṇakam | 
svarṇabhasma ca kaupīnaṃ pūrvādīśāntakaṃ nyaset || 

<p.1628> 

kālottare (-) 

sthaṇḍile tu prakartavyaṃ ukhale musalantathā | 

kāraṇe (-) 

viṃśatyaṃgulamāyāmamuttamantu prakīrtitam | smṛtyaṃgulaṃ 
bhavenmadhya kanyasantu kalāṃgulam || 

āyāmaṃ triguṇīkṛtya tannāhantu vidhīyate | caturddhā 
vibhajedāyaṃ tribhāgaṃ tasya ucyate || 

utsedhasyārdhamānena yuvāmūlasya nāhakam | 
oṣṭhavakṣāṃgulaṃprokta muttamasya viśeṣataḥ || 

pādaṃ pādāṃgulaṃ hīnaṃ madhyamasyādhamasya ca | ulūkhalasyaiva 
mākhyātaṃ maṇḍalasya vidhiṃ śṛṇu || 

sārddhatritālamadhamaṃ yugatālantu madhyamam | uttamaṃ 
bhūtatālantu anyādrirandhrikāṃgulam || 

kanyakādi parīṇāhaṃ vṛttaṃ sarvatrakīrtitam | adhasya 
dvayaṃgulenaiva tanmūle veṣṭayeddṛḍham || 

tanmadhye musalaṃ sthāpya pūrvāgraṃ cotarākam | 

cintye (-) 

plakṣoduṃbaramaśvatthaṃ vaṭañcolūkhalaṃ tathā | nava 
vastrairalaṃ kṛtvolūkhalaṃ musalantathā || 

saṃkalpyolūkhale śaktimādhārākhyāṃ prapūjayet | mūsale 
pūjayitveśaṃ rajanīṃ vinyasettataḥ || 

su śuklāṃ rajanīṃ śuddhāṃ cūrṇaṃkṛtvā dṛḍhaṃ tathā | 
tadardhamadhyamaṃ proktaṃ tadardhamadhamaṃ bhavet || 

<p. 1629> 

kāraṇe (-) 

vyomavyāpi samuccārya cūrṇayeddeśikottamaḥ | musalaṃ bādiraṃ 
vidyāt prokṣayeddhṛdayena tu || 

yogaje (-) 

lūkhalaṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ mūsalaṃ viṣṇudaivatam | vasu pūrvādi 
daivatyaṃ darbhapuṣpasamanvitam || 

vātule (-) 

nava vastrairalaṃ kṛtya lūkhalamusalantathā | tato bhakti janaiḥ 
sārdhaṃ gaṇikābhissamanvitaḥ || 

śivadāsī samabhyarcya vastragandhādibhistathā | mūsalaṃ 
pāṇisaṃyuktaṃ lūkhale ca praveśayet || 

rajanī cūrṇakārthantu lūkhalasya tu madhyame | 
pāśacchedanimittāya marddayecchivadāsibhiḥ || 

tāṃbūlaṃ dāpayetpaścāt bhaktānmāheśvarānapi | śave 
prokṣaṇakaṃ kṛtvā pāśabandhantathaiva ca || 

iti datvāstramantreṇa mukhavāsastu dāpayet | 

kāraṇe (-) 

lūkhale bhūmidaivatyaṃ mūsaleskandadaivatam | cūrṇe tu 
rudradaivatyaṃ damanaṃ vyomamantrakaiḥ || 

tattaddevañca saṃpūjya bheritāḍanamārabhet | 

tallakṣaṇamatrocyate (-) 

āsanaṃ candanaṃ vātha vakulañca śirīṣakam | uśīraṃ 
vyāghravṛkṣaṃ vā bherīṃ kuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ || 

tathā vātule (-) 

uśīraṃ ghṛtamityuktaṃ lakṣaṇena samanvitam | 

<p. 1630> 

dīpte (-) 

āyāmantu catustālaṃ tannāhaṃ pañcatālakam | āditya (*) 
gulamānena vaktratāraṃ vidhīyate || 

madhye ca suṣirantasya āmukhāntaṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
dhanamadhyāṃgulantasya āmukhāntaṃ suvṛttakam || 

navakīlasamāyuktamadhaḥ paṭṭena veṣṭanam | madhyeṃgula 
parīṇāhaṃ calanaṃ rajjuveṣṭitam || 

bandhayettu viśeṣeṇa gocarmakṛrajjubhiḥ | bheryāstu lakṣaṇaṃ 
proktaṃ mānāṃgula vaśannayet || 

siddhatantre (-) 

nādaṃ kirīṭamityuktaṃ śūlāstañca japānvitam | 
śaṃkhacakratriśūlākṣaṃ ityaṃ daṇḍāyudhaṃ karaiḥ || 

sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ tripādaṃ padmasaṃsthitam | 
cintayedbhogarūpaṃ dhyātvā nādākṛtiṃ sadā || 

vīratantre (-) 

tatassaṃpūjayedbherīnnavavastreṇa veṣṭayet | tanmadhye dakṣiṇe 
vāme śaṃbhuviṣṇuñcaturmukham || 

mātarassaptakīlāsyuścandrākauṣalayādhipau | carmasūtre 
bhujaṃgendraṃ skandaṃ koṇādhidaivatam || 

saṃpūjya gaṃdhapuṣpādyaistattanmantreṇa deśikaḥ || 

bhīmasaṃhitāyām (-) 

deśikastāḍayedbherīṃ praṅmukhovāpyudaṅmukhaḥ || 

<p. 1631> 

kāmike (-) 

bherī tāḍanakaṃ kuryādastramantramanusmaran | ekaḥ prahārataṃ 
pūrvaṃ dvitayaṃ dviprakārataḥ || 

tṛtīyaṃ triprakāreṇa trayañcaiva prakārataḥ | 

ajite (-) 

vādyakañca samāhūya prokṣayettacchivāṃbhasā | tasya haste tu 
salilaṃ kusumādiñca dāpayet || 

sopi puṣpaṃ vinikṣipya bherīmuddhṛtya vādayet | tatpuruṣeṇa 
mantreṇa tāḍayedvādaka svayam || 

aṃgapūrṇa samāyuktaṃ śaktyā sahitameva ca | aṃgahīnaṃ 
viśeṣeṇa varjayettu va (**) kṣaḥ || 

kāraṇe (-) 

acchapuṭena tālena vādyakartā ca vādayet | viprādīnāṃ 
viśeṣeṇa vedamantreṇa tāḍayet || 

ḍamaśca tryaṃbakenaiva tāḍayetprathamaṃ śubham | idaṃ 
viṣṇuriti mantreṇa ḍaḍamantāḍayetpunaḥ || 

nīyāḍaḍhḍhamañcaiva jabrajñāna mantrataḥ | bherī 
saṃtāḍanaṃ kuryāt astramantra manusmaran || 

ekaṃ prahārapūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ dviprahārakam | tṛtīyaṃ triḥ 
prahāreṇa trayaṃ vaika prahārataḥ || 

kālottare (-) 

anyena tāḍanaṃ kṛtvā rājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati | 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

cūrṇagānāvasāne tu tacchuṇuntailapūrvakam | 

<p. 1632> 

śaṃkhadhvani samāyuktaṃ dāpayet pretamūrdhani || 

vātule (-) 

tailatāṃbūla cūrṇantu sarvabhaktāṃstu dāpayet | nānāvādya 
samāyuktaṃ gāyakānāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 

kāmike (-) 

dīkṣitānāṃ tathānyeṣāṃ śivaśāsanadhāriṇām | anyeṣāñca 
yathāyogyamāro (*) ntaila cūrṇayuk || 

tāṃbūlasahitaṃ sarvajanebhyo dāpayennavam | cūrṇotsavasamāptau 
tu paścātpretāvarohaṇam || 

śivasya tīrthaṃ bhasmādi gandhamālyāṃdabarādiyat | datvā 
saṃbhūṣya tatpretaṃ namayacchīghraṃ śmaśānakam || 

āsandhikālakṣaṇa vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām | 

gṛhītvā yājñikaṃ vṛkṣāṃdhvā sandhināmati | athavā 
munivṛkṣairvā kramukaṃ veṇukantu vā || 

vastreṇopari saṃstīrya alaṃkṛtya viśeṣataḥ | 

vātule (-) 

auduṃbareṇa āsabiṃkārayetpretamānataḥ | mālikākṛti kūṭaṃ 
vā anyairvātha viśeṣataḥ || 

rathe vā śibikāyāṃ vā anyasminvā yathā ruci | 
puruṣāyatamānaśca ṣaḍaṃgulavivardhanāt || 

trihastantu samāyāmantricatuḥ pañcamāṃśataḥ | suvistāra 
samāyukta ojasaṃkhyāstu viṣṭarāḥ || 

āsandhikāṃ samāpādya kuṭā (*) rdhva kṛtikriyām | 

<p. 1633> 

raktamālāṃbarakliptāṃ vitānālaṃbamānataḥ || 

śrīśaivasamayācāra paddhatyāntu prakāśitam | 
śuddhavistārabhītyā tu vistareṇa na bhāṣitam || 

vidveśaṇasaṃhitāyām (-) 

vastreṇaiva paristīrya alaṃkṛtya viśeṣataḥ | 

śivayogiviṣaye kaścidviśeṣa uktaḥ | 

tathā (-) 

itaraścetotkrāntyā susthirañcaiva yoginaḥ | nissārayedalaṃ kṛtya 
śubhaistat (***) bhūṣaṇaiḥ || 

ārdravaṃśādibhikḷpte vimāne putraśobhite | svargasopānayukte ca 
śavamārpayettataḥ || 

apasavyopavītībhirdīkṣitaistulya jātibhiḥ | 
samaskandhaiśśastramantra japayuktaiśca dhārayet || 

kālottare (-) 

(**) rajanamāhūya mantrayedupavītikān | kūrcandatvā 
viśeṣeṇavastrakaupīna kandadet || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

gṛhītvāyasvajātīyairdīkṣitairna sudīkṣitaiḥ | 
saṃsmṛtāsthānamasthyaṃgāni vivarjitam || 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

nadī tīre taṭāke vā ārāmodyānakepi ca | antyeṣṭi sthānaṃ 
saṃkalpya deśikastu viśeṣataḥ || 

<p. 1634> 

vātule (-) 

pretāgni kāṣṭhadarbhañca akṣataistilamodanam | lājaiśca 
svarṇaśakalairgaḍḍukairvardhanīyutam || 

ghṛtaṃ puṣpañca vastrañca pañcavarṇaiśca tantukam | kalaśaṃ 
bhasmasarvāṇi śmaśāne purato nayet || 

homadravyañca vrīhīñca pañcagavyañca sruksruvam | 
dhūpadīpasamāyuktaṃ ghaṇṭā pañcāṃga bhūṣaṇam || 

upavītaṃ pavitrañca aṃgulīyayutantu vā | raktavastradvayopetaṃ 
uttarīyaṃ tathaiva ca || 

nālikeraphalañcaiva samidhā tāmrapātrakam | tāṃbūlañca 
sugandhañca tailañca tilasaṃyutam || 

kalaśān ṣoḍaśairyuktaṃ yuktyā tu kuṃbhavardhanī | kuṃbhamadhye 
tu tatsvarṇa niṣkaṃ niṣkārkamardhakam || 

vardhanyāṃ rajataṃ prokta muktamānapramāṇakam | kalaśaṃ 
daśabhisvarṇairyathāśaktisamanvitam || 

vrīhīṇāñca dvibhārañca droṇadroṇārdha taṇdulam | 
taṇḍulārdhatilañcaiva lājaiśca droṇa saṃyutam || 

pītaṃ śvetaṃ tathā raktaṃ śyāmaṃ kṛṣṇañca cūrṇayoḥ | 
pañcavarṇantu dviprasthaṃ ekamekañca kārayet || 

taduktaṃ vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

pañcavarṇamatho vakṣye gairikā śarkarā tathā | 

<p. 1635> 

rajanī cūrṇakañcaiva aṃgārakasamudbhavam | 

śaṃkhinīpatra cūrṇantu pañcapañcapadaṃ prati | 

vātule (-) 

prasthaṃ prastha samopetaṃ pañcagavya pramāṇakam | 
mudgamāṣakulasthañca śivaṃkāṣāḍhasarṣapam || 

homadravya samopetaṃ prasthaṃ prasthaṃ ghṛtaṃ śivam | 
caturdaśāntaṃ hastānāṃ utsedhantu samantathā || 

aṣṭatālañca vistāraṃ pracchanna paṭalakṣaṇam | 
yāvattanmātrakañcaiva ācāryāya pradetsudhīḥ || 

tatpādaṃ kuṃbhavastraṃ syāt tadardhaṃ vardhanī smṛtam | 
tadardhaṃ lūkhalaṃ bherī vastra lakṣaṇamucyate || 

pakvabiṃba phalākāraṃ kṛṣṇa maṇḍala varjitam | 
dvātriṃśatprasthasaṃpūrṇaṃ śivakuṃbhaṃ taducyate || 

atiśyāmañca varṇañca jaladroṇañca karkarī | vajrādīnāṃ 
daśānāntu kalaśān prasthakatrayam || 

asthiratnaṃ sirā sūtraṃ māṃsamṛt tena buddhimān | śoṇatāmra (*) 
majjaiva jalametattathaiva ca || 

kūrcajihvā samākhyātā carmavastreṇa veṣṭitam | 
saptadhātumayañcaiva kalaśeṣu ghaṭeṣu ca || 

jaṭācāmrakapatrañca nālikeraśirastathā | dravyaṃ 
śarīramityuktaṃ kriyāṇāmaṃga mucyate || 

<p. 1636> 

homadravyāṇi sarvāṇi kartārassannidhīyata | nānāvādya 
samāyuktaṃ pretāya purato nayet || 

vīratantre (-) 

nānādīrghasamāyuktaṃ śūladīpasamanvitam | cakradīpasamāyuktaṃ 
dīpādhāra samanvitam || 

grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ vāpi pradakṣiṇamathācaret | 

kālottare (-) 

gṛhāt śmaśānamadhye tu deśabhūtabaliṃ kramāt | śaṃkhakāhala 
ghoṣaiśca śivamantraṃ japetsudhīḥ || 

sukṣetre caiva kartavya mīśāne maṇṭapaṃ budhaḥ | 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

tannayetsaṃskṛtasthānaṃ asthyaṃgāravivarjitam | 

sarvajñānottare(-) 

nītvā tu śaṃkarī dīkṣā śuddhasthāne nidhāpayet | 
atramaṇṭapanirmāṇa prakāraḥ vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām || 

antyeṣṭi maṇṭapaṃ vakṣye dhātuṣaṭpañca hastakam | ravistaṃ 
bhasamāyuktantanmadhye kuṇḍasaṃyutam || 

kālottare (-) 

nava sapta ca pañcānāṃ hastaṃ caiva tu maṇṭapam | ṣoḍaśa 
dvādaśastaṃbhaṃ yugastaṃ bhamathāpi vā || 

yadvā (-) 

cintye (-) 

caturviṃśati tālaṃ syādvistārāyāmameva ca | caturdvāra 
samāyukta madhye navapadaṃ tathā || 

athavānyaprakāreṇa catustaṃ bhasamanvitam | 

vātule (-) 

maṇṭapaṃ navadhā kṛtvā navakoṣṭhantu saṃyutam | 

<p. 1637> 

vāyukoṣṭhaṃ tu tanmadhye vedikāñcaika hastakam || 

aiśānyāṃ vardhanīmadhye agnikoṣṭhe tu pretakam | pañcagavyañca 
nairṛtyāṃ madhyamekena kuṇḍakam || 

kālottare (-) 

agnikuṇḍantu tanmadhye ekamekhalameva ca | ṣaḍaṃgulocchrayaṃ 
kuṇḍaṃ vistārañca tadaṃgulam || 

hastamātrantu kuṇḍaṃ syāt tadūrdhve yoni saṃyutam | 

vātule viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

hastamānapramāṇena ekameva mayāyutam | nābhiyoniyutaṃ kṛtvā 
khātaṃ tālapramāṇakam || 

kāmike (-) 

kṛtvā kuṇḍaṃ vidhānena hastakantāmradānale | 

kālottare (-) 

vāyusthāneṣu saṃkalpya vedikāṃ hastamānataḥ | 
ṣaḍaṃgulocchrayaṃ kṛtvā nimnonnata vivarjitam || 

aiśānyāṃ staṇḍilantadvadvinyasedastavardhanīm | 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām | 

vajrādisthāna daśake kuḍaya saṃdhṛṣṇakam | 
vitastimātramāyāmaṃ caturaśrasamanvitam || 

ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ tadutsedhaṃ yathā śobhaṃ prakalpayet | 
caturdvāramekadvāraṃ vā dakṣiṇadvāramuttamam || 

pūrve ca paścime caiva madhyama dvāramucyate | saumyadvāreṇa 
saṃyuktaṃ adhamadvāramucyate || 

<p. 1638> 

dvāraṃ prativiśeṣeṇa yajedastreśamuktikam | 
toraṇadvārakalaśamāyudhaṃ vā samarcayet || 

kālottare (-) 

daśaiva kalaśān sthāpya maṇṭapābhyantare sudhīḥ | 
śūlādivajra (**) ntamapasavya krameṇa tu || 

ūrdhvataraṃga māveṣṭaya vitānadhvajaśobhitam | citāsthānantu 
saṃkalpya dakṣiṇottarāmayatam || 

āyāmamaṣṭatālañca tadardhaṃ vistṛtaṃ bhavet | 
dakṣiṇottaramāyāmaṃ pūrvapaśima vistṛtam || 

vasvaṃgulantu khātaṃ syānnimnonnataviva (**) | ṣaṭsūtraṃ 
dakṣiṇāgrantu paścimāgrantathaiva ca || 

pi (*) gretu catuṣkoṇe kīlaṃ tatraiva tāḍayet | āgneyādiṣu 
koṇeṣu śuṣkakāṣṭhīya kīlakān || 

ūrdhvamūrdhānadhogra saṃstānastṛlabdhān sakṛt sakṛt | 
pañcaraṃgita sūtreṇa kavacena cāvesṭayet || 

evaṃ maṇṭapa nirmāṇā śaktaścetkīlādīnā maṇṭapaṃ kuryāt | 

kālottare (-) 

athavā khātaśaṃku (*) tantutraya samanvitam | caturdvayasamāyuktaṃ 
saṃghanaṃ na samācaret || 

tallakṣanaṃ tatraiva (-) 

dvādaśāṃgula saṃyuktaṃ dvādaśāṃgula dīrghakam | 
aṃguṣṭhanāhamānaṃ syātkṣīravṛkṣeṇa kīlakam || 

<p. 1639> 

adhograsya tu mūlaṃ syāt maṇḍapādbahitāḍayet | itthaṃ 
maṇṭapaṃ nirmāya karmakuryādatandritaḥ || 

|| [ityantyeṣṭima (*) pa vidhiḥ] || 

|| [atha samayāntyeṣṭividhirucyate] || 

gomayenopalityāya tatsamīpasthitāṃ bhuvam | śuddhahuto gururmantra 
kāyostravardhanīkaraḥ || 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

vardhanī jalamādāya vāmabāhūrdhva saṃsthitaḥ | 
apasavyakrameṇaiva maṇṭapāt bā (****) || 

vardhanī jalamādāya vivacchinnapayodharam | 
īśānādīśaparyantantatsthāne vardhanīṃ nyaset || 

cintye (-) 

aiśānyāṃ vedikāsavya sukhāsīnaṃ samācaret | 

vidveṣaṇasaṃhitāyām (-) 

bhasmanyāsakaranyāsaṃ prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ param | kalānyāsaṃ 
tataḥ kuryādaṃ (*) nyāsamataḥ param || 

mātṛkānyāsasaṃyuktaṃ saṃhāra kramameva hi | 

atra nyāsaviparīta kramaḥ | astreṇa talapṛṣṭhe viparītena 
saṃśodhyamṛtīkṛtya (-) 

<p. 1640> 

hastatalayorāsanamūrtī vinyasya kaniṣṭhādvyaṃguṣṭhāntaṃ 
sadyādīśāntaṃ vinyasya vidyādeha netramūlamantrānvinyasya 
hṛdayādi mantrān nyastvā tālatraya purassaramastreṇa 
digbandhanamapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā mūlena mahāmūdrāṃ darśayet | 

kṛtāntaryajanostreṇa samālabhyostravardhanīm | 
tajjalaprokṣitairdravyaiḥ pūjāṃ saṃkalpya cātmani || 

pañcagavya saṃkalpya cordhvarede deśikottamaḥ | āvartya 
saṃhitāmantrān kalāsaṃhāravartmanā || 

brahmādikāraṇopetā svasminvinyasya deśikaḥ | 
saṃhāraharahastañca kṛtvā smṛtvā śivaṃ sakṛt || 

vikīrya vikīrāṃstatra kuśabhasmādikānatha | samāhṛtya 
vidhādhaivaṃ vardhanyā māsanāya ca || 

tataścitāvāstuṃ pūjayet | 

kālottare (-) 

tasminmadhye pāśupataṃ pṛthivīṃ brahmādhidaivatam | 
pītavarṇantu saṃkalpya lakāraṃ bījameva ca || 

oṃ hāṃ pṛthivī tatvāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ pṛthivītatvādhipataye 
brahmaṇe namaḥ | āpannairṛti saṃkalpya śvetaṃ bījaṃ va kārakam 
| 

viṣṇudaivaṃ samākhyātaṃ ardhacandraṃ catuṣpadam | oṃ 
hāmaptatvāya namaḥ | aptatvādhipataye viṣṇave namaḥ | 

āgneraktaṃ tathāsnānaṃ trikoṇaṃ bindukārakam | 

<p.1641> 

daivaṃ rudraṃ tathāsthānaṃ pūjayettu catuṣpadam || 

oṃ hāṃ tejastatvāya namaḥ | tejastatvādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ | 

vāyusthāne tu saṃkalpya vāyavyantu catuṣpadam | ṣaṭkoṇaṃ (*) 
ṣṇavarṇantu yakāraṃ bījameva ca || 

īśvaramadhidevantu pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ | 

oṃ hāṃ vāyutatvāya namaḥ | vāyutatvādhipataye īśvarāya namaḥ 
| 

īśe catuṣpadañcaiva ākāśaṃ sitavarṇakam | vṛttaṃ 
hakārabījañca adhidaivaṃ sadāśivam || 

oṃ hāṃ mākāśa tatvāya namaḥ | ākāśatatvādhipataye 
sadāśivāya namaḥ | 

aindrehyekaṃ padaṃ pītaṃ yāmye kṛṣṇamiti smṛtam | paścimetveka 
padāśvetaṃ raktavarṇantadūttare || 

pūrve indraṃ samabhyarcya dakṣiṇe yamaṃ pūjayet | paścime 
varuṇobhyarcya uttaresomameva ca || 

bilāntare tu nikṣipya svāhāntena yathākramam | 

oṃ hāṃ indrāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ yamāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
varuṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kuberāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe 
svāhā | viṣṇave svāhā rudrāya svāhā īśāya svāhā | 
sadāśivāya svāhā | indrāya svāhā | yamāya svāhā | varuṇāya 
svāhā | kuberāya svāhā | itthaṃ baliṃ datvā 
vardhanyāmastrārcanamārabhet | 

<p. 1642> 

aiśānyā (**) vardhanyāmiṣṭvā pāśupatantataḥ | 
śūlātkuliśaparyantān nyaṣṭastvānyaṣṭadīkṣi ca || 

dvitīyaṃ pūjayedūrdhvamadhaḥ patyuruṇāvapi | 

atrakramaḥ (-) 

oṃ hāṃ pāśupatavastrāsanāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | ityāsanaṃ 
saṃpūjya pāśupatāstramūrtaye huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ iti mūrtim | oṃ 
ślīṃ paśuṃ phaṭ pāśupatā vastrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | iti 
mūlam | oṃ oṃ hṛdayāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ ślīṃ śirase huṃ 
phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ phaṭ śikhāyai huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ śuṃ 
kavacāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | oṃ hāṃ netrebhyo huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | 
oṃ phaṭ astrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ | iti prāguktavaddhayātvāstraṃ 
saṃpūjya tadanvīśānādi diksthi teṣu oṃ hāṃ śūlāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ gadāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ dhvajāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
pāśāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ khaṭgāya namaḥ | oṃ hāndaṇḍāya 
namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śaktaye namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vajrāya namaḥ | 
nairṛteruttare oṃ hāñcakrāya namaḥ | īśānasya dakṣiṇe oṃ 
hāṃ padmāya nama iti pūjayet | 

kāmike (-) 

saptavānyasthite kuṃbhe sarvaśobhā samanvite | 

athavā (-) 

tiladarbhāntare samyak yajet sthaṇdilake bhavam | 

oṃ hāmādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | oṃ hāmanantāya namaḥ | 
īśānādyāgnyonta koṇeṣu oṃ hāṃ aiśvaryāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
jñānāya namaḥ | 

<p. 1643> 

oṃ hāṃ sarvāya namaḥ | itīṣṭvā uttarādipūrvānta dikṣu oṃ 
hāmanaiśvaryāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vairāgyāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
majñānāya namaḥ | oṃ hāmadharmāya namaḥ | ityabhyarcya īśāna 
nairṛtyayoḥ | oṃ hāmūrdhvacchadanāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāmadhacchadanāya namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya madhye kandabījāṃ 
kuranālakesara karṇikā bījapadmāni (-) oṃ hāṃ padmāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ bījebhyo namaḥ (-) 

itthamārādhya karṇikāyāmīśāne (-) 

oṃ hāṃ manonmanyai namaḥ | īśānādi 
pūrvāntāṣṭādalakesareṣu oṃ hāṃ sarvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ balapramathinyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ balavikariṇyai namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ kalavikariṇyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ kalavikaraṇyai namaḥ | 
oṃ hāṃ kālyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ raudyrai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ 
jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ vāmāyai namaḥ | iti saṃpūjya 
karṇikāmadhye oṃ hāṃ śaktimaṇḍalāya namaḥ | 
śaktimaṇḍalādhipataye īśvarāya namaḥ | 

karṇikāgre (-) 

oṃ hāṃ vanhimaṇḍalāya namaḥ | vanhimaṇḍalādhipataye rudrāya 
namaḥ | 

kesarāgravṛtte (-) 

oṃ hāṃ somamaṇḍalāya namaḥ somamaṇḍalādhipataye viṣṇave 
namaḥ | 

dalāgre (-) 

oṃ hāṃ sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ sūryamaṇḍalādhipataye brahmaṇe 
namaḥ | 

ityabhyarcya (-) 

oṃ hāṃ śivāsanāya namaḥ | ityāsanamabhyarcya tadupari mūrtiṃ 
nyastvā pādādi mūrdhāntaṃ sadyovāmā ghoratatpuruṣe śānādi 
daṃḍa bhaṃgyā vinyasya vidyā dehanetraṃ (-) 

<p. 1644> 

vinyasyādhvaśuddhi viṣaye nivṛtyādi kalāpādādisthāneṣu 
vinyasya mūlena śivamāvāhya pūrvavat 
sthāpanādyupacāraissaṃpūjya sadyojātādimantrairllayāṃgaṃ 
saṃpūjya prārthya bhogāṃga pūjārthaṃ vijñāpya paścimottara 
dakṣiṇa pūrveśānādi daleṣu sadyojātādīnā vāhyanetra 
maiśānyāṃ āgneyeśānanairṛtavāyavya daleṣu hṛdayādi 
mantrāṃścaturdikṣvastrañcābhyarcya hutvā japāntaṃ 
āvaraṇāṣṭakalaśe vā sahite vā kevala kuṃbhevā 
saṃpūjyābhyarccayet | 

yadvā (-) 

dahanakriyāyāṃ kālagnirudrādhikāratvā 
tadevatasminnāvāhyābhyarcayet | taduktaṃ vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

āvṛtān kalaśānaṣṭau hīnaṃ vā kuṃbhamarayet | tanmantreṇa 
tato dhyātvā dikpālasahitaṃ tathā || 

kālottare (-) 

tanmadhye sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā nalinoparikuṃbhakam | 
kiālāgnirudramāvāhya apasavyakrameṇa tu || 

tathā cintye (-) 

kālāgni rudramāvāhya vāyavyāṃ kuṃbhamarcayet | raktavastra 
triṇetrañca dvipādaṃ nūpurānvitam || 

caturbhujasamāyuktamīśakuñcitamūrdhani | śūlamūlaṃ tathā 
grañca hastadvayañca dhāriṇam || 

abhayaṃ varadopetaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam | evaṃ dhyātvā 
viśeṣeṇa pūjayettu viśeṣataḥ || 

<p. 1645> 

asyāmantyeṣṭirakṣāsaṃbandhasyāyogyatvāt sṛṣṭirakṣāhetu 
vardhanī sahita kuṃbhasya sthāpanā bhāvaḥ (-) saṃhāra 
hetubhūtāstravardhanī mātrasya pradhānasyaiva prayogaḥ | evaṃ 
dikpāla kuṃbhānamapi sthāpanābhāvaḥ | daśāyudha kuṃbhānāmapi 
prayogaḥ | pañcāvaraṇapūjārha śivakuṃbhasya sthāpanaṃ 
saṃhārakrameṇa pūjāvidhānādyaktameveti kiñca prayogasya 
vacanīyakatvāt na hi vācanikerthe yuktoyaṃ krama iti nyāyāt 
paramavāgamavacana pratipāditārtheṣu yuktayo na vicāraṇīyā iti 
bodhyam | 

cintye (-) 

ityevaṃ pūjayetpaścāt agnikāryavidhikramam | agnikāryoktamārgeṇa 
agni saṃsthāpanān || 

yājñīya vṛkṣasamidhān sadyomantreṇa hūyate | 
juhuyāttatsvanāmnena haviṣā caruvarmaṇā || 

tilamastreṇa hutvā tu pavāya sākantanotrayat | śatamardhaṃ 
tadardhaṃ vā pratyekaṃ vāhutīrhunet || 

hṛdaye na tu mantreṇa juhuyācchata saṃkhyayā | pūrṇāhutiñca 
śirasā sviṣṭamagneti homayet || 

atra kramaḥ (-) 

kuṇḍasamīpaṃ gatvopaviśya nirīkṣaṇādi saṃskāraissaṃskṛtya 
vāgīśī vagīśāvabhyarcya saṃskṛtamagniṃ triḥ paribhrāmya 
vāgīśīgarbhanāḍyānnikṣipya garbhādhānādi saṃskārannityava 
dāpādya mekhalāyāmastreṇa darbhā (-) 

<p. 1646> 

viparītakramādastīrya teṣu pariviṣtarāna pradakṣiṇandakṣiṇa 
paścimāgrān vinyasya la latpattaye pañca samidhā hutvā 
paridhiṣūttara dakṣiṇa paścima pūrvādi dikṣu anantaṃ rudraṃ 
viṣṇuṃ brahmāṇañca saṃpūjya viṣṭareṣvīśānādi 
pūrvāntadikṣu īśānaṃ somaṃ vāyuṃ varuṇaṃ niṛtiṃ yamaṃ 
agnimindraṃ nir(-)ṛteruttare | viṣṇumīśānadakṣiṇe 
brahmāṇañcābhyarcyāgnirakṣāṃ vijñāpya sṛk sruvau oṃ haḥ 
astrāya phaḍiti saṃprokṣyāgnau triḥ paribhrāmya pūrvavat 
śeṣaṃ saṃskṛtyājyasaṃskāravaktrābhidhāra vaktrasandhāna 
vaktraikīkaraṇa jihvaikīkaraṇādi pañcasaṃskāraṃ 
pūrvavadvidhāya nāmakaraṇaṃ pitara (**) visarjanañca 
pūrvavatkṛtvā vanhihṛdaye sthaṇḍilavadāvāhyābhyarcya 
mantratarpaṇaṃ vidhāya pūrṇāndadyāt | tato deśakālādyarthaṃ 
dravyakālānurodhena mūlena yathā śakti hutvā mantrasaṃhitayā 
santarpya sadnīpya pūrṇāṃ dadyāt | athavā pañcavarṇaracita 
sthānaṃ vīkṣaṇādi saṃskāraissaṃskṛtya tanmadhye māhendre 
puranirmāṇārthaṃ vītarajasā caturaśraṃ samālikhya tanmadhye 
trikoṇaṃ rakta rajasāvilikhya caturaśre oṃ hāmindrāya namaḥ | 
trikoṇe oṃ hāmagnaye nama iti saṃpūjya kāmike (-) 

śavaśayyāñcchite tatra kāṣṭhairāstīrya yājñikaiḥ | 
candanāgarusammiśreṃ viparīta paṭāvṛte || 

saṃpūjya cāstra rājena kusumaissakuśai sthale | 

<p.1647> 

saṃpūjya cāstra rājena kusumaissakusumaisthale || 

kṛtvāmṛtaṃ mṛtoddhṛṣṭaṃ gomayena sahāṃbhasā | snāpitaṃ 
dhūpitaṃ tatra bhasmanā nayavartmanā || 

sabrahma sūtra vasanaṃ pūrvavarṇānaprekṣayā | āgneya 
śaktimiṣṭvāgne ddakṣiṇasyāṃ kuśāsane || 

vīkṣaṇādi viśuddhasya dhāraṇābhiśca pañcabhiḥ | tatosya 
mantrakāryasya hṛdaṃbhoruhakoṭare || 

bhogyakarmāśayāraktaṃ prārabhdādharadehakam | 

atramahājāla prayogaḥ | mṛtaśarīrekṣatanyāsārthaṃ 
praṇavorcārasamarthitānādamamuṣya dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tena 
nādenekī bhūtahastasvakarmānuguṇya 
mitastatogacchantamātmānantadā kalpya nādaśaktyājālamiva 
sarvataḥ prasṛta tathā gṛhītaṃ vibhāvyātmamantraṃ 
susūkṣmamuccarannādarūpāntarjanīntridhā bhrāmyandūrasya 
mātmānamāsannaṃ vibhāvya tamaṃguṣṭha mūlakanyāsādyaṃguli 
saṃyojanāt gṛhītvā sṛṇi mudrayā mantreṇa svahṛdaye 
samākṛṣya svanādāntamātmānaṃ vibhajya oṃ hāṃ haṃ 
hāmmukātmane nama ityātma mantreṇa saṃhāramudrayā gṛhītvā 
prāṇapravāheṇa bahirnissṛtya bāhye dvādaśānte punaḥ 
saṃgṛhyodbhavamudrayā tasya hṛdaye saṃyojya kṣipet | itthaṃ 
kūrmamahājāla prayogeṇa vinyasya mūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā 
pāśatrayaṃ saṃbhāvya pādādikrameṇa sadyādi brahmāṇi 
vidyādehañca (-) 

<p. 1648> 

vinyasya tato nāḍīṃ sandhāya mulenāhuti trayaṃ 
tatsannidhānārthaṃ hutvā tatassamayinasvācāra vaikalyaśuddhaye 
mūlena śataṃ hutvā pūrṇayārudrādhiṣṭhāyakena śivena 
saṃyojya sthaṇḍileśaṃ agnau saṃyojya śavaṃ citāmāropayet | 

kāmike (-) 

kṛtanniśśeṣa pāśāntamiṣṭveśañca vivarjayet | vidyādehañca 
taddehe saṃhṛtya svapade guruḥ || 

sthaṇḍile śavamāropya saṃhṛtya svapade guruḥ | pitā sthāne tu 
saṃpūjya varṇānudbāhayetsudhīḥ || 

tatra sthāne citāṃ sthāpya pretanyāsastatopari | 

suprabhede (-) 

pretasya dakṣiṇe bhāge śivāgniṃ pūrvavadbudhaḥ | hṛdayena 
śataṃ hutvā tannāmnā tu śatāhutim || 

homeneṣṭayatenaiva caruṃ kṣīrākṣatādibhiḥ | 
nābhihṛdvakradeśeṣu hṛdayena vinikṣipet || 

datvā hi rasaśakalaṃ navadvāreṣu buddhimān | tadāsya cakṣuṣī 
karṇau nāsī dvāraṃgudantathā || 

liṃgaṃ cetinavadvāraṃ hṛdayena ca nikṣipet | kṣīraṃ 
taṇḍulasammiśraṃ datvā vāmena cāsya ke || 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

devasaṃbandhaśaivīñca astreṇaiva tu yojayet | 

kāmike (-) 

aṃguṣṭhatāḍanaccheda maghośastreṇa kārayet | 

<p. 1649> 

snigdhodañca tadā kuryātsapiṇḍā bhrātṛbhissaha || 

astrāgreṇa tadā sarve tatpradakṣiṇakāriṇaḥ | dāhakṛtpūrṇa 
kuṃbhañca samādāyāpradakṣiṇam || 

trayāvidhāya tadvāme nikṣipe dastramantrataḥ | toyaṃ bhinna 
kalāpasthaṃ pūrvasthāne tu nikṣipet || 

suprabhede (-) 

mūrdhādipādaparyanta mājyalepaṃ suśobhanam | padadvayañca 
saṃspṛśya smṛtvāgnau tu haviṣvavat || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

citāṃ sandīpayetpaścāt kuṇḍamadhyagatāgninā | śiraḥ 
pradeśejvalite cottarasyo hunetpunaḥ || 

kāmike (-) 

madhu saktaiśca sarpīṣiṃ prakṣityojvalitenale | sarpirmadhupayaḥ 
pūrṇāṃ srucamutkṣipya pūjitām || 

gurusthitvā śiro deśe sadyāśābhimukhānanaḥ | pāvakāsye 
kṣipeddhārāmiti vākyamudīrayan || 

tvamagne dakṣiṇaḥ kālaḥ kālenaivopapāditām | gṛhāṇa 
mantrasaṃpūtāṃ śrāvyāmenāṃ mahāhutim || 

asyārthaḥ (-) 

agniśabdena rudraḥ agneradhipaḥ kālaśabdena janma janmasthitiḥ 
kālāharaṃ yassaṃhartā sa kālaḥ | 

yadvā (-) 

truṣyādi mahāpralayāntaṃ ṣoḍaśātmakam | yathā 
śaktyuparicchinatti yaśśivassakalātmakaḥ || 

<p.1650> 

kālātmanātvayā deveti mantraliṃgāt ata eva dakṣiṇa aghora iti 
dakṣiṇaghoravidhānāt | aghoramūrtessaṃhāra kartā (**) 
ṣyādimantramūrtināṃ krameṇa sṛṣṭisthiti nidhana nigrahānugraha 
kartṛtvāt | ata kāle naivopapādināṃ sārdhañca bhogya 
karmabhoktṛtvaṃ kālenopapāditāṃ bhojanauṣadhādi sānnidhyena 
niṣpādyāṃ mantrasaṃpūtāndīkṣoktaradanvaṣammantra 
nyāsādibhiḥ | pūtāṃ saṃpratyahaṃ te vihitamantra saṃskāra 
pūjāñca enāṃ mahāhutinnara śavasvarūpāṃ gṛhāṇeti 
mantrārthaḥ | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

vṛkṣasya sammukhantatra (-) 

vaidika śaivamantrānuṣṭhānavatāṃ mahā śaivānāṃ pūrvoktavat 
vaidikāgnimutpādya śaivāgnau saṃyojya tena miśrāgninā 
antyeṣṭiṃ kuryāt | taduktaṃ kāmike (-) 

śaivagnilakṣaṇaṃ pūrvamuktam | 

miśra vaidikayośgne svarūpaṃ śṛṇutadvijāḥ | ekavigraha 
saṃyukto dvivaktraṃ syādināsikaḥ || 

ṣaṇṇetro mekhalāyuktaḥ pādatrayasamanvitaḥ | caturaṃga 
samāyukto dviśiro jaṭilo mataḥ || 

upavītī ca mauñjī ca saptahasta samāyutaḥ | saptajihvā samāyukto 
vṛṣavāhana saṃyutaḥ || 

hiraṇya kanakāraktā kṛṣṇā jihvāka (**) ṇe | suprabhāvātiriktā 
ca bahurūpā ca bāmame || 

<p. 1651> 

evaṃ jihvā samuddiṣṭā miśrāgnau vaidikānale | hiraṇyā 
vāruṇī jihvā kanakā madhyame sthitā || 

raktā cottarajihvāsyā kṛṣṇo yāmyadiśi sthitā | 
suprabhāpūrvajihvā syādatiraktāgnidik sthitā || 

bahurūpeśa jihvāsyāt jihvā sthānaṃ prakīrtitam | vaidike 
kevalāgnau tu śivamantrānnayojayet || 

śivāgnau vaidikāmantrāścānye vā saṃprakīrtitāḥ | tathaiva 
miśravanhauvai vaidikāgnistu kathyate || 

brahmāviṣṇuśca lokeśo devāścānye tu ye sthitāḥ | vyāso 
bodhāyanaścāpastaṃbaścaivā vātsyāyanaḥ || 

satyāṣāḍhaśca ye cānye mato devāṃśca sārthakān | 
śāstrāṇyanyāni śrutvā tu purāṇāni smṛtistathā || 

sūtrestu niyamārthastu vyāsassaṃkṣepakāriṇaḥ | tanmatena kṛto 
yogniḥ vaidikaḥ paripaṭhayate || 

kevalaṃ vaidikaimantrairvihitaṃ vaidikaṃ bhavet | praṇītaṃ 
brahmakūrcena saṃyukto vaidikasmṛtaḥ || 

tathaiva miśravanhestu śaivaṃ stābhyāṃ yutena ca | tribhiḥ 
paridhibhīścordhva samidbhayāṃ saṃyutastu yat || 

vaidikāgni samuddiṣṭo miśrāgnistūbhayātmakaḥ | adīkṣitāśca 
viprādyā vaidikaṃ kevalantu vā || 

<p.1652> 

adhikāriṇa ityuktā dīkṣitāssarva yogyakāḥ | ubhayo miśriṇo ye 
tu kṛtvādau vaidikaṃ pṛthak || 

kuṇḍasaṃskārapūrvantu śaivāgnissādhakottamāḥ | 
miśramityevamuddiṣṭamubhayāśramayogyakāḥ || 

evaṃ miśrantu saṃpādya juhuyāt sarvamatandritaḥ | 
evamantyeṣṭikarmādau saṃskāralakṣaṇantviha || 

ādonyatra pṛthak kāryaṃ śraddhāvittānusārataḥ | 

tatraiva (-) 

apradakṣiṇa mānīya gṛhītvā khaṭagamatandritaḥ | 
utkṣipyāropyarāmāṃsechanna mūrdhā parāṅmukhīm || 

sārāvimuñca saṃsakta svadharmasthaiḥ pradakṣiṇam | apasavya 
kramān gatvā vardhanīñca adhomukhīm || 

kṣipettatra śiro deśāduddhṛtāṃ śastravardhanīm | 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

toraṇādi visṛjyātha jalatīre praveśayet | 

tathā kāmike (-) 

tato jalāśayaṃ gatvā snātvā prastīrya satkuśān | 
tadūrdhvamapasavyena praṇavaṃ hṛdayaṃ purā || 

skandapūrvagaṇeśānta nāma vā paścimam | tilodakantu dātavyaṃ 
mṛtanāmnā samanvitam || 

ityādi karmakartavyaṃ tatvaśuddhi vihīnayā | bhūyaḥ snātvā 
japeyuśca saumyāsyo śiva saṃhitām || 

<p. 1653> 

tatra viśeṣa uktaḥ | 

snānānte pañcagavyaṃ vā ghṛtaṃ vā pītvā japecchivam| 

vidveṣaṇa saṃhitāyām (-) 

sūryābhimukha saṃyuktaṃ prāyaścittaṃ japedguruḥ | 
sapiṇḍānāṃ svajātīṃśca vaidikaṃ śaivamācaret || 

kāmike (-) 

brahmacārī yatīnāntu saṃnyāsakramayogyaka | āśoṣaṇāt 
snānavastraṃ bahurūpaṃ śataṃ japet || 

dviguṇaṃ skandadātārastathā tadvāhakā api | yathāśakti 
tadādānaṃ kṛtvā vāhaka dāhakayoḥ || 

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

udaṅmukhāsane sthitvā astrāṇi śataṃ japet | sahasraṃ vā śataṃ 
sāṣṭa dhyāna yuktena cet (*) || 

bāndhavāstu tadardhantu tadardhamathavāhaka | 

kāmike (-) 

vratasyamavratasyaṃ vā brāhmaṇaṃ śivadīkṣitam | vipine yo 
vahentasya nākāle maraṇaṃ bhavet || 

cintye (-) 

anātha pretasaṃskāra maśvamedhaphalaṃ labhet | 

kāmike (-) 

śavāśauca vidhāyaivamāgataścet svamandiram | vibhakṣya 
nimbapatrāṇi niyatadvāraveśmani || 

ācamyāgnimudakaṃ gomayaṃ garurasarṣapam | praveśayeyussaṃ labhya 
kṛtvāśamani padaṃ śanaiḥ || 

ṣaṭsashasrikāyām (-) 

prāpte nakte japānte vā viśeṣeṇa śivaṃ yajet | 

<p. 1654> 

japahomāvasāne tu samaśnīyāttato guruḥ || 

tadbāndhavaissaśiṣyaistu saṃvṛtaśśokaśāntaye | 

[iti vāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita dīkṣādarśe 
samayāntyeṣṭividhiḥ] | || [atha viśeṣāntyeṣṭividhirucyate] || 

cintye (-) 

kṛtvāsanañcana viśleṣo jīvasyākarṣaṇādikam | karmamānañca 
tatrastha dīkṣā vatsarvamācaret || 

atrakramaḥ (-) 

pūrvoktaṃ sarvaṃ vidhāyāgni 
hṛtpadmavāgīśīvāgīśāvāvāhyābhyarcya tatsannidhāya 
pratyekamāhutitrayaṃ datvā saṃśliṣṭau saṃbhāvya 
śiṣyamastreṇa saṃprokṣya oṃ haḥ huṃ phaḍiti hṛddeśe 
sapuṣpanārā ca mudrayā saṃtāḍyātmano recakeṇa huṃkāreṇa 
tasya dehe praviśya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ huṃ phaḍiti 
jyeṣṭhayā viyojya oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṃkuśamudrayā 
dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tṛṇāgrabindurūpañjīvaṃ sañcintya 
namontenātmamantreṇa saṃhāramudrayā saṃgṛhya pūrakavṛtyā 
svahṛdi sanniveśya kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantramanusmaran 
brahmādikāraṇatyāgakrameṇātma mantreṇa svadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā 
nissārya pitrossaṃyogaṃ vibhāvya vāmayodbhavamudrayā 
ātmamantreṇa vāgīśyāṃ saṃyojya mūlena śataṃ sahasramardhaṃ 
vā hutvā tamātmānaṃ pūrṇayā īśvaravadadhiṣṭhāyakena śivena 
saṃyojya vāgīśī vāgīśau santarpya visṛjya (-) 

<p. 1655> 

prāyaścittārthamastreṇāṣṭādhikaṃ śataṃ hutvā sthaṇḍileśā 
vanisthena saṃyojya śivaṃ visṛjet | tataśśvandakṣiṇa 
mastakaṃcitāyāmāropya viparītenājyāratapaṭenācchādya pūrvavat 
sarvaṃ vidhāya indahnādyairāvṛtya kuṇḍasthāgninā prajvālya 
śirodeśe gurusthitvā sarpimadhupayaḥ pūrṇāṃsasruvāṃ 
srucamutkṣipya pūrṇāmetaṃ vākyamudīrayan kṣipet | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tvamagne dakṣiṇaḥ kālaḥ kālenaivopapāditām | 
gṛhāṇamantrasaṃpūtāṃ śāvyāmenāṃ mahāhutim || 

anenaiva tu mantreṇa hutvā pūrṇāṃ bhavāntikam | vardhanīṃ 
śastrajaptāntu vāmāṃśe sanniveśayet || 

tanniveśya tato yāvat pratyak dharāmakhaṇḍitām | saritaśca 
taṭaṃgatvā paścādanava lokayet || 

snātvāprastīrya sandarbhānapasavyaṃ vidhāya ca | 

oṃ hāṃ śuddhātman skando bhava svadhā | oṃ hāṃ śuddhātman 
caṇḍo bhava svadhā | oṃ hāṃ śuddhātman gaṇādhīśo bhava 
svadhā | iti bhūmau nivāpāñjalitrayaṃ datvā punarapi snātvā 
prāyaścittārtha maghoraśatamāvartya skandadātārastadāhakāśca 
dviguṇaṃ japtvā nijāśrayaṃ gatvā taduddiśyaśeṣaṃ pūrvoktavat 
kuryāt | 

kālottare (-) 

svakāgnikāvasāne tu yajetpūrvoktavatprabhuḥ | 

<p.1556> 

viśeṣaṇa hitenaiva kartavyaṃ tvathalakṣaṇam | || iti 
[dīkṣādarśeviśeṣāntyeṣṭividhiḥ] || 

|| [atha nirvāṇāntyeṣṭividhirucyate] || 

ācāryaḥ pūvannāḍīsandhānāntakaṃ karma nirvartayet | 
kriyākramadyotikādau vistareṇa pradarśitaḥ | 
granthavistarabhītyātu saṃkṣipya varṇyate | 

tathā cintyaviśve (-) 

vidyā dehaña sūkṣme tu mastake vadane hṛdi | nābheradhaśśarīre 
ca śāntyatītaditaḥ kalāḥ || 

vidyātatvañca vinyasya śaktitatvaṃ tathā śivam | 
caitanyasannidhānāya mūlena juhuyācchatam || 

nivṛtyādisamādāya yugapadvā krameṇa vā | agnau saṃyojya 
saṃpūjya śivādyāvāhanādikam || 

kṛtvā tāḍanaviśleṣau jīvasyākarṣaṇādikam | karmātmasthañca 
tatrasthaṃ dīkṣāvatsarvamācaret || 

janmādhikārabhogāñca layaṃ sroto viśodhanam | niṣkṛtiñca 
tirodhānaṃ paśoḥ pāśavimocanam || 

marddanaṃ vartulīkāraṃ pāśadāhādikāḥ kriyāḥ | 
kāraṇāvāhanaṃ tadvadadhikārasamarpaṇam || 

ātmoddhāraṇa karmādi kṛtvā guṇavivarjite | 

<p.1657> 

yojayedbhāvanātīte śive caitanyamavyaye || 

kāmike (-) 

evamevopariṣṭācca pādānanyānviśodhayet | uktāyāḥ 
karmapaddhatyā tānativaṃ śivāvadhi || 

anyānuddhṛtyahomantaṃ yojayedamale pade | yanmukto na punarjātaḥ 
parādhīno bhavedaṇu || 

kṛtaniśśeṣa pāśānāntamiṣṭvevaṃ visarjayet | vidyādehañca 
taddehe saṃkalpassvapade nyaset || 

sthaṇḍileśānamapyevaṃ saṃhṛtya svapade guruḥ | 
śavapyantaśśayyāyāmāropya prāvṛtaṃ kuśaiḥ || 

yāmyaśīrṣamudakpādaṃ muktānāṃ srūksrukādikam | ācāryaṃ 
sādhakañcaiva tābhyāmanyattadujkṣitam || 

turuṣkāgarukapūra candanottara dārubhiḥ | sacchādyānīya 
kuṇḍāya māropyagniṃ vinikṣipet || 

madhusantailasarpīṃṣi prakṣipyoccalitenale | sarpirmadhupayaḥ 
pūrṇāṃ sṛcamutkṣipya pūjyatām || 

gurusthitvā śirodeśe sadyāśābhimukhānanaḥ | 
pāvakasyokṣipeddhārāmiti vākyamudīsyan || 

tvamagne dakṣiṇaḥ kālaḥ kālenaivopapāditām | 
gṛhāṇamantrasaṃpūtāṃ śāvyāmenāṃ mahāhutim | | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

prakṣipya vāṅmukhau tatra sruk srukāvapyanantaram | 

<p. 1658> 

niyujya satkriyākarma kuśalāṃścaturo guruḥ || 

apradakṣiṇamānīya gṛhītvā khaṭgavardhanīm | utkṣipyo 
vāṅmukha vāmāṃse channamūrdhā parāṅmukhī || 

dharāṃ vimuñca saṃyuktāṃ svadharmasthaiḥ pradakṣiṇam | apasavya 
kramādgatvā vardhanīntāmadhomukhīm || 

kṣipettatra śiro deśo duṣkṛtāṃ śastravardhanīm | saritañca 
taṭaṃ gatvā paścādanavalokayet || 

snātvā prastīrya sandarbhān apasavyaṃ vidhāya ca | oṃ hāṃ 
śuddhātmanī śobhava svadhā (-) oṃ hāṃ śuddhātman sadāśivo 
bhavasvadhā (-) oṃ hāṃ śuddhātman śānto bhava svadhā (-) 

pitṛtarpaṇametaistu mantraiḥ kuryātsamāhitaḥ | snātvā 
gururaghoreṇa śatamāvartayejjapam | 

dviguṇaṃ skandhadātārastoyā syānti nijāśrayam | tatra devaṃ 
samabhyarcya taduddiśya viśeṣataḥ | 

kālottare (-) 

ācārye dakṣiṇāndadyā dvastra hemāṃgulīyakaiḥ | bhūṣaṇaṃ 
svarṇadānañca godānañca tataḥ param || 

kṣetradānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā gajadānāśca dānakam | chatra 
cāmarakañcaiva pāda rakṣādikantathā || 

kāṃsantriśūladānañca śālīparyaṅkameva ca | parivārāśca 
viśeṣeṇa yathā śaktiñca dāpayet || 

<p. 1659> 

putrakāṇāṃ prakartavyamathavā śiṣya eva ca | maheśā sādhanaṃ 
paścāt śivānāñca prakalpayet || 

evaṃ saṃkalpya vidhivadantyeṣṭintu prakalpayet | 

[iti vāmadevātmaja vedajñānaviracita dīkṣādarśe nirvāṇa 
dīkṣāntyeṣṭi vidhiḥ] || 

[athāsthisañcayana vidhirucyate] || 

kāmike (-) 

dvitīyehaniśeṣāṃ dahanaṃ kārayennaraḥ | 
ghṛtakṣīrasamāyuktaṃ sapiṇḍaiśca samanvitam || 

tṛtīyetyathavā dehi kuryāt sañcayanañcite | hṛtvātha mṛṇmaye 
pātre sakṣīre payasānvite || 

asthisaṃgrahaṇaṃ vātha kuryāt sañcayanaṃ vinā | ekatripañca 
saptāhe navabhāṇḍe tu mṛṇmaye || 

asthi saṃgrahaṇaṃ vipra pramukhāṇāṃ krameṇa vā | satvantyaktvā 
caturdikṣu paiśācārthaṃ vinikṣipet || 

aṃgairaṃgāni saṃgrhya tanmantreṇa vinikṣipet | kugrāmādbāhye 
vinikṣipya gaṃgādikṣepaṇādi ca || 

taddine vātha pañcāhe māsānte vā trimāsake | ṣāṇmāsābda 
saṃpūrṇe tadūrdhve vātha nikṣipet || 

nikṣipya tatra tattīrthe snānaṃ kṛtvā tilaissaha | paitṛkaṃ 
tarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā devādīnapi tarpayet || 

dānaṃ kuryādyathā śakti piṇḍandatvā caturbhuvi | 

|| [iti asthisañcayana vidhiḥ] || 

<p. 1660> 

| [agnipāṣāṇa sthāpana vidhirucyate] | 

kāmike (-) 

vipraśuddhiṃ daśāhaṃ syāt kṣatriyo dvādaśānhikaḥ | 
daśapañca hikāśuddhirvaiśye śūdre hi māsikam || 

idaṃ sāmānyamartyānāṃ vidhānaṃ parikīrtitam | ye ca 
māheśvarāśśūdrāḥ bhasma rudrākṣadhāriṇaḥ || 

teṣāṃ pañcadaśāhena sū śuddhimmṛtāva pi | ye ca 
māheśvarāśśūdrā ityādyāḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 

śivagāna vidāṃ tadvacchivāśramaniṣeviṇām | 
dinairviṃśatibhiśśuddhirddevadāsyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 

dinairviṃśatibhiśśuddhāḥ pañcaviṃśatibhiḥ pare | 

raurave (-) 

tapasvī devadāsī ca pakṣāhena viśudhyati | 

ityādi vivecanamasmat śaivaśauca dīpikāyāṃ 
prapañcitantatrāvadhāryatām | 

kāmike (-) 

āvaśyakaṃ gṛhasthānāṃ lokamārgānuyāyinām | aṃkaṇe 
bāhyadeśe vāgāre pitṛgṛhannayet || 

pīṭhe pīṭhoktarītyā vā | 

viprādīnāṃ kramādvāpi rudrātpañcāntasammitaiḥ | darbhervā 
sakuśaiḥ kūrcāndakṣiṇāgraka sammitam || 

praṇamavanāsanandatvā mūrtimāvāhayettataḥ | tadgotrādi 
samopetamātmānaṃ praṇabenyaset || 

<p. 1661> 

pādyādīni ca naivedya māḍhakādi vinirmitam | tadardha nirmitaṃ 
vāpi tasya prītikarañca yat || 

etatsarvañca tannābhā svadhāntena hṛdānvitam | 
athavārdhyajalandadyāt anyatrānnaṃ prakalpayet || 

tamudvāsya ca tat sthānāt piṇḍaṃ puṣpasamanvitam | 
ādodyasahitaṃ vātha nikṣipettirthamadhyame || 

etatsarvantu vā puṇyasthāna nadyādike nayet | viprādīnāntu 
sāmānyaṃ viśeṣastvadhunocyate || 

antyeṣṭyā ca samopetā steṣāmmāheśvarātmanām | 
pratyahantarpaṇaṃ kāryaṃ śaktidānādi nāmataḥ || 

pṛthak pṛthak kuryuḥ kāryantarpaṇaṃ prathamehani | tarpaṇānte 
balindadyāt nadyādau vā gṛhepi vā || 

brahmaṇā daśapiṇḍāstu kṣatriyācca dedastu vai | vaiśyāḥ 
pañcadaśaḥ proktāśśūdrāstriṃśatprakīrtitāḥ || 

āśaucaṃ yāvadeteṣāṃ tāvatpiṣṭvodakakriyā | daśāhesamati 
krānte ekoddiṣṭe tu kṛte sati || 

piṇḍamekaṃ tadā deyaṃ āśaucañca pradhānataḥ | āśaucānte 
prakartavya mekoddiṣṭamathadvijaḥ || 

ekādaśe tripakṣe ca tathā ca pratimāsakam | vistāritañca yatkarma 
saṃvatsareṇa saṃyutam || 

<p. 1662> 

ṣoḍaśaśrāddhamityuktandānameteṣu yatkṛtam | etadvai 
ṣoḍaśaśrāddhamekoddiṣṭamitismṛtam || 

yasyetāni na kurvanti śrāddhāni navaṣoḍaśa | piśācatvaṃ 
sthiratvañca dattaśrāddhaśanairapi || 

ekoddiṣṭa dvitīyenhi sapiṇḍī karaṇakriyā | arvāk 
sapiṇḍīkaraṇaṃ yasya saṃvatsarātpare || 

tasyāpyannaṃ sodakuṃbhandadyātsaṃvatsaraṃ gurau | pūrvameva 
navaśrāddhamekoddiṣṭa samanvitam || 

sapiṇḍīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt tadarthaṃ pūjayecchivam | 
bhojanañcaikavardhanam | samūhya caitakartavya viśeṣāddeśikātmane 
| 

śivāya ca pradātavyamathavā deśikātmane | 

kāmike (-) 

ekoddiṣṭa kriayānte tu pakṣaśrāddhaṃ viśammatam | pākṣikaṃ 
māsikaṃ śrāddhaṃ śūdrāṇāñca tathā bhavet || 

anyatsarvaṃ samānaṃ syāt brāhmaṇādi trivarṇinām | 

kāmike (-) 

naiṣṭhikasya na kartavyaṃ pratyahantarpaṇaṃ balim | ekāhameva 
dāhānte īśāditribhireva ca || 

tadarthaṃ tarpaṇaṃ kuryāt tadarthaṃ pūjayecchivam | 
āmaśrāddhaṃ prakartavyaṃ pūrvāṇhe dvijasattama || 

āpādya nagnau tīrthe ca candrasūryagrahepi ca | 
āmaśrāddhamaśaktau syāt ārdrādyaistu tathaiva ca || 

<p. 1663> 

ityevamadhisandhāya śrāddhakarma samācaret | 

ityādi ṣoḍaśakriyā prakāśikāyāṃ vistareṇa pradarśitaṃ 
tatrāvadhāryatām | 

|| [iti pāṣāṇasthāpana vidhiḥ] || 

|| [atha śaivasanyāsinā mantyeṣṭividhirucyate] || 

śaivasanyāsināndahana dehāntyeṣṭidvividhamuktantathā cintyaviśve 
(-) 

athāntyeṣṭi vidhiṃ vakṣye dahanaṃ khananandvidhā | 
dhruvajñānaṃ tathā labdhaṃ saṃkalpajñānasaṃbhavam || 

kālajñānoktamārgeṇa tatkālantannirīkṣayet | kālottare tu 
kartavya mārabheddeha mutsṛjet || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tapassanyāsināñcaiva dāhaḥ paramahaṃsinām | lokāgnimudarāgnau 
ca samāropaṇataḥ purā || 

bāhyāgni kāryābhāvācca śāyayellavaṇaissaha | 
khananetyavaṭatmāpi derdhyaṃ vedakaraṃ bhavet || 

hastadvayañca vistāramadhaḥ khātañcatuṣkaram | 

kāmike (-) 

yatīnāṃ jñānīnāṃ vāpi kriyā syādavaṭātmikāḥ | 
yogināndaṇḍamātreṇa khananaddaṇḍārdhamātrataḥ || 

cintye (-) 

nirjanandeśamaśritya gomayenānulepayet | kṛtvā śarīraśuddhiñca 
gandhamālyai ralaṃkṛtam || 

sitāstaraṇo dakantairnāstikottaramantikam | 

<p. 1664> 

cūrṇotsava samāptau tu paścāt pretāvarohaṇam || 

kāmike (-) 

āropya śibikādau tu śmaśāne śuddhabhūtale | nadī tīre taṭāke 
vā maṇṭapaṃ samaṃlakṛtam || 

sthaṇḍilantatra kartavya śālitaṇḍulakā (**) | pañcakuṃbhantu 
saṃgrāhya vardhanī saṃytaṃ bhavet || 

sasūtrān sāpidhānāṃśca savastrānvāripūritān | śivakuṃbhantu 
madhye tu vardhanīntasya vāmake || 

caturddikṣu catuḥ kumbhān sthāpayettu viśeṣataḥ | 
devamantramanusmṛtya kuṃbhamadhye tu vinyaset || 

devīmantraṃ samāśritya vardhanī toyakenyaset | 
caturaśrārdhacandrañca trikoṇaṃ ṣaḍaśrakam || 

suvṛttañca pṛthivyādimaṇḍalākṛtayaḥ kramāt | pītaṃ śuklaṃ 
tathāraktaṃ kṛṣṇābhaṃ dhūmravarṇakam || 

pṛthivyādīni bījāni lavarayaha kārakāḥ | pṛthivyādīni 
bhūtāni sadyādīśāntaṃ yojayet || 

kālottare tu kartavyaṃ (********)| tattatkuṃbhenyaseddevaṃ 
saṃhārakramameva hi || 

athavānya prakāreṇa cakrastaṃbha samanvitam | daśakīla 
samāyuktandvārā dvādaśa kīlakam || 

kṣīravṛkṣasamāyuktantriṇetreṇaiva veṣṭayet | 

<p. 1665> 

kīlātkīla samopetaṃ daśāyudhaṃ samarcayet || 

kālāgnirudramāvāhya vāyavyāṃ kuṃbhamadhyame | 
sarvopacāraissaṃpūjya raudraṃ pāśupataṃ tathā || 

ityevaṃ pūjayetpaścāt astrarājaṃ yathā vidhi | tat sthāne 
nayebhūmau dakṣiṇottaramārgataḥ || 

aṣṭatāla pramāṇena ardhamātraṃ suvismṛtam | vāmadevena 
saṃprokṣya śāstramārgeṇa kārayet || 

yājñikaṃ vṛkṣamādāya kīlaṃ tatraiva dāpayet | 
veṣṭayetsūtramastreṇa apradakṣiṇataḥ kramāt || 

ṣaṭkasūtrasamāyuktaṃ vistārāyāmameva ca | paña pañca 
padantatra madhye pañcapadaṃ tyajet || 

evaṃ pañcapadetvekaṃ pṛthivī pītavarṇakam | varuṇa 
nairṛtayormadhye śrutīnāṃ padameva ca || 

evaṃ sthāne viśeṣeṇa āpāyaśvetavarṇakam | agnau śrutipadaṃ 
proktamekadhūmrasyavarṇakam || 

jīve vedapadaṃ proktamevaṃ kṛṣṇasya varṇakam | īśe vedapadaṃ 
proktammekadhūmrasya varṇakam || 

aindrāntakamale some pītakṛṣṇaṃ sitāsitam | citāsthānamidaṃ 
prokta tattatsthānercayedbudhaḥ || 

oṃ hlāṃ nivṛtti kalāyai sadyo jātāya namaḥ | iti madhye | 

<p. 1666> 

oṃ hrīṃ pratiṣṭhākalāyai vāmadevāya namaḥ | 

nirṛtau (-) 

oṃ hūṃ vidyākalāyai aghorāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ śāntikalāyai 
tatpuruṣāya namaḥ | 

vāyavye (-) 

oṃ hauṃ śāntyatīta kalāyai īśānāya namaḥ | 

aiśānye (-) 

pūrvapaścima dakṣiṇottaradikṣu oṃ hāṃ indrāya namaḥ | oṃ 
hāṃ yamāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ varuṇāya namaḥ | oṃ hāṃ somāya 
namaḥ | 

ityevamarcayitvā tu baliṃ paścādviśeṣataḥ | prāṅmukhantatra 
kurvīta kalpayedāsanādikān || 

āsanopari vinyasya gandhādyairarcayetkramāt | 
śiṣyādīnāmaśruvājyāya pūjayellakṣaṇena tu || 

cintyaviśve (-) 

agnikāryaṃ vinā sarvaṃ pūrvavatkarma vārayet | śivāgnikārya 
saṃyuktaṃ yatīnāṃ tena vai dahet || 

khanane dahane caiva daṇḍakaupīnaṃ saṃyutam | 

kāmike (-) 

lavaṇenāthavāpūrya bhasmanā vā viśeṣataḥ | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

bhadrāvā pūrayet snigdhaṃ deva hastantu tāḍayet | tadūrdhve 
kalpayetpīṭhaṃ kūṭantatra prakalpayet || 

tatravālaya saṃyuktaṃ pīṭhaṃ vā liṃgameva vā | 
bodharūpasvarūpaṃ vā kṛtvā saṃsthāpya pūjayet || 

<p. 1667> 

tatra piṇḍodakaṃ śrāddhaṃ yadanyadapi neṣyate | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

tatra deśe tu liṃgādi pratiṣṭhāñcaiva kārayet | tanmūrtiṃ 
vāpi pīṭhaṃ vā bhitticitramathāpi vā || 

kūṭaprāsādakaṃ vāpi tatra deśe ca kārayet | āvāhanādi 
balyanta dīpāntamapi kārayet || 

ityevaṃ khananaṃ proktaṃ pūrvoktavaddahetpunaḥ | 

aprasaṃgādviprādīnāṃ pratimā pratiṣṭhā prakāra uktaḥ | 

kāmike (-) 

brāhmaṇa kṣatriyo vaiśyaśśūdrā bāhyantaśalakāḥ | trayo 
vidhyuktavatteṣāmabhiṣekaṃ nṛpothavā || 

bhavabhakti samopetaṃ jīvantopi mṛtostu vā | teṣāṃ prakṛtikaṃ 
kṛtvā pratiṣṭhāpya samāpayet || 

śivadharmottare (-) 

dīkṣā viśeṣagata pāśasamanvitānāṃ sākṣācchivena 
sadṛśātmaguṇojvalānām | dehādi bhāravahana śramaduḥkhitānāṃ 
kalyāṇa heturaparo nahi dehapātaḥ || 

anena dehena labhantikecit siddhiñca lokān prala (*) ca muktiḥ | 
pralayānte tanuṃ tyaktvā svātmanyeṣā gatisṭhate || 

tathā śivadharme (-) 

bhuktvā tu vipulān bhogān pralaye samupasthite | dehakañcuka 
mutsṛjya jñānatkaivalyamāpnuyāt || 

sarvajñaḥ paripūrṇaśca svātmanyeva vyavasthitaḥ | 

<p. 1668> 

sarvādhva paripūrṇañca veṣṭayetpatikhyayaḥ || 

sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ brahmagītāsu ātmanyeva ratikrīḍāṃ 
śuddhātmā kurute sadeti | 

cintyaviśve (-) 

śivabhakta pratiṣṭhāñca yaḥ kuryānnara puṃgavaḥ | tasya śrī 
vijayodarcirante sāyujyamāpnuyāt || 

|| [iti śaivasanyāsināmantyeṣṭi vidhiḥ] || kailāsa śikhareramye 
vaṭamūlanivāsinam | dakṣiṇā mūrtirūpantu munissasmupasthire || 

agastyaḥ kāśyapaścaiva bharadvājothagautamaḥ | 
kauśikoparameśānādāgamārthañca tatvataḥ || 

jñātvā saṃprītamanasāste sarve munayastathā | teṣāṃ 
śiṣyāssanantādyā munayastānupāsire || 

kecillabdhāgamārthantu māṭhāpatyena saṃsthitāḥ | 
śrīmatkailāsapārśve tu caturthā sa vyavasthitā || 

āmardagaḥ puṣpagirirgolakīraṇabhadrakaḥ | sanatkumāro bhagavā 
nāmardaka maṭhādhipaḥ || 

kadaṃba vṛtta evasyāttasya saṃtānikaśca ye | 
puṣpagirirmaṭhapatissanako vṛkṣamarjanam || 

tasya santānakāḥ kecit golakīnagnāyakāḥ | 

<p. 1669> 

sanātano ṛṣirvṛkṣo jaṃbūpatrai vatiṣṭhati || 

raṇabhadrādhipaḥ proktassanātana iti smṛtaḥ | nyagordhavṛkṣa 
ityuktastasya santāni kāścaye || 

godāvarī nadītīre tasya santānikāśśubhāḥ | 
purāmaṇḍarakālādi tasyāṃ vasati śaṃkaraḥ || 

utpattiṃ tasya śaivānāṃ ācāryāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 

tatra maṇḍarābī ca mahīdāśca caturmaṭhāḥ | 

āmardakī puṣpagiri golakī raṇabhadrakā | rājendra cola ityākhya 
colabhūmau mahīpatiḥ || 

gaṃgā snātvāgamanārthamāgatya dṛṣṭvā śaivaparāṃstadā | 
snātvā pratinivṛttassan tasyāmādāya śaivakān || 

svarājye sthāpayāmasa śaivācārya varāṃstataḥ | kāñcī madhye 
colabhūmau saratraiva pravistaraniti || 

śrī puṣpagirisantānamaṭhādhipamahadguruḥ | tatsaṃpradāya 
siddhānāṃ bahavotra mumukṣavaḥ || 

kramaraktaka mālākhya paddhatīñcākarottataḥ | vidayā vāde 
ṣaṭpadārthaṃ saundarācārya nāmataḥ || 

toṇḍīra maṇḍale tasmin rudrakoṭi mahat sthale | ādiśaiva iti 
khyātaḥ pañcāṃgācāravartitaḥ || 

śrī vyāghrapuranivasi vāmadevo mahattataḥ | 

<p. 1670> 

tasyānujo mahāyogī vedajñāna munīśvaraḥ || 

bṛhatsabheśa muddiśya anekaiśśiṣyakaissaha | śrīmattillivanaṃ 
prāpya ciraṃ kālamavardhata || 

sadāśivamahārāje pṛthivīpālanakṣame | ālayānāmanekeṣāṃ 
gopurādīnyakalpayet || 

vedajñānamuniśrīmān drāviḍādīn keśava | śivadharmottarādīni 
śāstrāṇi parikalpayet || 

śrīmattillivane caiva aruṇādro mahatsthale | śrī 
vṛddhācalasaṃjñe ca madhyārjuna mahatpade || 

śvetena pūjitaṃ yatra śvetāraṇye ghaṭe pure | antyeṣvaneka 
sthāneṣu sthāpayāmāsa vāgamān || 

tasya śrotra sutaḥ kaścittannāmāṃ kita paṃḍitaḥ | 
dīkṣādarśa mahāgrantha paddhatīñca mahattarām || 

dakṣiṇā mūrtikṛpayāhyakarotsāṃpradāyikām | 

[iti śrī vyāghrapuranivāsī vāmadevātmaja vedajñāna viracita 
dīkṣādarśassamāptaḥ] || 

śrīmaddevaśikhāmaṇigurubhyo namaḥ 

|| śrīmat ṣaṇmukhagurave namaḥ || 

